window.FWN_GODLY_STAY_HOME_DAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_STAY_HOME_DAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1701,"title":"Chapter 1701 Attack","paragraphs":["Chapter 1701 Attack","“Damn it!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven cursed angrily.","He had managed the Highest Clouds Palace for many years. He wasn’t worried about the loss of his power but his subordinates.","“How are Immortal Master Wuluo and the others?”","Even Yue Wuwei looked a little worried.","If the forty Holy Lands attacked at the same time, how could the Highest Clouds Palace withstand them?","“Let’s find someone to ask.”","Zhang Han was silent with some anger lingering in his chest.","Swoosh!","Their spaceship tore through the void and headed for a nearby planet.","The planet belonged to the Dark Eagle Sect. It was also a super sect. It was located in a city in the outer ring, an open city on the planet.","Within the Seven Colors Pavilion, Zhang Han said directly. “We want to buy all the information regarding the Highest Clouds Palace.”","“Please wait a moment.”","The Seven Colors Pavilion was the place where the Dark Eagle Sect was in charge of information-related tasks. It was similar to the Highest Clouds Palace, but its scale was a little inferior to that of the Highest Clouds Palace.","The person in charge of the reception was a woman.","As she searched for news about the Highest Clouds Palace, she secretly contacted the Hall Master of the planet with her mind.","“There’s a lot of information about the Highest Clouds Palace. Which part do you need?” The woman asked.","“All the news in the past 40 years.”","“Please wait.”","After the woman finished speaking, she did something that made everyone wait for half an hour.","Immortal Master Lingxi, Immortal Master Waterheaven, and the others all knew it was strange.","There must be something strange going on.","Immortal Master Lingxi laughed coldly. “I advise all of you not to think too much about it. Or else, it’ll easily draw calamity onto yourselves.”","“You’re good at joking. Our intelligent system has just been updated. The information you want has come out.” The woman said with a professional smile.","“The information of the past 40 years is all in this wristband. The price is 50 million crystal stones.”","Zhang Han moved casually, handed over the crystal stones, and got the wristband. After that, they left the Seven Colors Pavilion and took the aircraft to the space station.","At this time, they also opened the wristband. There were quite a few videos inside.","Forty years ago, Han Yang Immortal suddenly appeared, and the Highest Clouds Palace became a super sect.","Thirty years ago, the Highest Clouds Palace had expanded in size by tens of times. Its disciples had participated in secret realm training many times.","Twenty years ago, the Highest Clouds Palace had been one of the top super sects. It had developed rapidly.","Ten years ago, Immortal Master Wumo came back. Led by the Dongruo Holy Land, a total of forty Holy Lands took action together.","They saw the videos of the Highest Clouds Star on the seventh mountain.","It was as if they were seeing a movie.","In the vast starry sky, many fleets appeared outside the Highest Clouds Star.","The first round of attacks began suddenly.","The defense power of the Highest Clouds Palace came out. However, it couldn’t withstand the combined assault of the forty Holy Lands.","The people of the Highest Clouds Palace fled in panic.","However, the enemies had come prepared and enveloped them.","It could be seen that Immortal Master Wuluo and thousands of elders fought against the other side.","The elders died one after another in the starry sky.","Under everyone’s gaze, the bodies of Immortal Master Wuluo and more than a dozen people were destroyed, and their souls were captured.","The fleet left in a mighty manner.","At the same time, the forty Holy Lands launched all-out attacks on the Highest Clouds Palace.","It was no exaggeration to say that all the planets in the branch palaces of the Highest Clouds Palace had been destroyed.","Everything happened suddenly. There was no movement before, but it suddenly broke out, causing countless disciples of the Highest Clouds Palace to die. Those who got the news later also fled.","The destruction of the Highest Clouds Palace became a thing of the past.","Han Yang Immortal, who had just reached the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage, also became a joke.","“Isn’t he powerful? He escaped in the face of danger, and there is no news of him.”","“The Sect Leader of the Highest Clouds Palace is also trash.”","There were a lot of such discussions.","Of course, some rational people would make such comments.","“They couldn’t defeat the 40 Holy Lands even if Han Yang Immortal was there. Their only way to survive was to escape, but they shouldn’t have fled by themselves. If they had disbanded their sect before leaving, many of their people wouldn’t have died.”","“Could it be that they didn’t know the news before they left?”","“If they were in the Star Sea, how could they not have heard of it? Ten years passed, but there is still no news of them. It seems they have been hiding from the disaster.”","A few years ago, it was hot news that the forty Holy Lands had joined hands to destroy the Highest Clouds Palace.","At the same time, the Dongruo Holy Land also issued a lot of tasks. Anyone who found Han Yang Immortal would be rewarded handsomely.","Therefore, many forces paid attention to this matter. When Zhang Han and the others appeared here, the Hall Master of a branch of the Dark Eagle Sect was tempted.","When Zhang Han and the others boarded their spaceships and entered the secondary space.","“Alert. There are 100 large fleets tracking us.”","The system issued an alarm.","This caused the sullen people present to become angry.","“They want to kick us when we’re down. I’m going to kill them!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was about to go out and kill.","However, he was stopped by Yue Wuwei.","“Don’t be impulsive. Let’s go back to the seventh mountain first. Let’s see if they will follow us or not.”","“Alas!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven squatted down in frustration.","The atmosphere on the scene was still oppressive.","No one spoke. They waited quietly.","“We’re about to reach the Space Shooting Planet.”","When the spaceships left the secondary space, they approached the Space Shooting Planet ahead. They were going to take the fastest route to the seventh mountain.","There was no danger at all. When they entered the Space Shooting Planet and advanced, the fleet of hundreds of flying ships appeared behind them and began to shoot.","When they arrived at the sixth Space Shooting Planet.","In the void of the universe, there was a fleet of hundreds of flying ships and more than a thousand people guarding the exit.","“All of you, get out of the spaceships.”","Someone directed Zhang Han and his people.","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s eyes were gloomy as he was the first to come out.","Everyone followed him.","As soon as they got off the spaceships, hundreds of flying ships that had been following them appeared.","“Sect Leader!”","A middle-aged man cupped his hands and said, “I’m the Hall Master of the Dark Eagle Sect’s C3123 Planet. I’ve been following them all the way.”","“Good.”","The Sect Master of the Dark Eagle Sect nodded slightly. He looked like an elder in his sixties, with long eyebrows and extraordinary momentum. He was also at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage.","Moreover, the five people standing next to him were also at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. They were the Sect Masters of several other super sects.","“Hello, Han Yang Immortal.”","The Sect Master of the Dark Eagle Sect said with a faint smile, “I’ve heard a lot about you. It was said that Han Yang Immortal had summoned the divine thunder over the sky. You are immortal. We came to see you when we heard that you had returned.”","The white-haired elder by his side raised his brows. “I didn’t expect that Immortal Master Lingxi would be here as well.”","Immortal Master Lingxi said indifferently, “I’ll be wherever I want to be. It has nothing to do with you.”","“Ha... You deserve to be Immortal Master Lingxi! You’ve lived for thousands of years, so you’re confident. Then I’ll seek guidance from Immortal Master Lingxi’s cultivation level later.” The elder roared with laughter.","Immortal Master Lingxi sneered and said, “Are you qualified to fight against me?”","“There’s no need to fight.”","The Sect Master of the Dark Eagle Sect sighed and said, “Han Yang Immortal, Immortal Master Lingxi, we are both at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage and have similar knowledge of each other. There are two of you, and there are six of us. As the saying goes, those who suit their actions to the times are wise. We are also a little curious about why the Dongruo Holy Land and the others from the 40 Holy Lands want to catch you. Needless to say, you must have something attracting them. If you hand over the thing, we can pretend that we have never seen you.”","“Really?”","Zhang Han said indifferently, “The thing is here. If you want it, come and get it.”","“Is Han Yang Immortal so courteous to me?”","The Sect Master of the Dark Eagle Sect smiled and took the lead in flying over. The six people were aggressive. Some of them had cold eyes, and some were scornful.","“Han Yang Immortal, although you are powerful, you are no match for the six of us.”","“You once summoned the divine thunder over the sky when meeting a tribulation. Even if it was true, it was a miracle that you didn’t die under the attack of the divine thunder over the sky. Do you think you will become a master at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage again?”","“You killed the Sect Master of the Holy Thunder Sect, but he was just a weak person among all the people in the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. I can even kill him with one finger.” Someone said in a deep voice, “I wanted to fight against Han Yang Immortal, but I didn’t expect you to admit defeat so soon.”","“Hand over the thing, and I’ll spare your lives.”","When the Sect Master of the Dark Eagle Sect approached, his face turned cold.","“Come and get it.”","Zhang Han suddenly stretched out his right hand and crooked his finger.","His indifferent expression made the Sect Master of the Dark Eagle Sect and the others look cold.","Even if they hadn’t noticed his attitude earlier, it was obviously provocation now.","“Good.”","The Sect Master of the Dark Eagle Sect flew over with a swoosh. “I’d like to see what tricks you have up your sleeve!”","Behind him were hundreds of ninth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivators. They were approaching Zhang Han aggressively.","Someone even said, “It’s better to kill them all!”","“Han Yang Immortal? He’s just a newcomer. Why haven’t I heard of those so-called legends? They’re just hype.”","“Sect Leader can kill him in less than five moves.”","Under the gaze of everyone, the Sect Master of the Dark Eagle Sect and Zhang Han got closer and closer.","His energy circulated freely, ready to fight at any time.","“Han Yang Immortal, do you know you deserve to die with your attitude? If I get what I want, maybe I will spare your life.”","Killing intent burst out from the Sect Master of the Dark Eagle Sect.","They were only 30 meters away from each other.","At this time, Zhang Han turned his right into a palm and slapped forward.","Slap!","An invisible and horrible energy surrounded the Sect Master of the Dark Eagle Sect.","“Oh?”","“No! Retreat!”","The face of the Sect Master of the Dark Eagle Sect changed. When he was about to leave, it was too late.","All eyes were focused on him. His figure suddenly became blurry and then drifted away with the wind.","“Is Sect Leader dead?”","“What?”","“That’s impossible. Han Yang Immortal has just entered the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. How could he have killed our Sect Master with one move?”","These people were dumbfounded.","“An illusion! This must be an illusion!”","Even the five Grand Masters couldn’t believe their eyes.","But they had seen it, so they had no choice but to believe it.","“Ha! You can’t blame anyone else for courting death.” Immortal Master Lingxi laughed coldly.","“How dare you guys, who know a little about the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage, stop me?”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly.","Swoosh!","He quickly rushed forward.","With his Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, he cast dozens of kinds of supernatural power and surrounded the five Grand Masters.","“Run now!”","They were scared out of their wits. They launched various attacks to escape.","But how could they have a chance? Facing the various supernatural power that bound them, they could do nothing.","“Stop, Han Yang Immortal!”","“We are just here to strengthen the momentum of the Dark Eagle Sect.”","“Listen to me.”","Hearing the words of these Grand Masters, Zhang Han sneered and said, “Don’t you want to kill me?”","Boom!","The huge Thunderbolt Crocodile opened its bloody mouth and swallowed them without mercy.","He had killed six experts of the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage with a hand.","This was the first battle Zhang Han had fought after returning to the Star Sea.","The ninth-tier elders of the Dark Eagle Sect were scared out of their wits.","“Is he still human?”"]},{"number":1702,"title":"Chapter 1702 Then Let’s Fight","paragraphs":["Chapter 1702 Then Let’s Fight","“You kick us when we’re down, and you deserve to die!","“Kill them!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven charged out.","“Eat them!”","The little white horse’s nostrils were smoking.","After that, many of its subordinates said, “We can’t defeat them.”","“Let’s wait and see.”","The little white horse thought for a moment and did not move. Although it was also an Exotic Beast at the Tribulation Stage, the Dao Seeking Cultivators on the opposite side were all at the ninth tier, so its subordinates could not intervene.","Only Yue Wuwei, Immortal Master Waterheaven, and Immortal Master Lingxi moved and rushed over to destroy the enemy.","A moment later, the crowd took the spaceship and entered the Space Shooting Planet.","The forces on the Space Shooting Planet trembled. How could they have the courage to stop those people?","Swoosh!","The spaceship did space shooting.","After Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others left, the people on the Space Shooting Planet finally breathed a sigh of relief.","Then, they quickly reported the news to the higher-ups.","“What? The Sect Masters of the Dark Eagle Sect and the other five super sects are all dead?”","“Who killed them?”","“Han Yang Immortal? It was the Dongruo Han Yang Immortal that Holy Land was looking for. Crap! Something bad is going to happen to the Seventh Mountain.”","“Since Han Yang Immortal dares to take action, he will definitely target the Dongruo Holy Land.”","Soon, the high-position officials of the sect held a meeting, and there were a lot of discussions.","“It is said that Han Yang Immortal used to be an expert at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. If that’s the case, then his strength will definitely be greater than that of other great experts, and he will be able to defeat the 40 Holy Lands, including Dongruo Holy Land.”","“No, that’s just a legend. Han Yang Immortal once summoned the divine thunder over the sky. Since he survived, it’s enough to show his luck. His strength may not be as strong as it used to be. Otherwise, how could Dongruo Holy Land dare to attack the Highest Clouds Palace?”","“Benefits. Han Yang Immortal seems to have enough treasures to tempt Dongruo Holy Land, but... what made them take risks? Han Yang Immortal is no pushover. Moreover, Immortal Master Lingxi is helping him. The 40 Holy Lands appear to be very powerful. In fact, their Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage masters are only at the middle level. They will not win unless the top ten magnates of the Seventh Mountain take action.”","“Should we tell the Dongruo Holy Land about this? If we send a message to them now, it will probably reach them a few days before Han Yang Immortal and the others take action.”","“Inform them.”","The Sect Master made up his mind. “We’re on good terms with a few of the 40 Holy Lands, and we should inform them. As for this competition, we won’t participate.”","Then, after the meeting, the Sect Leader led the team to the Seventh Mountain quickly, ready to act as onlookers.","“Sect Master, didn’t you say we wouldn’t participate?” an elder asked.","“What do you know? I said we wouldn’t participate in the battle, but I didn’t say we wouldn’t join in the fun. Of course, I would watch a battle of this level.”","In the spaceship that Zhang Han and the others were on.","“It seems that the situation is very serious.”","Zhang Mu let out a long sigh and said, “Otherwise, those people wouldn’t have followed us closely when they heard the news. There are a total of 40 Holy Lands, including the Dongruo Holy Land.”","At that moment, Immortal Master Waterheaven fell silent.","He was still a little confused. He didn’t know what to do.","Immortal Master Wuluo and more than a dozen others had their bodies destroyed. Were their souls still there?","As for the Highest Clouds Palace, it was a large sect. Yet, it had been beaten beyond recognition and countless sect disciples had fallen.","So many people had died.","A blood debt must be paid in blood. However, with the influence of the 40 Holy Lands, they had asked almost all of the top ten magnates of the Seventh Mountain for help, as well as the experts at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.","Could the Highest Clouds Palace defeat those people?","Without Zhang Han, what else could Immortal Master Waterheaven do?","He might leave the Star Sea in sorrow.","The team was doing space shooting at a very fast speed toward the Seventh Mountain.","When they stepped on the bottom of the Seventh Mountain, they came to a Space Shooting Planet.","“Greetings, Han Yang Immortal.”","The guard of the Space Shooting Planet handed him a wristband and said, “This is from the Dongruo Holy Land. We are only responsible for transferring it. Immortal Master Tianyi said that you can take it back, but it has nothing to do with our sect whether you take it or not.”","Zhang Han didn’t say anything. He nodded slightly and took the wristband.","When the spaceship started doing space shooting, he activated the wristband.","“Hahaha, I didn’t expect you to dare to come back!”","Scenes appeared one after another. The arrogant smiles of Immortal Master Wumo, the indifference of Immortal Master Tianyi, the Grand Master of the Dongruo Holy Land, and the more than a dozen souls trapped in the flames around them could be seen.","Creak!","Immortal Master Waterheaven gritted his teeth so hard that cracking sounds could be heard as he clenched his fists tightly.","He could also vaguely see the outline of the souls of Immortal Master Wuluo and the others. They were roaring silently and reaching out their arms to stop him.","It was as if they were saying, “Don’t come over!” “Don’t come over!”","Seeing this, Zhang Han looked terrifyingly calm.","A trace of coldness could be captured in his eyes.","Yue Wuwei looked grave, while Zhang Mu and the others were all sad.","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s face turned ashen.","Immortal Master Tianyi said, “The Highest Clouds Palace has been destroyed by us and suffered heavy casualties. But we still have more than 3600 of your elders and core figures. I’ll kill one person every minute. If you want to save people, come to us now.”","“Hahaha, kill them!”","In the picture, it could be seen that Immortal Master Wumo swept down with his long broadsword and directly hacked a Dao Seeking Cultivator of the Highest Clouds Palace to death.","Hiss!","The video ended.","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s eyes turned red.","“Dammit! Dammit!”","His heart was filled with monstrous killing intent.","He had almost gone crazy.","But he knew very well that the person who could take him to avenge the Highest Clouds Palace was Zhang Hanyang.","“Hanyang.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven took a deep breath as his eyes turned red. “Can I ask you a favor?”","He wanted to say, “I beg you to take revenge, as long as the situation is under our control.”","He was afraid that the Dongruo Holy Land would have stronger help, whom even Zhang Han couldn’t defeat.","This was what Immortal Master Waterheaven was thinking.","But before he finished speaking, Zhang Han said, “There’s no need for words, Palace Master. I’m the second elder of the Highest Clouds Palace. The 40 Holy Lands have destroyed the Highest Clouds Palace and declared war on us. Let’s... let’s fight. I’ll lead you, and we’ll wipe out the 40 Holy Lands ourselves!”","As Zhang Han spoke, his strong body seemed to eclipse the sun, the moon, and the Galaxy as he stood there. His eyes were deep in the sea, and his killing intent swept over like a shocking wave.","Immortal Master Lingxi was extremely shocked.","It seemed that the Killing God, Han Yang Immortal, was going to show his might again. How could these ignorant Holy Lands know his previous glory?","He was glorious in the past. In the eyes of Immortal Master Lingxi, Zhang Han at this time was much stronger than before. In this case, those people still dared to provoke him. They truly didn’t know what they had asked for.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The team crossed one Space Shooting Planet after another.","They arrived at the middle area of the Seventh Mountain.","When they passed by the Highest Clouds Palace, they saw broken planets. The whole ground was covered with gray fog, which was extremely dilapidated. It could be imagined what kind of attacks the previous planets had suffered. They could also feel how desperate the many Dao Seeking Cultivators of the Highest Clouds Palace were.","“There is no right or wrong in war. Only slaughter can quell the flames of war.”","Yue Wuwei had sharp eyes.","They headed for the top of the Seventh Mountain. Their destination was the Dongruo Holy Land. The battle was about to begin.","Along the way, they received image wristbands from the Dongruo Holy Land three times.","There was nothing else in the video, only constant provocation.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Immortal Master Wumo brandished his broadsword. “Killing the people of the Highest Clouds Palace is truly enjoyable!”","He and his companions were eager to see Zhang Han and the others go there, for fear that they would run away.","However, when had they ever thought of escaping?","On the Dongruo Holy Land’s side.","Immortal Master Tianyi organized the 40 Holy Lands. The Dongruo Holy Land was heavily guarded, and they had even set up inescapable traps.","“Everyone, as long as you can help us catch Han Yang Immortal and avenge Immortal Master Wumo, we will give you 30% more of the spirit treasures I mentioned.”","Immortal Master Tianyi spoke to everyone.","Only three of the 40 Holy Lands present knew the inside story.","The matter was about the Pearl of Fate, the supreme treasure of the higher world. Who didn’t want to get it?","Thus, Immortal Master Tianyi contacted his two old friends, and the three of them decided together to seek out the alliance’s Holy Lands and give them a reward in order to take revenge for Immortal Master Wumo. All they needed to do was to jointly deal with the Highest Clouds Palace.","They had prepared for a long time for this.","Unexpectedly, Han Yang Immortal and others were not there at all.","After discovering their return, the three Holy Lands quickly contacted the others. The 40 Holy Lands quickly gathered at the Dongruo Holy Land with many fleets.","“Grand Master, when we catch Han Yang Immortal later, I will kill him with my own hands,” said Immortal Master Wumo.","“Okay.”","Immortal Master Tianyi nodded calmly.","“It’s about time. If they come, they’ll be here soon,” one of the Grand Masters said.","At this moment, they were quietly looking ahead in the cosmic void outside the Dongruo Holy Land’s planet.","There were more than a hundred people in the space station next to them, including Immortal Master Wuluo, whose souls were still trapped in the flames, suffering from burning pain at all times.","Swoosh!","A little light lit up in the distance.","It was several spaceships.","Moreover, they were getting closer and closer.","“They’re here.”","Immortal Master Tianyi’s gaze sank slightly. “I’ll have to trouble you this time.”","“They really dare to come?”","Immortal Master Wumo snickered. “What a bunch of ignorant fools.”","They hoped that Zhang Han and the others would come, but now they mocked them for their arrival.","The spaceships slowly approached.","Zhang Han and the others went down from the middle.","The number of people on both sides was like a tree versus a forest.","However, in the heart of Immortal Master Lingxi, it was like a group of ants versus ancient demonic beasts.","There was indeed a huge gap between them.","“Han Yang Immortal has the Heavenly Tribulations of two famous attributes. He’s so powerful that no one in the whole Cultivation World may be a match for him. These average people at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage are too arrogant.”","Immortal Master Lingxi thought to herself.","Since ancient times, there had never been anyone who could face the Heavenly Tribulation head-on. If she had recorded what happened back then, it would likely leave behind a legend that would stun everyone who had lived in this world.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","After Zhang Han and the others appeared, many fleets immediately jumped into the secondary space and formed an encirclement, eyeing them covetously.","“Hahaha, you’re here?”","Immortal Master Wumo laughed wildly.","He was suppressed in the fragments of the secret realm. Only he knew how coincidental it was for him to come out alive.","“Go to hell!”","He slowly pulled out his long broadsword, and the fierce sword light slashed forward.","It blew up the entire space station behind him.","There were more than 100 cultivators from the Highest Clouds Palace above, and he wanted to kill them all.","He was going to kill Immortal Master Wuluo and the others in front of his enemies.","“Wuluo! Hanfeng...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven roared.","In his roar, the little white horse appeared. It also let out a cry and flew toward Immortal Master Waterheaven with a whoosh, bowing slightly.","Immortal Master Waterheaven rode the One-horned White Horse with his saber.","“Then let’s fight.”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly. Holding the Seven-star Sword in his hand, he was ready to kill."]},{"number":1703,"title":"Chapter 1703 Peerless in the World","paragraphs":["Chapter 1703 Peerless in the World","“Han Yang Immortal!”","Immortal Master Wumo held his broadsword in his right hand and approached step by step. He sneered and said, “Back then, you tried every means to trap me in the secret realm and schemed against me with despicable means. Your Highest Clouds Palace means nothing to me. Today, I shall take my revenge. I will personally refine your soul!”","The Grand Masters of the 40 Holy Lands flew forward one after another before Immortal Master Tianyi and the others could say anything.","They had dozens of people on their side, while only four of their opponents took action.","There was a huge disparity in numbers.","This gave Immortal Master Wumo tremendous confidence.","Although he had heard that Han Yang Immortal was very famous, which put some pressure on him, how could he allow his enemy to make trouble while so many Grand Masters were present?","“Don’t worry, Han Yang Immortal. I will kill you at last and let you see the group of people behind you die one by one under my broadsword!”","Immortal Master Wumo gnashed his teeth, and his eyes were full of anger. He wanted to take the lead in the charge and make the first strike, which represented the start of the battle.","Swoosh!","Huge sword radiance appeared above him.","Behind him, many people from the Dongruo Holy Land marveled.","“Uncle Wumo’s broadsword-using supernatural power has become much fiercer.”","“This is called the Deadly Broadsword. It’s a super supernatural power that Uncle Wumo learned after cultivating for a hundred years. At least 18 ninth-tier Tribulation Stage experts died under this broadsword.”","“This aura...”","The sword light was thousands of feet long, like a solid sword. It emitted a faint dim light, attracting people’s attention. It was as if one could observe the deep starry sky while looking at this sword light.","“No wonder it’s called the Deadly Broadsword.”","Several other Grand Masters nodded and said, “Wumo’s strength is almost the same as ours. In time, he can also become a Grand Master. With two Grand Masters, the Dongruo Holy Land will rise. Tianyi, congratulations.”","Immortal Master Tianyi laughed when he heard this. “Wumo is capable. It has nothing to do with me. I’m quite gratified to see how powerful he is.”","“With this strike, not only can we defeat Han Yang Immortal, but we can also make him panic. If it’s Immortal Master Waterheaven who blocks the attack, I guess its aura can directly kill him. If it’s Immortal Master Lingxi, she is also capable, and Wumo can also fight with her for a while.”","Some people were talking about it.","The Deadly Broadsword contained 50% of Immortal Master Wumo’s energy. He didn’t want to kill his enemies in one blow, because he knew that it was impossible. He wanted to seriously injure them and then begin to destroy them.","Swoosh!","The speed of Immortal Master Wumo was getting faster and faster.","Carrying the Deadly Broadsword Qi, he charged at his enemies.","For the sake of preventing any mishaps from occurring, Immortal Master Tianyi and the others sped up as well, and they didn’t intend to give their enemies any chance to escape.","However, something unexpected still happened.","Under everyone’s gaze, Zhang Han didn’t move at all. Immortal Master Waterheaven took out his broadsword and wanted to kill them, but he was no match for these Grand Masters. He was waiting for an opportunity to fight with the ninth-tier Immortal Masters. Yue Wuwei was about the same as him. As for Immortal Master Lingxi, she was not far from Zhang Han.","“Let’s see who can defeat more people.” Immortal Master Lingxi gave Zhang Han a provocative look.","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “Then you may be disappointed.”","Buzz!","Zhang Han suddenly burst out with extreme might.","His eyes shone brightly, and his terrifying momentum rose steadily.","“Hmm?”","Immortal Master Tianyi frowned slightly. “Judging from his aura, it seems that Han Yang Immortal is quite capable. Wumo, be careful.”","“Go to hell!”","Immortal Master Wumo moved his right hand forward, and the huge light of the Deadly Broadsword quickly fell.","Right at this moment-","Poof!","The eyes of Immortal Master Wumo suddenly widened.","He seemed to feel that his body was like a punctured balloon, and a lot of energy was constantly leaking out. Even his control of the Deadly Broadsword became unstable, causing the sword light to flash constantly.","“Hmm?”","He didn’t notice anything unusual.","However, what happened wasn’t within his expectations.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Someone patted him on the shoulder three times, and a faint voice came to his ears.","“Killing you will only take an instant.”","Hiss!","Immortal Master Wumo gasped. “What, what do you mean?”","He turned his head in confusion and saw the figure of the white-shirted Zhang Han. He also saw that there was a sword in his chest, the Seven-star Sword.","“When did that sword disappear?”","Immortal Master Wumo looked forward and saw that Zhang Han’s Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure was still standing in the same place, but he didn’t have the Seven-star Sword in his hand.","“How could it be?”","Swoosh!","The Deadly Broadsword light suddenly dissipated. Powerful energy turned into a gale and blew in all directions.","In the gale, Immortal Master Wumo’s body constantly disintegrated.","As for Zhang Han, his Extreme Purity Immortal Body was wearing a white shirt and his long hair was fluttering in the wind. Holding the Seven-star Sword in his hand, he stood in the starry sky and overlooked everything.","“Are you sure you’re ready before attacking the Highest Clouds Palace?","“Hahaha.","“It seems that the name of Han Yang Immortal is not enough to deter you villains. Or do you think that the divine thunder over the sky can greatly damage my strength?","“You all are too ignorant.”","Buzz!","The Great Demon Body appeared on the right side of the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","The Nine Suns Godly Body, the Golden-armored Giant Beast, and the Thunder Body appeared one after another.","The six bodies appeared at the same time.","“It’s so scary.”","Immortal Master Lingxi grinned and didn’t want to stay here any longer. She moved and said to the dozens of dumbfounded Grand Masters in front of her, “Guys, come to play with me.”","“Wumo died just like that?”","“How did he do it?”","“He did it silently. This body movement is too strange. We have to be careful.”","“We underestimated the strength of Han Yang Immortal.”","After the shock, the Grand Masters present became extremely serious.","Even they couldn’t perform such a skill. It could be imagined how difficult it would be for them to face it.","“Also, what kind of Replication Technique is that?”","Everyone was stunned.","“He even has an ancient demonic beast. What is this huge beast?”","They were concerned about the combat capability of Zhang Han.","As for Immortal Master Tianyi, his face was slightly pale, and the words of the dead people from the Highest Clouds Palace inexplicably came to his mind.","“Your Dongruo Holy Land can just wait. When the Second Elder of my sect returns, it will be the time for revenge!”","At this moment, Immortal Master Tianyi actually felt a trace of panic in his heart.","Even the crowd behind him was still in shock.","“Immortal Master Wumo died in a single exchange.”","“How could this be?”","Suddenly-","“Kill them!”","Zhang Han’s Extreme Purity Immortal Body raised the Seven-star Sword, and his figure disappeared again without a trace.","“Watch out!”","Immortal Master Tianyi and the other Grand Masters shouted one after another, launching various defensive and offensive supernatural powers.","“Shadow of Light!”","For the first time, the Nine Suns Godly Body showed his power. He clapped his hands to both sides, and the sun suddenly appeared behind him. The sun shone in all directions, and countless bodies could be vaguely seen in the light. Their movements were different as if they were displaying different supernatural powers, and the power was getting stronger and stronger.","“Thunder Domain!”","The Thunder Body showed its power. Huge thunderbolts turned into tens of millions of raindrops, swirling around him.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure launched all kinds of supernatural powers that could seal the void.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast roared and moved its huge body forward. It waved its claws, and several sharp blades that could cut through space quietly approached.","“Not good! His attacks are too powerful!”","“We’ve underestimated his strength far too much. We can’t defeat him. Retreat now!”","The faces of the 40 Grand Masters present changed drastically.","“He definitely has the strength of a top 10 magnate on the Seventh Mountain.”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Just one round of attacks was enough to make the 40 Grand Masters tremble with fear.","They kept defending, while the six bodies kept attacking.","They were the ones who were in a mess.","Zhang Han pressed forward step by step, while Immortal Master Lingxi watched the fun from the side. Her eyes were also filled with shock. “Zhang Hanyang is simply a freak.”","His super combat capability made his attacks like a great storm.","Immortal Master Tianyi and the others couldn’t bear the enormous pressure.","“Let’s go!”","Immortal Master Tianyi let out a furious roar.","They had never expected that Zhang Hanyang would be so powerful. If they had known earlier, they would have contacted more Holy Lands and would not have been forced to flee like this.","“We have to get the Pearl of Fate.”","“Let’s escape for the time being and find another magnate.”","Immortal Master Tianyi and the other two talked via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","On the surface, however, they yelled, “He won’t be able to last for long against such a strong attack. Everyone, let’s work together and kill him!”","An elder, whose face was covered with a red light, finally murmured and suddenly shouted.","“Soul Suppressing Skill!”","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","As if a breeze was blowing, Zhang Han’s Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure was attacked by a powerful incantation. The unknown energy was devouring the energy in his body.","“Hmm?”","Zhang Han looked at the old man who had made a move.","“I once killed two people at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage with the Soul Suppressing Skill. Han Yang Immortal, I advise you to leave now. Otherwise, all of you will die.”","What he said was enough to show his fear.","However, a strange scene appeared again.","“The incantation is not bad. Unfortunately, you chose the wrong target.”","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body suddenly appeared beside the old man. He raised the Seven-star Sword and stabbed out, leaving no time for the old man to react.","The old man died.","This was the first Grand Master of the 40 Holy Lands to die.","“Ah!”","The people beside him were so scared that their faces turned pale. They quickly retreated.","“What happened?”","“How did he appear here?”","“That’s impossible. There are hundreds of defenses. It’s impossible for him to come in silently.”","“Could... could that be an Immortal Technique? Heavens! That’s an Immortal Technique!”","Immortal Techniques were extremely strange and powerful supernatural powers. One must use special methods to defend against them. It was extremely difficult to learn them.","However, the duplication of Han Yang Immortal in front of those people had mastered an Immortal Technique.","The death of the first Grand Master really scared many people.","“Let’s go!”","They decided not to fight anymore. “Break through the blockade and leave. Damn it. Dongruo Holy Land, you told us that he has just reached the Peak Stage!”","Many hostile gazes turned to the Dongruo Holy Land.","It was simply unforgivable to start a war without knowing the enemy’s combat strength.","“You want to leave?”","The supernatural power unleashed by the Nine Suns Godly Body shone brightly in all directions. Countless figures were partly hidden and partly visible. Many kinds of supernatural powers struck out from the light, which were impossible for others to defend against.","Boom!","Another Grand Master was killed.","However, his soul was still there. Just as he was about to escape, a hand appeared in the light and suddenly crushed his soul.","Boom!","A punch appeared out of thin air. Even with their rigorous defense, they could not sense it in advance. Another Grand Master was hit in the back. He spat out a mouthful of blood and staggered.","“Go now!”","Fortunately, as a cultivator who practiced Body Cultivation, he was able to withstand the first punch. He was scared out of his wits and wanted to escape.","However, he failed to withstand the second punch.","Boom!","His Qi and blood overflowed, and he constantly cast powerful supernatural powers to attack his surroundings.","However, his supernatural powers could only wear down the attacks launched by the Thunder Body, the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, and the Golden-armored Giant Beast, and they could not resist the strange light of the Godly Body.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","After another three punches, the face of the Peak-Stage Body Cultivator turned pale.","“Han Yang Immortal!”","He seemed to want to beg for mercy, but at this time, a sword light flashed, and the Extreme Purity Immortal Body appeared like Death and killed him.","The third Grand Master had died.","At this time, those people realized that the killing moves were launched by the Extreme Purity Immortal Body and the Nine Suns Godly Body. The other four bodies were responsible for the main attack and entangling them.","Although they knew what was going on, they couldn’t defend against the attacks.","“Flee. Flee NOW!”","Many Grand Masters completely panicked.","They formed groups, forcefully breaking through the entanglement, and then quickly fled.","“You want to escape?”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body and the Nine Suns Godly Body began their slaughter.","The death of the fourth, the fifth, and more Grand Masters shocked everyone.","“Is he a devil?”","Countless disciples around were also stunned at this time.","“He can even kill the Grand Masters at will. What do we need to do?”","“Invincible!”","“Master is invincible!”","Mu Xue and the others subconsciously shouted.","Not far away, Immortal Master Lingxi looked at this scene and muttered to herself, “He’s really invincible.","“Zhang Hanyang is unparalleled in the world.”"]},{"number":1704,"title":"Chapter 1704 What Strange Body Movement","paragraphs":["Chapter 1704 What Strange Body Movement","“How could Zhang Hanyang be so powerful?”","Immortal Master Tianyi’s expression looked terribly gloomy.","He and his two old friends were also three people who coveted the Pearl of Fate. They had extraordinary strength. They broke through the blockade of Zhang Han and were the first to escape.","Of the dozens of Grand Masters behind them, only five were able to escape.","In just a quarter of an hour, 32 Grand Masters had died in the battle.","“He crushed them alone!”","“Han Yang Immortal killed 32 Grand Masters. How could it be possible?”","Swoosh!","The Nine Suns Godly Body and the Extreme Purity Immortal Body chased after those people at the same time.","The two Killing Gods had just killed so many Grand Masters with strange means. Although the survivors were quite far away, they were still terrified.","“Kill them!”","Zhang Han looked around at the teams of the Dongruo Holy Land with cold eyes. There were countless fleets. They thought they were safe, so they were not ready to escape yet. However, the spaceships had already begun to retreat.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast suddenly roared, and its sound waves spread in all directions. Its figure suddenly became erratic, and in the blink of an eye, it came in the direction of the enemy’s largest fleet. The horn on its head was shining with dazzling golden light.","Buzz!","In the cosmic space within a circumference of ten thousand miles, the space was vibrating.","“Alert. Unknown energy fluctuation detected.”","“The secondary space is unstable. We need 60 seconds to enter the secondary space.”","“The countdown begins. 60, 59...”","The alarms on these spaceships scared many teams out of their wits.","“What?!”","“Why can’t we get in?”","“Oh no, the ancient demonic beast is coming!”","Under countless people’s gazes, the tail of the Golden-armored Giant Beast swept across the fleet. As it was tens of thousands of feet tall, it dealt with the fleet easily. With a sweep of its tail, it smashed hundreds of king vessels.","Immortal Master Waterheaven and Yue Wuwei also found an opportunity. They all rushed over and used all their means to try to support Zhang Han.","Actually, the effect was limited. After all, there were too many people from the Dongruo Holy Land.","However, it was difficult for them to escape in 60 seconds.","“It’s too late, it’s too late!”","“Save me, Grand Master!”","“Grand Master has run away. Let’s run quickly and abandon the spaceship. Hurry up!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Countless disciples abandoned their spaceships and fled in all directions into the void.","Only by fleeing separately would they have a chance to survive.","“Behold the Pluto’s wrath... Heaven and Earth Curse. Pluto Wrath!”","Zhang Han’s Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure displayed the super-killing move of the Pluto Incantation.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","All the Qi, blood, and energy released by the fallen Dao Seeking Cultivators in the void continued to gather, getting stronger and stronger, and finally formed a superstorm.","The energy of the incantation began to spread.","Wherever the storm passed, it devoured the flesh and souls of countless Dao Seeking Cultivators.","Even if someone could resist it, they would be slowed down by the storm and become weaker and weaker. In a limited time, if they could escape from the storm, they might be able to survive. If they couldn’t, they would die.","“Formation! Assemble formation. We have tens of millions of elites. Why should we be afraid of him alone?”","Many generals roared.","As a result, the people around them soon assembled into a square formation of 500,000 people.","“Defense!”","The energy cover that defended against the incantation was set up to block the storm.","Seeing this, the others followed suit. There were more and more square formations, and they found a way to fight back.","However, on the side of the Grand Master of the Dongruo Holy Land, Immortal Master Tianyi.","“Why are they resisting instead of running away?”","When he saw the square formation moving toward Zhang Han, he was furious and wanted to remind those people.","But before he could say anything, the Golden-armored Giant Beast suddenly flew into the void and appeared above the 500,000-man army.","“Ow!”","The huge roar made everyone’s souls tremble.","With a wave of its claws, it cut through the group below like a sharp blade.","Screams rang out all around.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast started its merciless slaughter.","A Grand Master next to Immortal Master Tianyi said, “Why don’t you tell them to escape? That powerful man is at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. How can the Dongruo Holy Land compete with him? We can only defeat him by attacking him together.”","“Run! Run now!”","With a sullen face, Immortal Master Tianyi said those words to several elders behind him via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","They gave the order to retreat.","More than half of the Dao Seeking Cultivators from the Dongruo Holy Land had died.","“A magnate at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.”","“This is terrible!”","“Now that Han Yang Immortal is so powerful, we have no choice but to turn to another magnate of the Seventh Mountain for help.”","Grand Master Tianyi and the others didn’t even dare to start the spaceships. The Nine Suns Godly Body and the Extreme Purity Immortal Body were going after closely behind them. Only when they fled to a distance could they have a chance to leave.","Boom!","In the distance, many fleets burst into flames in the void. Zhang Han stood in the midst of the flying flames of war, his eyes fixed on the fleets.","Seeing this, Mu Xue trembled all over.","“Great Demon King. That’s it. Great Demon King. This is like what I saw back then.","“There were corpses everywhere. It turns out that the group of people who died at that time were all Tribulation Stage experts!","“Master has long been a Great Demon King!”","Back then, with the help of the spirit treasure and her little tricks, she accidentally saw a few scenes in Zhang Han’s memory, which had a great impact on her. She didn’t expect that she would see these scenes with her own eyes today.","Although the number of the ones who died today was not comparable to that of the previous scenes, it was enough to prove that there were not many people in the vast Star Sea who could make Zhang Han afraid.","“Zhang Hanyang.”","Immortal Master Lingxi reminded. “Those eight people are about to flee.”","“Yeah.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly and said, “They can’t escape. Let’s go.”","Tiny Tot flew out from the wrist of Zi Yan.","It was still in a daze.","Seeing so much soul energy around it, it began its devouring right away.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","After swallowing for two minutes, it smacked its lips.","Swoosh!","After everyone entered its Alternate Space, Tiny Tot directly broke into the secondary space.","Tiny Tot was now at the sixth-tier Tribulation Stage. It was no exaggeration to say that it was faster than a king vessel.","Dahei and Little Hei were both at the third tier of the Tribulation Stage. They had been devouring spirit treasures all year round, and they fell asleep in Mengmeng’s schoolbag when they went out.","It was the same with the Golden-winged Roc of Immortal Master Lingxi, which had followed her for decades. It had been sleeping since she came to Earth.","The crowd came to the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot.","Immortal Master Lingxi praised, “This Alternate Space is really big. No wonder it’s called the Ancient Cursed Roc.”","Noticing that the atmosphere was a little sullen, she didn’t continue.","Although Dongruo Holy Land was crushed and the revenge had been initially taken, they were not in a good mood. The Highest Clouds Palace was destroyed, and Immortal Master Wuluo and others died in front of them. Immortal Master Waterheaven was the saddest one among them.","Yue Wuwei was also a little sad.","Immortal Master Wuluo had a good relationship with him. Sometimes, they called each other Old Yue and Old Luo.","“Alas!”","Yue Wuwei sighed softly.","“Master, what should we do now?” Kong Ling’er asked.","“Let’s fight,” Zhang Han said in surprise. “Since the 40 Holy Lands have destroyed the Highest Clouds Palace, we’ll destroy them.”","“Tiny Tot, if you can defeat them, do it.” Zi Yan communicated with Tiny Tot with her mind.","“Coo.”","The Ancient Cursed Roc chased after the spaceships in front of it.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body and the Nine Suns Godly Body also dissipated and returned to Zhang Han’s Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","Just like that, one day, two days, and three days passed.","Tiny Tot kept attacking and using incantations and supernatural powers to affect the spaceships. However, the effect was not great, and the Grand Masters on the opposite side could easily defend themselves.","Therefore, Tiny Tot set its eyes on the spaceships.","It kept using the ability to destroy spaceships.","“Alert. Energy defense has been reduced to a dangerous level.”","There was still 50% of the energy left in the defensive layer. When it reached 30%, the spaceship would face a crisis.","“We have about five days left.”","“We’ll be able to reach the Haomu Holy Land in five days.”","The person next to Immortal Master Tianyi said, “We need to get out of the secondary space in advance and send out a message. Then, deploy people in the Haomu Holy Land to retreat while fighting. We’ll try our best to hold on until the third magnate comes.”","Two days later, their spaceship left the secondary space.","The message was sent out.","“Run!”","They were fleeing while preparing spaceships.","They knew very well that the power of one Holy Land could not stop Han Yang Immortal.","When they arrived at the Haomu Holy Land, they found that everyone there had left, leaving more than a dozen spaceships behind.","“Quick, let’s go!”","The eight Grand Masters hurriedly fled, boarded the spaceship, and entered the secondary space. Tiny Tot followed closely behind and rushed into the secondary space again.","Just like that, a pursuit began.","Every few days, those people would change spaceships.","However, they were flying in the secondary space, where their power didn’t cover all the places.","When they arrived at the transfer station-","Swoosh!","Before the spaceship broke into the secondary space, Tiny Tot appeared and bit the spaceship into pieces.","“Oh no, oh no!”","“Run now!”","Left with no choice, Immortal Master Tianyi and the others braced themselves and flew away.","“Go!”","Zhang Han controlled the Extreme Purity Immortal Body to chase after them. His Original Body and Tiny Tot entered the secondary space, but they were too close, so they couldn’t control the angle accurately. After they appeared, they were a little far away from Immortal Master Tianyi and the others.","“Hold on!”","“The people of the third magnate will be here soon!”","There was hope in the hearts of Immortal Master Tianyi and the others.","After fleeing for two days, they finally saw a fleet coming.","Immortal Master Tianyi called out, “Here! We’re here!”","He flew over quickly. Hundreds of people walked down from the fleet. Each of them had an extraordinary aura. With a glance, one could tell that more than a dozen of them were at the Last Stage of the ninth tier, and the rest were all at the Middle Stage.","“They’re Immortal Master Beiqing’s men.”","Immortal Master Lingxi’s expression changed slightly. “That guy’s strength is very strong, and he has mastered many supernatural powers. He’s the third magnate on the Seventh Mountain. During the previous battles, he easily annihilated more than a dozen cultivators at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.”","“I’ve never heard of him.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly, and everyone left the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot.","Before they could see those people, they heard the other party say, “Are you the remnants of the Highest Clouds Palace?”","“The 40 Holy Lands attacked the Highest Clouds Palace because you trapped Immortal Master Wumo first. There’s a reason for doing everything. What reason do you have for coming for revenge?”","“As the Third Elder of the Beiqing Holy Land, I order you to retreat immediately. Otherwise, if Immortal Master Beiqing targets you, you will have no way out!”","A white-haired old man from the Beiqing Holy Land had his hands clasped behind his back in a very arrogant posture.","He knew that something had happened to Dongruo Holy Land and the others. However, he was not afraid because first, he was far away from the opponents, and second, the fame of Immortal Master Beiqing was well-known.","“Watch out!”","Immortal Master Tianyi said hurriedly, “Don’t get close to them. Han Yang Immortal has a duplication. His body movement is strange and unpredictable! Let’s leave as soon as possible and ask Lord Beiqing to uphold justice.”","“What strange body movement?”","The leading old man frowned and became vigilant.","He had never expected that-","Bang! Bang! Bang!","He was patted three times on the shoulder.","Moreover, a faint voice sounded in his ear.","“What strange body movement did you say?”"]},{"number":1705,"title":"Chapter 1705 Unstoppable","paragraphs":["Chapter 1705 Unstoppable","The pupils of the old man leading the group contracted rapidly.","He had never expected that the body movement mentioned by Immortal Master Tianyi would be so weird that it was so incredible.","“I was too careless!”","The old man felt sad.","The next second, he felt that his consciousness began to dissipate.","He knew that even he regretted it, there was nothing he could do.","“If you dare to kill me, Immortal Master Beiqing won’t let you go! He won’t let you off!”","The old man roared with his last strength.","Then, his body dissipated.","Zhang Han fixed his eyes on the others in front of him.","“Crap, let’s go!”","Immortal Master Tianyi and the others had learned their lesson. As soon as they spoke, they quickly approached the spaceship.","“Where’s his duplication?”","Immortal Master Tianyi and the others entered the spaceship one after another.","At this time, the Extreme Purity Immortal Body had begun its slaughter, killing the reinforcements sent by the Beiqing Holy Land.","“We’re from the Beiqing Holy Land. Stop right now, or you’ll die.”","“Milord, please don’t attack! Please spare me!”","“I’m willing to serve you as my master.”","“Don’t kill me!”","Other than Immortal Master Tianyi and his companions that fled into the flying ship, the others in this group of a few hundred people were already unable to escape, and they kept shouting to beg for mercy as they were in a complete state of panic.","“Enter the secondary space!”","Immortal Master Tianyi and the others who entered the spaceship instantly became nervous.","Buzz!","The energy cabin of the spaceship began to operate.","But at this critical moment, the Nine Suns Godly Body appeared right in front of the spaceship. He threw a fierce punch, and a ball of light appeared in front of his fist.","Rumble!","The ball of light, which was only five meters in diameter, blew up the entire spaceship.","As the power surged, Immortal Master Tianyi and the others prepared to defend themselves and flee as soon as the spaceship exploded.","Their team consisted of not only eight Grand Masters but also dozens of people from the Beiqing Holy Land.","Someone from the Beiqing Holy Land questioned in a cold voice, “Didn’t you say that the strength of Han Yang Immortal has just reached the Peak Stage?”","“According to the message we just sent, Han Yang Immortal has the strength of the top ten magnates in the Seventh Mountain.”","“Damn it!”","The questioner said angrily, “Our elder didn’t tell us earlier, but our forces from the Beiqing Holy Land are coming. It’s the Dragon Killer Team.”","“That’s great!”","The expressions of Immortal Master Tianyi and the others shook, and they were filled with pleasant surprise.","The Dragon Killer Team was well-known all over the world. They were the most powerful team in the Beiqing Holy Land. The team consisted of a total of 500,000 people, and only eighth-tier cultivators and above could join them. It could be said that they were 500,000 experts.","This team had always liked to wander around the Barren Stars and fight with the ancient demonic beasts. They were the ones who captured the ancient demonic beasts for Immortal Master Beiqing. That was why they were called the Dragon Killer Team.","“You can’t escape.”","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body followed right behind with both hands behind his back. His speed was quite fast.","At this time, Zhang Han had already eliminated the team at the rear. Everyone was sitting in Tiny Tot’s Alternate Space, following behind. Looking at the scene outside, they couldn’t help sighing with emotion.","It seemed that after decades, Zhang Han would have no rivals in the Star Sea.","“Beiqing Holy Land has extraordinary strength.”","Immortal Master Lingxi said, “We need to defend against not only Immortal Master Beiqing but also his Dragon Killer Team. It’s a well-trained team. Most of its members are ninth-tier Dao Seeking Cultivators and have the strength to fight against the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage experts.”","Her tone was heavy. Obviously, she was very afraid of the Dragon Killer Team.","“They’ve mastered a lot of cooperative supernatural powers. In terms of square formation tactics, in the entire Star Sea, only the First Mountain and the Third Mountain can suppress them.”","Immortal Master Lingxi told everyone everything she knew.","“They have powerful square formations?”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly.","“Go!”","A golden light left the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot.","The golden light flashed and disappeared.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body and the Nine Suns Godly Body were still pursuing the enemies, and they were getting closer and closer.","“They’re about to catch up with us.”","“What should we do?”","“If he gets any closer, he will be able to perform that strange body movement.”","Wisps of cold sweat flowed down from the foreheads of Immortal Master Tianyi and the others.","They were all desperate. They kept taking out all kinds of Defense Treasures, which turned into layers of light, and then took out disposable offensive spirit treasures in order to buy more time.","Seconds later-","Swoosh!","When the Extreme Purity Immortal Body suddenly disappeared-","Clatter!","The hearts of Immortal Master Tianyi and the others skipped a beat.","The white-haired old man beside him suddenly turned around and said, “Han Yang Immortal, I also have a duplication. Although it only has the strength of a sixth-tier Tribulation Stage expert, you can’t kill me. Why don’t we make a deal? I’m Immortal Master Jinkong, and I am willing to swear that as long as you stop, we will all retreat. I won’t tell anyone about this. You know what I mean!”","They knew that if news of the Pearl of Fate were to spread, countless people would be attracted.","Perhaps all the Holy Lands would be alarmed. The Star Sea was so big. Even the Holy Lands of the Seventh Mountain combined were powerful. Moreover, they thought that Zhang Han could not defeat Immortal Master Beiqing.","However, he was about to arrive. In order to survive, they could only discuss it.","“That’s right, that’s right!” Immortal Master Tianyi said, gasping with excitement. “We can discuss this. Right now, only the three of us know about the Pearl of Fate. No one else knows!”","“Do you all think that I would care about that?”","Zhang Han’s Extreme Purity Immortal Body appeared near Immortal Master Jinkong. He casually cast three sealing supernatural powers, and the Nine Suns Godly Body appeared, which crushed Immortal Master Jinkong with one punch.","“WHAT?!”","Immortal Master Tianyi was scared silly. He moved even faster than the squad of the Beiqing Holy Land.","Just as Zhang Han was about to continue, a fleet of fleets appeared out of nowhere in front of him.","“They’re here.”","“Dragon Killer Team.”","The people of the Beiqing Holy Land said excitedly, “Hurry up and support us. Be careful of this man. His body movement is strange and unpredictable.”","The voices echoed in the void of the universe.","After all, those people were the Dragon Killer Team. They were well-trained.","In just 30 seconds, 500,000 people gathered into a formation.","“They’re really here.”","Immortal Master Lingxi said solemnly, “Be careful, Zhang Hanyang. Don’t fall into their trap.”","“Yes.”","Zhang Guangyou was also worried about what Immortal Master Lingxi said. He advised, “If it doesn’t work, we can retreat first. We’re not in a hurry and need to take a long view. Besides, Immortal Master Jinkong has a duplication. If the news is spread out, we’ll be in trouble.”","“It doesn’t matter.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “I’m at the ninth tier. Almost no Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage experts can scare me.”","Everyone was slightly stunned.","Immortal Master Lingxi heaved a sigh of relief. “Right, you were already so powerful at that time, and you’re even more formidable than before now. But it might take a very long time to take down the Dragon Killer Team’s square formation. If Immortal Master Beiqing comes personally, then he and the Dragon Killer Team would still be a threat to you.”","“Just wait and see.”","As Zhang Han said that, more of his thoughts were focused on the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","At this time, the Golden-armored Giant Beast was still hiding in the void, like a wolf staring at its prey.","“Hahaha, they’re here.”","Immortal Master Tianyi smiled with joy. “The Dragon Killer Formation is here, Han Yang Immortal. You can’t kill us!”","“Activate the defenses.”","The elder of the Beiqing Holy Land near Immortal Master Tianyi said, “Dragon Killer Formation. Defend quickly. Don’t give him any chance.”","“He’s just at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. How dare he fight against the Dragon Killer Formation?”","The captain of the Dragon Killer Formation was an old man. His status was second only to that of Immortal Master Beiqing in the Beiqing Holy Land. At this time, when he saw that an insignificant elder dared to give him an order, he couldn’t help but frown slightly.","There was no need for him to say anything else. The Dragon Killer Formation had already raised its defensive layer and was on guard against their surroundings.","“Captain Ling.”","The elder said, “The strength of Han Yang Immortal is also among the top ten magnates in the Seventh Mountain. Don’t be careless.”","“Is that so?”","The captain narrowed his eyes and said, “The top ten magnates are indeed capable, but it doesn’t matter. He will never dare to take the initiative to rush over. As long as the square formation isn’t hurt, we can wait for the Grand Master to come.”","“When will the Grand Master come?”","The elders breathed a sigh of relief. Only now did they realize that their clothes were drenched in sweat.","“In a few days.”","The captain replied, looking around at the Nine Suns Godly Body and the Extreme Purity Immortal Body in front of him, and said lightly, “Han Yang Immortal, since you have killed the people of our Beiqing Holy Land, you must give us an explanation. Today, before our Grand Master arrives, you may still be able to escape.”","Before he finished his words-","“Ow!”","A deafening roar shook the heavens and earth.","The ten-thousand-foot-tall Golden-armored Giant Beast suddenly appeared below the formation. Its horn shone with golden light. Accompanied by the ability to cut space, it bombarded the formation in a frenzy.","The Nine Suns Godly Body launched another supernatural power.","However, the Extreme Purity Immortal Body vanished.","The battle had begun.","“How dare he?”","The captain said angrily, “Defend! Kill the enemy! We have killed countless ancient demonic beasts. How dare he use that beast to attack us!”","The defensive energy shield blocked the attacks of the Golden-armored Giant Beast. Meanwhile, their powerful attacks landed on the back of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","It felt a little numb, which meant that the attack was very powerful, but it was useless. The Golden-armored Giant Beast lazily flew up. It was just like a barbaric collision.","“Retreat!”","The captain was also very capable. He led the square formation. When the Golden-armored Giant Beast came, they retreated, avoided it, and fought in the safest way.","But this was what they thought was safe.","The Great Demon Body quietly appeared behind him. Wisps of black mist swirled around the formation.","“Demon Angel!”","This was the fourth and most powerful supernatural power of the Great Demon Body.","Swoosh!","An enormous phenomenon appeared out of thin air.","The man had twelve black wings, a helmet, and a sword in his hand. The black clouds behind him churned like tribulation clouds.","Suddenly, he raised the sword in his hand, and it was like scattering beans into soldiers. The black clouds transformed into a myriad of devils that surged over.","“Prepare to defend and charge!”","The captain got serious.","But he had never expected that-","Boom! Boom! Boom!","In merely a single exchange, their first layer of defense had been shattered.","“What kind of combat strength is this?”","“Retreat!”","There was an ancient demonic beast below, and above them was an unknown supernatural power launched by the enemy, so they had no choice but to retreat.","“Come!”","The Nine Suns Godly Body launched another supernatural power, which shone brightly and accompanied his attack.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body appeared behind the formation.","Swoosh!","Hundreds of Immortal Technique duplications appeared in an instant. Furthermore, they all unleashed their supernatural powers.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast stopped defending and suddenly burst out with supernatural powers.","As a result, the Dragon Killer Formation was in a mess.","“Shit. The formation can’t hold on. Hurry up, defend with all your strength. Don’t retreat. Stay where you are and defend. What’s going on with Team 126? Don’t run, defend!”","“Captain, Captain, Team 126 is dead. We can’t hold on any longer.”","Hiss!","The captain staggered with a pale face. He knew very well that once the formation was breached, they would be doomed.","The Dragon Killer Formation was extremely powerful and sharp, and yet it was now breached.","“Who is he?”","The captain was shocked. “How could this be? He definitely has the strength of one of the top three magnates. Who asked us for support?!”","Seeing the murderous look on his face, Immortal Master Tianyi and the others were dumbfounded and did not dare to speak at all, for fear that they would be killed by the Dragon Killer Team before they were killed by Han Yang Immortal.","“Hold on, hold on. Immortal Master Beiqing will be here soon!”","Immortal Master Tianyi shouted loudly.","It seemed that his words had worked. In the distance, a black-winged roc appeared, which was also a Holy Beast of the same race as the Golden-winged Roc of Immortal Master Lingxi. But it had different abilities.","“He was actually able to defeat the Dragon Killer Team. He has some power.”","Immortal Master Beiqing looked indifferent. “Come on, let me see how powerful Han Yang Immortal is, who has summoned the divine thunder over the sky and is praised by others.”"]},{"number":1706,"title":"Chapter 1706 Suppressing All Enemies in the World","paragraphs":["Chapter 1706 Suppressing All Enemies in the World","Immortal Master Beiqing showed up in an imposing manner.","Seeing that the Dragon Killer Formation had been broken, he didn’t look flustered.","In his opinion, the failure of the Dragon Killer Formation did not mean that they were weak, but that the other party’s strength was aboveboard.","He could also break the Dragon Killer Formation, so he didn’t find what happened surprising.","However, to his surprise, Zhang Han completely ignored him. His four duplications were still bombarding the Dragon Killer Formation.","The members of the team died very quickly.","Immortal Master Beiqing didn’t expect that Zhang Han wouldn’t stop even when he arrived.","“Didn’t you hear what I said?”","Immortal Master Beiqing moved and rushed over.","The Black-winged Roc under him rushed toward the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","The corners of Immortal Master Lingxi’s mouth trembled slightly when she saw this scene. “Isn’t he courting death?”","The Golden-winged Roc had fought against the Golden-armored Giant Beast for such a long time that its wings hurt, but the beast was fine.","The strength of the Black-winged Roc and the Golden-winged Roc was almost the same. They were on the same level. How could the former defeat the Golden-armored Giant Beast?","When the Black-winged Roc approached-","“Ow!”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast suddenly roared, and the Giant Mouth Image appeared. Endless devouring power fixed the Black-winged Roc in the void.","Boom!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast smashed the Black-winged Roc into pieces with its claw.","“What?!”","The expression of Immortal Master Beiqing changed dramatically. “Black-wing! You actually killed it?”","He got defeated the moment he showed up.","Immortal Master Beiqing arrived on an ancient demonic beast with extraordinary momentum, but his mount died in an instant.","“What...”","Hidden within the Dragon Killer Formation, Immortal Master Tianyi was so terrified that he began to tremble.","It turned out that the golden Exotic Beast was so fierce.","Many people knew that the Black-winged Roc of Immortal Master Beiqing was also a fierce Exotic Beast.","However, it was killed by the giant golden beast’s claw strike.","Such a scene would only appear when there was a huge gap between the two opponents.","“The Black-winged Roc is dead.”","“Grand Master will definitely go crazy.”","The members of the Dragon Killer Team were secretly shocked. At the same time, the pressure on them was getting heavier and heavier, and the casualties were getting faster.","“Damn it!”","“How could he be so strong!”","“Even the Dragon Killer Team is unable to restrict him.”","Immortal Master Tianyi stared at Zhang Han’s duplications, gnashing his teeth.","He thought of what he had heard.","“Han Yang Immortal has summoned the divine thunder over the sky during his final Heavenly Tribulation. He was the most powerful talent and died in the end.”","“He’s not dead. Han Yang Immortal is back. Hahaha, just wait and see. The whole Star Sea will tremble.”","“You don’t know that in the past, Han Yang Immortal dominated the world, and few people in the Cultivation World could compete with him.”","“He is unbelievably rich and controls many resources alone.”","They had heard of Zhang Han’s fame before.","They were very clear about these legends, but what did that mean?","It was just a thing of the past. Many Grand Masters thought that it was heaven-defying enough for Zhang Han to resist the divine thunder over the sky and not die. If he wanted to restore his strength to his peak, it would not be possible.","However, now it seemed that it was possible.","“Damn it!”","Immortal Master Beiqing broke down for a few seconds. Then, he looked fiercely at the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“Your opponent is me.”","Sizzle!","A bolt of lightning flashed and descended not far from Immortal Master Beiqing.","The Thunder Body appeared.","“You’re courting death!”","With a gloomy face, Immortal Master Beiqing swooped down with a long spear in his hand.","“Cold Light Flash!”","Immortal Master Beiqing immediately launched his trump card, a supernatural power.","The spear radiance turned into countless beams of light, flashing over.","But the Thunder Body was too fast.","In the face of this move, Zhang Han chose to dodge. His Thunder Body turned into thousands of thunder threads and floated in the light beams of the long spear.","For a time, the attack of Immortal Master Beiqing did not affect the Thunder Body at all.","“Your supernatural power is good, but it’s useless.”","Immortal Master Beiqing grinned hideously, and then he suddenly roared furiously.","His voice turned into a huge wave, shaking the void. The white soft light caused countless thunderbolts to gather together.","“Hmm?”","Zhang Han was a little surprised.","He didn’t expect that Immortal Master Beiqing was indeed capable. The sound wave supernatural power just now could be called an Immortal Technique, which contained unknown energy.","“It’s a good move. If I met you a few years ago, I might have to avoid it for the time being, but now...”","Zhang Han gathered his Thunder Body again and turned it into a body. He drew circles with his hands and conjured up a powerful supernatural power of the Thunder Body, the Pattern of Yin and Yang.","As the thunderbolts gathered, they gradually gained attributes and became Elemental Energy Thunder.","The Pattern of Yin and Yang even contained the power of the qualitative tribulation thunder.","The world was shaking, and Immortal Master Beiqing felt as if he were going through his own tribulation.","“Thunder Control?”","Immortal Master Beiqing took out a cyan flag and waved it a few times.","The two were surrounded by cyan clouds.","There was a strong devouring power in the clouds that could devour thunderbolts.","As soon as the huge Pattern of Yin and Yang appeared, it maintained a scale of 3,000 feet. It was still condensing, but it was suppressed by the cyan clouds and could not continue to expand.","It was a Profound-grade treasure that could resist the Heavenly Tribulation.","For example, Yue Wuwei’s One Cloud could also escape from the Heavenly Tribulation, making it difficult for the Heavenly Tribulation to sense him.","As for the flag of Immortal Master Beiqing, it could also devour thunderbolts to assist him while he underwent his tribulations.","This kind of Profound-grade treasure was rare and precious.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The shockwaves from their battle were incomparably powerful.","The Dragon Killer Team below felt a sense of despair.","“Grand Master has been held up by him.”","“What should we do?”","“Grand Master, save us! Grand Master, we can’t hold on any longer.”","The number of members of the Dragon Killer Team was falling faster and faster.","At first, Zhang Han had to use many supernatural powers to breach the Dragon Killer Formation, which showed that its combat capability was very strong. But once the formation was broken, its power and defensive power would be sharply reduced. At this time, it had collapsed, and the number of people falling was getting faster and faster.","“We’re doomed.”","The face of Immortal Master Tianyi was ashen, and he was completely dumbfounded.","“Immortal Master Beiqing, Immortal Master Beiqing can’t even kill a duplication of Han Yang Immortal. He can’t stop Han Yang Immortal...”","His eyes were dull as he watched Zhang Han and his other duplications display their divine power.","“Why? I shouldn’t have provoked him. I shouldn’t have.”","All kinds of roars sounded in the Dragon Killer Formation.","The flames of war raged.","“Han Yang Immortal, are you planning to make an enemy of me?” Immortal Master Beiqing was so angry that his face turned livid. He had used many means, but Han Yang Immortal could always avoid them.","“If you want to kill me, I swear that as long as you, Han Yang Immortal, establish a force, I will destroy it!!","Immortal Master Beiqing shouted angrily.","In fact, there were quite a few Grand Masters in the Nine Mountains Region and the Star Sea who held grudges against each other. It wasn’t that they didn’t want to fight, but rather that there was no way to kill their opponents in one blow. If they attacked and had their Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage opponents escape, it would lead to endless trouble.","There were some planets in every Holy Land. Those Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage experts who had escaped would make trouble every now and then.","Therefore, there were not many wars in the Nine Mountains Region, but private battles.","Generally speaking, when Immortal Master Beiqing shouted like this, the other party might stop.","However, it was just a possibility.","“Ha...”","Zhang Han suddenly chuckled and said, “The Highest Clouds Palace has been destroyed. Do you still want to threaten me with your sect?”","Immortal Master Beiqing had a stiff look on his face. “What does the Highest Clouds Palace have to do with me? I just want you to leave. If you continue to stop me, you and I will be mortal enemies.”","Hearing this, Zhang Han said indifferently, “You may have misunderstood something.”","“Hmm?”","Immortal Master Beiqing looked at him coldly as he made his moves.","Zhang Han said flatly, “Do you think you can leave this place?”","Clatter!","The eyes of Immortal Master Beiqing narrowed slightly as she sensed the presence of the Dragon Killer Team.","The ancient demonic beast had killed the Black-winged Roc in an instant. Its strength was also at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. There were also a few people there.","“Wait!","“Why are those people exactly the same as Han Yang Immortal in front of me?","“Is it the Replication Technique? “Impossible!”","Immortal Master Beiqing was slightly shocked, but as the third magnate, he was powerful and confident. He rushed over with a spear in one hand. “I don’t care what tricks you play. The feud between you and me is irreconcilable!”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The two of them fought again.","This time, the attack of Immortal Master Beiqing was more powerful, like an overwhelming tsunami.","He was also paying attention to the Dragon Killer Team. Obviously, the team could no longer be saved, but the ones who were besieging the team were what Immortal Master Beiqing focused on.","“Ah!”","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body suddenly appeared beside Immortal Master Tianyi and the others.","After several palm strikes, every single one of them suffered serious injuries.","“No, no, no, Han Yang Immortal, I...”","Immortal Master Tianyi and the others were completely panicked.","Zhang Han sneered and waved his right hand. With the Shadow Displacement Transposition, he brought those people to the back.","“Palace Master, these people...”","Zhang Han said to Immortal Master Waterheaven, “You can kill them.”","“Don’t kill me. I know a lot of secrets in the Cultivation World. I can tell you. I also know a lot of secret places and spirit treasures.”","Poof!","Before the Grand Master could finish his words, Immortal Master Waterheaven’s eyes turned red, and he killed him with one strike.","“All of you deserve to die!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven roared as he continuously struck out with his sword.","As for Zhang Han’s Extreme Purity Immortal Body, he had targeted Immortal Master Beiqing.","“There’s no need to say anything. Even Immortal Master Beiqing is no match for you.”","Immortal Master Lingxi let out a long sigh.","She felt a little stressed. She couldn’t figure out why Zhang Han was so horrifying.","Swoosh!","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body vanished.","At the same time, the Nine Suns Godly Body also left the battlefield, and the Golden-armored Giant Beast and the Great Demon Body were responsible for the final slaughter of the Dragon Killer Team.","“Shit!”","Immortal Master Beiqing narrowed his eyes slightly and became more and more shocked as the fight went on.","However, the shock was yet to come.","“There will be plenty of time in the future. We...”","Immortal Master Beiqing was about to retreat when he saw the Extreme Purity Immortal Body disappear in the distance.","But the next second, a voice appeared behind him.","“I told you, you can’t leave.”","The pupils of Immortal Master Beiqing shrank. “He has crossed such a long distance. Did he teleport?”","“I want to leave, and you can’t keep me!”","“You can’t leave.”","The Nine Suns Godly Body arrived, and he used his supernatural power of brilliance to completely cover the surrounding area.","It was Imprisonment with one strike.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure held the Yin-Yang Brush and outlined a supernatural power.","“As the third magnate of the Seventh Mountain, you are more inferior than I imagined. Compared with the previous third magnate, you are much weaker.” Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","“The previous third magnate...”","“Do you mean Immortal Master Wufeng?”","The face of Immortal Master Beiqing changed. Immortal Master Wufeng was just like his name implied. He was powerful and famous all over the world. He was very famous in the Nine Mountains Region. Immortal Master Beiqing considered himself a talent, but he was indeed no match for Immortal Master Wufeng.","“Immortal Master Wufeng is indeed very strong, but you’re not him. There are countless mighty figures in the world, and what you’ve seen is only the surface. There is always someone better than you. Even an expert like Immortal Master had encountered an unknown enemy in the secret realm and died miserably. Who do you think you are? Do you want to trap me with this little supernatural power of yours? Dream on!”","Immortal Master Beiqing sneered, and his supernatural power appeared.","The darkness devoured the light at a very fast speed. It seemed that he would escape in five seconds.","But at this moment, Zhang Han sighed leisurely.","“I killed Wufeng.”","Clatter!","The black light shot by Immortal Master Beiqing suddenly trembled, which was enough to show his horror.","“What? You! That’s impossible!”","Zhang Han did not answer.","The Nine Suns Godly Body quickly approached and raised his huge fist.","There were countless supernatural powers of the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure. The Extreme Purity Immortal Body was weird and unpredictable, and the Thunder Body could produce terrifying thunderbolts.","Under everyone’s gaze-","Boom! Boom! Boom!","At first, Immortal Master Beiqing could block those attacks. But five minutes later, he began to show signs of decline. Half an hour later, he became exhausted and became the target of the beating.","He was like a small boat in the sea floating with the waves. In the face of the huge waves, it was gradually unable to resist.","“Immortal Master Beiqing is dead.”","Immortal Master Lingxi took a deep breath and said, “Zhang Hanyang is too horrible. He has suppressed all the enemies in the world. He is really invincible in the Star Sea.”"]},{"number":1707,"title":"Chapter 1707 Grand Master Tongtian","paragraphs":["Chapter 1707 Grand Master Tongtian","There were simple furnishings inside a sealed cultivator’s abode of the Manhong Holy Land, with only a table, a chair, and a cattail cushion.","An elder in gray was sitting cross-legged on the cattail cushion. All the things were covered with dust everywhere. It seemed that no one had been here for many years.","The elder seemed to have passed away in meditation, completely silent.","Hiss!","The elder took a deep breath, and his chest heaved up and down. He suddenly opened his eyes. His breath was weak, but his voice was full of resentment.","“How dare you kill me, Han Yang Immortal? How dare you! I, Immortal Master Jinkong, swear that you will be doomed eternally!”","“You have the Pearl of Fate. If you don’t hand it over, you will be the enemy of the entire Star Sea!”","“Go to the first mountain and find the Grand Master Tongtian. This news will make me enter the Tongtian Holy Land.”","Originally, he was at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. But now, he was in the sixth-tier Tribulation Stage. It would be difficult for him to return to the Peak Stage.","Fortunately, at the very least, this precious duplication had been used. As long as he didn’t die, he would have a chance to start over.","Boom!","After leaving the cultivator’s abode, Immortal Master Jinkong immediately went to the secret place. It was his private palace. He got a lot of cultivation resources left behind, took the spaceship, and went to the first mountain.","At the same time, the news that Han Yang Immortal had come back and killed 40 Grand Masters spread in the seventh mountain.","“Really? Has Han Yang Immortal killed 40 Grand Masters?”","“This is Highest Clouds Palace’s revenge.”","“Look! I said they attacked a force having a person at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage rashly and didn’t defeat all its people, there would be endless troubles in the future. I thought Han Yang Immortal would attack the planets of those Holy Lands. I didn’t expect he would kill so many Grand Masters. Will he become another magnate on the seventh mountain?”","While they were talking about it, another piece of news came.","“The Grand Master of the Dongruo Holy Land escaped and sent a message to the third magnate, Immortal Master Beiqing, for help.”","“Dragon Killer Team, go reinforce them.”","“With the Dragon Killer Team there, maybe Han Yang Immortal will retreat.”","Moments later, a piece of news spread.","“The Dragon Killer Team was wiped out, and Immortal Master Beiqing personally came personally. In the end, Immortal Master Beiqing also died.”","Hiss!","Countless people who heard the news gasped.","“Even the third magnate is no match for Han Yang Immortal.”","Like Immortal Master Tianyi, they also recalled the legends about Han Yang Immortal.","The Holy Lands of the top ten magnates were also shocked when they heard the news.","“Has Immortal Master Beiqing died?”","“Hurry up and inform everyone that don’t offend Han Yang Immortal at this critical moment.”","“The Highest Clouds Palace has been destroyed. Han Yang Immortal is going to take revenge. Be careful recently.”","Sure enough, it was as the crowd had anticipated.","A series of counterattacks were launched.","On a planet with rich resources in the Dongruo Holy Land, a Golden-armored Giant Beast, tens of thousands of meters tall, appeared and attacked the surface of the planet.","None of the guards on the ground could withstand it.","“It was destroyed!”","“All the planets of the Dongruo Holy Land have been attacked.”","“Many people from the Holy Land escaped. They don’t dare to return to their own territory. After leaving the seventh mountain, they won’t dare to take half a step back in the future.”","“The Lengfeng Holy Land was attacked.”","“The Futushan Holy Land has also been attacked.”","“The people of the forty Holy Lands are fleeing. They can’t be a match for the other party at all.”","“Some survivors of the Highest Clouds Palace have regathered. They are currently under the leadership of Immortal Master Waterheaven to intercept and kill the members of the forty Holy Lands.”","“It’s not only about the forty Holy Lands but forty-one. The Beiqing Holy Land has also been attacked. The seventh mountain is about to change.”","The entire seventh mountain, including the first-rate forces, the super sects, and the first magnate’s Holy Land, were focused on this matter.","In only a few months, all the territories of the forty-one Holy Lands had been destroyed.","“Is Han Yang Immortal invincible on the seventh mountain now?”","“Since ancient times, there have been world-shocking experts several times. In the past 10,000 years, only Han Yang Immortal has summoned divine thunder over the sky. With the recognition of the Heavenly Tribulation, he is qualified to be the strongest cultivator in 10,000 years.”","Many Grand Masters of the Holy Lands were discussing it.","“We speculated that since he was able to withstand the divine thunder over the sky and survive, his strength must have been greatly damaged, and it would be difficult for him to recover to his Peak Stage. But now, it seems that he is already at the Peak Stage. Except for the few Holy Lands on the first mountain, the second mountain, and the third mountain, the other experts in the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage are no match for him.”","“He may be one of the top five super masters among those at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. We can’t afford to offend him at all.”","Nine months later, the seventh mountain returned to peace and ended with the destruction of the 41 Holy Lands.","The few planets of the Highest Clouds Palace regained their vitality, and many disciples who had escaped in the past came here to gather.","Immortal Master Waterheaven no longer planned to develop his force. With a few planets, he only wanted to establish a Holy Land.","“How about establishing a new Holy Land?”","One day, Immortal Master Waterheaven came to find Zhang Han and said, “I don’t intend to establish the Highest Clouds Palace. I want it to be a new Holy Land. You can be the Grand Master, and I can be an elder. We can raise Exotic Beasts and enjoy the rest of our life.”","However, Zhang Han shook his head and said, “There’s no need. Let’s rebuild the Highest Clouds Palace.”","“Okay.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled wryly.","Just as he was about to leave, several flying ships quickly flew over from the sky.","“Sect Leader, bad news. There are many fleets outside. There are more than a million flying ships. They have surrounded us.”","“What?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was alarmed. “Which force are they from?”","“It’s the Tongtian Holy Land of the first mountain!”","After receiving the news, Immortal Master Waterheaven’s face became a little dark, “Tongtian Holy Land is the first magnate’s Holy Land in the first mountain. What are they doing here?”","“The Tongtian Holy Land?”","Not far away, Immortal Master Lingxi flew over in an instant, and her face was a little pale. “Oh no! The Tongtian Holy Land has around a hundred thousand years of martial arts heritage of predecessors. It is said that the Grand Master Tongtian has lived for more than fifty thousand years. His strength is terrible.”","Even Zhang Han had heard of the Tongtian Holy Land. It was indeed a very mysterious and powerful Holy Land.","Although it was a Holy Land on the first mountain, it was located in a precious and eternal secret realm, just like the worldlet. No one knew where it was, but they could occasionally see disciples from the first Holy Land to gain experience.","At this time, Tongtian Holy Land took action and sent a million spaceships flying in the sky.","“They’ve come with ill intentions.”","Zhang Mu and the others came from not far away.","Everyone gathered together again.","“We’ll know what they want after we ask them.” Zhang Han said calmly.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","They took the flying ships and arrived in the void of the universe.","It could be seen that the area around the Highest Clouds Star was filled with fleets. They were evenly distributed. In front of each fleet, there were many square arrays as if there was going to be a big battle.","“Who is Han Yang Immortal?”","Seeing Zhang Han and the others, an elder in white at the front of the team said, “I’m Elder Mu Hai of the Tongtian Holy Land.”","“What’s the matter?” Zhang Han asked.","“Our Grand Master from the Holy Land has invited Han Yang Immortal and the others there. He has something to ask you,” Elder Mu Hai said flatly. “Come with me. Don’t waste my time.”","Zhang Han suddenly smiled, looked straight at him, and shook his head. “If he wants to see me, let him come in person.”","“What?” Elder Mu Hai frowned and said, “Han Yang Immortal, although your strength is not low, many Dao Seeking Cultivators can kill you. Don’t refuse a toast only to be forced to drink a forfeit. I said those words because I wanted to give you a face. To be more realistic, I’m here to catch you. How dare you refuse?”","Sure enough, they did not come with good intentions.","“To put it bluntly, the Tongtian Holy Land is very powerful. To be more realistic, I don’t even know if your Grand Master is dead or alive. If he wants to see me, let him come in person.”","After Zhang Han finished speaking, he led the team away without looking back.","At the same time, a golden light flashed past.","“Humph.”","Elder Mu Hai coldly snorted and waved his hand to give the order to attack.","He was also an expert at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage, so he thought he was not afraid of the other party.","Countless square arrays and fleets burst into light at the same time, about to blow up the Highest Clouds Star.","At this moment, a huge Golden-armored Giant Beast appeared.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast and the people from the Tongtian Holy Land fought back and forth.","In the end, the Golden-armored Giant Beast didn’t attack much, allowing the enemy’s attacks to land on its body.","“Why is the defense of this ancient demonic beast so strong?”","They went back to the surface of the planet.","“They fight again. Should we leave?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven said worriedly, “If they can’t defeat us, they will invite Grand Master Tongtian.”","“If we kill them, we’ll be invincible in the Star Sea,” Zhang Han said flatly.","He meant he would be invincible and there would be no enemies in the Star Sea.","“Daddy.”","Mengmeng walked to his side and asked in a low voice, “Have you finished cultivating the powerful incantation?”","“Almost.” Zhang Han smiled and said, “When Grand Master Tongtian comes, I should have finished cultivating it.”","“Okay. I’ll be relieved.” Mengmeng pouted and walked away with Yue Xiaonao and the others.","After a while, Zhang Han and Zi Yan came to the practice room. Zi Yan bit her lower lip and said, “The Tongtian Holy Land is here. Will there be any other Holy Land after this?”","“There should be no.” Zhang Han sighed softly. “There aren’t many wars in the Nine Mountains Region, and I suspect that the Tongtian Holy Land has learned something.”","“You should comprehend it first. Let’s do Pair Cultivation for a while longer in the evening,” Zi Yan said slowly.","Their Pair Cultivation not only improved the integration between the six duplications of Zhang Han but also enabled Zi Yan to control her energy at will.","In fact, Zi Yan was already the second one to reach the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage in the team.","The flames of war raged outside the planet just like that.","The war lasted for ten months.","Immortal Master Mu Hai was numb from the fight. “What kind of ancient demonic beast is this? It’s too powerful. It seems that only when our Grand Master is here can we kill this golden beast.”","Finally, Grand Master Tongtian arrived.","Grand Master Tongtian came with a huge black spaceship.","He was five meters tall. From his appearance, he looked like a handsome man. His eagle-like eyebrows reached his temples, and his eyes were as deep as the sea. When he stood there, the sun, the moon, and the Galaxy paled in comparison. He looked like the ruler of the whole world, overlooking the Highest Clouds Star.","“Han Yang Immortal, you let me come here, and I’m here.” Grand Master Tongtian’s indifferent voice spread throughout the entire Highest Clouds Star.","“Get straight to the point.”","After Zi Yan and the others entered the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot, Zhang Han appeared in the void of the universe alone.","Grand Master Tongtian knew countless means. Zhang Han was also afraid of his sudden attack. He was not afraid of him, but others were. Therefore, they could only hide in the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot.","“Han Yang Immortal, you are also a super strong man.”","Grand Master Tongtian said, “In the past 50,000 years, I’ve only seen two people like you. They successfully went to the world of immortals. With your personal strength, you will also succeed. I’m surrounded by the rules of the Great Domain. Normally, I can’t summon the final Heavenly Tribulation. Leave the Pearl of Fate to me.”","As expected, he was here for the Pearl of Fate!","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly.","When he got the Pearl of Fate, it shattered and was absorbed by the Heavenly Pearl. Now, the energy of the Heavenly Pearl had turned into a lot of energy and helped Mengmeng build a Fire Spirit Body.","How could he give the other party the thing that had disappeared?","“What if I say the Pearl of Fate is gone?” Zhang Han said calmly.","“That’s a pity.” Grand Master Tongtian sighed softly. “I came here to get what I wanted. What’s the point of your living if I can’t get what I want?”"]},{"number":1708,"title":"Chapter 1708 Invincible","paragraphs":["Chapter 1708 Invincible","“Then let’s take action.” Zhang Han nodded.","Zhang Han had a cold look in his eyes.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The Great Demon’s Figure, the Thunder Body, the Extreme Purity Immortal Body, and the Nine Suns Godly Body appeared.","His four duplications appeared in the void of the universe. His Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure flashed back to the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot and watched from a distance.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast was still staring at the attacks of the other enemies.","Grand Master Tongtian’s mighty body moved and pressed forward with monstrous power.","With just one look, he seemed to have experienced the vicissitudes of life. Endless pressure pervaded the air. An unknown attack was about to descend.","Grand Master Tongtian had a lot of trump cards. Even Zhang Han hadn’t seen many of them in the past.","Even so, Zhang Han could dominate the world with his strong talent.","Zhang Han’s four duplications began to defend himself.","The Nine Suns Godly Body emitted a bright light, and the Extreme Purity Immortal Body continuously flickered. The Thunder Body was fearless. The Great Demon’s Figure had a natural dignity. He looked at Grand Master Tongtian with an expression of attacking head-on.","Every duplication of Zhang Han had a very different temperament.","Under the gaze of Zi Yan and the others, the tens of thousands of disciples of the Tongtian Holy Land, many shocked Holy Lands and super sects on the seventh mountain in the distance who had rushed over not long ago after hearing the news, Han Yang Immortal and Grand Master Tongtian started an unprecedented collision.","One of the two was Grand Master Tongtian. He levitated in the void and seemed to be able to suppress everything in the world and had a great spirit.","The other one was the newly rising Han Yang Immortal. He had killed Immortal Master Beiqing with one hand. He was also a magnate.","The battle between the two caused everyone present to involuntarily hold their breaths.","Grand Master Tongtian pressed forward.","Zhang Han’s four duplications remained motionless.","The void around them was silent.","Boom!","Suddenly, a huge muffled sound rang out in the void between the two of them. The space around them was shattered, and huge space cracks appeared one after another.","“They are so cruel.”","Except for the destroyed Beiqing Holy Land, all the other top ten Holy Lands on the seventh mountain had also arrived.","They had been paying close attention to the Highest Clouds Palace before. After all, it was the new king of the seventh mountain. When the people of the Tongtian Holy Land from the first mountain came, they were shocked.","Although the mountains in the Nine Mountains Region were similar. The region of the first mountain was the domain that the Dao Seeking Cultivators of the Human Clan had first developed. There were countless secret places in it, and the ancient martial arts heritage of predecessors there was the most abundant. Therefore, in terms of comprehensive strength, the first three mountains were much stronger than the later ones.","The Tongtian Holy Land was the number one magnate Holy Land in the region of the first mountain. Their presence was not something that the seventh mountain’s Holy Lands could inquire about.","“Their auras are super strong. This is the real Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. When they reach the Peak-Stage Realm, they can break through the void and open the Heaven Road to the world of immortals!”","The eyes of countless Grand Masters were filled with envy.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The space in the domain between the two continued to collapse.","Thirty seconds later, Zhang Han’s four duplications began to retreat.","“He does have some strength.”","Zhang Han said with his Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","“You are also a good young man I have seen,” Grand Master Tongtian said lightly. “But I, Tongtian, only give people one chance to do things. Since you refused just now, you can only go die.”","After saying that, Grand Master Tongtian sighed softly, seeming to be a little emotional.","At the same time, the pressure around him became higher.","There was a faint vision behind him. It seemed to be a super tornado, constantly rotating.","The power of supernatural power!","At that moment, the people from the Tongtian Holy Land had stopped their attacks on the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast didn’t intend to participate in the battle. It quietly levitated to the side.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","From a distance, it could be seen that Zhang Han was slowly retreating.","In fact, he had retreated dozens of kilometers per second. However, this distance was too short in the vast starry sky.","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “A few years ago, I couldn’t do anything to you, and I might even run away. But now, I’ll let you feel it.”","The four duplications suddenly smiled evilly.","Buzz!","The four bodies emitted light at the same time. The Extreme Purity Immortal Body was green, the Nine Suns Godly Body was white, the Great Demon’s Figure was black, and the Thunder Body was dark blue.","Surrounded by four kinds of light, an extraordinary aura spread out.","The light swirled extremely fast and turned into nothingness.","His four duplications became illusory. He could feel that his four duplications seemed to have merged into one.","This was not a real fusion but the benefit of Pair Cultivation that he often made with Zi Yan in recent years.","They were closely related. Zhang Han could finally use a supernatural power similar to that after the Integration.","“Blood Killing Curse!”","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body made a magic signet with both hands as if practicing Grand Terminus. The Thunder Body and the Nine Suns Godly Body stood still and produced energy.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","It was like a breeze blowing.","Grand Master Tongtian raised his right hand and suddenly found that the Qi and blood on his right finger were being stolen.","“Is this a supernatural power of incantations?”","Grand Master Tongtian was extremely calm. He casually launched three kinds of supernatural power of incantations against the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","“Corrosion!”","“Soul Extermination.”","“Endless Wind.”","The three incantations merged together and descended upon the area around the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body had no defense at all.","When the incantations arrived, the Extreme Purity Immortal Body turned into a mist and dissipated with the wind.","“No power?” Grand Master Tongtian shook his head slightly with disdain in his eyes. “You’re too young. How dare you make an incantation in front of me? I thought you would perform some special means, but I didn’t expect... Huh?”","As he spoke, he couldn’t continue.","Grand Master Tongtian narrowed his eyes.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body, which had just been destroyed by him, reappeared. The other party’s curse didn’t disappear. Qi, blood, and energy in his fingers were quickly devoured.","“It appeared again.”","After the people from the Tongtian Holy Land saw this, their voices sounded in all directions.","“Han Yang Immortal should be proud to have withstood a blow from the Grand Master and not die.”","“The strength of Han Yang Immortal is quite strong, but he shouldn’t have refused. The words of the Grand Master are the decree. How can he refuse?”","Even many onlookers on the seventh mountain in the distance shook their heads.","“It seems that the legend of Han Yang Immortal will come to an end.”","“It’s useless to defend blindly.”","“It’s good enough that he can escape from Grand Master Tongtian. How dare he try to resist?”","Under everyone’s gaze, Grand Master Tongtian kept pressing forward. Zhang Han’s four duplications steadily retreated.","Swoosh!","Grand Master Tongtian’s right index finger was a little numb. He waved his arm, and streaks of golden light appeared. The light turned into a giant palm and smashed the four duplications of Zhang Han from top to bottom.","“He’s dead.”","“The battle is over.”","The people from the Tongtian Holy Land were about to shout to celebrate the victory of their Grand Master.","However, the next second, the four figures condensed again, and the Blood Killing Curse still functioned.","“Oh?”","Grand Master Tongtian was a little surprised. “Your vitality is tenacious, but it’s not enough. You’ll die if I kill your Source.”","Buzz!","The eyes of Grand Master Tongtian turned red.","It covered the sky and destroyed all the Source Energy.","This kind of supernatural power was rare, but it was just a piece of cake for Grand Master Tongtian.","The four duplications dissipated.","After it was peaceful for twenty seconds, an elder began to celebrate.","“Grand Master, Congratulations on killing the enemy!”","But Grand Master Tongtian looked at his right hand in confusion.","Just now, only his index finger was numb. But now, half of his palm was numb.","The incantation didn’t disappear, but he couldn’t feel it.","“What a strange attack!” Grand Master Tongtian murmured.","The next moment, his pupils contracted slightly.","Those four figures appeared again. Furthermore, their movements were the same as before.","“What is this?” Grand Master Tongtian asked curiously.","Countless people gasped in the starry sky.","“Are you still alive?”","Zhang Han’s Great Demon’s Figure said indifferently, “It’s a way to kill you.”","“No supernatural power can revive you countless times.”","Grand Master Tongtian suddenly laughed.","The sound turned into waves and destroyed the four duplications again.","Swoosh!","The duplications appeared again.","A diamond bracelet appeared in the hands of Grand Master Tongtian. After he threw it out, it expanded to thousands of meters long. The huge suppressive force made the space tremble violently and Zhang Han retreat slower.","Grand Master Tongtian kept approaching, and his whole right hand was numb at this time.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","On the way here, the Grand Master Tongtian made five hundred and thirty moves.","Each one of them was a powerful supernatural power. He hadn’t used any skill repeatedly yet, which made everyone around trembling with fear.","In this case, Zhang Han’s duplications gathered again as if they couldn’t be killed at all.","“You can’t revive forever!”","Grand Master Tongtian was surprised and moved faster and faster.","As he got closer, he used more moves and destroyed the duplications with his fists and feet.","However, it was useless. After being destroyed, these duplications would revive.","Boom!","The right arm of Grand Master Tongtian became numb. It affected part of his combat capability.","His eyes were filled with shock. “What kind of skill is this?”","“I have told you before. It’s a way to kill you.”","The Great Demon’s Figure said, “You still have three breaths of time to attack.”","“Okay.”","Grand Master Tongtian was calm and continued to attack. He had tried almost all the methods he could think of.","However, they were useless. He had launched about 1,500 supernatural power attacks in total.","After three breaths of time, Grand Master Tongtian’s Qi and blood were reversed, and he felt numb all over.","He stopped attacking and became a bit stupefied.","“Such incantation is incredible. Han Yang Immortal, you are so strong. You even have the ability to kill me.”","Grand Master Tongtian sighed deeply, “But I have countless life-saving means, and you still can’t kill me completely.”","“Perhaps the next time we meet, it will be the time for me to kill you.”","The Nine Suns Godly Body suddenly opened its eyes and said indifferently, “Today, I will take three drops of your blood essence. When I am able to trace back to the Source in the future, you will die.”","When his six duplications could resonate with each other and cast the Blood Killing Curse at the same time. No matter how powerful he was, he would die.","“Ha...”","Grand Master Tongtian laughed wildly, “Good. I wonder what method you will use to take my blood essence?”","Soon, he stopped laughing.","Under his gaze, the Nine Suns Godly Body raised its right hand and suddenly snapped its fingers.","Clang!","With a crisp sound, a drop of blood essence the size of a fingernail suddenly appeared on his chest.","“What?”","“How is this possible?”","Grand Master Tongtian’s face turned pale with horror.","How could the blood essence condense in his body?","Then the second drop and the third drop condensed.","“What kind of supernatural power is this?”","Grand Master Tongtian couldn’t figure it out at all, but he knew that he couldn’t control the Qi and blood in this body anymore. His body was numb, and he couldn’t make a move. In other words, he had been killed once on this trip.","Zhang Han did not answer his question.","“Very good! Young man.”","Grand Master Tongtian’s eyes darkened. He said coldly, “I admire you more and more, but at the same time, I have a stronger desire to kill you. I must kill you. Disciples of the Tongtian Holy Land, listen up. Surround the people of the Highest Clouds Palace instead of attacking them. Hold them back until my Original Body arrives!”","Rumble!","The body of Grand Master Tongtian couldn’t bear it. As soon as he finished speaking, his body withered and dissipated.","The entire void of the universe fell into dead silence.","“Is it true?”","“Is Grand Master Tongtian dead?”","“Han Yang Immortal killed Grand Master Tongtian. My God.”","“Calm down. That’s a duplication of Grand Master Tongtian. But I still want to say that Han Yang Immortal is invincible.”"]},{"number":1709,"title":"Chapter 1709 A Battle Without End","paragraphs":["Chapter 1709 A Battle Without End","“Grand Master Tongtian is no match for him. He is invincible in this world.”","Many people said so.","They were extremely emotional. This battle shocked them.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","After all, it was the magnate Holy Land of the first mountain.","The millions of fleets around were also shocked.","They finally found that Han Yang Immortal was so strong that even their Grand Master could not defeat him.","But it didn’t matter. Their Grand Master had a lot of life-saving means. Perhaps only one duplication of their Grand Master had died.","“We can’t defeat him. Let’s pin them down!”","Many people in the square arrays flew back to the fleets. The fleets retreated tens of thousands of kilometers, including the square arrays. Their movements were well-trained.","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","Some elders of the Tongtian Holy Land also had some ancient demonic beasts.","There were about 2,000 of them. Although most of them were ordinary ancient demonic beasts, most of them were at the seventh-tier or eighth-tier Tribulation Stage.","There were more than a dozen Holy Beasts, but none of them could compare with the Golden-armored Giant Beast and Tiny Tot.","However, they could sense the coordinates of the secondary space where Tiny Tot was.","“Let’s try our best to pin them down and wait for the Grand Master to arrive.”","“Be careful. The most important task is to defend and stop them from leaving.”","Zhang Han and the others were sitting in Tiny Tot’s Alternate Space.","“Coo.”","A cloud of monstrous black mist appeared around Tiny Tot. It cast an incantation and tried to escape.","“Squeak! Squeak!”","In the distance, there was a mouse more than 10 meters long. Its eyes were shining with a sneaky light. It was a mouse-type Holy Beast. It had discovered the coordinates of Tiny Tot.","“Attack!”","“Disturb the space. Don’t let it stay in the secondary space for too long!”","Those square arrays close to the place immediately launched powerful attacks. The energy of hundreds of thousands of people merged into one attack. The fluctuations were terrifying.","Swoosh!","Tiny Tot struggled and withdrew from the secondary space. It was a little angry and roared. Its target was the nearest square array. Its monstrous power of incantation covered the other party.","“Oh no! It’s an incantation. Retreat!”","“Defense!”","The square array retreated very quickly. Two adjacent square arrays launched their defensive incantations of supernatural power.","They successfully retreated.","“They want to trap us.” Zhang Mu frowned and said, “If we can’t leave, Grand Master Tongtian may bring more people here.”","“We have to be on guard,” Zhang Guangyou said in a deep voice.","“The square arrays of the Tongtian Holy Land are also very powerful. In the Star Sea, it is one of the top three Holy Lands,” Immortal Master Lingxi said. “Maybe we will be in trouble. They possess a lot more means than the other Holy Lands.”","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on Zhang Han.","Zhang Han was the only one who could withstand such pressure.","“If they trouble us without stopping, it will be very difficult for us to leave.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","“Alas! It would be great if One Cloud could cover all of us.” Yue Wuwei sighed softly.","Their treasures were powerful. One cloud could block the detection of tribulation lightning. It was already incredible, but it could not accommodate too many people.","Tiny Tot had the Alternate Space that allowed it to escape into the void at any time. However, it would still take some time for it to fly in the secondary space. Moreover, after Tiny Tot transformed, the Alternate Space could not be used.","Zhang Han’s Golden-armored Giant Beast could attack like a barbaric charge, and the enemy’s square arrays could not resist it. However, the other party could retreat and follow a certain distance to restrict Zhang Han and others.","Such a situation was rather troublesome. Unless each of them had a duplication, it would be extremely difficult to escape.","This also showed that there were no heaven-defying moves in the world.","“No need to run.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “Just wait for Grand Master Tongtian to come. Since I can kill him once, I can kill him a second time.”","His calm and steady tone made everyone rest assured.","“Ha... That’s right.” Chen Changqing laughed and said, “Since you can kill him once, you can do it twice. My Brother Han is invincible in the world. Let’s cultivate faster. Even if we can’t help him, we can’t hold him back.”","“Yes.” Zhao Feng and others nodded.","In the past, they could help him in places like the Sea Dragon Star Area and the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","Now that they were in the Star Sea, they didn’t expect them to become spectators and couldn’t interfere at all.","Zhang Han had grown too fast.","“Let’s go back to the Highest Clouds Star. It will take about nine months for them to come.” Zhang Han said.","With a stir of his mind, the Golden-armored Giant Beast flew back to the top of the Highest Clouds Star to protect it.","All of them returned to the palace of the Highest Clouds Star and started cultivating successively.","“Did they go back?”","Many Holy Lands on the seventh mountain were shocked.","“Grand Master Tongtian didn’t die, and he’ll set off right away. They didn’t think of a way to escape but stayed on the Highest Clouds Star. They’re too confident.”","“The key is that he is Han Yang Immortal.” An elder sighed and said, “He has the means to kill Grand Master Tongtian. It is enough to show that his strength is at the top of the Star Sea. It’s normal for him to be confident.”","“Isn’t he afraid that Grand Master Tongtian will bring more people at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage here?”","“So what if he is afraid?” Someone said coldly, “Han Yang Immortal can’t escape even if he wants to. With so many square arrays of the Tongtian Holy Land restraining you, you won’t be able to escape either.”","“You’re right.”","The onlookers didn’t leave. They stayed in the distant void and observed at all times.","Even the people of the Tongtian Holy Land were taken aback as well.","“How dare they stay here?”","“How arrogant they are!”","“That’s good. We’ll completely lock down the Highest Clouds Star. Let’s not give them any chance to escape. Attack the giant golden beast from time to time.”","One order after another was given.","They moved even faster. In just a few minutes, they had surrounded the Highest Clouds Star from the inside out.","On Highest Clouds Star, Zi Yan said, “Honey, let’s begin our Pair Cultivation.”","Wearing a nightdress, Zi Yan took the initiative to find Zhang Han.","Zhang Han was comprehending the Blood Killing Curse at this time.","He used the four duplications at the same time and killed Grand Master Tongtian. When he used his six duplications at the same time, his power would increase by several levels.","However, it was too difficult to comprehend the supernatural power of merging his duplications. The six duplications were not compatible enough.","Zhang Han and Zi Yan entered the bedroom. The atmosphere gradually became hot.","Zhang Han was surprised.","Zi Yan had an endless clear stream flowing into his body. In the past, every time they did Pair Cultivation, it felt like a stream. But this time, it was like surging waves, with energy dozens of times greater than before.","The compatibility of his six duplications increased rapidly.","Even Zhang Han felt a little dizzy.","He seemed to see a strange phenomenon. The bright moon’s inverted image was in the sea, and the bright moon was in the sky. It was shining brightly, cool, soft, and quiet. How wonderful it was!","Clatter!","However, after he regained consciousness, his heart contracted violently.","Zhang Han immediately sat up. Seeing Zi Yan’s face was pale and her lips were not as ruddy as usual, Zhang Han was distressed and angry.","“What are you doing? Do you know what the consequences are? Do I need you to output energy like this? What time is it now? Why do you let me worry about you?” Zhang Han said in a harsh tone.","However, Zi Yan said with a smile, “Why are you so angry? I’ve just lost some energy. It will be replenished in a few days. I’m fine. Only you can protect everyone. My little effort is nothing serious.”","“This is absurd!”","Smack!","Zhang Han gently slapped Zi Yan on the arm.","“Don’t do this again. Since I have stayed, I have confidence.”","Zhang Han let out a long breath and said, “I’ll make you some nutritious dishes.”","“You’d better go to cultivate.” Zi Yan pursed her red lips.","However, Zhang Han said grumpily, “I’m not in a hurry to cultivate.”","He went to make a sumptuous nutritious meal with a few medicinal pellets.","After Zi Yan had the meal, it didn’t have much effect.","However, the energy Zhang Han absorbed had a great impact on him. The integration of his six duplications increased several times.","“Alas!”","He rested with Zi Yan for three days.","Zi Yan looked a little better.","Then Zhang Han went to cultivate in seclusion.","Even the Golden-armored Giant Beast had returned. As a result, the people of the Tongtian Holy Land outside didn’t even bother to attack. They directly blocked the place and waited for the Grand Master to arrive.","Now, six duplications were in the training room at the same time.","He kept comprehending the Blood Killing Curse, the fearless way to fight against enemies.","As long as one of his duplications was hidden in the back, the other five could display their power at the same time. They could kill as many enemies as they wanted. Whatever trouble they faced, they wouldn’t move at all.","Nine months passed.","Zhang Han had integrated with his Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, but the Golden-armored Giant Beast made progress slowly.","“Han Yang Immortal, I, Tongtian, have come to experience your supernatural power again.”","Grand Master Tongtian came alone again. But this time, his aura was more powerful.","“This body is my Second Battle Body.”","“It’s thirty times stronger than the one you killed.”","“Are you confident in winning this battle?” Grand Master Tongtian said lightly.","In the void of the universe, Tiny Tot hid in the back, with the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure and Zi Yan waiting in the Alternate Space.","At the same time, his Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure and his four duplications outside cast the Blood Killing Curse.","It looked like he had only used four duplications. But in fact, there was one more.","“Tongtian River!”","Grand Master Tongtian launched a powerful attack quickly.","This was the move he came up with to deal with Zhang Han on the way.","“Huh?”","“So fast?”","However, his entire right hand began to go numb in a few seconds. The opponent’s unknown supernatural power was much stronger than before.","A huge river, accompanied by earth-shattering power, came and destroyed the four duplications of Zhang Han quickly.","But it was useless.","The incantation continued, and the same situation as the last time occurred.","“Nice.”","“It’s time to use my First Battle Body.”","After Grand Master Tongtian said those words, he disappeared.","“Has he been killed again?”","Countless people of the Holy Lands and super sects from the seventh mountain, the sixth mountain, and even the fifth mountain let out cries of horror.","“This is the second time Grand Master Tongtian failed.”","Five months later, Grand Master Tongtian came again.","“Han Yang Immortal, Tongtian’s First Battle Body has come!”","“You can’t dodge it.”","“The Divine Technique Heading for the Netherworld!”","Grand Master Tongtian knew he only had one chance. If he failed, he would be defeated again.","His powerful supernatural power made the sun and moon in the world lose their luster. A lifelike pattern appeared. That was a white lotus. After it appeared, even the rules of the Great Domain were affected as if this lotus should not have existed in this world. It was resisted by the rules.","“This won’t work.”","Zhang Han felt a sense of crisis.","The four duplications died faster and faster. They died thousands of times a second, which had even affected the Source Energy of the duplications.","Yes! It was indeed impossible for Zhang Han to revive infinitely.","This was also the way of Grand Master Tongtian to deal with him.","Unexpectedly, this seemed to have turned into a long-lasting battle.","Thirty seconds later, the Blood Killing Curse destroyed everything, and the duplication of Grand Master Tongtian died again.","“The next time, my Third Holy Body will come.”","Grand Master Tongtian died again.","“This is the third time.”","More and more people gathered around.","Three months later, Grand Master Tongtian appeared. His Third Holy Body was hidden in a secret place in the outer ring, not far away.","“Grand Master Tongtian is about to challenge Han Yang Immortal for the fourth time. It has begun. Do you want to bet on it? Be quick. The battle will start soon.”","The many onlookers began to do something interesting.","“The bet is over. The battle begins. Wow, Grand Master Tongtian is dead again. He failed the fourth time. Next time, his Second Holy Body will come. The new round of the bet begins.”","“He comes. He arrives again after just a month. His Second Holy Body is powerful. This is the fifth challenge of Grand Master Tongtiann. What the fuck! He died so quickly after he showed up.”","“It’s the sixth challenge. Grand Master Tongtian’s First Holy Body died again. What? Grand Master TongTian wants to use the Third Demonic Figure.”","“He failed for the seventh time. He failed the eighth time. He failed the ninth time.”","“How many duplications does Grand Master Tongtian have in all?”"]},{"number":1710,"title":"Chapter 1710 The Fleets Coming Prepared","paragraphs":["Chapter 1710 The Fleets Coming Prepared","As the Grand Master Tongtian failed in his challenges again and again, the battle lasted for six years and had not been over yet.","The entire Nine Mountains Region was shocked.","Many people from the Holy Lands of the first mountain to the ninth mountain came to watch the battle. Even many Grand Masters were watching from a distance.","At first, everyone was extremely shocked.","“Is he Han Yang Immortal? What a fierce man.”","“Grand Master Tongtian is an old monster who has lived for more than 50,000 years. His trump cards are many and powerful, but he has been killed by Han Yang Immortal dozens of times.”","“Han Yang Immortal may be the No.1 in the Star Sea now. If he can kill Grand Master Tongtian, he must be the No.1.”","But after the shock, they gradually became numb.","In the end, their reactions changed.","Every time Grand Master Tongtian showed up, he didn’t put on airs at all. Instead, people talked about him.","“They are about to fight again. How many seconds do you think Grand Master Tongtian can hold on this time?”","“He held on for eight seconds last time. The time before the last time, he held on for six seconds. This time, I want to make a compromise. I guess he can only hold on for three seconds.”","“Good job.”","Also, they became extremely emotional in the end.","“Even Grand Master Tongtian can’t defeat Han Yang Immortal. It’s terrible.”","“I don’t know why they began to fight, but it seems that the battle will not stop.”","“I think they can kill me with one move. We are both at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. Why is the gap between us so big?”","Zhang Han and the others had been guarding the Highest Clouds Star for six years.","Everyone was used to it.","During the last battle, people talked again.","“Has Grand Master Tongtian come here again?”","“Yes. He just arrived. But while we were talking, he seemed to have died.”","“This battle has been going on for six years. We also can’t leave.”","“It’ll come to an end. Mengmeng said Master would soon master the supernatural power with his six duplications. At that time, he will be able to kill Grand Master Tongtian.”","“I think once Grand Master Tongtian is dead, there will be no more enemies.”","The crowd was also discussing.","At the same time, a figure that the people of Mount New Moon were familiar with appeared in the people watching in the distance.","“Oh, my god.”","“I haven’t seen Zhang Hanyang for decades. But now, he can already fight against Grand Master Tongtian.”","“It’s fucking ridiculous. I fought all the way and almost died dozens of times before I became a fifth-tier Immortal Master. But Zhang Hanyang is about to be invincible in the Star Sea. What a freak!”","Wearing a suit of golden armor, Ye Longyuan floated in the distance to watch the fun.","At the same time, in the depths of the starry sky, there was an inconspicuous place. It was deep darkness.","An evil smile could be seen vaguely.","The Demonic Ghost King Clown!","“Ha...”","He laughed in a low voice as he looked off into the distance. Wisps of mist could be seen behind him. There seemed to be something terrifying within the mist.","Ding Jiuming had sold his soul to the devil. Logically speaking, the mask he was wearing was his host. But unexpectedly, after he wore the mask, he merged with it and became a new existence.","He was no longer Ding Jiuming. Neither was he a Demonic Ghost King. He was just a clown hidden under a mask. He was also a complicated existence.","No one noticed such an existence hidden in the void not far away.","Zhang Han had been cultivating all the time for the past six years.","The last time Zi Yan had overdrawn her energy and helped Zhang Han’s duplications be much more compatible.","Since then, Zhang Han had not touched Zi Yan again for three years. He had almost been cultivating in seclusion.","Recently, his cultivation level had improved rapidly, mainly relying on the breakthrough of the Great Demon’s Figure. The breakthrough of the Nine Suns Godly Body would affect the whole situation.","“I’m about to reach the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage.”","“After I reach the Peak Stage, I can kill him at any time.”","“The Blood Killing Skill is about to be executed at the same time.”","Zhang Han used to call it Blood Killing Curse because its embryonic form was a kind of incantation. But now, it had exceeded the scope of the incantation and became an Immortal Technique.","“There’s only one step left.”","Everyone had witnessed the power of the Blood Killing Skill. It could even kill Grand Master Tongtian.","Zhang Han had two means to deal with Grand Master Tongtian. One was to make a breakthrough, and the other was to let six duplications perform the Blood Killing Skill simultaneously.","“Han Yang Immortal, this is my Netherworld Body.”","Grand Master Tongtian was a little numb.","However, he was trying to see if the opponent’s attack was special. He also needed special bodies to use his supernatural power to resist. For this reason, he had used too many precious duplications.","Each of them had consumed a lot of supreme treasures.","Of course, with the status of the Tongtian Holy Land, its resources of tens of thousands of years were a huge amount.","“It’s useful.”","Zhang Han’s Nine Suns Godly Body shook its head slightly.","With the Great Demon’s Body, the Thunder Body, and the Extreme Purity Immortal Body, four bodies were all levitating in the void.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure was cultivating in the palace and was too lazy to go out.","“One Point Leading to Hell.”","“This Immortal Technique is used to resist your supernatural power!”","An endless dim light appeared in the hands of Grand Master Tongtian.","But as soon as he used his supernatural power, his arms began to go numb. The energy could not be gathered through his arms.","The power of the Blood Killing Skill was fully displayed.","“How could it be so fast?”","Grand Master Tongtian’s pupils contracted. “Will you make a breakthrough?”","He suddenly thought of a terrible thing.","In the first round of battle, Han Yang Immortal obtained three drops of his fundamental blood essence.","In the other round of battles, he dissipated all the energy in advance every time, and his duplication vanished into thin air.","To some extent, the three drops of fundamental blood essence were related to him. If he broke through and his Immortal Techniques became more powerful, it might affect his Original Body.","“Could he kill me?”","Grand Master Tongtian’s face darkened.","Zhang Han didn’t say anything and continued to use his skill. On the fifth second, the Blood Killing Skill spread all over the body of Grand Master Tongtian.","Netherworld Body was completely useless.","On the sixth second, he was about to die.","Grand Master Tongtian said angrily, “Next time, I will fight you with a stronger body!”","He had said these words many times.","But this time, it was unusual.","Swoosh!","In a cultivator’s abode in the Tongtian Holy Land, the Original Body of Grand Master Tongtian suddenly opened his eyes. His face was slightly pale.","“He has the ability to kill me. It’s absolute.”","“No matter how many duplications I have, it’s useless. He can threaten my Source. He can kill me!”","How could he let it go like that?","As one of the magnates in the entire Star Sea, Grand Master Tongtian had lived for more than 50,000 years. In the past, those who had almost the same strength as him couldn’t kill him.","However, a person capable of killing him had appeared. How could he possibly endure this?","“No. I have to kill him before he makes a breakthrough. His supernatural power is getting faster and stronger.”","Grand Master Tongtian’s face darkened.","“Should my Original Body go to fight? If I can’t resist his moves, my strength will be greatly damaged.”","His Original Body was the strongest in terms of fighting capability. Compared to his Original Body, his duplications were a level lower.","However, he felt his Original Body might die if he went there. It would be a great loss. But if he didn’t go, the breakthrough of the other party’s supernatural power would also threaten his life.","“Pearl of Fate.”","“Since that’s the case, I’ll prepare a great gift.”","The voice of Grand Master Tongtian spread.","“Disciple of the Holy Land, head to the Shanwang Holy Land, the Tianyun Holy Land, the Chiyang Holy Land...”","Several months passed in the blink of an eye.","“It’s so strange. Six months passed, but Grand Master Tongtian hasn’t come yet.”","“Over the past three years, Grand Master Tongtian has been here every more than four months.”","Over the years, many Dao Seeking Cultivators in the void of the universe around and the Nine Mountains Region did not leave. They just watched the unprecedented confrontation. When they found Grand Master Tongtian was late, they felt strange.","Right at this moment, a faint blue feather floated in the air above the people of the Tongtian Holy Land, following the crowd.","“What is that?”","A person in the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage from the Tongtian Holy Land took a closer look but found nothing special.","“Who cares? As long as Han Yang Immortal and the others don’t run away, it has nothing to do with us,” an elder said.","“That’s right. Even if someone were to send some treasures in, it would be useless.”","Few people found it but didn’t pay attention to it.","Moments later, the feather floated above the palace.","Zhang Han’s Nine Suns Godly Body suddenly appeared. “Who is it?”","As early as the feather came, Zhang Han was alert. Everyone entered the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot and hid aside.","Thus, the entire palace was empty at this moment.","“It’s me.”","The feather emitted a faint light and converged into a human.","“Immortal Master Mingyu?”","Zhang Han looked a little surprised. “What are you doing here? If you’re discovered, you’ll be the enemy of the Tongtian Holy Land.”","“That is frightening. I cannot afford to offend the Tongtian Holy Land. Thus, I can only come here secretly.”","As he spoke, Immortal Master Mingyu took a deep breath and said solemnly, “I’ve come to notify you of something.”","“What is it?” Zhang Han asked with a smile.","“Run!”","Immortal Master Mingyu said in a low voice, “Escape before Grand Master Tongtian arrives! You may have a few days left. They will arrive soon. Grand Master Tongtian found more than 600 top-grade Holy Lands. Most of them are rushing here. This time, he wants to kill you. Maybe you can resist him, but your people can’t. Take advantage of the time to escape. The cultivation of five people on their team is not weaker than that of Grand Master Tongtian. There are advanced forces in more than half of the Star Sea.”","Immortal Master Mingyu was slightly nervous. He spoke successively.","“More than 600 top-grade Holy Lands?” Zhang Han was silent for a moment. There were indeed a lot of enemies.","“Yes. It is true. Your strength is beyond my expectation, and we know each other. In fact, I hesitated for a whole day and didn’t know if I should come or not. As a result, I came. Maybe it is because I don’t want to see you die, and I want to see you fight against the divine thunder over the sky again.” Immortal Master Mingyu smiled bitterly.","Zhang Han was very grateful. He cupped his hands and said, “Thank you for telling me the news, Immortal Master Mingyu. But I won’t escape.”","“Are you sure?”","Immortal Master Mingyu’s eyes were filled with shock.","“He doesn’t want to escape. Will he fight?”","“I can’t stay here any longer. I’ll be detected soon. I hope you can think it over.”","Immortal Master Mingyu glanced at the sky and vanished.","When his mind was about to disappear, he felt the body of Han Yang Immortal in front of him suddenly burst out with monstrous energy.","“It seems to be a breakthrough.”","“Han Yang Immortal is at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. How can he make a breakthrough?”","Immortal Master Mingyu felt strange.","At this time, he was in the crowd, watching the battle from a distance.","The news came from his Holy Land. His subordinates had seen Grand Master Tongtian’s team and learned of it.","But he didn’t expect that Grand Master Tongtian and the others would come so soon.","They only rushed for one day!","The fleets, which were as vast as the sea, appeared above the Highest Clouds Star at the same time. There were more than a hundred million of them.","In an instant, many people from the Holy Lands watching the battle were dumbfounded.","“So many?”","“Tonglang Holy Land, Beizun Sacred Land, Tongtian Holy Land...”","Famous Holy Lands came one after another."]},{"number":1711,"title":"Chapter 1711 The Start of the Chaotic Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 1711 The Start of the Chaotic Battle","“Oh, my god! There are so many top Holy Lands from the first mountain to the third mountain.”","“Grand Master Tongtian has gathered more than half of the top-grade forces in the Star Sea and the Peak-Stage masters of more than 5,000 races. Who can be a match for them?”","“It’s horrible. Grand Master Tongtian has lived for more than 50,000 years, and his foundation is too horrible. Not to mention so many of his duplications, although he failed the challenge, his connections are also a part of his strength. Now that he has found so many Holy Lands, it seems Grand Master Dongtian is determined to kill Han Yang Immortal this time.”","“Of course.” An elder took a deep breath and said, “Let’s not talk about the reason why the two magnates fought. The loss of so many duplications of Grand Master Tongtian is enough to make his heart ache. Moreover, once someone like Grand Master Tongtian takes action, he won’t give up.”","“I wonder if this is the Original Body of Grand Master Tongtian. It’s said that his Original Body is several times stronger than his duplications.”","“I don’t think so. After all, he has died so many times. If his Original Body dies, even if Grand Master Tongtian used a heaven-defying method to revive his duplications, his strength will be greatly reduced. He won’t allow such a thing to happen.”","Many Holy Lands had arrived.","In the void in the distance, the people watching the battle, including many forces in the Nine Mountains Region, rushed over after hearing the news. There were super sects, Holy Lands, and even many forces in the inner ring.","“This is probably the biggest battle in millions of years. It will cause a sensation in the Star Sea.” Someone trembled with excitement. “This will definitely be an epic story. Han Yang Immortal and Grand Master Tongtian will be remembered in history. No matter who wins or loses this battle, the legend will be praised by future generations!”","There were so many of them.","Hundreds of top Holy Lands took action at the same time. Not only the Grand Masters but also their strongest legions had come.","The fleets flew above the Highest Clouds Star. In comparison, the Highest Clouds Star seemed to be a small pearl in the hands of a giant. It looked so small and weak as if it could not even withstand the wind.","“They came too fast.”","Immortal Master Mingyu smiled bitterly and said, “He didn’t escape in such a short time. Now, he can’t leave. I’m afraid that Han Yang Immortal is going to die.”","“Grand Master.”","The cute little girl pouted and said, “Will Han Yang Immortal die? I want to see him fight against the divine thunder over the sky.”","“There’s no chance. There’s no chance at all. Grand Master Tongtian is already very difficult to deal with. Although the supernatural power of Han Yang Immortal is powerful, it can’t deal with a large scale of enemies. Once other people stop him, the consequences will be unimaginable.” Immortal Master Mingyu sighed, “If a lot of powerful people at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage help him, he may have a chance to survive.”","“Oh! Grand Master, you can do it. You are also very powerful,” the little girl muttered.","Immortal Master Mingyu was shocked. “Don’t talk nonsense. If I go up, I can’t even resist a single slap from Grand Master Tongtian. I only brag at home but don’t brag outside. It wouldn’t be good if others heard me.”","“Last time, you said you would be invincible in the Star Sea.”","“Do you believe me even if I brag?”","Including Immortal Master Mingyu, all the people present, whether they knew Han Yang Immortal or not, thought he couldn’t win.","“It’s about to end.”","They saw the huge fleets slowly approaching the Highest Clouds Star as if pressing down on it.","Moreover, the main cannons of many spaceships lit up. Only seven fleets fired at the same time.","A dazzling light burst out from the Highest Clouds Star. It exploded.","The entire planet was smashed into pieces.","“Han Yang Immortal!”","Grand Master Tongtian looked at the scene of the destruction of the planet in front of him and said indifferently, “This is the first time in tens of thousands of years that I admire a young man. Don’t hide yourself anymore. There’s no need. This place has become a tight dragnet. You can’t escape.”","“Coo.”","Tiny Tot let out a cry and showed up in the encirclement.","“I’m going out. Let Tiny Tot hide in the back.” Zhang Han smiled at the crowd.","At this time, the atmosphere was extremely depressing in the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot.","For a moment, no one spoke.","Zi Yan was about to cry.","The pressure was too high.","Zhang Guangyou looked pale, and Rong Jiali was out of her wits.","Everyone was extremely surprised. The enemies were too many and came too fast.","“Daddy,” Mengmeng said in a trembling voice.","Seeing this, Zhang Han said helplessly, “What are you doing? I’ve told you I’ll be fine.”","“But there are too many enemies. They are more than half of the top forces of the Star Sea,” Immortal Master Lingxi said. “Now, we are all in the same boat. Zhang Hanyang, why don’t you stay here? You have a lot of supernatural power. Think of a way to escape. As I said before, as long as you can summon the divine thunder over the sky, they will all avoid it. Then, there is a chance for us to escape.”","There was no absolute death situation.","Although there were so many Dao Seeking Cultivators outside, as long as the divine thunder over the sky came out, who dared to touch it in the face of the strongest Heavenly Tribulation? They would avoid it and might leave.","“As I said, I don’t have any Heavenly Tribulation.” Zhang Han laughed and said, “All right. Don’t be nervous. I’ve already broken through to the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. There’s nothing to be afraid of.”","“I’ll go with you.” Zi Yan pursed her red lips. “Let’s fight together.”","“Don’t joke around.”","Zhang Han frowned slightly and said seriously, “Stay here. Don’t distract me. Anyone who goes out a step may cause me to die. Do you understand?”","“Alas!” Yue Wuwei sighed softly.","“I once said that when I reached the Peak Stage, I would be invincible in the Cultivation World.”","Zhang Han put his hands behind his back and said, “Although the enemies are so many and have many strong cultivators, for an ant-eating beast, no matter how many ants there are, they are just food.”","Swoosh!","Zhang Han flashed and left the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure instantly transformed into the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","He seemed to have traveled thousands of kilometers with every step he took. In the blink of an eye, he arrived in front of Grand Master Tongtian and the others.","He faced hundreds of millions of enemies alone.","His charm was unparalleled, and he was the best in the world. Even the universe and the Galaxy paled in comparison with him. He was the only one in the starry sky.","“You’re finally out.”","Grand Master Tongtian put his hands behind his back and said with a faint smile, “Your Immortal Techniques are indeed powerful, but they are only the strongest single-target attack. As long as more than ten people attack you at the same time, the Immortal Techniques will be of no use.”","He seemed to know how to deal with Zhang Han. At least, that was what he thought.","“Why not give it a try?”","Zhang Han said with a faint smile, “Grand Master Tongtian, you do have some way of Tao. You knew I was about to kill you, so you brought your people here in advance. Unfortunately, you came too late.”","“Ha... Too late?” Grand Master Tongtian laughed and said, “It won’t be too late. I’ve fought with you for several years, so I know how powerful you are.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and did not respond.","In the distant void, someone else asked, “Will we bet this time?”","“Bullshit.”","“Obviously, Han Yang Immortal is doomed.”","Countless people were discussing.","In the team of Grand Master Tongtian, a famous Grand Master from a Holy Land shouted, “Han Yang Immortal, you are famous all over the world and do have the strength. Let me have a try.”","“I’ll go with you!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","A group of 20 Grand Masters flew out of the group together.","“Is the leader Immortal Master Beisheng?”","“He is one of the top ten magnates of the second mountain. He has the same status as Grand Master Tongtian. In the beginning, they sent out such a person. They really don’t want to give Han Yang Immortal a chance to live.”","“Immortal Master Beisheng’s strength is almost the same as that of Grand Master Tongtian. The two of them have fought for 30 years without a winner.”","“Although he can’t defeat Han Yang Immortal alone, the 19 Immortal Masters next to him are also top experts.”","Under everyone’s gaze, the atmosphere began to tense up.","Most of the Dao Seeking Cultivators held their breath. They didn’t blink, and their divine senses covered the place in front of them all the time.","Swoosh!","Zhang Han flashed.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure appeared.","Then the Nine Suns Godly Body, the Great Demon’s Figure, the Thunder Body, and the Golden-armored Giant Beast came.","The six bodies appeared in the void at the same time.","“Ha... Come on!”","The Great Demon’s Figure laughed wildly. Since Zhang Han didn’t use any large-scale supernatural power, it didn’t have much of an impact on the 20 Grand Masters in front","The Great Demon’s Figure quickly rushed over, Demonic Might surging.","“Go to hell!”","One of the Grand Masters was the fastest. With a sword in his hand, accompanied by supreme power, he attempted to pierce the chest of the Great Demon’s Figure.","“Doesn’t he even defend himself?”","The Grand Master grinned hideously.","Clang!","Something unexpected happened. His Profound-grade treasure sword stabbed into the chest, producing a metallic clang.","“What?”","He couldn’t break through his opponent’s defense with all his strength.","Before he could retreat, the right fist of the Great Demon’s Figure had been accumulating power for a long time and bombarded him.","Boom!","The Grand Master in front of him was smashed by Zhang Han’s punch. The energy in his whole body turned into faint cyan smoke and gathered in the rear, but his face was much paler.","He was in the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage, so he had many life-saving means.","Boom!","The Great Demon’s Figure didn’t give up. He punched the other party from a distance and smashed him again.","“You!”","The Grand Master was flustered and exasperated. How could he be blown up by the other party from a distance? How strong was the other party?","His figure condensed once more, and he intended to retreat because there were already specks of blood on the corners of his mouth.","Even if he was beaten to death, his energy could only be revived three times in a short time.","Boom!","As a result, the Great Demon’s Figure was smashed immediately for the third time.","“Save me!”","The Grand Master was horrified and roared.","Not far from the back, five Grand Masters arrived. Three of them were on the defensive, while the other two were attacking.","When the injured Grand Master was about to retreat, a voice rang out in his ears.","“Do you want to leave?”","Then, to his horror, the tip of a sword appeared on his chest.","“How did you...”","He turned around in a daze and vanished.","The first Grand Master died!","“Watch out!”","All the people around, including Immortal Master Beisheng, looked serious.","At the same time, many people on the team of Grand Master Tongtian gasped, “He is so powerful!”","“This is a great vicious individual!”","Grand Master Tongtian also frowned and said, “He has become stronger again. The twenty of them can’t kill him.”","Sure enough, as soon as he finished speaking, Zhang Han and his six companions began to fight against the other side at the same time.","“What tough skin!”","Immortal Master Beisheng’s first target was the Golden-armored Giant Beast. He had used all his means, but he couldn’t break any of its scales. He was secretly shocked. It must be a king of the ancient demonic beasts.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Every time the Nine Suns Godly Body waved its fist, it would shine brightly and break all the magic with one force. No matter what kind of supernatural power it faced, it could break the other party with one punch.","The Great Demon’s Figure was even more powerful.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure had all kinds of supernatural power to restrain the enemies.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body cooperated with it to kill the enemies.","Soon, the second Grand Master failed to withstand the attack of the Nine Suns Godly Body and was seriously injured by a punch. Then, he was killed by the sword of the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","“Another Grand Master has died. How can Han Yang Immortal resist them?”","Boom!","The third Grand Master was suppressed and killed by the Great Demon’s Figure.","The fourth Grand Master unexpectedly died.","He didn’t expect that the horn on the head of the Golden-armored Giant Beast attacked by Immortal Master Beisheng could emit an irresistible beam of light that contained an aura that could destroy the world and directly kill him.","Then more and more Grand Masters were killed.","In just a few seconds, eight of the 20 Grand Masters who rushed up had died.","Many people in the army behind Grand Master Tongtian lost their cool.","“He’s so fucking strong.”","“Hurry up and save them!”","“Go kill him.”","More than a hundred Grand Masters rushed over at the same time. A chaotic battle was about to break out!"]},{"number":1712,"title":"Chapter 1712 The Enemy of the Star Sea","paragraphs":["Chapter 1712 The Enemy of the Star Sea","“How did his strength suddenly increase so much?”","The expression of Grand Master Tongtian changed slightly.","He couldn’t figure it out.","In any case, it was impossible for him to know that Zhang Han, previously, was not at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage at all. According to the rules of the Great Domain in the Cultivation World, above the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage was the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage.","As for Zhang Han, he was able to fight against Grand Master Tongtian at the ninth tier and kill many of his duplications. No Dao Seeking Cultivator had ever heard of such a thing.","Grand Master Tongtian and the others all thought that Zhang Han was at the Peak Stage. However, to their surprise, he had just broken through to the Peak Stage and had a strong combat capability. His six bodies fought proudly in the void and suppressed all the other talents. Grand Master Dongtian was stunned when he saw this.","“Was his combat capability relatively weak before?”","There were more than 30 people close to Grand Master Tongtian. Five of them had fought against him, and they were equally powerful. As for the other Grand Masters, they were also well-known. In their era, they almost crushed all their enemies and reached the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.","They were not in a hurry to make a move. Instead, they watched from behind.","Someone couldn’t help but comment, “His combat strength is almost the same as ours. Besides, he has five duplications. But why are his duplications so powerful?”","“A few years ago, his strength was not as strong as it is now. It’s just that he knows how to display some supreme supernatural powers.” Grand Master Tongtian pondered for a moment and said, “His duplications can be resurrected and cast an Immortal Technique. It’s difficult to defend or interrupt it. According to the time each duplication can hold on, I suspect that there is a kind of special constitution that can resist his Immortal Technique.”","“If even you can’t handle it, then we have no chance.” A Grand Master lamented.","“Fortunately, his Immortal Technique can only attack one person. If he can hit all of his opponents, then Han Yang Immortal is really incredible.”","The atmosphere on their side was very relaxed.","More than a hundred Grand Masters had rushed over.","Even Grand Master Tongtian could fight against more than 100 people at the same time.","“Let the fleet kill that giant golden beast first.”","“The ancient demonic beast of Han Yang Immortal is quite powerful with strong defense.”","“It’s strange. I’ve studied Exotic Beasts for many years, but I’ve never seen this kind of Holy Beast.”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","As soon as the order was given, many main cannons of the spaceships were aimed at the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","Beams of light, like fireworks all over the sky, fell on all parts of the huge Golden-armored Giant Beast.","Soon, it was surrounded by flames, and the smoke was hazy. In the raging flames, the Golden-armored Giant Beast roared.","“Ow!”","The sound was deafening.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast suddenly flew out of the flames.","“It’s still not hurt.”","Grand Master Tongtian and the others frowned slightly.","“The defense of this Holy Beast is too strong.”","“Oh no, it’s going to the fleet.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","More than 40 Grand Masters flew out.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast fled into the secondary space. Three seconds later, it appeared in the direction of the fleet.","Its every palm strike could smash dozens of spaceships. These hard king vessels could not stop its attacks at all.","However, the group of Grand Masters reacted very quickly. The nearby spaceships that had not been attacked retreated one after another. It took more than 40 Grand Masters to block the attack of the Golden-armored Giant Beast. However, no matter how hard they fought, the giant Golden-armored Giant Beast was unhurt.","“The incantations can’t work.”","“The supernatural powers or illusions don’t work.”","“The sword skills or saber skills don’t work.”","“The soul attacks can’t work either.”","“What kind of attack can affect it?”","As the battle went on, more than 40 Grand Masters began to question everything they had learned.","Every one of them could usually leave calmly in the face of a top-level Holy Beast in the barren Star Areas.","Now more than 40 people were working together to fight against one, but they still couldn’t defeat it.","It was disappointing.","The spectators in the distance were so excited that their bodies were convulsing.","“He’s so powerful. Han Yang Immortal is too formidable.”","“More than a hundred Grand Masters are surrounding him and attacking him. He’s dealing with them with ease.”","“Damn! Look! Look quickly! My god! Grand Master Manqi is dead. He’s the Immortal Master with the swiftest speed in the Star Sea, so how could he have possibly failed to dodge the attack and perished?”","“He is the seventeenth Grand Master to die.”","“Will Han Yang Immortal leave after this battle?”","“If he leaves, Grand Master Tongtian and the others will be in trouble!”","Countless Dao Seeking Cultivators who were watching the battle didn’t even blink their eyes and appreciated what they were watching.","“He’s freaking powerful.”","Immortal Master Mingyu gasped from behind.","“Great Demon King. Why do I feel that he is about to win?” Ye Longyuan suddenly realized that this scene was very familiar. Every time he watched the battle, Zhang Hanyang would win with ease.","Sure enough, twenty-one Grand Masters had died within a minute.","The more than 100 Grand Masters fighting at the front were trembling with fear.","Some people felt that the next second, they might be stabbed in their chests by their opponent’s sword.","“Tongtian, why aren’t you all taking action yet?!”","A Grand Master shouted and took the initiative to retreat.","They were utterly defeated.","More than a hundred Grand Masters kept launching defensive measures to retreat quickly.","They didn’t want to fight, and they didn’t dare to.","“Grand Master Tongtian called for help, but they aren’t fighting. We’re fighting a life-and-death battle in front of them. So many people died, but they are still indifferent.","“Are they taking us as cannon fodder?”","“They’re retreating.”","“More than a hundred Grand Masters are beaten back by Han Yang Immortal alone.”","In the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot, Zhang Guangyou, Zhang Mu, Zhao Feng, and Mengmeng were also watching nervously. But as the fight went on, they relaxed a little because Zhang Han was winning, as they expected.","Mu Xue exclaimed, “Look, Grand Master Tongtian has brought his men up.”","With these words, they became nervous again.","Grand Master Tongtian and the others flew forward at the same time. After they met up with the people who retreated, hundreds of Grand Masters confronted Zhang Han together.","“Han Yang Immortal, I didn’t expect your strength to reach this level.” Grand Master Tongtian sighed. “You’re amazing. I don’t think I can kill you. Fortunately, I have enough people this time.”","All of a sudden, Grand Master Tongtian’s tone became extremely fierce, and his eyes lit up.","“Han Yang Immortal! We have all reached the Peak Stage and are the top-notch forces in the Star Sea. What power do you have to fight against us? Today, you must die!”","The five-meter-tall Grand Master Tongtian released his powerful aura. At the same time, the hundreds of people around him also began to release their might. The power seemed to have materialized and turned into a huge ball of energy.","It was no exaggeration to say that a Dao Seeking Cultivator at the second tier of the Tribulation Stage would be suppressed and killed by this power in an instant.","However, Zhang Han’s five bodies didn’t move at all.","“Grand Master Tongtian.”","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure put his hands behind his back and said indifferently, “Originally, I had no intention of fighting. However, you provoked me again and again. Do you really think that I’m a pushover?”","“So what if you’re not?” Grand Master Tongtian sneered. “Can you fight against hundreds of us?”","Zhang Han said in a low voice, “Not only the hundreds of you but also the other Holy Lands are my enemies. A few years ago, I succeeded in crushing 41 Holy Lands. Now, I can also destroy hundreds of them.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he made his move.","He took the initiative to attack.","His five duplications rushed forward at the same time.","“Demon Angel!”","The Great Demon Body showed its Demonic Might. The shadow of a twelve-winged Dark Angel appeared and launched a powerful supernatural power.","“Light!”","The Nine Suns Godly Body was shining, and a strange phenomenon appeared. A bright sun was in the sky, illuminating the front. In the sun, there were countless shadows of the Nine Suns Godly Body, who were practicing supernatural powers.","“Immortal Mountain Seal!”","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body also began to cast all kinds of Immortal Techniques.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure performed more supernatural power at a high speed.","The Thunder Body simulated the attacking method of the Holy Thunder of the Five Elements.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","However, no matter how fast Zhang Han moved, he could not move faster than hundreds of people.","Yet, the supernatural powers and skills of those Grand Masters would always be destroyed by Zhang Han.","For a moment, it was thousands of supernatural powers fighting against several ones.","They fought back and forth.","“It’s one against hundreds.”","“If I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes, I wouldn’t have believed it.”","Under countless shocked gazes, Zhang Han’s five bodies suppressed all the enemies in the world. They advanced at the same time, while Grand Master Tongtian and the others were retreating.","“Tongtian!”","As they retreated, a Grand Master shouted angrily, “Did you trap us?”","When they came here, Grand Master Tongtian didn’t say that the enemy was so strong.","“He has clearly surpassed us, and he can’t be defeated by numbers.”","Grand Master Tongtian felt depressed. “It’s true that he wasn’t that powerful the last time I left, but he broke through again.”","“How can a cultivator at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage make a breakthrough?”","In the face of doubt, Grand Master Tongtian had a darkened face.","“There’s nothing we can do about it. If we can’t kill him, or even several hundred people can’t defeat him, then could it be that I, Tongtian, am really going to die?","“No, this is impossible, absolutely impossible!”","The eyes of Grand Master Tongtian were gradually filled with madness.","“Do you still remember these three drops of blood?”","As Zhang Han’s Extreme Purity Immortal Body waved his right hand, Grand Master Tongtian’s three drops of blood essence appeared.","“This time, I’ll kill you first!”","He displayed the Blood Killing Skill.","His five duplications performed at the same time, and the Golden-armored Giant Beast stood in the direction of the fleet in the sky.","Hiss!","Grand Master Tongtian gasped. His scalp went numb, and his eyes were filled with fear. He shouted, “Kill him! Kill him now!”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Hundreds of people attacked at the same time. After destroying the supernatural powers Zhang Han had cast, all the major attacks landed on his duplications.","They were obliterated and then resurrected, and this repeated.","Three seconds later, Grand Master Tongtian felt his arms go numb.","Furthermore, unlike before, his soul had also become numb.","This caused him to be extremely terrified.","“Am I really going to die?”","“Kill him! Kill him now!”","He went crazy. He roared and tried his best to exert his supernatural powers.","But his effort was in vain.","“Grand Master Tongtian, what’s happening?”","When the people around him saw his state, they shivered with fear.","The whole body of Grand Master Tongtian was covered with a layer of blood color.","“Han Yang Immortal!”","Grand Master Tongtian roared indignantly. “You can’t kill me. My Original Body is surrounded by the rules of the Great Domain. You can’t kill me! I hate you!”","It didn’t matter if his duplication was destroyed. But his soul had been contaminated by the Blood Killing Skill. Even if Grand Master Tongtian could withstand it, his strength would decline a lot. He might drop to the seventh-tier Tribulation Stage or the sixth-tier one. Then, he would not have a chance to return to the Peak Stage.","Zhang Han said indifferently, “You shouldn’t have messed with me.","“Even if you possess your Original Body and cannot die, I will still be able to find you through the aura of your blood essence.”","He had only killed one person like Grand Master Tongtian.","Grand Master Tongtian would be his next great target to kill, but not his last one.","“Haha!”","Grand Master Tongtian suddenly laughed and said, “Wonderful! Han Yang Immortal, you are very good, very strong, detached from the world, ah!”","As he spoke, he cried out in pain, and his whole body was about to dissipate.","He used his last strength to roar, “Han Yang Immortal has the Pearl of Fate that can control the Law of the Great Domain in the world. With this pearl, he can change the fate of the Cultivation World. All the Holy Lands in the Nine Mountains Region, come to the First Mountain as soon as possible.","“He, Han Yang Immortal, will be the enemy of the entire Star Sea if he doesn’t hand over the Pearl of Fate!”","Swoosh!","Grand Master Tongtian disappeared.","There was no sound in the void of the universe for hundreds of millions of miles around, and the scene was dead silent."]},{"number":1713,"title":"Chapter 1713 Be a Spy","paragraphs":["Chapter 1713 Be a Spy","“What? What did Grand Master Tongtian just say?”","“The Pearl of Fate can control the Law of the Great Domain in the world! It can change the fate of the Cultivation World. Does, does such a thing really exist?”","“It makes sense that Han Yang Immortal has such a supreme treasure. No wonder Grand Master Tongtian was willing to fight at all costs. No wonder even if so many of his duplications died, he still had to target Han Yang Immortal, who turns out to have such a treasure.”","“Can we all go to the higher world with the Pearl of Fate? When the rules of the world change, will there be more and more people who can survive the final tribulation thunder?”","“Damn!”","Countless people gasped in horror.","“Tongtian died. This is his strongest duplication.”","The pupils of several people beside Grand Master Tongtian shrank.","If Grand Master Tongtian couldn’t resist Zhang Han’s attacks, they had no chance at all.","“Let’s go!”","“Let’s go back to the First Mountain.”","“Retreat now!”","“He’s here! Flee! Flee!”","Under the gaze of these Grand Masters, Zhang Han flew over with his six bodies at an extremely fast speed.","Some of the weaker Grand Masters immediately panicked.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Many Grand Masters showed their supernatural power and retreated one after another.","The distant fleet reacted even faster and immediately retreated.","However, they were still quite powerless in the face of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","Swoosh!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast went into the secondary space. When it came out, it was in the middle of a dense fleet.","The gigantic tail swept out. The horn, the limbs, and every part of its body seemed to have transformed into weapons for combat.","Boom!","Countless spaceships burst into flames in the void.","Hundreds of spaceships exploded every second.","However, there were too many spaceships, and they were densely packed. Even though the Golden-armored Giant Beast was very large, it was impossible for it to attack all of them. In fact, its attacks merely hit only one-thousandth of the spaceships.","“You were very fierce when you came. Now you want to escape?”","Zhang Han’s Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure sneered. “Seal!”","All kinds of supernatural powers to seal the space were displayed frequently.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body, the Nine Suns Godly Body, the Thunder Body, and the Great Demon Body all possessed an invincible bearing as they pressed forward.","“Immortal Master Mingsa!”","Someone cried out in alarm. Just now, Immortal Master Mingsa was right beside them, but in the next second, he directly died.","“Let’s go! He’s a devil!”","“We can’t stop him. We can’t!”","Hundreds of Grand Masters were trembling with fear and even broke out in a cold sweat.","At this moment, they were extremely nervous. More and more Grand Masters had died.","Ten, twenty, thirty... The number was still increasing.","“The Grand Masters of all the Holy Lands have been slaughtered?”","“This is unprecedented.”","“Han Yang Immortal is too fierce and brutal.”","In the distance, those Dao Seeking Cultivators who were watching the battle were horrified.","Even Immortal Master Mingyu was stunned.","“He, he won?”","The cute little girl next to him said, “Grand Master, you bragged about the invincible Han Yang Immortal.”","Immortal Master Mingyu was unable to refute it, and he even nodded and said, “Yes. He’s invincible in the Star Sea and the Cultivation World! A king is about to appear in the entire Star Sea, the one and only king!”","In the distance, Ye Longyuan exclaimed, “Heavens!”","He was so scared that his face changed greatly. “Zhang Hanyang is really freaking cruel. It’s only been so many years. He’s invincible in the Star Sea. Damn, I owe him crystal stones. No one will dare to hurt me in the Star Sea in the future!”","“His attack is too strong!”","The faces of many Grand Masters on the battlefield turned pale.","“We have no way to stop him.”","“Break out!”","The group of people was chased by five bodies.","Soon, 40 Grand Masters, 50 Grand Masters, and then 60 Grand Masters died. When the number of dead Grand Masters reached nearly 100, the remaining ones fled fast.","“Hurry up. Let’s enter the secondary space!”","They were in groups of three or four, staring at the nearest spaceships. Before they could board the spaceships, they already ordered people to start the energy cabins and were ready to jump into the secondary space.","They had to make full use of every second.","Perhaps these two seconds didn’t matter in a normal battle, but in the face of the horrible being behind them, they might die in two seconds.","Buzz! Buzz! Buzz!","The spaceships’ energy cabins started, and several doors opened.","Many Grand Masters entered the spaceships one after another.","Swoosh!","However, some people were unlucky. The Golden-armored Giant Beast appeared and blew up dozens of spaceships that were about to enter the secondary space.","Zhang Han made more than 50 of these Grand Masters stay.","The large fleets in the other directions finally found an opportunity to escape into the secondary space.","The fleet, which had just filled the void, dispersed in an instant, leaving only the flames of war and more than a hundred dead Grand Masters.","In the distance, hundreds of millions of Dao Seeking Cultivators watching the battle in the void were dumbfounded.","“He killed more than a hundred Grand Masters and dozens of top-tier Grand Masters?”","“Han Yang Immortal is so powerful that he can crush everyone alone. This is unbelievable. Those rumors have all underestimated him. This is obviously the strength of the No. 1 Expert in the Cultivation World!”","“What should we do?” Someone suddenly said, “Grand Master Tongtian is not dead yet. He has just released the announcement that Han Yang Immortal is the enemy of the Star Sea. He has the Pearl of Fate, which is the lifeline of the Cultivation World.”","“Is that true?” Someone doubted. “What if Grand Master Tongtian is lying?”","“I think it should be true.” One Grand Master took a deep breath and said, “Otherwise, why do you think Grand Master Tongtian attacked Han Yang Immortal dozens of times without stopping? In the beginning, there must be something attracting him, otherwise, he wouldn’t have moved. So, the matter of the Pearl of Fate should be true.”","“Shall we go or not? Han Yang Immortal is unstoppable. If we go to the First Mountain Region, we will be his enemy.”","Someone said with great concern, “Even more than half of the forces of the advanced Holy Lands can’t defeat Han Yang Immortal, which means that even if countless people fight him, it won’t work.”","“But if Grand Master Tongtian or their alliance survives, we will offend them by not going.”","In the face of all kinds of discussions, someone said in a low voice, “This is not a matter of choosing sides but about the Pearl of Fate. What we pursue is to go to the world of immortals. Since ancient times, there are very few people who can make it to the Heaven Road to the world of immortals, and now there is a chance, how can we be indifferent?”","“I’m going. Han Yang Immortal has won this battle, but it’s still impossible for him to fight against the entire Nine Mountains Region and even the Star Sea.”","“If he can hand over the Pearl of Fate and reach an agreement with Grand Master Tongtian, this matter will come to an end.”","“Let’s go to the First Mountain!”","In the distance, many Grand Masters watching the battle gave orders one after another. This was the Nine Mountains Region’s operation.","The spectators finally glanced at the levitating figure.","The name of Han Yang Immortal resounded through the Star Sea.","“Grand Master, they’ve all gone to the First Mountain. Shall we go?” asked Immortal Master Mingyu’s little girl.","“Why would we go?” He said grumpily, “Anyway, I’ve informed Han Yang Immortal. This is a favor. If he becomes invincible in the future, I may be able to get some treasures from him.”","“Okay.”","Half an hour later, the onlookers in the distance left one after another.","Only then did Immortal Master Mingyu find an opportunity to fly over.","“Powerful and invincible!”","Just as he was about to say something, another person flew over from not far away, whose voice was louder than his.","“Oh, Zhang Hanyang, you are so awesome!”","Ye Longyuan ran over and flattered Zhang Han without hesitation.","“Why are you here?”","Zi Yan and the others also came out of the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot. When Chu Qingyi saw Ye Longyuan, she was surprised.","“I’m here to raid the tombs,” Ye Longyuan said casually. “I have to make money. I still owe Zhang Hanyang a lot of crystal stones. I’ll pay him back half of them this time, and I’ll keep working on it.”","Ye Longyuan smiled and threw over a Space Ring.","Zhang Han glanced at it and took it directly.","At this point, the effect of the incantation in the past had long been gone, but Ye Longyuan and the others obeyed it.","Ye Longyuan took out another Space Ring and said, “This one belongs to Shi Fenghou. I ran into him last time. We both agreed that if either of us meets you, that person will repay you on behalf of both of us.”","“How is Shi Fenghou doing?” Mu Xue asked curiously.","“He’s now at the third or fourth tier of the Tribulation Stage, not like me. I’m already an Immortal Master. Mu Xue, call me Immortal Master Dragon-king from now on.” Ye Longyuan put his hands behind his back.","Immortal Master Mingyu instantly glanced at him from the corners of his eyes.","“What an arrogant attitude this kid has!”","“Uh, is it really okay for you to be so arrogant in front of my dad?” Mengmeng teased.","They were really relieved and proud that Zhang Han had won the battle and he was invincible in the world. More importantly, they were now completely relaxed.","Now, they could choose to stay or leave.","“Ahem, ahem.” Ye Longyuan coughed softly and said, “I told you guys that Zhang Hanyang was not at the same level as us when he beat us like that.”","“Haha, I’m sorry, but I’m also at the sixth tier of the Tribulation Stage now,” Mu Xue said flatly.","“Me too.” Zhao Feng nodded.","“Me too.”","“I’m also a sixth-tier cultivator.”","“I’m about to reach the seventh tier.”","Ye Longyuan looked embarrassed as he stood aside and stared.","“Alas!”","Ming Yu sighed softly, “You are relaxed now. Many forces have gone to First Mountain. Han Yang Immortal, what are you going to do next?”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","All eyes were focused on Zhang Han again.","He smiled faintly and said, “I’ve been attacked for so many years. Now I’m going to take the initiative. Grand Master Tongtian didn’t die this time, but his strength has been greatly damaged. He may only be at the seventh or eighth tier.”","“Damn!”","Immortal Master Mingyu gasped.","He hesitated for a moment and wanted to ask something, but he didn’t know what to say.","Zhang Han knew what he was thinking at a glance. He shook his head and said, “There is no Pearl of Fate, or in other words, it existed, but now it’s gone.”","“Is, is this a misunderstanding?” Immortal Master Mingyu said, “If it really doesn’t work, I’ll release the news. But those people will never believe it. Forget it. I didn’t intend to go to the First Mountain. Now that I think about it, I’d better go there. I’ll tell you if there’s any news.”","In next to no time, Immortal Master Mingyu and the others had left, and they intended to take the members of the Holy Lands with them to the First Mountain.","When he left, the little girl next to him was silent for a while.","She then muttered, “Grand Master, you’re going to be a spy openly.”"]},{"number":1714,"title":"Chapter 1714 Persuade Him to Retreat","paragraphs":["Chapter 1714 Persuade Him to Retreat","“So what if I’m a spy?”","Grand Master Mingyu said casually, “I still care about my prestige as a spy. I find that you have been shocked recently. You need to flatter me, not belittle me, understand?”","“Oh, I see. You’re the most powerful, Grand Master. You’re invincible in the world,” the little girl immediately said.","After Immortal Master Mingyu heard this, the corners of his mouth trembled. “Don’t say that again. It sounds awkward. No one in the world is a match for Han Yang Immortal now.”","“Then what should I say?” the little girl asked.","“I’m actually very strong now. For example, if Grand Master Tongtian dares to appear in front of me, I can kill him with one palm strike.” Immortal Master Mingyu snorted.","“That’s awesome! But that Grand Master Tongtian is said to be only at the seventh or eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage,” the little girl said.","“Why are you always ruining everything?” Immortal Master Mingyu said grumpily, “From now on, you need to say that I’m number two in the world, not number one. Do you hear me?”","“Got it. You rank second in the world, Grand Master. You can’t defeat Han Yang Immortal.”","“Alas!”","Immortal Master Mingyu said with exhaustion, “Even though it’s the truth, you just have to say the first line. Keep the second line to yourself.”","“Okay. Got it.”","“And then?”","“You don’t allow others to say that you’re the second in the world.”","“Stupid...”","The two of them flew all the way back to the Holy Land. Immortal Master Mingyu said in an imposing manner, “Soldiers, head to the First Mountain!”","The Holy Land’s main force had moved.","On Zhang Han’s side.","As Ye Longyuan arrived, Mu Xue, Chen Changqing, and the others became more active and chatted with each other for a while.","They had the same topic. Back then, they were all in the same group.","“At that time, my name, Emperor Qing, was also very famous. Everyone said that I was a talent specialized in dealing with your worldlet.” Chen Changqing bragged.","“Oh please. If Zhang Hanyang hadn’t come out, I would have beaten you up long ago,” Ye Longyuan said.","“You wouldn’t get to do that. At that time, I...” Mu Xue couldn’t help but say a few words.","They chatted for a few hours.","“Alas, the Highest Clouds Star is gone.” Immortal Master Waterheaven sighed. “Oh, Hanyang, what can we do?”","He wanted to give some advice, but he felt that it was not a good idea, so he didn’t say it out loud.","“Let’s go to the First Mountain.”","Zhang Han said calmly, “Before Grand Master Tongtian died, he locked my Qi and blood with a Supreme Soul Method. He was courting death.”","Grand Master Tongtian had countless means. When Zhang Han was fighting, he killed Grand Master Tongtian with the Blood Killing Skill. Unexpectedly, Grand Master Tongtian also used the Blood Killing Skill to hide a trace of his Qi and blood in Zhang Han.","This was a soul method.","Zhang Han tried some methods, but he couldn’t expel the method. It seemed that it would last for about five years.","Since Grand Master Tongtian desperately wanted to know his location, Zhang Han might as well kill his way through.","Grand Master Tongtian knew where he was. Similarly, Zhang Han had a way to know where Grand Master Tongtian was.","“Let’s go!”","The crowd set off as soon as he said that.","Tiny Tot swam into the void, entered the secondary space, and began to fly forward.","It would take four or five years to go from the Seventh Mountain to the First Mountain at the fastest speed.","Grand Master Tongtian and the others soon arrived and walked on the Ancient Road of Starry Sky. Unfortunately, ordinary outsiders didn’t know about such a place.","“When this battle is over, we’d better go back to Earth and stay there for a while.” Zhang Guangyou suggested, “In the Star Sea, there are always fights. I’m scared.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly and said, “As long as we get rid of them, there will be no more trouble.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Tiny Tot shuttled through the secondary space. When it passed by a planet, the crowd would occasionally go out to have a look.","“This is the Nankong Holy Land. There’s no one here.”","Immortal Master Lingxi said in shock, “We have passed by seven Holy Lands, and no one is there. The cities are empty, and even the Dao Seeking Cultivators who live there have left. It seems that they have all gone to the First Mountain.”","Many planets were empty. Only the electricity and the intelligent system were still running, and there was no sign of human habitation. The crowd left and went to First Mountain.","“It’ll be troublesome if they find out about the Pearl of Fate.”","Zhang Mu sighed softly.","Sometimes, gossip was terrifying. The entire Nine Mountains Region was on the side of Grand Master Tongtian. There were too many enemies. Even if they were suppressed by tough means, Zhang Han’s team would probably be regarded as overbearing and ruthless.","Zhang Han said calmly, “If we kill them, there will be no more trouble.”","His words made everyone nod.","Now, many forces were confident while they were in groups. But once they were breached, they would retreat in the face of their own life-and-death problems.","Although the Pearl of Fate was amazing, only living mattered to those people.","Soon, Zhang Han and the others left the Seventh Mountain and arrived at the Sixth Mountain through the Space Shooting Planet.","The entire Seventh Mountain was empty.","In the face of such a storm, most of the forces went to the First Mountain.","Many of them might not be on Grand Master Tongtian’s side, but they wanted to figure out what was going on with the Pearl of Fate.","“The Sixth Mountain seems to be empty. I can’t see any Dao Seeking Cultivator.”","In the Nine Mountains Region, even if some of the Holy Lands were unwilling to get involved in the disputes, they would still lead a team and leave for some planets of their sects in the inner ring to live there for the time being. They would not care about worldly affairs. No matter what happened to Han Yang Immortal and Grand Master Tongtian, they would not get involved or offend either side.","They couldn’t afford to offend those two, but they could hide.","That was what some forces were doing.","They never expected the conflict to affect the entire Nine Mountains Region.","Therefore, Zhang Han basically didn’t see any Dao Seeking Cultivator along the way.","“We’ve arrived at the Fifth Mountain.”","“There’s no one here. Did they all go to the First Mountain?”","“There are so many Dao Seeking Cultivators in the Nine Mountains Region. Just thinking about it makes my scalp tingle.”","According to people’s previous thoughts, how could a single person fight against the Nine Mountains Region?","But now, they suddenly found that no matter how many people there were, it seemed to be very difficult to deal with Han Yang Immortal. It was very difficult to kill him at all.","Zhang Han’s team passed by the Fourth Mountain, the Third Mountain, and then the Second Mountain.","It took them four years to get to the First Mountain from the Seventh Mountain.","Even the skill that Grand Master Tongtian cast on Zhang Han before his death was running out of its effect.","Everyone looked from afar.","In the peripheral area of the First Mountain, there were already groups of fleets levitating in the air with extraordinary momentum.","The leader was still Grand Master Tongtian. He had already brought people here to prepare in advance.","“Here you are, Han Yang Immortal.” The duplication of Grand Master Tongtian had no momentum, and his strength was greatly damaged. No one could see through him.","“You dare to show up again?”","Zhang Han left the secondary space of Tiny Tot and faced the crowd in front of him alone.","“Ha...”","Grand Master Tongtian chuckled. He shook his head and said, “Do you really think we can’t deal with you? You’re too naive. How can our Holy Land, which has existed for tens of thousands of years, not have extraordinary means? Since you dare to come to our Holy Land, you’ll definitely die!”","Swoosh!","As soon as Grand Master Tongtian finished speaking, his figure slowly dissipated, leaving no chance for Zhang Han to get close to him and make a move.","He couldn’t defeat Zhang Han. Even Grand Master Tongtian, who often looked down on the world, couldn’t face Zhang Han head-on.","He disappeared. However, many of the teams from the Holy Lands present did not leave.","One of the teams slowly approached, and the leading old man said with a smile, “I am the Grand Master of the Luke Holy Land. Our Holy Land has cooperated with the Highest Clouds Palace for 30 years. I am also an old friend of Immortal Master Waterheaven, so I came to see you.”","When Zhang Han saw the scene on the opposite side, he did not say anything. Running his power a bit, he asked the people in Tiny Tot’s Alternate Space to show up.","“Grand Master Luke.” Immortal Master Waterheaven cupped his hands. “I didn’t expect to see you here.”","This Grand Master was obviously afraid of Zhang Han, so he didn’t dare to say something directly. He said in a roundabout way, “Immortal Master Waterheaven, many of our forces are willing to help rebuild the Highest Clouds Palace. We can also offer half of the resources of our sects. From the First Mountain to the Ninth Mountain, each sect can give up some planets for the Highest Clouds Palace to develop. What do you think?”","“What is your purpose?” Immortal Master Waterheaven let out a soft sigh. He seemed to have guessed that the other party had an idea.","As expected-","“Well, since we are friends, I’ll get straight to the point. What we want is still the Pearl of Fate,” Grand Master Luke said.","“Immortal Master Waterheaven!”","At that moment, a large number of people flew over from afar. They were all acquaintances of Immortal Master Waterheaven. They were super sects or Holy Lands that had cooperated with the Highest Clouds Palace.","“Lord Han Yang Immortal, what we want is the Pearl of Fate. Grand Master Tongtian said that no matter what the result is, he will hand over the Heavenly Bead to all Dao Seeking Cultivators.”","“Han Yang Immortal, I’m the Sect Leader of the White-mountain Sect. You’re a magnanimous man, and you’re the No. 1 Expert in the Star Sea. Think about it. Over the years, very few people in the Cultivation World have gone to the world of immortals because of the lack of rules. As long as you offer the Pearl of Fate, it will be a blessing for the entire Star Sea, and at that time, your name will be remembered forever and praised by the whole world.”","“Han Yang Immortal and all the masters, the Nine Mountains Region can’t stand the war at this level. You’re a magnanimous man, and you should live and let live.”","Those words made people silent.","It turned out that these powers who had previously cooperated with the Highest Clouds Palace were all here for the Pearl of Fate.","“Milord, what do you think? As long as you agree, we are willing to take you as our king,” someone said.","“Not bad.” Zhang Han nodded.","Everyone was pleasantly surprised. “My Lord, did you really agree?”","“Agree to what?” Zhang Han asked.","At this time, the expressions of Zi Yan, Mengmeng, Zhang Guangyou, and the others changed slightly.","They felt that this group of Dao Seeking Cultivators in front of them was near the end of their lives. They were risking their lives.","The situation did not surprise them.","The crowd in front of them said, “Hand over the Pearl of Fate, and let’s call it a day. Han Yang Immortal, you are number one, but you can’t be the enemy of the entire Nine Mountains Region. All human Dao Seeking Cultivators in the First Mountain are eager to see you make the right choice.”","“Ha...”","Zhang Han was both amused and furious. He hated the group of people in front of him very much. He said, “What I mean is that your theory is not bad. You’re just like those keyboard warriors.”","“So you don’t agree?” A Grand Master changed his expression slightly.","“It’s none of your business.” Zhang Han looked indifferent.","“It’s just a treasure. You can use it first and then leave it to everyone else,” Grand Master Luke said in confusion.","“At this time, he is still unwilling to hand over the treasure related to the fate of the Star Sea? How dare he go against the entire Star Sea?”","“What are you talking about? My daughter has absorbed the Pearl of Fate. How can I hand it over?” Zhang Han asked.","“Is that so?”","Unexpectedly, Grand Master Luke was pleasantly surprised. “That’s great. As long as it’s not absorbed by you, you can hand it over!”","Clatter!","Zhao Feng and others’ hearts skipped a beat.","Zhang Guangyou and the others couldn’t bear to look straight at the scene.","“Tell me, how am I going to hand it over?” Zhang Han looked at Grand Master Luke coldly.","“It’s very simple. Let your daughter disperse all her blood essence and soul. We can naturally extract and condense the treasure’s energy,” said Grand Master Luke immediately. “That’s why I said that as long as you didn’t absorb it, there’s no problem at all.”","“This matter is easy to deal with, and the battle can be avoided.” A Sect Leader smiled and said, “After this is done, we will offer hundreds of millions of beautiful women to you, Han Yang Immortal. By then, you can have as many daughters as you want.”","“Now we can relax. Hahaha, Han Yang Immortal, I was afraid that if you had absorbed it in person, we would have come here for nothing and have to go back.”","Grand Master Luke said seriously, “A person’s sacrifice means nothing. Han Yang Immortal, what do you think?”","Under the gaze of everyone, including the fleets behind the hundreds of people and many people nearby, Zhang Han darkened his face.","He nodded and replied seriously, “Grand Master Luke, right? You’re right.”","“Then, Han Yang Immortal...” Grand Master Luke looked pleasantly surprised.","He felt that as a friendly partner of the Highest Clouds Palace, he played a big role at this time. “He has made the right choice!”","However, before he finished speaking, Zhang Han raised his right hand and waved.","Boom!","Grand Master Luke turned into ashes and then disappeared.","At the same time, Zhang Han said coldly, “How dare you, a bunch of nobodies, tell me what to do?","“Hahaha, a person’s sacrifice means nothing? In my eyes, you are not as good as a speck of dust under my feet. Shame on you!","“Go to hell!”","The echo spread all over the void. Zhang Han attacked with all his strength, and his six bodies appeared at the same time. The power was amazing."]},{"number":1715,"title":"Chapter 1715 Invite the Ancestors","paragraphs":["Chapter 1715 Invite the Ancestors","Zhang Han was like a Killing God that no one could stop.","The hundreds of Sect Masters and Grand Masters in front of him thought that with their friendly relationship with the Highest Clouds Palace, they would be able to persuade him.","When large-scale battles broke out in the Star Sea, many sects would unite together to persuade the one who started the war, and they would usually get what they wanted.","But no one had expected that Han Yang Immortal would not listen to them at all.","According to the thoughts and customs of Immortal Master Luke, he could give up his women and children. He had more than 5,000 children, and he couldn’t remember all of their names. He didn’t care about one of them dying.","However, he didn’t know that what he said about asking Mengmeng to sacrifice herself made Zhang Han really angry.","Zhang Han’s attack was shocking, and the hundreds of people in front of him all died in the blink of an eye.","These were all Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage experts.","However, their strength was much weaker than that of Grand Master Tongtian.","Therefore, the fleets in the rear were also stunned.","“Is Han Yang Immortal still reasonable?”","Someone said in horror, “He’s gone mad! He’s gone mad! We need to leave now! No one can stop him!”","“Great Demon King! He has become a demon and is going to slaughter all the people in the world. Let’s go!”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast appeared out of thin air and smashed tens of thousands of spaceships into pieces. Most of the other fleets fled as fast as they could.","The starry sky calmed down.","“Master is too strong.” Although Mu Xue and the others had seen Zhang Han display his power many times and were used to it, they still couldn’t help but be shocked.","“Let’s go.”","To everyone’s surprise, it was Zi Yan who spoke first this time. She said softly to Zhang Han, “Let’s end this soon. I don’t want to stay in the Star Sea anymore.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han nodded.","The group returned to the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot and set off again.","Three days later.","Rumble!","A huge ball of light shook the secondary space as Tiny Tot left the secondary space.","The moment it appeared in the void of the universe, there were attacking spaceships in all directions. At a glance, there were hundreds of millions of them. Those densely packed spaceships consisted of probably more than half of the spaceships in the Nine Mountains Region.","This was a premeditated attack.","Grand Master Tongtian knew where Zhang Han was and came to intercept him in advance. All the main cannons of the spaceships lit up.","It could be said that even if one of ten thousand spaceships here were to fire their main cannons at the same time, they would be able to blow up the Vast Heaven Star. The scale of the spaceships was shockingly large.","Even Tiny Tot would easily get injured after taking such an attack.","However-","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Countless shells fell like rain.","Zhang Han snorted.","The golden light flew out. The giant Golden-armored Giant Beast was tens of thousands of feet tall.","Rumble!","Countless firepower covered the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","It was swallowed up by the waves of fire.","These spaceships were all controlled by an intelligent system. Behind them, countless eyes were fixed on the scene in the void.","“We made it!”","“Many spaceships have even integrated with Profound-grade treasures. This kind of tense attack will definitely kill the giant golden beast!”","“It will be either dead or disabled. As long as the Golden-armored Giant Beast is injured, the defensive power of Han Yang Immortal will be greatly reduced.”","“Hahahaha!”","Some Grand Masters laughed.","The next second, they were stunned by what they saw.","“What?! It’s unhurt!”","“How is that possible? There are 78 kinds of Profound-grade treasures, so many rare gems, and so many magic formations, but none of them could hurt it?”","“Is, is this still an ancient demonic beast? What kind of defensive power is this?”","When they saw this scene, their faces turned pale with horror.","At this moment, they finally realized how strong the defense of the Golden-armored Giant Beast was after several collisions.","“We can’t break it. We can’t. With this golden beast, Han Yang Immortal is invincible!”","“There’s nothing we can do.”","Silence, sorrow, and all sorts of negative emotions shrouded the teams that planned this attack.","“Ow!”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast stared into the distance with its cold eyes. Its huge roar shook people’s hearts.","Its horn shone with golden light, covering the sky and the earth. It waved its claws, and countless spaceships exploded one after another.","At this time, the Golden-armored Giant Beast had exerted its power and supreme defensive power. When Zhang Han reached the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage, nothing could break through its scales.","“He’s coming!”","“He’s getting closer and closer!”","Many Grand Masters panicked.","At this time, a high-position official of the Tongtian Holy Land arrived.","“Grand Master ordered the high-position officials of each Holy Land to go to the secret realm to negotiate some business.”","“What...”","They looked at each other. They knew very well that when they sent out the spaceships, they were already on the opposite side of Han Yang Immortal.","However, to their surprise, the fleets’ attacks didn’t work at all.","Zhang Han set off again.","Soon, he arrived at the middle area of the First Mountain.","On the edge of this area, there was a group of tens of thousands of people. They were about 30 meters tall, with stone-like skin and mottled marks. They looked like they were from the Stoneman Clan, staring coldly ahead.","“Come out!”","The leader was wearing a set of golden armor. He launched a palm strike, which shook the void around Tiny Tot and sent it flying.","Zhang Han appeared alone again.","“I am the king of the Ancient Red Stone Clan. I’m now ordering you to withdraw!” the Red Stone King in golden armor said coldly.","At this time, one of his subordinates next to him said coldly, “Han Yang Immortal, our Ancient Red Stone Clan has been living in the secret realm of Immortal Master Tongtian and has not appeared for tens of thousands of years. We heard that you have caused trouble for him. You’re now ordered to retreat quickly.”","“The Red Stone Clan? What’s that?” Zhang Han replied flatly.","“Hmm?”","The subordinate sneered and said, “Han Yang Immortal, although your strength is extraordinary, do you really think you are invincible in the Star Sea? There are many ancient mysterious clans hidden in the secret realm. Do you think you are the only one who wouldn’t die? My king can also be resurrected infinitely! My king can’t die, and our clan can also revive forever!”","“Go to hell!”","The Red Stone King in golden armor rushed up with a sword.","“He has the Law surrounding his body?”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly and took the initiative to fight back.","He believed the words of the other party. He felt that the power of the Law attached to the body of the Red Stone King was very magical. It was true that the Red Stone King could be resurrected, just like his duplications. If one of the six bodies did not die, he could be resurrected.","“It’s just that your resurrection ability is too weak.”","Zhang Han shook his head and sighed. Then, he transformed into the Nine Suns Godly Body and suddenly flew forward with a punch.","Rumble!","He shattered the Red Stone King’s long sword and even crushed his body.","“Ha...”","The subordinate of the Red Stone King who was good at talking laughed and said, “Han Yang Immortal, you are indeed powerful, but my king wouldn’t die. We can suppress you with our 13,000 people! My clan has 30,000 secret skills and 5,000 supernatural powers. Also, what else? Where is my king?”","At first, his tone was very arrogant, but as he spoke, he couldn’t continue. In front of him, Rules of the Heaven and Earth spread very fast, and their Grand Master Red Stone hadn’t been resurrected yet.","Just now, he seemed to have seen a little bit of soul energy appear in the void and dissipate directly.","“He’s dead.”","Zhang Han sneered and said, “Come on, let me see how you can be resurrected. You haven’t shown up for 10,000 years. Are you out of your mind?”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The Nine Suns Godly Body rushed into the enemy camp. With a wave of crazy attacks, the Red Stone Clan disappeared from this world.","Zhang Han found it ironic that those clansmen had not appeared in the world for thousands of years, and yet they looked down on their enemy or had been used as cannon fodder by Grand Master Tongtian.","Swoosh!","Tiny Tot set off again.","It quickly approached the top of the First Mountain.","The Tongtian Holy Land was a secret place hidden in the starry sky at the top of the Mountain.","At this time, the atmosphere here became tenser and tenser.","“There’s no way out. Either he dies, or I die!”","Grand Master Tongtian’s eyes were filled with resentment, and he had gone mad.","“Why don’t I take some people to persuade him?” Immortal Master Mingyu, who was not far away, said, “When Han Yang Immortal was undergoing the Divine Thunder Tribulation, I was also watching. I’m kind of familiar with him, so I should be able to talk him down. Don’t hold the dangerous ceremony until you’ve run out of your options.”","“I’ve made up my mind!” Grand Master Tongtian said coldly.","After that, he closed his eyes and adjusted his breath.","An expert who was familiar with Grand Master Tongtian said, “Well, it’s okay to have a try. It’s better than nothing.”","Immortal Master Mingyu didn’t say anything and took the initiative to leave the secret realm, and very few people from the other powers followed him.","When Zhang Han arrived at the top of the Mountain, he saw the fleet of Immortal Master Mingyu.","There were more than 10,000 spaceships.","“Han Yang Immortal! Come out. I have something to tell you,” said Immortal Master Mingyu lightly.","“Watch your tone, Grand Master. Be careful, or he’ll beat you to death,” the little girl next to him reminded him in a low voice.","“Tsk!”","Immortal Master Mingyu glared at her.","“I’m a spy. Why should I be afraid?”","Zhang Han soon appeared in the void.","His face darkened slightly.","Five days ago, Zi Yan suddenly felt a little scared.","As for Zhang Han, he seemed to be inexplicably worried.","“Could it be that there is an unknown crisis ahead?","“Is it my calamity?”","Zhang Han was cautious and hesitant. “Is it necessary to continue this trip in the Tongtian Holy Land?”","Luckily, Immortal Master Mingyu had arrived at this moment.","“Han Yang Immortal, let me tell you something. You’d better think about it carefully now. If you can’t think it through, it will be a big deal for you, me, and the Star Sea,” said Immortal Master Mingyu.","At that moment, an elder from the Tongtian Holy Land frowned.","He suddenly said, “Let me tell you. Han Yang Immortal, I’m Hong Yi, the First Elder of the Tongtian Holy Land. I’ve been living in a secret place and know a lot of secrets about the Cultivation World. I can tell you the biggest secret.","“In fact, the entire Cultivation World is a Sin Domain. It is an independent and enormous world that has been locked down.","“The Law here is very bad for Dao Seeking Cultivators. Since ancient times, very few people have been able to successfully go to the world of immortals by undergoing tribulations. But there are also many mighty figures who left behind important information and even many world-shocking supreme treasures.","“It just so happens that Grand Master Tongtian has that kind of treasure. If you continue to move forward, we will hold an ancestral ceremony for you. The people we invited are immortals. No matter how invincible you are in the Cultivation World, can you defeat immortals?”","Hearing his words, Zhang Han narrowed his eyes.","“Do they have a supreme treasure that can invite people from the higher world here? Is it true?”","If it was true, Zhang Han didn’t want to see it happen.","If it was not true, it could only be said that the other party had a good strategy and said something that made Zhang Han afraid.","“Don’t make a mistake, Han Yang Immortal. You should make the right choice.”","The Tongtian Holy Land’s First Elder said, “You must provide us with an answer to the Nine Mountains Region and the entire Star Sea.”","“Ahem. Ahem.”","Immortal Master Mingyu said coldly, “Han Yang Immortal, this is serious. I’ll repeat it again. This is serious. This is not a joking matter. Besides, I am here. If you take another step forward, don’t blame me for showing no mercy! For the sake of the fact that I know you, give me an explanation and I will pass on the message for you. You will leave and never contact me again.”","The little girl next to him was stunned for a few seconds. Then, she said to him via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Grand Master, your acting is quite exaggerated. It’s a little fake. I’m so embarrassed.”","Immortal Master Mingyu was speechless.","Once again, he felt mentally exhausted."]},{"number":1716,"title":"Chapter 1716 Origin","paragraphs":["Chapter 1716 Origin","What he didn’t know was that the First Elder of the Tongtian Holy Land was deeply moved at this moment.","He had never thought that even though Immortal Master Mingyu was a man of few words, he would stand firmly on the side of the Tongtian Holy Land at such a crucial moment.","Zhang Han remained silent, making the atmosphere on the field gradually tense up.","In particular, the First Elder of the Tongtian Holy Land knew very well that in fact, the success rate of the ancestral ceremony was only 30%. If they failed, they would have no chance to defeat Han Yang Immortal, but if they succeeded, the situation might not be favorable to them. After all, with the temperament of the people in the world of immortals, those people might regard them as nobodies.","One second, two seconds...","One minute passed.","Even the First Elder of the Tongtian Holy Land could hear his own heartbeat.","It had been a long time since he had been so nervous.","He was more willing to let Han Yang Immortal leave.","Finally, Zhang Han spoke.","He took a deep breath and said, “Tell them that I will give them an answer about the Pearl of Fate. After that, we will mind our own business. I am invincible in the Cultivation World, but I am not going to conquer the world. I have no intention to start a war, so I will give them a chance.”","Zhang Han was not afraid of them. He was worried about his calamity.","He didn’t know what would happen, and he didn’t know the details according to Sir’s tone. He just said that Zhang Han had been reborn and needed to face a calamity.","Not to mention whether the ancestral ceremony would affect him or not, Zhang Han’s duplications belonged to the higher world. Besides, Zhang Han felt that it was not safe to continue to fight against Grand Master Tongtian. Grand Master Tongtian’s strength had been greatly damaged, so it didn’t make much sense to kill him.","Zhang Han thought about it and chose to give the other party a chance.","Zhang Han said, “Ask them now. I’ll leave after that.”","“You are a sensible man, Han Yang Immortal. I admire you. Well...” Immortal Master Mingyu looked at the First Elder of the Tongtian Holy Land. “What do you want to ask?”","“In the entire Nine Mountains Region, the only thing we pay the most attention to is the Pearl of Fate. Han Yang Immortal, we desperately hope that you can hand it over,” said the First Elder.","“The Pearl of Fate has been broken. My daughter has absorbed it, so I can’t take it out,” Zhang Han said directly.","“It’s hard to explain that to the Dao Seeking Cultivators of the Nine Mountains Region,” the First Elder of the Tongtian Holy Land said softly.","Zhang Han frowned slightly and said coldly, “Do you want me to kill some people to explain myself?”","Hiss!","The First Elder gasped.","At this point, they couldn’t threaten Han Yang Immortal. A group of Holy Lands that they had sent out to cooperate with the Highest Clouds Palace had been killed.","In the entire Nine Mountains Region, no one was a match for Han Yang Immortal.","From a certain point of view, Zhang Han was already showing them enough respect by explaining a few words.","“This is terrifying. No one can defeat him. What explanation do we need? I’ll take it as a way out.”","The First Elder of the Tongtian Holy Land cupped his hands.","“I see. I’ll report it to the Grand Master as soon as I get back.”","Zhang Han looked at them silently. He then turned around and left. He went into the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot, entered the void, and left.","“Why are we leaving?”","Immortal Master Lingxi said in surprise, “We’re now at the top of the First Mountain. We’ll reach the Tongtian Holy Land soon. At this time, the strength of Grand Master Tongtian has been greatly damaged. We should take him down in one go. As long as the Tongtian Holy Land is destroyed, the conflict will end.”","She felt that with Zhang Han’s character, Zhang Han should be able to defeat all of those enemies.","The others didn’t say anything.","They knew Zhang Han. The reason why he wanted to leave might be that he was afraid of the ancestral ceremony.","“This battle is almost over. We didn’t lose anything. Although Grand Master Tongtian is not dead, he doesn’t have much power now. It’s impossible for him to return to the Peak Stage.” Zhang Han shook his head and said, “Let’s go back to Earth and rest for a while.”","“That’s a good idea,” Zhang Mu said. “It’s been some time since we came out. Zhang Han has been fighting all the time. It’s inevitable that he will get tired. Let’s go back and recuperate.”","“Yes, the battle has been going on for too long, and we’ve seen enough of it,” Zhang Guangyou echoed.","“Let’s go back. After a while, when they figure it out, no one will dare to provoke us,” Dong Chen said.","They felt that Zhang Han was fighting alone, and all the responsibilities were on him. It would not be good for him to fight for a long time.","Moreover, they didn’t want to gamble on something full of accidents. If that group of people brought the ones from the world of immortals over, it would be really troublesome.","Zhang Han’s team left and set foot on the Space Node leading to the outer ring of the First Mountain, ready to return.","At this moment, Immortal Master Mingyu heaved a sigh of relief.","He and the others also returned to the Tongtian Holy Land.","On the way, the First Elder pondered for a long time and said, “Mingyu, how do you think I should persuade Grand Master about this? He is determined to hold the ancestral ceremony. I can feel it.”","“What?” Immortal Master Mingyu was shocked. “Why didn’t you say so earlier? If we invite the immortals over, it may not be good for us. Besides, even if those immortals are here, they may not attack Han Yang Immortal as we wish.”","“I’m also worried about that.” The First Elder sighed. “However, Grand Master’s strength has been damaged, and he can’t return to the Peak Stage. It’s an extravagant hope for him to go to the world of immortals. Also, many Holy Lands agree with this matter. They think that this may be an opportunity. Instead of letting Han Yang Immortal dominate the Cultivation World alone, it’s better to invite the ancestors over.”","“Isn’t... isn’t it good to stay alive?” Immortal Master Mingyu laughed bitterly.","“The ceremony requires the blood essence of the Human Clans to be activated through the Grand Master’s supreme treasures. If some of the people disagree, then the ceremony can’t be carried out. I’ll try to persuade Grand Master when we get back,” the First Elder said.","At this time, another Grand Master said, “What’s wrong with inviting the ancestors? The people who come here will all be immortals. Maybe we can find a way to the world of immortals. This time, Tongtian Holy Land has gathered all the Dao Seeking Cultivators from the Nine Mountains Region. The myriad clans are on the First Mountain. If we miss this opportunity, we may not be able to gather all the clans next time. Why don’t we give it a try?”","The First Elder of the Tongtian Holy Land was silent for a moment. “It is indeed a way. Maybe opportunity and danger coexist. I just think that it is better to negotiate with Han Yang Immortal than to invite the ancestors.”","“How can we negotiate with that brutal Demon King? Even those cooperative forces have been beaten to death by him. How can he negotiate with us?” The Grand Master sneered.","“Didn’t Han Yang Immortal explain it to us just now?” Immortal Master Mingyu couldn’t help but refute, “The Pearl of Fate is gone. We just need to pretend that we don’t know about it. We’ll do everything as usual. There is no need to talk about the Pearl of Fate.”","“In my opinion, Mingyu, you’re too shortsighted.” The Grand Master by his side shook his head and said, “You dared to fight and go all out all those years ago, so why are you so cowardly now?”","“Alright.”","Immortal Master Mingyu couldn’t be bothered to say anything.","They flew all the way back to the Tongtian Holy Land. When they entered the passage to the secret realm and arrived on the continent, they saw a huge palace with tens of thousands of clans gathering. It was surrounded by light. The blood essence of each clan was constantly converging up like raindrops.","There was a golden ring in the air, which was constantly rotating and emitting supreme power. It overshadowed everything. It was as if the whole world could not accommodate the ring’s power, and muffled sounds were constantly coming from the surrounding space.","“Oh, my god!”","The Tongtian Holy Land’s First Elder narrowed his eyes, his voice quivering. “The, the ancestral ceremony has begun!”","“Start to invite the ancestors!”","“Hahahaha!”","Some Grand Masters who were with him laughed out loud.","Hiss!","Immortal Master Mingyu gasped. When he sensed the power above him, his scalp went numb.","“What should I do?”","“This is too terrifying. My, my heart can’t take it anymore. No, no, I’m going back to the Holy Land to hide. I’m done!”","Immortal Master Mingyu found an excuse to slip away.","The First Elder of the Tongtian Holy Land was stunned.","Fortunately, Immortal Master Mingyu didn’t say that he had a stomachache or anything. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be able to leave the Holy Land.","Some noticed Immortal Master Mingyu, but under the watchful eyes of the First Elder of the Tongtian Holy Land, they let him go.","It didn’t matter that one person was leaving since the members of the myriad clans were there.","Just as Immortal Master Mingyu was about to leave, he turned to look behind him.","Grand Master Tongtian was levitating in the sky. He spread out his arms, surrounded by energy, and recited the ancient inscriptions in a low voice.","More than a thousand top-tier Grand Masters of the same level were levitating a kilometer below Grand Master Tongtian. They were gathering the blood essence of various clans and sending it to Elder Tongtian. Then, the blood essence, including the ring, would be controlled by Grand Master Tongtian.","The power became more and more intense. It was as if the sky was falling and the earth was cracking.","Gradually, even the rules of the world were suppressed by the ring. Suddenly, there was a colorful light in the ring.","If Zhang Han and the others saw it, they would definitely know that the light swirling inside was similar to that on the Ancient Road of Starry Sky from the Boundless Sea to the Sea Dragon Star Area.","They gradually made their way.","Someone cried out in surprise, “The gate of the world of immortals is about to open!”","After he finished speaking, Immortal Master Mingyu left with a swish.","“This is incredible.","“The power is shocking. It’s unbelievable.”","Immortal Master Mingyu asked, “Which direction did Han Yang Immortal and the others go? Hurry up and catch up with them. Hurry up. Maybe it’s not too late.”","“Well...”","The little girl next to him was silent for two seconds. “It seems to be here.”","She opened the Star Map and pointed in a direction.","“Don’t guess. Is this their direction?”","“Yes, Grand Master. They’re heading in that direction.”","“This direction leads to the inner ring. Let’s chase after them.”","The great condor of Immortal Master Mingyu was fairly fast as well.","But he couldn’t catch up with Zhang Han’s team at all.","Smack!","The energy emitted by Immortal Master Mingyu turned into a long whip. It hit the great condor as if it were whipping a horse. It looked like a whip, but in fact, it was injecting energy into the great condor.","Through his and the great condor’s efforts, finally, ten days later, Immortal Master Mingyu sensed the trajectory of Tiny Tot.","“Wait, Han Yang Immortal, wait!”","Ming Yu used his supernatural power. The sound waves were so fast that they swept around Tiny Tot.","“Hmm?”","Tiny Tot appeared in the cosmos, and Zhang Han also flew out.","“Not good!”","Before Immortal Master Mingyu could say anything, the little girl beside him said, “Han Yang Immortal, things are not good. When we went back, the Tongtian Holy Land was already holding the ancestral ceremony. Judging from their particularly powerful momentum, it seems that they’re about to succeed.”","Zhang Han frowned slightly when he heard that.","The so-called ancestral ceremony was nothing more than to invite people from the higher world, and his six bodies were also from the higher world.","He did have the power to fight against the enemy, but what level the people from the higher world were at was very important.","“You’ve said what I wanted to say.”","Immortal Master Mingyu said grumpily, “Han Yang Immortal, bad news. The ancestral ceremony has begun.”","Helplessly, he repeated it again.","“Furthermore, I can feel...”","Immortal Master Mingyu added in a low voice, “The ancestral ceremony cannot be stopped once it starts. Even the rules of the Tongtian Holy Land will be suppressed.”"]},{"number":1717,"title":"Chapter 1717 The Arrival of Immortals","paragraphs":["Chapter 1717 The Arrival of Immortals","Hearing the words of Immortal Master Mingyu, everyone present was astounded and fell into silence.","They didn’t know what to say.","The silence wasn’t broken until Yue Xiaonao said in a cold voice, “That Grand Master Tongtian coveted the Pearl of Fate and attacked us many times. If Uncle Zhang couldn’t defend against him, we would all have been killed by him. Now, Uncle Zhang has retreated and given him a way out, but he still wants to make trouble. He is really courting death!”","What she said made everyone come to their senses.","“That’s true, but the Cultivation World is not a place to reason.” Dong Chen snorted and said, “We didn’t take the initiative to start a war, but they didn’t let us go. Now they’re going to hold some ancestral ceremony. The fuck with that.”","“What if they really invite immortals here?” Immortal Master Mingyu said worriedly, “Han Yang Immortal, although your combat capability is very strong and you are invincible in the Cultivation World, I’m afraid that the people from the world of immortals are quite dangerous.”","“Humph.”","Zhang Guangyou snorted and said, “At worst, we won’t come back. Let’s see what tricks they can play. The Star Sea is so big. Finding a few people is more difficult than finding a needle in a haystack.”","“Yes,” Chu Qingyi said. “Let’s go back and rest for a while. When the time comes, we can just inquire about what they have done.”","Zi Yan had mixed feelings.","Would the ancestral ceremony bring danger to everyone?","“Where are you going?” Immortal Master Mingyu asked curiously.","“We’re going back to our hometown.” Immortal Master Waterheaven sighed softly. “The Highest Clouds Palace still has millions of people. I’m not going to stay in the Star Sea anymore. I’ve already informed them that those who are willing to go may go to the Silver Dragon Galaxy with us.”","“A Galaxy.”","Immortal Master Mingyu rolled his eyes and said, “I’ve never heard of the Silver Dragon Galaxy. Well, how about this? I’ll go with you and travel there. Anyway, I have nothing to do. Besides, the ancestral ceremony they’re holding seems to be very scary. They may invite a group of fierce people over. I’ll hide during this period. Well, why don’t you talk to me? Do you welcome me?”","He felt like he was performing a monologue, and no one paid attention to him.","Zhang Han was amused and said, “Go if you want.”","Immortal Master Mingyu had taken the risk to go to the Highest Clouds Star to tell Zhang Han the news, and then he went to the Tongtian Holy Land to inquire about it. Although Immortal Master Mingyu was gossipy and liked to watch the fun, his friendly attitude was very clear. He was on the side of Zhang Han.","Therefore, Zhang Han didn’t care. He didn’t think that Immortal Master Mingyu would turn on him. Once he entered Earth, the news couldn’t spread. Zhang Han also believed in his judgment.","“That’s great!”","Immortal Master Mingyu smiled faintly and said, “Let’s go out for a walk. Leave the matter of the Star Sea here for the time being. I plan to come back after traveling around for a hundred years.”","“Let’s go!”","Zhang Han nodded slightly, and everyone went to the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot.","“Damn, it’s so big!”","After seeing this, Immortal Master Mingyu said in surprise, “The Ancient Cursed Roc is really powerful. The Alternate Space is really big.”","“Grand Master, don’t act like you’ve never seen so much of the world.” The little girl next to him said those words via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","“Shut up,” Immortal Master Mingyu responded via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","At this time, Zhang Guangyou asked, “How’s the ancestral ceremony going over there?”","He wanted to ask about the details.","Immortal Master Mingyu thought for a moment and said, “When we met and went back, it had already begun. From the looks of it, it should have been going on for a few days. The power should be very strong. There is a huge ring in the air, surrounded by light. It gives me a feeling that there is a terrifying creature inside. I heard them talking about it. This ancestral ceremony may last for a month. It took me ten days to catch up with you, and there should be a result in less than twenty days. But I feel that it is very likely to succeed because the aura is too stable.”","“It won’t take long. We’re on the way, and the results over there will come out soon,” Chen Changqing said.","This conclusion also made the scene quiet down.","“However, it doesn’t matter since we’re so far away,” said Immortal Master Mingyu.","It made sense, but Zhang Han still felt that something was wrong.","He said, “Let’s go!”","Swoosh!","Zi Yan communicated with Tiny Tot with her mind.","The Ancient Cursed Roc could give full play to its power and speed. It could overuse its power. In the secondary space, Tiny Tot was surrounded by monstrous black mist. It had even surpassed the Space Shooting Planets.","Just like that, the team arrived at the outer ring. This was the route that everyone had discussed before coming here. A few of the Highest Clouds Palace’s fleets were waiting. There were many disciples, and only a few hundred thousand of them had left. The rest followed along. They did it not only because of Immortal Master Waterheaven but also the Second Elder.","“Second Elder is invincible in the Cultivation World. If we follow him all the way, we can witness many miracles and get more cultivation resources. What’s so good about going to the Galaxy?”","Many Dao Seeking Cultivators of the Highest Clouds Palace discussed animatedly and finally decided to go to the gathering place on the outer ring of the First Mountain.","All the fleets moved.","The spaceships flew to the edge of the Cosmos Node.","Mengmeng stretched out her right hand and grabbed something in the air.","The Ancient Road of Starry Sky was opened.","“What kind of skill is this?”","Immortal Master Mingyu was stunned.","They entered the Ancient Road of Starry Sky one after another. In the blink of an eye, they arrived at the Boundless Sea.","Mengmeng looked up at Zhang Han and asked, “Are we going to the ancient martial arts world directly?”","“Yeah.”","Zhang Han nodded gently.","He didn’t need to tell her what to do. There were many fleets. If anyone was in a bad mood and cast a few supernatural powers while flying above the secular world, it would be earth-shattering.","After thinking for a while, Mengmeng directly opened the Space Portal and arrived at the ancient martial arts world in the blink of an eye.","Seeing this, Yue Wuwei felt distressed and reminded her, “Mind the Source, the Source of the world!”","“It doesn’t matter.” Mengmeng chuckled and said, “We don’t use it much. Nothing wrong will happen. I can feel it.”","Only then did Yue Wuwei feel a little better.","As for Immortal Master Mingyu, he just stared at Mengmeng.","“This girl is really special. She can get the Space Portal and the Ancient Road of Starry Sky with just a wave of her hand. She is amazing.”","They followed the ancient martial arts world to the Silver Dragon Galaxy.","“Another Ancient Road of Starry Sky.”","Immortal Master Mingyu looked left and right. “Your homeland isn’t ordinary.”","“Just watch,” Immortal Master Lingxi replied calmly.","When she first arrived, she was also shocked for a long time.","“You’re back.”","In the Silver Dragon Galaxy, they saw Liu Qingfeng and the others, who had been developing their business like playing games, constantly filling up all the major sections of the Silver Dragon Galaxy.","“Qingfeng, make some arrangements and start to deploy some precautions. We’ll go back to Earth for the time being and won’t come out,” Zhang Han said directly.","“Hmm?”","Liu Qingfeng slightly changed his expression. “Do we have a powerful enemy?”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “It’s just preventive measures. The power of the entrance to the Ancient Road of Starry Sky will be a hundred times lower than before. Just keep the situation here normal.”","“What enemies can we make? Han Yang Immortal is invincible in the Cultivation World,” Immortal Master Mingyu couldn’t help but say, “but there may be unknown enemies that we need to guard against.”","“Got it.” Liu Qingfeng did not ask about the details. Instead, he ordered, “All the high-position officials will have a meeting in an hour.”","Liu Qingfeng knew more information. When he heard about the ancestral ceremony, he was also a little confused.","“What the hell is an ancestral ceremony?”","Thinking that he might have to face an enemy from the higher world, Liu Qingfeng couldn’t make up his mind. After thinking about it carefully, he said, “Then let’s activate the first-level alert and spread it all over the Galaxy. If an enemy comes, we’ll just escape and go to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven to meet our people. Seal the Ancient Road of Starry Sky. This is the warning plan we’ve prepared.”","Many details were settled in a few hours.","A large number of people and vigilant spaceships began to make arrangements in the Silver Dragon Galaxy.","At the same time, Liu Qingfeng and a large group of people also returned to the secular world.","This was not only because they were worried and on guard, but also because Zhang Han suddenly felt terrified on his way back.","After he did some thinking, he found that at that time, it seemed to be a period away from the 30 days that Immortal Master Mingyu spoke of.","“Are there really people from the higher world coming?”","Zhang Han felt a little pressured.","He had used the Blood Killing Skill many times to kill the duplication of Grand Master Tongtian. He had also used three drops of his blood essence to seriously injure him. After he used the blood essence, Grand Master Tongtong used his incredible supernatural power to locate Zhang Han. Now that Zhang Han’s Qi and blood had dissipated, if he stayed in the Cultivation World, perhaps Grand Master Dongtian would have a way to find him.","“I’ll continue to cultivate. If my six bodies are combined, I can definitely transcend the world,” Zhang Han thought.","Moreover, Zhang Han and Mengmeng talked about the places here.","Except for being able to control the rules of the world, there was nothing else the little princess could do. She couldn’t feel where Sir’s Mind was at all. She even tried calling out to him, but she couldn’t summon him.","The places here were unlike the Land of God’s Meteorite, which had a secret place that Mengmeng could sense.","“Honey, let’s do more Pair Cultivation,” Zi Yan said. “When you are stronger, we won’t be afraid even if we have enemies from the higher world.”","“Hmm...”","Just as Zhang Han was worried about, the situation was similar to what he had expected.","When it was the 30th day of the ancestral ceremony in the Tongtian Holy Land, the ring in the sky had a diameter of tens of thousands of feet. The elites of the myriad clans who were holding the ceremony took out their blood essence drop by drop and turned it into profound energy according to the supreme treasure controlled by Grand Master Tongtian.","In the empty space in the center of the ring, there seemed to be a starry sky, surrounded by flickering light.","Was it an Ancient Road of Starry Sky?","“The ancestral ceremony, done, done! Hahahaha, we’re going to have the immortals over!”","Grand Master Tongtian laughed wildly when he saw this.","He felt that he had great luck by succeeding in the ancestral ceremony, which only had a success rate of 33%.","“Merely, why are there no immortals descending?”","As the crowd watched, they hesitated and were stunned.","In the middle of the ring was an image of the starry sky, filled with motes of light that looked like rain. They were stars, but the images people saw made it hard to believe that they were real.","Nothing happened during the ancestral ceremony.","Gradually, a month passed.","The huge ring was still circling in the air.","However, nothing came down.","“What’s going on?”","“Grand Master Tongtian, did the ancestral ceremony fail?”","In the face of many questions, Grand Master Tongtian said in an uncertain tone, “No. The ancestral ceremony is successful. Haven’t the immortals found out about it yet?”","“We wasted so much blood essence for nothing?”","Someone said coldly, “We’re even on the opposite side of Han Yang Immortal. Grand Master Tongtian, will your stupid thing work or not?”","“Tongtian, you don’t have the strength you used to have. What did you do when we asked you to be the leader of the alliance? You sent so many people to die, and now the ancestral ceremony doesn’t work. Do you need to give everyone an explanation?”","Grand Master Tongtian’s face darkened.","Many Dao Seeking Cultivators of the myriad clans in the Star Sea were here. He had some scruples even if his strength was not damaged, not to mention that he had no strength now.","“If the ring does not disappear in a few more days, the ancestral ceremony will be successful,” Grand Master Tongtian said.","“We’ll give you time!”","Many voices of dissatisfaction began to put pressure on Grand Master Tongtian, and his hatred for Zhang Han deepened.","Another month had passed.","The ring energy began to dissipate.","“It failed.”","Many people were upset and angry.","“I’m doomed!”","Grand Master Tongtian felt a chill in his heart.","Buzz! Buzz! Buzz!","A low and deep muffled sound suddenly surged out from the middle of the ring.","“Look! Look over!”","A huge spaceship’s bow slowly appeared.","Grand Master Tongtian roared with laughter.","“Hahaha, I made it. Hahaha, the immortals have descended to the world!”","His laughter was filled with madness. He didn’t care about the consequences as he just wanted the ceremony to succeed."]},{"number":1718,"title":"Chapter 1718 Time to Fight Back","paragraphs":["Chapter 1718 Time to Fight Back","The spaceship was very large. The bow of the spaceship alone was about 8,000 feet long and oval in shape.","Seeing this, the crowd was extremely terrified.","In the Cultivation World, no spaceship could be so large. If the spaceships were too large, they were very easy to be destroyed. Moreover, the cost was extremely high. They were worthless. Even when flying in the secondary space, they might be attacked and destroyed by a single attack from some Holy Beasts among the ancient demonic beasts.","But the huge bow of the ship in front of the crowd was made of metal, giving off an extraordinary aura.","It was heavy and ancient, and there were many visible traces on the metal. From this, it could be seen that the spaceship had experienced many battles.","“This, this is actually a huge spaceship. It’s different from what I imagined!”","“I also thought there should be a lot of immortals flying down with immortal energy. Unexpectedly, it is a huge spaceship.”","“Heavens! Immortals have truly descended! They’ve truly arrived! What, what should we do?”","At that time, some people panicked.","The ones who had arrived were people from the world of immortals. If they were hostile to those mortals, the consequences would be unimaginable.","It was only at this moment that the crowd suddenly realized that ever since the ancestral ceremony had been successful, their lives and deaths had been under others’ control.","Many fence-sitters from the Holy Lands and super sects felt a trace of regret in their hearts.","They regretted what they had done.","Instead of facing the unknown fear, it was better to face Han Yang Immortal. At least he had been in the Star Sea for so many years, and his attack was not for no reason.","“I’m so scared. We shouldn’t have invited the ancestors.”","The tremendous power made some seventh-tier and eighth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivators tremble with fear.","Buzz! Buzz! Buzz!","Muffled metallic sounds rang out, filling the void. This sounded like the sound of outer space, which was astounding.","“Immortals have descended!”","There were also many excited people in the crowd.","Because they knew that since the immortals could descend, there might be a way to take them out of the Cultivation World and leave this sealed domain to experience the world of immortals, which was what they had longed for for a long time.","This was the dream of Dao Seeking Cultivators since ancient times.","The bow of the spaceship appeared, which seemed to be suppressing the void. It was completely round as if it were a whole.","Gradually, the entire body of the ship appeared. It was 2,5000 meters wide and 100,000 meters long. An enormous spaceship appeared in the void.","Sizzle!","Numerous beams of light lit up on the spaceship. The cabin doors opened one after another, and countless spaceships that no one had ever seen before appeared. They were of different shapes and sizes and covered the void. At a glance, there were at least four to five thousand of them.","“Greetings to all the True Immortals by Immortal Master Tongtian!”","Grand Master Tongtian raised his hands high and shouted, “I took the initiative to carry out the ancestral ceremony to summon all of you here, milords.”","Creak!","Many people came out of a batch of spaceships.","Those True Immortals were very different from what the crowd had imagined.","This group of people was wearing black clothes and holding guns that the crowd had never seen before. They levitated in the void in an orderly manner.","“Why do they look like soldiers from a low-tech world?”","Many Dao Seeking Cultivators were dumbfounded.","“Are they immortals?”","“I can’t sense any aura of a Dao Seeking Cultivator. Is it possible that we’ve only opened a one-way Ancient Road of Starry Sky without immortals? Is it just a small Star Area?”","“Wait! No, they don’t have any aura. How can they fly in the air? Is there some energy that we can’t detect?”","The people from the myriad clans stood in great numbers, and many Dao Seeking Cultivators were discussing.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Under the gaze of tens of thousands of people, a white spaceship, which looked like a bird, appeared from the huge metallic spaceship at an extremely fast speed. In the blink of an eye, it flew to the front and a group of people got off the spaceship.","Those people were from the Human Clan.","They were dressed in different shapes and sizes. There were about 20 people. The leader was a man with short hair and a long face. He was dressed in white clothes. His eyes were blue, and his skin was very fair. His hair was blond, and he had the temperament of a prince. He appeared elegant and calm.","“Prince Wo Lun!”","Someone said to the blond man in white, “This is really a small Level S universe.”","“Congratulations, Your Highness, for discovering this huge treasure.”","The surrounding guards congratulated him one after another.","Obviously, this man in white was the prince of a certain force.","At this moment, his face was filled with pleasant surprise as he looked down.","“It’s indeed a small Level S universe. The world’s Source and the Law are very rich. I’m really lucky.” The blond man in white smiled faintly and said, “Detect the language information of these natives below.”","Beep! Beep! Beep!","The subordinate next to him pressed a few times on a device on his arm.","Five seconds had passed.","“Your Highness, the test has been completed.”","“Okay.”","Wo Lun took out a pair of gold-rimmed glasses and put them on.","At this time, Grand Master Tongtian and the others were a little confused.","“What are the immortals talking about?”","“I don’t understand their language.”","“Could it be that they’re really from a remote Star Area?”","“No, no, no. Look at this kind of spaceship. It must be a high-tech civilization product.”","Suddenly, that man in white spoke. What he said was something that everyone present was able to understand.","“What is this world?” Prince Wo Lun asked quietly.","Hiss!","“He spoke!”","All eyes were focused on the man in white, and the field gradually fell silent.","“Immortal!”","Grand Master Tongtian said excitedly, “This is the Cultivation World. I took the initiative to hold an ancestral ceremony to invite all the lords of the world of immortals here.”","“Ancestral ceremony?” Prince Wo Lun’s eyes were a little strange, and he said, “Do you have a technological civilization here?”","When science and technology facilities and spaceships’ intelligent systems received the news, they could understand a world as soon as possible.","“Yes, yes, yes!”","Grand Master Tongtian immediately ordered, “Get someone to send the spaceship over.”","His men flew away at a high speed.","Moments later, the spaceship arrived.","“Open the database and receive the information.”","Prince Wo Lun didn’t bother to say anything more. His subordinates were still levitating in the air, holding guns in their hands and staring down coldly.","From their point of view, the tens of thousands of people below were slaves of the native world, which would bring a lot of benefits to their team.","About ten minutes later, Wo Lun and the others began to gain a comprehensive understanding of the situation.","“The Cultivation World?”","“Make it to the Heaven Road and become an immortal? Are we all immortals?”","Prince Wo Lun was pleasantly surprised. “I didn’t expect this aborigines world to be so big. A universe of stars, hahaha.”","“Congratulations, Your Highness!”","The surrounding subordinates cupped their hands and congratulated him.","A universe of stars was a relatively large world, and the small universes were surrounded by the Law. It could be imagined what kind of wealth this place could bring to Prince Wo Lun.","“Only in the indigenous world will people think of cultivation and searching for immortals.”","Some of his subordinates discussed with each other.","“Yes. The hierarchy system here is relatively complete, and their realms are exaggerated. I didn’t expect that they could also mobilize the energy of heaven and earth and achieve supernatural powers at will.”","“This is the small Level S universe. I can even feel the existence of all kinds of the Law.”","“...”","No one knew what the people in the sky were talking about.","Grand Master Tongtian and the others suddenly became a little nervous.","“Immortal, I have something to say,” Grand Master Tongtian said after taking a deep breath.","“What is it?” Prince Wo Lun flicked an indifferent glance at him.","He also knew that this man was called Tongtian, the Grand Master of the No. 1 Holy Land in the Cultivation World.","“I’m Immortal Master Tongtian. This time, I performed...”","Before he could finish his words, Wo Lun frowned slightly and interrupted, “Just address yourself by your name. Don’t call yourself Immortal Master or Grand Master. You’re just a group of Dao Seeking Cultivators. Who do you think you are to have an honorific title?”","His extremely indifferent words made everyone present feel a chill in their hearts.","Grand Master Tongtian’s face stiffened. He felt that things were different from what he had expected.","“I took the initiative to perform the ancestral ceremony to invite the immortals to fight against the enemy and go to the world of immortals,” Grand Master Tongtian said.","“Haha, you actually have a request?”","Prince Wo Lun smiled faintly and said, “For the sake that you have used the ancestral ceremony, I will grant this wish of yours.”","As he spoke, Prince Wo Lun raised his hands slightly. The Law of heaven and earth swirled around him, showing a huge golden light. The whole space seemed to be under his control. It gave people the feeling that he dominated everything between heaven and earth.","Prince Wo Lun said, “If you all want to go to the world of immortals, I’ll satisfy you. I’ll take you there, and I’ll let you join a very powerful force.”","Hiss!","What he said was surprising.","Grand Master Tongtian and other Grand Masters and high-position officials of the Holy Lands trembled with excitement.","“That’s great!”","“We can finally go to the world of immortals!”","“Hahahaha, we’ve succeeded!”","Seeing the ecstatic crowd, some of Wo Lun’s men showed disdain in their eyes.","Someone said in a low voice, “They’re indeed natives. They’re so happy to be slaves.”","At this moment, Prince Wo Lun spoke again. “Who is your enemy?”","“His name is Han Yang Immortal. He is a very powerful man, invincible in the Cultivation World, and his strength is extraordinary,” said Grand Master Tongtian.","“Let’s set him aside first.”","Prince Wo Lun said calmly, “Tongtian, I now designate you to act as the leader of the Cultivation World. You need to issue an order and tell every Dao Seeking Cultivator who wants to go to the world of immortals to gather here in the First Mountain.”","“Everyone be taken to the world of immortals?","“If I had known this would happen, I would have held the ancestral ceremony a long time ago. Why would I fight over that Pearl of Fate?”","Grand Master Tongtian was relieved. In fact, his previous worry came from the fact that when he got the supreme treasure, an unknown voice said that when the ancestral ceremony was activated and the light ring appeared, there was a high chance that it would bring horror to the world.","Now that he thought about it, it was not scary at all. Wasn’t this a benefit?","As for what they were going to do in the world of immortals, they had never thought about it. They just wanted to the world of immortals, and nothing else mattered.","“Now, continue to talk about your enemy. Don’t use any honorific title. It makes me uncomfortable,” Prince Wo Lun said.","“Yes, sir. Our enemy, Hanyang, is very strong. He has six duplications and has mastered powerful supernatural powers. This is the projection of us fighting against the enemy.”","Grand Master Tongtian was prepared. He showed the scene of the battle between Zhang Han and him in the void.","In the air, one could see Zhang Han’s four duplications casting the Blood Killing Skill. People could also see the enormous Golden-armored Giant Beast shaking the void.","“What?”","“Oh, my god!”","All of a sudden, cries of surprise came from Prince Wo Lun’s team.","“Am I seeing things? Is, is this a Golden-armored Giant Beast that has appeared in a native world?”","“Yes. It’s a Golden-armored Giant Beast tens of thousands of feet tall, and it’s underage!”","“If we capture it, its value will even surpass this small Level S universe.”","“Your Highness! We’re so lucky to meet an underage Golden-armored Giant Beast.”","Someone congratulated Prince Wo Lun, who looked pleasantly surprised at this time.","“It turns out to be a Golden-armored Giant Beast. Hahaha, I was set up by my elder brother and assigned to the border. I never thought that this trip would give me such a big surprise.”","Several of his men said one after another, “Your Highness, if you can capture the Golden-armored Giant Beast, you will definitely be able to return to the imperial palace and even assume the position of the king.”","“Not bad, not bad!”","Prince Wo Lun nodded and gazed at Grand Master Tongtian with a slightly friendly look.","He said with a smile, “Where is your enemy? Take me to kill him.”","Rumble!","He gave the final call.","The eyes of Grand Master Tongtian were filled with fierceness. “It’s time to fight back!”"]},{"number":1719,"title":"Chapter 1719 Used to Be a Great Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 1719 Used to Be a Great Emperor","“Tell the whole Cultivation World about this!”","Grand Master Tongtian’s face was flushed, and he was in high spirits. He felt as if he had become young again.","He ordered, “We’ve found a way to the world of immortals. Tell all Dao Seeking Cultivators who want to go to the world of immortals to gather at the First Mountain!","“At the same time, tell them to behave themselves and not offend the immortals.","“Go all out to search for the news of... Hanyang!”","As soon as the order was given, many teams went out to spread the news.","As for Prince Wo Lun, he had been hovering in the air the entire time, silently observing the situation below.","“It’s so beautiful, so beautiful. Everything here represents wealth.”","“The next step is to kill you.”","Grand Master Tongtian felt comfortable. Han Yang Immortal had destroyed so many of his duplications. Now, he finally succeeded in inviting the ancestors over and asking those greater experts for help to kill Han Yang Immortal.","Grand Master Tongtian cupped his hands and asked, “May I know your name, immortal?”","“Just call me Prince Wo Lun.”","“Prince Wo Lun.” Grand Master Tongtian signaled his subordinates with his eyes.","The First Elder of the Tongtian Holy Land asked with a smile, “Prince Wo Lun, you are an immortal, but there is also a problem. That Han Yang Immortal is too powerful. He is detached from the world and is an invincible figure in the Cultivation World. He also knows supreme Immortal Techniques. You should be careful.”","“Are you doubting my strength?”","Prince Wo Lun’s blond hair fluttered. He raised his right hand and pointed at the First Elder.","Swoosh!","The First Elder was surrounded by the Law of the world. Before he could say anything, he was directly obliterated and turned into nothingness.","Clatter!","Grand Master Tongtian’s heart skipped a beat.","The expressions of the others changed slightly.","They were stunned that to let everyone see his strength, Prince Wo Lun directly killed the First Elder of the Tongtian Holy Land.","“I am the ruler of this world.”","Prince Wo Lun put his hands behind his back and looked indifferent. He despised everything and stared at Grand Master Tongtian.","He said lightly, “I’ll give you ten days to find the Golden-armored Giant Beast. If you fail to do so, I’ll kill you.”","Swoosh!","Prince Wo Lun flew back to his spaceship.","“Team One, take charge of this place. The other teams, prepare the machines to capture the Golden-armored Giant Beast.”","“Yes, Grand Master!”","Many of Grand Master Tongtian’s men responded one after another.","It was only then that the crowd suddenly realized that in fact, their lives were still in the hands of others.","They all behaved themselves.","There were only five hundred people in the first team. Many mechanical facilities had been set up in various parts of the Tongtian Holy Land.","Grand Master Tongtian and the others didn’t know why Prince Wo Lun was doing this, but they knew that they couldn’t disobey him.","“Hurry up and find the news!”","Grand Master Tongtian was a little anxious.","Ten days was too short. If he couldn’t find where the beast was, he would be in trouble.","“Investigate all information about Han Yang Immortal. Be quick, and send out a reward. Whoever has the news will be rewarded with ten Profound-grade treasures.”","Grand Master Tongtian gave another order.","Soon, the people of the myriad clans returned to various halls to rest, and many Grand Masters of the Holy Lands gathered.","“He really is an immortal, and his means are extraordinary. Not even the natural laws of the world can control him. He’s a dominator here, and that’s terrifying.”","“We can only obey orders now. Once we resist, he may kill us.”","“I’m fine with that. As long as I can go to the world of immortals, I’m willing to do anything.”","“The era of Han Yang Immortal is over. Since we have invited the immortals over, I am afraid that he will die within one move.”","“...”","Countless people were discussing this matter.","They were also paying attention to the huge spaceship in the sky all the time.","“This is such a large metal spaceship. I feel that the technology of the world of immortals is much more advanced than ours.”","“They must be the subordinates of Prince Wo Lun. They have been patrolling here all the time. What kind of weapons are they holding in their hands?”","“Watch your mouth. Don’t be curious. Think about what happened to the First Elder of the Tongtian Holy Land.”","“That’s right, that’s right. We can only listen and watch, but we cannot ask. If we do, we might die.”","Ten days passed in the blink of an eye.","On the ninth day, Grand Master Tongtian’s heart sank.","If he failed to obtain the news of the Golden-armored Giant Beast within ten days, he would be in a life-and-death crisis.","He might die before he saw the death of Han Yang Immortal.","Fortunately, his men came back one after another when he had a few hours left.","“We’ve got the news, Grand Master.”","“Han Yang Immortal is from another Galaxy. I found a former protector of the Highest Clouds Palace who said that Han Yang Immortal is from the Silver Dragon Galaxy.”","“Grand Master, Han Yang Immortal and his people have gone to the outer area and disappeared into a void. They seem to have left for another Galaxy.”","Hearing this, Grand Master Tongtian stood up, “It’s the Silver Dragon Galaxy, their destination!”","Grand Master Tongtian got up and flew into the air.","He headed for Prince Wo Lun’s spaceship.","In the past ten days, Prince Wo Lun and several core subordinates had been checking out more information about the Cultivation World.","“Impressive!”","“It’s really amazing. There are still many rules and Sources in this world. If we can find the core of the universe, we can open up a cultivation place, which can be used for a hundred years.”","“It’s just that this place is too remote, and the Starry Sky Road they summoned can’t last for too long. We’ve used the Level A space expansion devices, but they can only last for five years.”","“There are a total of thirteen expansion devices, which are enough. When we get the Level S space expansion devices, we can maintain the passage for a longer time.”","“It doesn’t matter. The only way to get me back to the core of the empire is to find the Golden-armored Giant Beast, which is underage and easy to catch,” Prince Wo Lun said. “However, the Cultivation World is not small. If we want to find the Golden-armored Giant Beast, those natives’ help is essential.”","“Your Highness, Captain Tongtian has arrived.”","“Okay.”","Prince Wo Lun nodded and let Grand Master Tongtian into the spaceship.","Seeing the most basic metals and other materials in the spaceship, Grand Master Tongtian felt that this spaceship was many times more advanced than their king vessels.","“Prince Wo Lun, I’ve brought the news.” Grand Master Tongtian immediately said, “The hometown of Han Yang Immortal is in the Silver Dragon Galaxy. Some time ago, he left the First Mountain and went to the outer ring. He disappeared. He should have gone to the Silver Dragon Galaxy.”","“Is that so? Not bad. Do you know where he disappeared?”","Wo Lun said, “In other words, do you know where the Golden-armored Giant Beast last appeared?”","“Yes. In the First Mountain Region.”","Wo Lun said directly, “Take us there.”","Except for the first team that stayed, the other spaceships swarmed into the huge spaceship one after another.","When they arrived inside, they saw that it was like a huge hotel. Grand Master Tongtian was following Prince Wo Lun. This was the most luxurious area of the spaceship.","Grand Master Tongtian couldn’t help but ask, “What kind of spaceship is this?”","“Mother Ship E30.” Prince Wo Lun glanced at him and said, “Have you heard of it?”","“I’ve never heard of it.” Grand Master Tongtian groveled, not even daring to breathe heavily.","He quickly reported the coordinates and displayed the Star Map in front of Prince Wo Lun.","As soon as Prince Wo Lun gave the order, the huge spaceship erupted with energy.","Normally speaking, it would take people three days to get to the First Mountain even if they took the Space Shooting Planets. Unexpectedly, the spaceship arrived at its destination in just a few minutes.","“This speed...”","The heart of Grand Master Tongtian trembled endlessly.","Prince Wo Lun said, “Go capture the aura.”","A group of subordinates left the spaceship and appeared in the starry sky.","Someone brought out bottles and jars, waving them through the void. Light surged.","Grand Master Tongtian asked with concern, “Your Excellency, what’s this?”","“Alchemist skills,” Prince Wo Lun said with a hint of playfulness in his eyes.","He felt that this Grand Master of the Holy Land could be used to relieve boredom.","“The aura is captured.”","“Then let’s go to the Silver Dragon Galaxy,” Prince Wo Lun said flatly.","They followed the First Mountain to the outer ring area, where Zhang Han and the others disappeared.","“Strange. The aura is missing.”","Prince Wo Lun’s subordinate reported, “The aura of the Golden-armored Giant Beast can no longer be detected here.”","Prince Wo Lun said decisively, “Then let’s go straight to the Silver Dragon Galaxy and continue the search.”","The huge metallic spaceship set off again.","When they arrived at the Silver Dragon Galaxy, the huge spaceship was immediately alerted.","“The people of Vast Heaven Sect have run away?”","“Is there an Ancient Road of Starry Sky there? It may be hidden in the void.”","“Full detection!”","...","Zhang Han lived on Mount New Moon.","It had been two years since he came back, and his life had become peaceful again.","Zhang Han’s six duplications were cultivating all the time. His Original Body and Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure would occasionally cook and chat with Mengmeng. He could also go out for a walk with Zi Yan and do Pair Cultivation with her.","They lived a leisurely life and were just like an enviable couple.","But on this day, the peaceful life was broken.","Boom!","All the Tribulation Stage Dao Seeking Cultivators, including Zhang Han, Mengmeng, and Zi Yan, heard a violent muffled sound.","“What’s going on?”","Dong Chen and the others were confused.","Ordinary people couldn’t hear it, but they could feel the vibration from the abnormal energy.","“Hmm?”","Zhang Han frowned, and his soul sense covered the place.","On Mount New Moon, there were many people standing near the Thunder Yang Tree. Everyone was a little confused.","“What happened?” Mu Xue asked, “The noise just now gave me a fright.”","“I don’t know. I can’t feel it at all.” Zhao Feng shook his head.","Gradually, they looked at Zhang Han and Immortal Master Mingyu.","“I feel the power as well. It’s like a hole has been pierced through the sky.” Immortal Master Mingyu sighed lightly. “I don’t feel anything specific, and I suspect that a precious treasure has appeared in the world.”","“There are no precious treasures.” Mengmeng felt the rules of the world, and her face suddenly changed. “Some place is ruined.”","“Where is it?”","Zhang Han was about to ask some questions.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The pure white light grew larger and larger in his sight, gradually filling the entire world. It was as if he was standing within the white light.","Zhang Han slightly narrowed his eyes and said, “Sir?”","In front of him, Sir’s Shadow of Light slowly appeared.","“You can’t escape. This is a necessary experience for you.” Sir’s voice was ethereal.","Zhang Han felt a chill down his spine.","“Which Mind are you?” Zhang Han asked.","“The second one.”","“What happened?” Zhang Han asked.","“I’ll tell you about the higher world first,” Sir’s Mind said. “You may have guessed that the Cultivation World is an independent world. Its rules are like layers of shackles that are difficult to break through. The so-called higher world and immortals do not exist.","“The higher world is the real world. It’s infinitely vast. The territory of the Human Clan is unimaginably vast. The Star Sea in the Cultivation World is inferior to a Star Area of the higher world.","“In the higher world, there are martial artists, soul cultivators, alchemists, strange races, mechanical creatures, and metallic creatures. There are all kinds of creatures.”","At this point, Sir paused.","Zhang Han asked, “Are you telling me this to ask me to go to the higher world?”","“You can go there, but your family can’t break the rules of the world. Are you willing to leave them behind?”","Sir’s Mind continued, “When a cultivator breaks the rules of the world and reaches the higher world, he will be in the Zone Lord Realm. He will be a top-notch master in the Star Areas. Above him are the Kingdom Lords, High Kings, Heavenly Masters, Emperor-to-bes, and Great Emperors.","“It is known that the Great Emperors are the top beings, who are like dominators and rarely seen.”","After hearing this, Zhang Han was shocked. “What level are you in?”","“I used to be a Great Emperor.”","Zhang Han was speechless."]},{"number":1720,"title":"Chapter 1720 Just Eat It","paragraphs":["Chapter 1720 Just Eat It","It seemed that now, Sir’s Second Mind was going to tell something that Zhang Han once wanted to know.","But now, Zhang Han suddenly realized that when he was about to reach more things, he felt depressed.","He had no way out.","What a vast and wonderful world it was to have Zone Lords, Kingdom Lords, High Kings, Heavenly Masters, Emperor-to-bes, Great Emperors, and even dominators.","But Zhang Han was not interested at all.","“When I came back, my mind was divided into nine parts. The Cultivation World is a closed world. I can control a part of the void in the Cultivation World with my nine Minds, but I can’t hurt the people of the higher world. This is limited by my mind.” Sir’s voice sounded a little aged.","“The great enemy’s mind.” Zhang Han was touched and suddenly thought of something, but he didn’t say it.","“Yes, I’m dead.” Sir’s Shadow of Light sighed softly. “My remaining mind has merged with the rules of the Cultivation World.”","“What...” Zhang Han froze slightly.","“That is why you will face all of this yourself and bear it yourself. You have not matured yet. The world is full of accidents, and your calamity cannot be avoided. You can only take the initiative to endure it,” Sir’s Shadow of Light said.","Zhang Han sweated on his forehead.","To be honest, he was worried.","“But when the main nest of the Bug Clan first appeared, it was you who destroyed it.” Zhang Han suddenly felt a little strange.","“Because the main nest of the Bug Clan has devoured a large part of the continent of the Cultivation World. Its body contains the rules of the world. As long as the rules of the Cultivation World are in place, I can change them. I can’t change anything related to the higher world even if I used to be a Great Emperor.”","Sir’s Mind sighed and said, “Zhang Han, you have to remember one thing. Anyone who defies the natural order must have defects!”","Swoosh!","The Mind’s light dissipated, and the scene around Zhang Han reappeared again.","He could even hear everyone’s discussion.","“What the hell is going on? I feel scared when I hear that voice,” Mu Xue muttered.","As usual, the Thunder Yang Tree was tall and magnificent. The red sun was shining in the west, casting a layer of golden light on the horizon.","The pleasant smell of grass on Mount New Moon swayed with the breeze.","The sea of flowers, the plants, and everything else was full of vitality.","But for some reason, Zhang Han felt that the place was on the verge of death.","The people of Mount New Moon were still here. Many children of the new generation were running, jumping, and playing. They were carefree and didn’t have to worry about anything. Living in Mount New Moon was their happiest moment during childhood.","Mengmeng had too many memories on Mount New Moon.","She grew up here and grew up under the care of Zhang Han.","Now she was an adult. At this time, she was frowning slightly and said, “Dad, it seems, it seems to be in the ancient martial arts world.”","“What happened to the ancient martial world?” Yue Wuwei was anxious. In the past, he could use the subsidiary pearl to investigate, but now he felt dizzy and couldn’t use it. He asked, “Even if something happened to the ancient martial arts world, it’s not a problem. The Ancient Road of Starry Sky has been sealed. Could it be that some strange place has appeared?”","“No.”","Mengmeng shook her head slightly and said, “I can’t feel it clearly, but it seems that...”","Swoosh!","While they were talking, a spaceship quickly flew over from a distance.","It attracted everyone’s attention and made Mengmeng pause.","Some people had come over from the ancient martial arts world.","“Boss, boss, bad news.”","A member of the security group jumped down from the air and said, “There’s something wrong with the Ancient Road of Starry Sky. There’s a huge chain coming out of it. It can’t be broken. The Ancient Road of Starry Sky will be reopened.”","“Hmm?”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly.","He was silent for a few seconds.","As usual, Mengmeng could control the rules of the world here.","However, the rules of the Cultivation World were not invincible. Just like Zhang Han, he had broken the rules.","The people of the higher world were also like this.","Zhang Han didn’t care about Grand Master Tongtian and the others, but the ones who had arrived were Dao Seeking Cultivators from the higher world, which made Zhang Han feel the pressure he hadn’t felt for a long time.","“Should I go alone?","“Or should I go with the team?","“What should I do?”","At this moment, Zhang Han had a lot on his mind.","“Should I leave from the Ancient Road of Starry Sky and go to the Sea Dragon Star Area to escape or hide somewhere else?”","“They took the initiative to open the Ancient Road of Starry Sky.","“The huge chain is from the higher world. They’ve chased me to the Silver Dragon Galaxy in such a short time. They have no Ancient Road of Starry Sky. They flew over from the Star Sea.”","This speed shocked Zhang Han.","“If it’s a curse, it’s unavoidable.”","He had to face this calamity alone.","Zhang Han looked calm and did not show any unusual expression. He even smiled and said, “Maybe Grand Master Tongtian is here. It doesn’t matter. I’ll go and get to know him this time. You...”","Zhang Han pretended to be lost in thought. After waiting for two seconds, he said firmly, “After I leave, Mengmeng, close the entrances to the ancient martial arts world and the secular world and try to seal them off completely. You’ll go to the Chaotic Region and wait for me there. Ask the armies of the Demon Clan to guard the surroundings.”","His words made the atmosphere oppressive.","Everyone knew about the ancestral ceremony, and they guessed that the enemy might be from the higher world, which was great trouble. If they went, it might distract Zhang Han. If they didn’t go, they would be very worried.","Zi Yan took Zhang Han’s hand and said with a smile, “Let’s go together. What if you get lost? Besides, the Ancient Road of Starry Sky is closed. It’ll take us years to travel from the Silver Dragon Galaxy to the Sea Dragon Star Area. Why don’t we ask our parents to head to the Chaotic Region? We will go together. I’m also at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. It seems that I haven’t fought yet.”","Although Zi Yan was smiling, the seriousness in her eyes made Zhang Han unable to refute what she said.","“I’ll go with you,” Mengmeng said.","“No matter what it is, let’s face it together.” Yue Wuwei took a deep breath and said with a smile, “I’m also at the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage. There’s nothing to be afraid of. We’ve gone through so many things together, and it’s like a big family here on Mount New Moon. After going through so many trials, everyone knows each other very well. We’ve been through thick and thin together. No matter what difficulties we face, we have to face them together. Zhang Han, you should understand that at this time, you can’t refuse me.”","“I’m not leaving, Master.” Zhao Feng smiled.","“We’re not leaving. We can hide behind,” Chu Qingyi said.","“...”","Hearing everyone’s words, Zhang Han fell silent.","“Let’s go together.” Zhang Guangyou patted Zhang Han on the shoulder with a smile and said, “Son, you’re invincible in the Cultivation World. If there is an enemy, you can just kill them. What’s more, it’s very likely that a treasure has appeared.”","Although he was smiling, Zhang Han could see more expressions in his father’s eyes.","Under everyone’s gaze, Zhang Han nodded slightly and said, “Let’s go together.”","He hesitated and looked at the time. “Prepare for half an hour, and then we’ll set off.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Everyone returned to their respective villas.","Chen Changqing said to Chen Chuan and Nina with a sullen face, “You will stay here.”","They had different opinions.","“We’ll advance and retreat together,” Chen Chuan said in a low voice.","“How are you going to advance and retreat together with us with your strength?” Chen Changqing snorted. “Stay here and don’t go out.”","“We want to go.”","In the end, Nina spoke.","Zhou Fei sat next to them. It was a little difficult for her to make a choice, but she still agreed to have Nina and Chen Chuan go together.","The same thing went on in other villas.","Others were also talking about this matter. They didn’t talk much, and the atmosphere was very heavy.","Within the castle, Zhang Han stood behind the dressing table, looked at Zi Yan softly, and said with a smile, “Why do you still want to do makeup?”","“I’m wearing light makeup,” Zi Yan said with a smile. “I haven’t done it for a long time.”","While Mengmeng was sorting out her things, she picked up the schoolbag she often carried with her.","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","Dahei patted the window from the outside. “Little Master, I’m here.”","“What are you doing here?” Mengmeng pouted and said, “Go back to sleep. You have to keep watch.”","“You’re so mean, Little Master. You don’t want to take us with you when you go out to have fun,” Dahei said.","Little Hei was more straightforward. It pushed the door open with its nose, and the two of them went straight in. They shrank and got into the schoolbag.","...","Half an hour later, Mengmeng opened the Space Portal and arrived at the ancient martial arts world. The team was above a city.","Near the Ancient Road of Starry Sky, the rules of the world had been disrupted. Even Mengmeng’s Space Portal could not go deep into it. Mengmeng had lost control of the rules.","When the hundreds of people approached the Ancient Road of Starry Sky in a mighty manner, they saw the 100-man team of the security group and many high-position officials of the forces of Mount New Moon.","There were about five million people.","“In a few hundred years, these people can go to the Star Sea to gain experience.” Immortal Master Mingyu flew over from the side.","“You haven’t left yet?”","Zhang Han glanced at him.","“I have to stay behind to watch the show,” said Immortal Master Mingyu. “It’s impossible for me to join in a battle of your level. Immortal Master Lingxi, what are you doing here?”","“I’ll take a look here. I have so many disciples here. If possible, I’ll take action. It won’t be a big deal since Grand Master Tongtian’s strength has been damaged,” said Immortal Master Lingxi indifferently.","Immortal Master Lingxi thought that she could show her power properly to these disciples and show them how powerful their master was.","“The chain is right ahead. The space turbulence is so serious that no one below the Tribulation Stage can get close to it,” said Immortal Master Mingyu.","As they flew forward, they saw that there was really a hole in the sky on the coast. It was pitch-black, and the space was constantly trembling like a cave. In the middle, there was a rusty chain that penetrated out of space and landed on the coast. They couldn’t tell how long the chain had been in the ground, and they couldn’t detect it at all.","Around the chain, the space vibrated, and the waves near the coast swept toward the deep sea. The sea level was rapidly dropping. It was like the eve of a tsunami.","In the nearby forest, the leaves were dancing wildly, the branches were constantly broken, and even the tall trees were uprooted.","The energy was raging and destroying everything around mercilessly.","When people saw this scene, their faces changed slightly.","“What’s this?” Immortal Master Lingxi was shocked. “I can’t feel the aura of a treasure, but the chain seems to be very powerful.”","“Yes.”","Immortal Master Mingyu said, “Before this, I have already attacked more than a dozen times, but it was completely useless. Before the attacks got close, they dissipated. And the black cave above is getting bigger and bigger.”","Mengmeng said to Zhang Han, “The rules of the world have been suppressed by the chain.”","Zhang Han frowned slightly.","After he ran his power a bit, the Golden-armored Giant Beast appeared. It turned into a thousand feet long and jumped to the coast. Looking at the chain, it opened its bloody mouth and bit down on the chain.","“So straightforward?”","Immortal Master Mingyu was astounded.","He had never expected that Han Yang Immortal would directly bite the chain."]},{"number":1721,"title":"Chapter 1721 The Moon Spirit Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 1721 The Moon Spirit Clan","Clack! Clack!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast was gnawing on the iron chain. The crisp sound shook the void, which could be clearly heard in the entire ancient martial arts world.","“Will this work?” Dong Chen asked in shock.","“It will.” Zhang Han nodded slightly and said in a deep voice, “This is an object from the higher world. It’s very solid. Step back 100 kilometers and go to the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot. Tell the army to step back and be ready to leave at any time.”","“Okay!”","The crowd nodded and retreated one after another.","During this period, everyone looked grave.","“It’s from the higher world. The Dao Seeking Cultivators from the higher world are really here.”","“What a terrible situation.”","“Alas, we can’t help much. We can’t even get close to the chain.”","Yue Wuwei sighed softly.","Only Dao Seeking Cultivators above the Tribulation Stage could get close to the nearby area, and even Immortal Master Mingyu couldn’t get close to the chain.","“The shock of space is too terrifying. The void looks calm, but in fact, there are countless cracks. At the very least, we will get hurt, and if it’s serious, it can kill Dao Seeking Cultivators.” Immortal Master Mingyu sighed with emotion. “Only he can do it.”","He looked at the back of Zhang Han in front of him and sighed.","“He’s the No. 1 Expert in history and is simply too powerful.”","“I’ll have a try.”","After saying that, Zi Yan flew to Zhang Han. She was wearing a beautiful crystal stone dress. Zhang Han bought it for her at the Dragnet Academy. She still remembered that someone had wanted to compete for it at that time.","Wearing such a bright and gorgeous long dress, Zi Yan looked like an empress. Her temperament was otherworldly. Her perfect cheeks were covered with light makeup.","She was delicate and beautiful, like a beautiful figure in a picture scroll.","“Why are you here?” Zhang Han chuckled, touched the hair of Zi Yan, and said, “Go back and stay with Mengmeng.”","“I’m also at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. I’ll give it a try.”","Zi Yan blinked her beautiful big eyes. Her voice was light and pleasant. There was a happy smile on her face, but her right hand suddenly waved forward slightly.","Swoosh!","Like bright moonlight, her power fell on the chain.","To everyone’s surprise, the shaking in the surrounding space dissipated a lot.","With the gnawing of the Golden-armored Giant Beast, traces had been left on the chain.","It worked. If there was enough time, the Golden-armored Giant Beast would definitely bite the chain to pieces.","Even the cave in the air began to shrink.","At the same time.","In the void of the Silver Dragon Galaxy.","The huge metal spaceship was levitating at the place where the Space Node used to be.","There were more than a thousand spaceships of different shapes and sizes around, and there were nearly ten thousand people. They moved quickly, and each team had their own task.","At the same time, there were security teams around.","Five or six groups of spaceships were observing in the distance.","“Prepare the Level E Eagle God Cannon.”","“Lock onto the target. Attack!”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","A tiny jet of light flashed into the distance.","In the distant void, waves of flames erupted.","Without exception, not only the spaceships but also the Dao Seeking Cultivators inside were all turned into ashes.","“What stunning battle power.”","Grand Master Tongtian’s eyelids trembled when he saw this.","He lowered his voice and said with a flattering look, “Your Excellency, the spaceships from the world of immortals are so powerful.”","“Yeah.”","Prince Wo Lun responded indifferently.","Here, not only did Grand Master Tongtian see the alchemists, but he also saw many instruments, such as tools that were used to lock onto Space Nodes, Space Piercing Chains, all kinds of detection devices, and so on.","Grand Master Tongtian didn’t dare to say anything when he saw that Prince Wo Lun wasn’t interested in talking.","“The progress of shattering the void has reached 50%.","“When it reaches 80%, the passage will open. We can go in.”","Someone reported one piece of news after another to Prince Wo Lun.","“The progress has reached 60%.","“70%.","“75%.”","Prince Wo Lun had been sitting on the chair all the time. When he heard this, he stood up.","This made Grand Master Tongtian realize that the passage was about to open.","But as soon as Prince Wo Lun left his chair-","“Your Highness, the progress has suddenly decreased.","“Now it’s 73%, 71%, 68%, and 60%. Someone is affecting the Space Piercing Chain inside.”","“Who can affect the Space Piercing Chain?”","Prince Wo Lun frowned slightly and said, “Improve the strength of the chain to its highest point. Attack the other party with the Level A Space-shaking Cannon.”","He was always calm and composed.","At this time, he had already got up and didn’t want to sit there anymore. He moved, quickly left the spaceship, and levitated in the void of the universe.","“What a wonderful feeling. I can easily control the laws of the world!”","Swoosh!","He stretched out his arms, and his energy was surging.","Grand Master Tongtian was terrified as he watched from behind.","“As expected of an immortal. Even if I were at my peak, I would not be as powerful as him. He can kill me with any move. Han Yang Immortal, your time is up!”","While Grand Master Tongtian was terrified, he also felt great.","At the very least, these immortals had brought him to kill Han Yang Immortal.","Under his gaze, a group of spaceships appeared on the Mother Ship. There was a huge muzzle under the spaceship, which was shining brightly. As the cannons fired at the same time, the space around it shattered, and the cave around the chain suddenly became three times larger.","Zhang Han and the others were all shocked.","At first, the cave was suppressed by Zhang Han and Zi Yan.","But they didn’t expect it to counterattack so quickly.","“It suddenly expanded by more than three times.”","“What’s going on?”","Immortal Master Mingyu was dumbstruck.","Before Zhang Han and the others came here, he had tried a lot of means to understand the power of the chain. He thought that Zhang Han and Zi Yan could suppress the chain, and now he was shocked by the sudden expansion of the cave.","“Exactly what level of battle is this?” Immortal Master Mingyu wasn’t sure.","The others didn’t understand either.","However, everyone knew that if the cave was too large, there might be dangers descending upon them.","Clack!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast gnawed on the chain faster and faster.","If it weren’t for the imposing manner of the Golden-armored Giant Beast, it would look like a dog gnawing on bones.","“It’s not easy to deal with this.”","Zhang Han pondered for a moment. Then, his six bodies appeared at the same time and bombarded the chain.","In particular, the attacks of the Thunder Body and Zi Yan were very effective.","The cave began to shrink.","The bite marks left by the Golden-armored Giant Beast on the chain were getting deeper and deeper.","They attacked with all their strength.","Soon, the size of the cave was reduced by half.","This result secretly shocked Prince Wo Lun’s team in the outer space.","“Why did it shrink so quickly?","“Why are the Space Piercing Chain’s effects suppressed?”","“Your Highness, the entrance is shrinking. We...”","Prince Wo Lun frowned slightly and asked in confusion, “Did the Golden-armored Giant Beast do this?","“Go. Use ten Level S Space-shaking Cannonballs.”","Prince Wo Lun waved his hand.","This time, to the surprise of Grand Master Tongtian, a huge muzzle of cannons appeared on the huge spaceship that was about 23,000 meters long.","Ten beams of light bombarded the entrance with irresistible force.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","It was much more violent than the explosion of a planet. Waves of Space Storm swept in all directions from here.","Even Grand Master Tongtian was startled. He had to put all his strength to defend himself before he could stabilize himself in the storm.","If it were a Dao Seeking Cultivator at the third or fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage, he would probably be seriously injured by the storm and die.","“What kind of power is this?”","Grand Master Tongtian was horrified.","Swoosh!","For a moment, the entire ancient martial arts world was shaking.","The air was covered with cracks in an instant, and then it healed.","The cave expanded by ten times.","“Hmm?”","Zhang Han was shocked. He didn’t expect the energy to be so high.","“Suppress!”","Zhang Han was determined.","Except for the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, all five of his duplications ran to the side of the chain. The Golden-armored Giant Beast was gnawing on the chain, while the other duplications pressed their hands on the chain.","Hiss!","Every one of Zhang Han’s bodies felt bone-chilling cold.","The energy of each duplication was quickly injected into the chain, attempting to disintegrate its interior, throw it out, and destroy this hole.","Zhang Han tried his best, and Zi Yan launched her attacks one after another.","The cave shrank at a speed visible to the naked eye.","In just three minutes, the cave had shrunk by one-tenth.","But compared to before, it was still many times larger.","“I’ll join you!”","When Mengmeng approached, she unleashed the flames she controlled with all her might.","The little princess was a Fire Spirit Body. The power of her flames increased the speed of the cave shrinking.","“Your Highness, there are indeed people inside affecting the space.”","A subordinate reported.","Prince Wo Lun said indifferently, “Continue. Use ten more Level S Space-shaking Cannonballs.”","“Your Highness, this...”","His men’s expressions changed slightly. “We only have 20 Level S Space-shaking Cannonballs. If we use them up and there is a problem with the passage, we won’t be able to get out in a short time.”","Prince Wo Lun reminded them with concern, “Inform the first squad to guard the passage. Use five cannonballs first.”","He can’t have something wrong happen to the passage. Otherwise, it would be troublesome to leave this world.","Boom!","After five cannonballs were fired, the cave expanded once again, and layers of ripples appeared within.","Prince Wo Lun and the others could see and observe the world inside.","The sun hung high in the sky, illuminating the earth. Except for the destroyed scenery around the cave, one could vaguely see groups of mountains and ravines in other places.","“Hahaha, it’s open, it’s open. Han Yang Immortal, you will die!”","Grand Master Tongtian laughed out loud.","At the same time, the people inside could also see the scene outside.","“What’s that? A spaceship? Why is it so huge?”","“Grand Master Tongtian is here!”","“These people are, immortals?” Immortal Master Mingyu’s eyes widened. In his opinion, immortals should be like Immortal Master Qingfeng, otherworldly and awe-inspiring, but those people didn’t look special at all.","The images on both sides could be captured by the naked eye, but they couldn’t feel the momentum or hear the voices.","However, Prince Wo Lun got excited, and his eyes were filled with madness.","“The Golden-armored Giant Beast is indeed here. Perfect! It will help me return to the empire!”","Prince Wo Lun said excitedly, “Continue to bombard. Use all five Level S Space-shaking Cannonballs!”","“Yes, Your Highness!”","Many of his subordinates used the main cannon once again.","Five streams of light made the cave expand by two times once more.","The sky was pierced.","In a huge cave, one could see the void of the universe, and many enemies were about to descend.","“Your Highness, the progress of shattering the void has reached 96%.","“We’re stabilizing the space. There are still 60 seconds left before we enter the passage.”","Finally, they could enter.","“Detect the energy of the world inside.”","The huge spaceship started an invisible wave of light and traveled along the Space Piercing Chain to the ancient martial arts world.","“Beep! Warning! Spirit-type energy is detected, possessing the power of the Moon Spirit. 87% of the power is compatible with the Moon Spirit Clan.”","Once the alarm sounded-","“Wh...what?!”","Prince Wo Lun’s expression changed drastically. “Impossible! How could there be a Moon Spirit in this native world? How could it be possible? The Moon Spirits only appear once every trillion years. They are Emperor-to-be when they’re firstborn. How could there be one here?","“Is there an Emperor-to-be here?”","Prince Wo Lun’s body was convulsing. At the thought of the Emperor-to-be’s power, he broke out in a cold sweat.","“Am I going to die here?” Prince Wo Lun was stunned.","But the next second-","“The power of the primary Moon Spirit has been detected. It’s suspected to have one-thousandth of the bloodline of the Moon Spirit Clan. Its energy intensity hasn’t reached the level of the Zone Lord Realm yet.” The voice of the spaceship resounded in his ears.","“Hmm?”","Prince Wo Lun was furious at first, but then he was overjoyed.","“A bloodline holder of the Moon Spirit Clan?","“I’m going to be rich!”"]},{"number":1722,"title":"Chapter 1722 To Live and Die Together","paragraphs":["Chapter 1722 To Live and Die Together","“Oh, my god! Each person with the bloodline of the Moon Spirit is worth more than a hundred times more than the Level S small universe!”","Prince Wo Lun’s eyes were full of ecstasy. It could be seen by anyone.","Grand Master Tongtian was at a loss. He didn’t know what Prince Wo Lun was happy about.","“A Fire Spirit Energy has been detected. It’s suspected to be a Fire Spirit Body.”","“A Thunder Spirit Energy has been detected. It’s regarded as a Thunder Spirit Body.”","When Prince Wo Lun heard these words, his heart beat wildly in surprise.","“Thunder and Fire! Ha... Heaven is on my side. I will be the successor of the empire!”","At first, the Golden-armored Giant Beast attracted his attention. He didn’t expect that there would be a cultivator with the bloodline of the Moon Spirit.","There were also Thunder Spirit Body and Fire Spirit Body.","“This is a blessed land for me!”","Prince Wo Lun was so excited that he went crazy.","Seeing his expression, Grand Master Tongtian, who was not far away, swallowed hard.","“This immortal is not like an immortal at all. He’s just like a mortal.”","Grand Master Tongtian thought to himself, “If it weren’t for his overwhelming power that could kill me with one finger, I wouldn’t have believed that he came from the world of immortals. Sure enough, one shouldn’t judge a book by its cover.”","As the saying went, to be in the emperor’s company was tantamount to living with a tiger. This was the first time that Grand Master Tongtian had such a feeling.","When he grew up, he had taken the path of invincibility. All of his enemies had turned into dried bones beneath his feet. He dominated this world and become Grand Master Tongtian, and his might shook the Star Sea.","But now, he found that he didn’t even have the right to speak in front of the immortals.","After pondering for a while, he asked in a low voice, “Your Highness, Prince Wo Lun, I have a request.”","“Hmm?”","Wo Lun’s face was red as he turned around to look at him, “You have performed meritorious service. Just go ahead.”","“I want to record these with some recording crystal stones. When I return to the first mountain, I will give everyone an explanation. Han Yang Immortal is the enemy of the whole Cultivation World. This is my presumptuous request,” Grand Master Tongtian said cautiously.","“Recording?”","Prince Wo Lun sneered, “Do you need to record? Just do the live broadcast. The technology of your indigenous world is too outdated.”","He shook his head slightly and ordered his men, “Let the first team start the live broadcast to meet his requirements.”","“Thank you, Your Highness.”","Grand Master Tongtian was overjoyed. While Prince Wo Lun was happy, he suddenly had an idea. His heart was beating fast, and he was so nervous that he almost suffocated. He plucked up his courage and asked, “Your Highness, I wonder if I can join your force. I’m willing to do anything for you.”","“Are you sure?”","Prince Wo Lun looked ahead and laughed heartily. “Okay. Join us. You can do trivial things. When we get back, I’ll let you be my pet trainer.”","Grand Master Tongtian was taken aback.","He didn’t mean that!","“Your Highness, I mean...” Grand Master Tongtian wanted to explain.","“There’s no need to say more. It’s good enough that I haven’t sold you as a slave. I let you be a pet trainer because of your contribution.”","Prince Wo Lun looked ahead and no longer paid attention to Grand Master Tongtian.","“The signal is connected.","“Start the live broadcast.”","The image of the spaceship was projected on the screen of the Tongtian Holy Land on the first mountain.","“Is this the Silver Dragon Galaxy?”","“Oh, my god. They can project the images from so far away.”","“They deserve to be called immortals. The means are extraordinary. Amazing!”","The tens of thousands of clans in the Holy Land were extremely shocked.","They had never expected that these people could do live streaming from so far away.","No one cared about their shock.","At this time, everyone’s eyes were fixed on the screen.","There was a cave in the void of the universe, and the environment inside got clearer.","Hiss!","“Sure enough, the women of the Moon Spirit Clan are all beautiful.”","After seeing it clearly, Prince Wo Lun gasped and fixed his eyes on Zi Yan.","“She’s the person having the bloodline of the Moon Spirit.","“The woman next to her has a Fire Spirit Body. She’s so beautiful. This woman is already quite beautiful.","“The Golden-armored Giant Beast is charming and underaged. It’s the perfect time to capture it. If it were an adult, the machines I brought with me wouldn’t be able to catch its aura at all.","“Thunder Spirit Body? Not bad.”","Prince Wo Lun looked back and forth.","At the same time, Zhang Han and the others were also watching the crowd outside.","“As expected, it’s Grand Master Tongtian.”","Mengmeng snorted and said, “He came to us with his men. Daddy, why don’t we leave here?”","She was ready to slip away.","Zhang Han slightly changed his expression, and a trace of hesitation flashed across his face.","“You all...”","There was a hint of sadness in the depths of his eyes.","“You can’t leave.”","Sir had just sent a Designated Voice-transmitting Technique with his mind.","The Space Piercing Chain was a treasure from the higher world. It was specially created to break through space.","The spaceships outside were depot ships. Those who had depot ships generally came from large forces.","There was at least an alchemist outside.","With the depot ships and alchemists, the enemies could find the auras of the Golden-armored Giant Beast, Zi Yan, and Mengmeng in this void of the universe.","Even if this world was destroyed, they would be unable to eliminate the enemies.","The gap between the two sides was too great.","Whether in technology or in cultivation level, the other party was at a higher level.","Zhang Han felt cold in his heart.","He was even a little impatient.","He couldn’t be calm. He was wondering if he could make others leave. He wanted to stay behind to carry the burden alone.","However, he couldn’t. Zi Yan and Mengmeng could be detected by the other party.","“We can’t leave.”","Zhang Han seemed to have experienced many vicissitudes of life. He said in a low and hoarse voice, “Mengmeng, you’ve grown up. Although I seldom express my feelings, I want to say I love you.”","“Honey, you are my true love. You are the most beautiful woman.”","“This time, I’m afraid that our three will have to bear everything. I’m very helpless and heartbroken. It shouldn’t be like this!”","Zhang Han was about to cry.","Endless pressure and cruel reality crushed him.","It shouldn’t be like this. Even if he had to bear it, he didn’t want to implicate Zi Yan and their daughter.","Why?","Could it be that this tribulation was a must in his life? Was it the end of his life?","Zhang Han felt his heart trembling.","It was not until he could sense the other party’s energy that Sir told him this cruel news with his mind.","Zhang Han was depressed for a few seconds and broke down.","He broke down because of Zi Yan and Mengmeng. He even thought that if the enemy was too strong, he would let them leave. However, the reality made him desperate.","Zi Yan suddenly covered her mouth and burst into tears.","She felt the pain of Zhang Han.","Zhang Han felt sad because of Zi Yan and Mengmeng, and Zi Yan also felt sad because of Zhang Han and Mengmeng.","Mengmeng pursed her lips and didn’t blink her beautiful big eyes. There was a layer of light, but she didn’t cry. She tried to keep her voice steady, but there was still a trace of trembling.","“It doesn’t matter. It’s good that we can be together. Mummy and Daddy, I love you, too. I love you so much. You know, I’ve been fearless since I was a child. It’s enough for me to be with you. Humph! Aren’t they just a few stinky enemies? Let’s beat them to death later.”","The pleasant voice of Mengmeng calmed Zhang Han down a lot.","No matter what would happen, he had to face it. Besides, there was no real death situation in the world. It was just very dangerous.","But how could they succeed?","“I must protect them.”","Zhang Han gradually narrowed his eyes.","His momentum rose.","Zi Yan calmed down quickly.","At this time, Zhang Han turned around.","“You go. Don’t look back. Go to the Chaotic Region and hide. We will come back in hundreds of years.”","Zhang Han gave a specific number, thinking that it might be convincing.","However, according to the previous ancestral ceremony and the fact that Zhang Han couldn’t deal with the chain, how could they not understand the situation?","“I won’t go,” Mu Xue said stubbornly.","“I won’t, either.” Chu Qingyi said.","“Go. Don’t get in the way here,” Mengmeng said impatiently and took down her school bag. “Dahei, Little Hei, get out of here. Don’t delay our business.”","Mengmeng felt very upset, but she had to pretend to be strong.","She pretended to hide her sadness but not to make a trick.","“I won’t go. You’re Little Master, not the host. I won’t listen to you.” Dahei curled its lips.","Hearing this, Mengmeng fell silent.","Little Hei was very imposing. It grew bigger and guarded Mengmeng.","Boom!","All of a sudden, a muffled sound resounded between heaven and earth.","Everyone looked over and saw Yue Wuwei looking calm. He had punched his chest with his right fist.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Yue Wuwei put his fist in his heart and looked straight at Zhang Han. “After being with you for so many years, I have understood one thing.”","Suddenly, Yue Wuwei raised his right fist and said in a deep voice, “Let’s live and die together!”","Knock! Knock!","In the rear, millions of core members of Mount New Moon were beating the ground with fog.","At first, there were only a few people. But gradually, more and more people did so. Millions of people, including Zhao Feng, Zhang Guangyou, Rong Jiali, and others, all did so.","“Let’s live and die together!”","These words could be heard between heaven and earth. Powerful sound waves spread in all directions.","Under the setting sun, the world was filled with a golden color. However, the space was filled with desolation and sorrow!","The wind was bleak, like a tragic song between heaven and earth.","Seeing this, Zhang Han fell silent.","More than half of the hundreds of thousands of people watching the live broadcast also fell silent.","“This sort of scene is rare.”","A Grand Master said with a wry smile, “I regret the ancestral ceremony now. If we had known we were about to die, how many of us would stay here?”","“We may have misunderstood Han Yang Immortal. With such cohesiveness, he is an excellent ruler, not a killer.”","“Alas!”","The emotions of the people had nothing to do with their cultivation realms. Even these Grand Masters sighed with emotion for a moment.","“Let’s live and die together! Damn it! Just kill!” Heavenly Hound roared.","Hun Shang said calmly, “Since I joined Vast Heaven Sect, I have known this is the place where I have been fighting for my whole life. I will never abandon it.”","“Let’s live and die together,” Hun Shang murmured.","Their slogan spread throughout the ancient martial arts world.","“It’s not necessarily a deathtrap.”","Even Zhang Han was very touched. His mood became firm in the complexity. He smiled and said, “Look at me. I’ll show my power. This time, let’s fight side by side. Let’s live and die together.”","“We should be like this,” Zhang Mu said in a clear voice. “The people afraid of death are not from the Zhang Clan!”","“Our Dong Clan is also not afraid of death, although I’m its only person.”","“Our Chen Clan is not afraid of them.”","The atmosphere quietly changed, and the fighting desire rose steadily as if they were an invincible force."]},{"number":1723,"title":"Chapter 1723 The Big Gap","paragraphs":["Chapter 1723 The Big Gap","“Ha... It’s useless!”","Grand Master Tongtian laughed wildly outside and said, “You are facing immortals! How dare you resist? You are dreaming. Han Yang Immortal, you can’t escape.”","Swoosh!","Zhang Han suddenly turned his eyes and looked at everything outside coldly.","He sensed that the space was gradually stabilizing, and the passage was about to open.","Swoosh!","Under the gazes of hundreds of thousands of clans, the passage opened!","Swoosh!","Zhang Han’s six duplications appeared in the void. The size of the Golden-armored Giant Beast kept expanding. It was now tens of thousands of meters tall as if about to pierce through heaven and earth.","“Go to the rear.” Zhang Han said to Zi Yan and Mengmeng.","“Okay.”","Zi Yan and Mengmeng also knew the seriousness of the matter. Although both of them had Spirit Bodies and high combat capability, they still had to be cautious in the face of unknown powerful enemies.","“Square arrays, be prepared!”","Yue Wuwei personally served as the commander in the rear.","Millions of core members were divided into thirty square arrays. Both the Divine Bow Troops and the Divine Shield Troops were ready.","“Go.”","Prince Wo Lun smiled and said, “Team Nine, go in and play with them.”","After the order was given, in just three seconds, a line of 30 eagle-shaped spaceships quickly entered the passage and arrived at the ancient martial arts world.","These spaceships were attacked as soon as they entered.","They faced the powerful attack of Zhang Han head-on.","The Thunder Body was powerful, with lightning flashing. The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure had infinite supernatural power. The Great Demon’s Figure had supreme Demonic Might. His six duplications attacked at the same time.","But the Divine Bow Troops in the rear were faster than Zhang Han.","They had been preparing for the arrival of the enemy spaceships. The moment they entered, the Divine Bow Troops launched an accurate attack.","The overwhelming rain of energy arrows was shocking.","To everyone’s surprise, none of these spaceships made a defensive energy layer.","“Have they given up their defense?”","The members of the Divine Bow Troops stared at the front, prepared to launch the second round of the attack.","However, he didn’t expect when these energy arrows hit the spaceships, these spaceships were not affected at all, and the energy arrows dissipated.","The scene was like the rain dripping into the sea.","“What’s the level of the defense?”","The people of the Divine Bow Troops were shocked when seeing this.","It was a strange defensive ability.","“Continue!”","The Divine Bow Troops continued their attacks. Regardless of the effect, they had to fight to see what would happen.","The second round of energy arrows fell.","At this time, Prince Wo Lun and a dozen people, including Grand Master Tongtian, happened to cross the passage and come over.","Prince Wo Lun waved his right hand to the left.","It was as if he were chasing away the flies in front of them.","As a result, the rain of arrows dissipated in the air one after another.","Hiss!","Yue Wuwei gasped and felt his scalp go numb. “What kind of skill is this?”","“Attacks are ineffective! Attacks are ineffective!”","The people of the Divine Bow Troops were silent.","They had been famous in the Galaxy for a long time. However, in the face of the people from the higher world, they couldn’t even hurt the other party.","Even Zhang Han was shocked.","He felt the rules of the world were like a toy to the blond man.","“Ow!”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast roared and attacked fiercely with its right claw.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The spaceship hit by the Golden-armored Giant Beast shook violently. The Golden-armored Giant Beast moved extremely fast. It cooperated with the other five duplications and launched hundreds of moves on the other party.","Finally, cyan smoke rose from one spaceship and remained motionless in the air.","At this time, the cabin doors of the spaceships opened one after another, and a group of people in black clothes came out, holding weapons in their hands.","There were only 300 of them.","None of them gave off an aura as if they were ordinary people.","Even Prince Wo Lun and others were the same. Their auras couldn’t be felt. Perhaps, their state was beyond that of the Cultivation World, so Zhang Han and others’ energy couldn’t detect the other party’s aura.","“Catch the Golden-armored Giant Beast.”","Prince Wo Lun spoke indifferently. Then his eyes were fixed on Zi Yan. He said in the local language, “You’re a stunning woman, a descendant of the Moon Spirit Clan. You’re mine now.”","“Unless I die.” Zi Yan said coldly.","A fierce look appeared on her face.","“No! You won’t die,” Prince Wo Lun said gracefully. “I won’t let you die. At the very least, you won’t die here. You will bring me a lot of wealth. Your value is many times higher than that of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.”","“Since you want to go to the rear, have you asked me?”","Zhang Han’s Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure slowly floated upward. It was only a few hundred meters away from Prince Wo Lun.","“How dare you!”","Prince Wo Lun swept a glance at him and shook his head slightly. “How dare you speak in front of me with your strength?”","After that, he waved his hand.","Swoosh!","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure directly dissipated.","The unknown power destroyed the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","But Zhang Han had a horrible resurrection ability.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure was soon condensed again.","“Huh?”","Prince Wo Lun frowned slightly. Seeing his six duplications, Prince Wo Lun suddenly came to a realization. “It turns out that the Duplications Coexisting Technique. You’ve refined a Golden-armored Giant Beast. You’re so lucky. But it doesn’t matter. Once I capture you and cut off your connection with the Golden-armored Giant Beast, I’ll be able to kill you.”","At a glance, he knew what was going on.","Zhang Han felt a chill down his spine.","“Han Yang Immortal, as I said, you will die today!” Grand Master Tongtian said arrogantly.","“Start to capture them,” Prince Wo Lun ordered. He looked at Zi Yan and Mengmeng, stretched out his arm, and grabbed forward. “You two, let me have a look at the body with the bloodline of the Moon Spirit Clan and the Fire Spirit Body.”","Buzz!","Zi Yan and Mengmeng couldn’t control their bodies and flew straight forward.","“How dare you!”","Zhang Han was furious and kept attacking Prince Wo Lun.","Swoosh!","On the way, Zi Yan’s eyes shone with moonlight. It pierced everything. The space power capturing the two was cut off.","“Ha... As expected of the bloodline holder, you’re able to interrupt me. Amazing.” Prince Wo Lun laughed heartily.","Zhang Han’s attack could no longer touch Prince Wo Lun.","Nearly 200 warriors in black clothes surrounded the Golden-armored Giant Beast. With all kinds of facilities appearing in their hands, they began to capture it.","Another 50 martial artists in black clothes attacked Zhang Han’s five duplications. Their attacks were relatively gentle as if they didn’t want to kill Zhang Han’s duplications in vain.","The other 50 people’s eyes fell on the line at the back.","They picked up the weapons in their hands.","Sizzling!","Several tiny beams of light flashed and landed in the millions of people without giving them any time to react.","Rumble!","The sky was breaking, and the earth was cracking. The powerful firepower killed more than seven hundred thousand people in an instant.","“No!”","“Their attacks are too powerful.”","“What should we do?”","The gap in strength was too great.","Immortal Master Mingyu stood at the back with a hesitant expression.","“Grand Master, do you want to have a try?” The little girl next to him asked.","“I want to go, but I don’t dare,” Immortal Master Mingyu said hesitantly.","At this time, the little girl took out a bottle of white wine and said, “This is white wine. Grand Master, everyone says that wine boosts one’s courage.”","Immortal Master Mingyu was speechless.","“I’m not afraid. I’ll give it a try,” Immortal Master Mingyu said. “Otherwise, these people will all die in a few minutes.”","Swoosh!","With a long sword in his hand, Immortal Master Mingyu flew forward and flashed to a warrior in black.","Just as he was about to stab the sword in his hand, the person in black kicked horizontally.","Although it didn’t possess much might, the expression of Immortal Master Mingyu changed greatly.","He didn’t have much time to do anything. He took out a pearl and crushed it.","Boom!","Immortal Master Mingyu’s body was kicked and dissipated.","“Damn it!”","He returned to the little girl’s side and said, “I can’t be a match for them. They are too strong. I can’t even resist a kick. If it weren’t for my duplication dying for me, I would have died just now. Let’s go. Run away quickly.”","Immortal Master Mingyu said to everyone.","But no one left.","“Let’s help protect these people. I advise all of you to retreat. There’s no other way.” Immortal Master Lingxi sighed lightly.","Yue Wuwei said, “Immortal Master Mingyu, Immortal Master Lingxi, thank you for your help, but you’d better not get involved. I’ll stop them.”","“You?”","Immortal Master Mingyu said, puzzled, “You are only in the ninth tier.”","“As long as I am in this world, it will be difficult for me to die.”","Yue Wuwei smiled and suddenly flew forward. He put his hands behind his back and said calmly, “Come on! Let me see your strength.”","Swoosh!","One of the warriors in black fired a shot.","Yue Wuwei was directly blown up.","“Dad!” Yue Xiaonao was shocked and couldn’t help crying out.","However, in the next second, Yue Wuwei condensed again, and a token appeared in his hand.","“Undying Token!”","“This is the supreme treasure that Sir gave me. You can’t kill me! Ha...” Yue Wuwei laughed wildly.","He began to let the other party deal with him. He wanted to die again and again to stall for time. Although it was not very useful, and the Undying Token also contained energy, once his death exceeded the limit, he would die. However, Yue Wuwei went forward and resisted the attack with his own body.","Boom!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast had attracted most of the energy among the six duplications of Zhang Han. The other five duplicates were also engaged in the fierce battle. At the least, they were able to fight against the other party.","The rest of the people surrounded Zi Yan and Mengmeng.","“You know nothing about power.”","Prince Wo Lun said disdainfully, “In the face of absolute power, numbers are meaningless.”","“Go.”","A metal bead appeared in his hand, and he tossed it forward.","Sizzling!","Instantly, it transformed into tens of thousands of metallic monsters.","“This is mechanical technology. Try it.” Prince Wo Lun said lightly.","The metallic monsters had different shapes. Most of them were three meters high, looking like spiders. Some of them were more than ten meters high and looked like human beings.","Tens of thousands of machines flew toward the main force behind them.","“Divine Bow Troops, kill!”","Their group condensed once again. Then a rain of arrows was released, targeting the machines.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","After the arrows collided with the machines, the sound of metal colliding could be heard, but none of the machines exploded.","The attack still didn’t work.","It was chilling and depressing.","“How should we fight?” Millions of people fell into despair.","These scenes were broadcasted to the Tongtian Holy Land of the first mountain.","When everyone saw this, they were all shocked.","“This is crushing.”","“The power of the world of immortals is too strong. We can’t compete with it at all.”","The gap between them was too big.","Zhang Han looked a little pale. He was under a lot of pressure. Some of the martial artists’ bullets contained strange energy. It was constantly weakening his capability.","If it went on like this, he wouldn’t be able to hold on for much longer.","There were also many warriors in black in the rear.","No one could stop them. How long could they hold on?"]},{"number":1724,"title":"Chapter 1724 Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 1724 Death","“Han Yang Immortal, your strength is not weak.”","Prince Wo Lun watched the battle calmly.","“Your six bodies have all reached the first tier of the Zone Lord Realm. It is beyond the Cultivation World. You are indeed powerful. As they said, you are invincible in the Cultivation World.","“But it’s your misfortune to meet me.”","Prince Wo Lun smiled elegantly and said,","“Let me introduce myself. I’m Wo Lun Difeinibu. Just call me Prince Wo Lun. I’m the prince of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire.","“You have a Spirit Body, an aura and energy beyond the standards of the Cultivation World, and a Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“You have a heaven-defying opportunity.","“You have a beautiful wife with the bloodline of the Moon Spirit Clan and a beautiful daughter with a Fire Spirit Body.","“You have a great life. Of course, my arrival is the beginning of your despair.","“The real world is extremely vast, and the starry sky is boundless. The Blood Dragon Mountain Empire is also famous in the Northern Three Galaxys, and I’m the third tier of the Kingdom Lord, the third among the younger generation of the princes of the empire.”","The information contained in his words was shocking.","A trace of gloom flashed across his eyes. He seemed to want to talk more.","“My father has cultivated for millions of years. When he broke through to the Heavenly Master Realm, all of his hidden diseases broke out. His cultivation was damaged, and his life was about to reach an end. Therefore, the princes of the empire competed for the throne fiercely. I was schemed against by my eldest brother. I lost my right to compete and was exiled to the border. Do you know how desperate I was?","“I was exiled to the border area and was not allowed to return to the imperial palace of the empire. It is ridiculous. But I never expected I would find this Level S small universe in the border area. To my surprise, there are a Golden-armored Giant Beast, a person with the bloodline of the Moon Spirit Clan, and two Spirit Bodies here. Ha... Han Yang Immortal, you are my lucky star!","“Your six bodies are merely at the first tier of the Zone Lord Realm. Do you know how great the gap between you and me is?”","Prince Wo Lun took a deep breath to calm himself down.","He felt he had said much. Next, he just wanted to enjoy seeing the scene of them being captured.","Zhang Han felt cold in his heart.","It was as if the air had become cold, hitting his face and making him shiver.","The third tier of the Kingdom Lord.","Sir had told him this with his mind.","The cultivation levels were different in the real universe of the higher world. Those who broke the rules in the Cultivation World and went to the real universe were in the Zone Lord Realm. There were nine tiers in each realm below the High King. It was similar to the Tribulation Stage. When one reached the High King, there were only four stages, the Early Stage, the Middle Stage, the Last Stage, and the Peak Stage.","Now, there was a big gap between Zhang Han and his opponent.","This was a piece of news that made Zhang Han desperate.","Judging from Prince Wo Lun’s attitude, he didn’t even want to take action himself. He just wanted to watch the fun from behind.","Zhang Han struggled to hold on. His continuous eruption of power attracted more martial artists in black.","This group of three hundred people was only a small team of Prince Wo Lun.","“Each of them is at least in the fifth-tier Zone Lord Realm. They’ll play with you.”","Prince Wo Lun was not in a hurry. He just watched calmly.","Under the suppression of strength, all of this was like a play in his eyes.","Hearing his words, the hundreds of thousands of clans watching the live broadcast were shocked.","“What are the Zone Lord Realm and the Kingdom Lord? Are they the realm of the immortals?”","“No wonder Han Yang Immortal is invincible in the world. He has actually reached the standard of the world of immortals.”","“He’s so strong. It’s a pity that he has no hope today.”","Someone released an incomparable sigh. Not long ago, he was unmatched under the heavens. But now, he was going to die.","“He may be the fastest Dao Seeking Cultivator to reach the supreme and end his era in history.” Someone commented.","“That group of the subordinates in black has all reached the fifth-tier Zone Lord Realm. How terrifying!”","Under the gazes of hundreds of millions of people, Zhang Han and his people, including the troops, began to face the terrifying attacks.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Yue Wuwei died again and again, but it didn’t take long. Maybe it was only a few seconds before the martial artists in black took action.","The subordinates of Prince Wo Lun were all unstoppable as if they were invincible experts.","Soon, more than a dozen martial artists in black approached Zi Yan and Mengmeng.","“Attack! Attack!”","Zhang Guangyou, Zhang Mu, Chu Qingyi, Kong Ling’er, Zhao Feng, and the others all rushed to the front.","However, they were facing tens of thousands of mechanical monsters. These mechanical monsters moved very fast, and their attack methods were unpredictable.","The kind of energy was different from the supernatural power and the occult art in the Cultivation World.","“Destroy!”","Zhang Mu roared angrily. He swung his long broadsword but couldn’t even kill a small metal monster. In fact, he couldn’t even affect the other party.","Sizzling!","One of the metal monster’s legs shot out a ray of light and pierced through the chest of Zhang Mu.","Blood spurted out.","Zhang Mu flew backward and fell to the ground with a plop. His breath was weak, and he was seriously injured.","“Go to hell!”","With the power of the Devil Shadow Clan, Chu Qingyi possessed a strange body movement. In the blink of an eye, she came close to the other party and cut off a metal machine with her sword.","“Go!”","“Damn it! Kill!”","Heavenly Hound, Yun Han, Xu Xiaoqiang, and the others kept casting their supernatural power behind them.","The metal machines fell and were destroyed one by one.","But it was too slow.","If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, who could have imagined that these tens of thousands of metal machines hard to deal with came from a small metal ball?","“Go with us!”","The two martial artists in black had flown to a place 100 meters away from Zi Yan and Mengmeng.","They waved their hands casually, and two big nets came from above.","“Flames!”","Mengmeng eyes shone with white light, and invisible flames were burning.","But she didn’t expect that the flames could only let the falling net slow down.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Zi Yan gritted her teeth and kept launching moonlight attacks.","She didn’t even hesitate to overdraw her energy to slow down the approaching nets.","Zhang Han was in the front. There were bloodstains at the corner of the mouth of the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure. He turned his head and looked at the two people behind him. His eyes gradually turned red.","He knew many kinds of supernatural power. But at this moment, they seemed to be useless.","These warriors in black had restricted him. The legs of the Golden-armored Giant Beast were chained by silvery-white chains. They were trying to restrain its claws.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure was almost exhausted. The Thunder Body could interfere with many people, but the effect was not obvious. The Great Demon’s Figure, the Nine Suns Godly Body, and the Extreme Purity Immortal Body had all been cleverly dissolved by the other party.","These warriors in black were well-equipped and had more means.","Sizzling! Sizzling! Sizzling!","Numerous metal machines continuously shot out beams of light.","The covering attack fell on the troops like a blooming light and swept away everything.","“Yun Han!” Heavenly Hound screamed.","Just now, Yun Han was still by his side. But in the next second, he was disintegrated by a beam of light.","Was he dead?","Heavenly Hound fell into a daze at this moment.","In his sight, too many former teammates died in groups not far away.","“Ah!”","A faint sound came from the boulder on the boulder under the mountain below. “I can’t hold on anymore. Heavenly Hound, give me some medicinal pellets. I’m going to die.”","Yun Han still had half of his body left, and his breath was almost gone.","“Fuck!”","Heavenly Hound immediately flew over and took out several medicinal pellets. Yun Han felt better after taking them.","“Go. All of you leave here. You really can’t hold on any longer!”","Immortal Master Mingyu was frantic. “We can’t help them.”","When he and the Immortal Master Lingxi saw the seriously injured Dao Seeking Cultivators, they came to help.","Everyone was fighting. Painful cries, screams, and sounds of explosions could be heard everywhere. The voice of Immortal Master Mingyu had spread far and wide, but it had no effect.","The metal machines drew near.","“Brother Feng!” Ah Hu roared.","He flew over and caught Zhao Feng, who had lost an arm.","At this time, Zhao Feng was pale. After taking the medicinal pellets, he held the sword with one hand and was about to rush over again. He said in a low voice, “Stop them with all our might. As long as we’re alive, we can’t let them take anyone away!”","“Brother Feng, we can’t resist them anymore!” Some members of the security group couldn’t bear the pressure and cried out.","“This is the meaning of our security group.”","With red eyes, Zhao Feng continued to rush forward.","“Damn it! Let’s go all out!” Ah Hu was hit by the beam head-on. His body fell to the ground, and he kept vomiting blood.","“Watch out, Liu Qi!”","Jiang Yanlan’s expression changed. She wanted to help, but she didn’t expect that Instructor Liu to follow in the footsteps of Ah Hu.","“Ma’am!”","Seeing that the big nets were about to cover Zi Yan and Mengmeng, Mu Xue flew over with her sword.","However, she was blocked by two metal machines. She was forced to retreat step by step, and her body was covered with blood.","A rout was like a landslide. It was a one-sided war. In the past, they were the winners. But this time, they were the losers.","“What should I do? What can I do?”","The weaker ones, such as Rong Jiali, Rong Jiaxin, and Zhou Fei, could only use some supernatural power in the rear, but it had no effect. Their faces were pale and powerless.","“Ow!”","Just as the big nets were following them like shadows and Zi Yan and Mengmeng could not dodge them, they were only 20 meters away.","Dahei suddenly roared out. It was getting bigger and bigger. It became a King Kong, who was thousands of feet tall, grabbed two big nets with its left and right hands and kept pulling them.","“Ow!”","Dahei looked ferocious and stared at the warriors in black with hatred.","It tried its best but couldn’t tear through the big nets.","Boom!","One of the warriors in black only threw a punch and pierced through Dahei.","Plop!","Dahei rolled its eyes and half-knelt on the ground. It gritted its teeth and tried to tear apart the big nets.","“Dahei, come back!”","Mengmeng cried from below. She was already confused. She had never experienced such a scene since she was a child.","Her flames kept bursting out. Even though she performed her capability together with Zi Yan, she couldn’t stop the other party.","“Ow!” Dahei roared with all its strength.","However, the enemy’s second punch made its body collapse. It turned into a one-meter-tall gorilla and fell to the ground beside Mengmeng.","“Ow...”","Dahei looked at Zhang Han in front of it with nostalgia and looked at Zi Yan, Little Hei, and Tiny Tot who had appeared. Finally, it looked at Mengmeng.","It raised its arms and moved them up slightly.","It meant holding Mengmeng high, a game it had played with Mengmeng since she was a child.","“Ow...”","Dahei curled its lips and tried to smile, trying to express something, but it couldn’t. It closed its eyes in the cold wind.","Mengmeng screamed.","Zi Yan bit her lower lip so hard that it turned pale.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Immortal Master Lingxi came to Dahei in a flash, smashed more than a dozen ninth-tier medicinal pellets, turned them into energy, and injected them into Dahei’s body.","“Retreat now!” Immortal Master Lingxi led them back.","Little Hei stared coldly at a warrior in black with a bloodthirsty light in its eyes.","Swoosh!","It bit the leg of the warrior in black.","However, its teeth, which had always been sharp, did not break the other party’s pants.","Boom!","With just one kick, Little Hei’s bones were broken.","“Suppress!”","Two warriors in Black controlled the big nets. They took out a metal ball and crushed it.","The space in the surroundings of Immortal Master Lingxi was locked down.","The big nets were about to arrive.","“Coo.”","Tiny Tot was furious. It turned into the cursed roc and got bigger and bigger. However, it was bleeding because of the big nets. The monstrous incantation turned into a black light, but the black light could not break through the cover of the big nets at all.","Swoosh!","Tiny Tot became the boat of curse and was beaten into the state it was in after it was just born. It fell to the ground and remained motionless.","Mu Xue rushed over and cast the Frozen Sword.","Crack! The sword broke.","Under the control of the martial artist in black, the broken sword tip rushed toward Mu Xue on her forehead.","Buzz!","Just as Mu Xue narrowed her eyes and could even feel the sharpness of the sword.","An illusory figure suddenly appeared in front of her.","He had an evil smile.","The Demonic Ghost King Clown came.","“Ha...”","A hoarse laughter filled the area.","“I like souls. I like the souls of people from the higher world.”","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","A terrifying wind howled, and the black light shone.","Countless spaceships appeared in the void. The army of the Demonic Ghost King came!","Countless Yin souls appeared in each spaceship. Through the spaceships, they effectively attacked the metal machines.","One metallic machine after another fell.","Even the two nearest martial artists in black were slightly shocked.","“A Soul Creature?”","The two of them exchanged a look. This thing was a bit valuable. Should they take action or capture it?","They temporarily backed up, withdrawing the large nets.","The destruction of the metal machines also reduced the pressure on the troops of Mount New Moon. But there were less than 500,000 people who could stand.","“A rare Soul Creature.”","Prince Wo Lun clapped his hands and said, “You’re a little valuable. But compared to the descendant of the Moon Spirit Clan and the Golden-armored Giant Beast, I’m not interested in you at all.”","Prince Wo Lun slapped forward with his right hand.","Endless strength crushed the Demonic Ghost King Clown to pieces!","Slap!","The black fog began to dissipate.","The Demonic Ghost King Clown became more illusory. A mask was about to fall from the sky.","The Dark Mask!","“Who are you?”","Mu Xue stared blankly ahead.","The Demonic Ghost King, who was about to disappear, turned around.","“I’m a clown, as well as Ding Jiuming. I’m a Demonic Ghost King formed by my obsession. I was born and died because of it. You are my obsession, so I’m here. I hope you can live and be safe for the rest of your life.”","His voice was much similar to that of Ding Jiuming.","This meant that his consciousness had occupied the main body. But after he finished speaking, he dissipated.","The Dark Mask fell to the ground.","The appearance of the Demonic Ghost King had destroyed the metal machines, but this had also given everyone only a brief respite.","Dozens of warriors in black descended.","More than a dozen of them came straight at Zi Yan and Mengmeng.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast could only roar as its limbs were trapped.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure became illusory.","The Thunder Body flickered, and the white clothes of the Extreme Purity Immortal Body were all red. The horn of the Great Demon’s Figure was broken, and the Nine Suns Godly Body was almost transparent.","Zhang Han was the one under the greatest pressure among all the people present","He stood in front, but he couldn’t hold on any longer.","“Han!”","“Master.”","“Boss!”","Muffled cries filled the air.","The strong wind swept across heaven and earth, cold and bone-piercing. The last light of dusk dissipated, and the world fell into darkness.","There was only a faint light of battle.","But the next second, boundless bright moonlight illuminated everything!","It was not from the moon.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Everyone looked at Zi Yan.","She was wearing a crystal dress, and her body was shining like a holy queen. She wore a sad and beautiful smile. She pursed her lips and looked at Mengmeng beside her. She reached out and touched the head of Mengmeng.","“Mummy loves you.”","Clatter!","Mengmeng was full of tears. She immediately grabbed Zi Yan’s hand and realized what Zi Yan was about to do.","However, her hand grabbed nothing. Zi Yan seemed to be in another space and did not exist in this world.","Zi Yan floated into the air.","She turned around and looked around at the crowd seriously.","She seemed to have ascended to heaven and was like an immortal running to the moon. However, there was no moon in the sky. Zi Yan represented the moon.","In a few seconds, Zi Yan flew forward and came to the side of Zhang Han’s Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","Under the moonlight, the warriors in black stopped. They looked slightly shocked and retreated one after another.","On the other hand, Prince Wo Lun could no longer keep his cool. His expression changed drastically.","“How dare you? Damn it! Stop! If you dare to destroy yourself, I’ll kill all of you. If you stop, I’ll spare your lives!”","Prince Wo Lun roared, “Stop!”","He even attacked several times. However, the overwhelming power couldn’t be condensed under the moonlight.","The person with the bloodline of the Moon Spirit Clan was very valuable. How could Prince Wo Lun be willing to let her self-detonate?","“Stop!”","The Prince Wo Lun’s voice was hoarse.","His voice vibrated.","Right at this moment, Zhang Han and Zi Yan couldn’t hear him. They looked at each other.","“No!”","Zhang Han looked desperate, sad, and pleading.","“Don’t speak.”","Zi Yan blinked. Her eyes were red, and there were tears in them. She kept smiling and approached Zhang Han. She wanted to kiss him, but she couldn’t touch him.","She pursed her lips. Under her sad and beautiful expression, she was afraid in her heart.","Yes. She was afraid. She was afraid that she would not see Zhang Han and Mengmeng in the future the most.","“Honey.”","Zi Yan was crying, and her lips were trembling. She choked with sobs and said, “Live well and take good care of our daughter.”","Clatter!","Zhang Han felt his heart stop beating.","He was crazy.","He stretched out his arms to grab her.","“No! You can’t! No! Don’t do that!”","Zhang Han looked pale, and his eyes were purple.","Zi Yan pursed her lips and cried with reluctance in her eyes. Finally, she looked at Zhang Han and became silent.","But judging from the shape of her mouth, she was saying, “I love you.”","“No!’","Zhang Han roared, which was the only sound between heaven and earth.","Zi Yan suddenly burst out a light more dazzling than the sun!","Buzz!","The rules of the entire ancient martial arts world had disappeared.","Even the rules of the Great Domain in the entire Silver Dragon Galaxy were extinguished.","A dull sound came from the Great Domain in the whole Cultivation World.","The light covered the ancient martial arts world.","All the things revived.","The destroyed plants started to grow again, and many people who had been seriously injured and on the verge of death recovered under the moonlight.","More energy was madly injected into the six duplications of Zhang Han.","“Alert!","“The aura of a person of the Moon Spirit Clan is detected.","“That person is not a person with a bloodline of the Moon Spirit Clan. She’s a person of the Moon Spirit Clan.”","Rumble!","Prince Wo Lun was dumbfounded.","“What? A member of the Moon Spirit Clan? How is that possible? This energy...”","He immediately wanted to escape.","However, he suddenly discovered that space had been locked down, and no one could move.","It was like a world in the daytime.","Zhang Han roared in pain.","Boom!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast, the Great Demon’s Figure, the Nine Suns Godly Body, the Extreme Purity Immortal Body, the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, and the Thunder Body roared at the same time.","The six voices gradually merged into one.","The six figures merged into one.","“Alert! The aura of the fifth-tier Zone Lord Realm has been detected. The seventh-tier Zone Lord Realm. The ninth-tier Zone Lord Realm. The second-tier Kingdom Lord. The fifth-tier Kingdom Lord. The ninth-tier Kingdom Lord. The Early-Stage High King.”","“Alert! The enemy is at the Early-Stage King Realm. It is recommended to escape.”","The alarm of the spaceship system sounded in his ears.","But Prince Wo Lun couldn’t move at all. His face was pale.","“How could this be? How could she be a member of the Moon Spirit Clan? Impossible! It is only a native world! She is only a native!”","Within the light, Zhang Han became more and more solid.","His six duplications merged together.","He had reached the High King!","His long hair fluttered about, his aura incomparable to even heaven and earth. When the radiance scattered, his figure appeared.","What a look of despair!","What a desolate face!","Zhang Han looked pale. He felt cold as if his heart had been stabbed countless times!","At this moment, he lost everything in his eyes.","He kept looking around in the air.","He tried to find that beautiful figure.","“Where are you?”","“Please come out.”","“Honey? Don’t joke around. Come out quickly.”","“Please come out! Come out! Please!”","He kept looking at heaven and earth and roaring like a madman.","He cried, weeping bitterly. That was the only sound he could make.","The powerful man, the pillar of support, the man who had always been calm, had collapsed.","“How can you leave me?”","Crack!","His heart was broken.","“Ah! Ah! Ah!”","Zhang Han looked helpless, pleading, and expectant.","He hoped that he could see her, but he couldn’t. He couldn’t see her anymore!","“Mom! Mummy!”","Mengmeng was stunned. She cried and couldn’t even breathe. Her face became pale immediately. She couldn’t bear the huge blow, rolled her eyes, and fell to the ground.","Zhang Guangyou, Rong Jiali, Zhao Feng, Mu Xue, Zhang Mu, Yue Wuwei, and others all cried, full of sadness.","The wind was blowing coldly.","It was bone-chilling cold, and the night filled the air. There was no light of dawn.","The wind stopped, the lights went out, and the person left. Everything became dead silent.","Only the cry of Zhang Han was heartbreaking.","Zhang Han roared unwillingly as if the heavens were unfair!","Invisible energy fluctuations crushed forward.","Crack! Crack! Crack!","Space shattered, and the space of the cave in the sky expanded by a thousand times.","Grand Master Tongtian, Prince Wo Lun, many warriors in black, and all the people in front of the enormous flying ships outside were eliminated by the fluctuations.","They were not able to withstand the might of a High King.","However, who could bear the pain of Zhang Han now?","No one.","Suddenly, in the air in front of Zhang Han, a ray of colorful light slowly floated up because of his fluctuations.","“That is...”","Zhang Han suddenly felt hopeful.","He reached out his hand, trying to grab that ray of light.","But the light slowly floated up like a flying ribbon. In just three seconds, it dissipated.","Swoosh!","Zhang Han’s face turned paler.","His body staggered and fell from the air. Then He collapsed on the boulder.","The waves ahead were roaring, rising, and falling, playing a sad song.","Zhang Han seemed to be petrified, and his eyes lost their color.","His eyes were unblinking, and he was in a daze.","The Shadow of Light of the second mind appeared in the distance for a moment and murmured sadly, “This is your heart’s tribulation and her death’s tribulation.”","Zhang Han’s heart was empty as if he had lost his soul. He sat on a stone by the sea and let the sea breeze blow.","His long hair rapidly turned white, and he became older.","Zhang Han seemed to be frozen. Only his white hair fluttered slightly accompanied by the howling sea breeze.","As of this moment, everything was frozen in place as if it were eternal."]},{"number":1725,"title":"Chapter 1725 Slaughtering in the Star Sea","paragraphs":["Chapter 1725 Slaughtering in the Star Sea","“This...”","The hundreds of thousands of clans who saw this fell silent.","They couldn’t believe that Han Yang Immortal still turned the tables.","Only the hoarse cries and shouts lingered in their minds.","Han Yang Immortal was defeated.","They all knew this was an enormous blow to him.","Some people regretted it, but more clans immediately suggested, “Prince Wo Lun is dead. Please take us away quickly.”","But they didn’t expect that this group of people also fell into a daze.","“His Highness is dead.”","“Go back to the empire and report the news.”","“Change the passageway mode and maintain a one-way mode.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The spaceships left behind left.","The people of hundreds of thousands of clans kept flying into the air, trying to pass through the passage, but they couldn’t get close at all.","They tried for a few days.","However, they were disappointed.","“It’s over! It’s all over!”","“Let’s go back. There is no Grand Master Tongtian or Prince Wo Lun. Han Yang Immortal will dominate the world.”","“Yes! It’s over.”","The people of the hundreds of thousands of clans left one after another.","In the ancient martial arts world, the whole world was beautiful and exquisite. All things were revived, and many seriously injured people recovered.","However, many of them were dead.","Zhang Han sat alone on the stone platform.","Little Hei slowly approached Zhang Han and lay down beside him. Its eyes were full of tears as it cried in a low and pitiful voice.","Dahei was a gorilla that Zhang Han met for the first time. It sat behind Zhang Han and looked at the sea in front of it in a daze.","The boat of curse of Tiny Tot was slowly moving behind it. It had become a newborn. The muffled sound coming from the boat sounded sad.","“Yan!”","Zhang Guangyou, Rong Jiali, Yue Wuwei, Chen Changqing, and the others all stood still.","“Why did it end up like this?” Rong Jiali broke down and burst into tears.","“Ma’am.” Mu Xue covered her mouth and cried silently.","Kong Ling’er stared blankly ahead.","The figure and the scene just now showed that he loved Zi Yan so deeply that this love was deep in his bones.","She thought it was ridiculous for her to pursue Zhang Han at that time.","After Zi Yan died, no one could heal the pain in his heart.","“Daughter. Daughter.”","Xu Xinyu was so sad that she collapsed on the ground.","Zi Qiang, Zi Long...","At this moment, the people of the ancient martial arts world felt very uncomfortable.","Five hours passed.","Suddenly, Mengmeng seemed to wake up from a dream and shouted, “No!”","She opened her eyes and looked around. She hoped it was just a dream.","But the reality shattered her desire.","Mengmeng cried and ran to Zhang Han. She didn’t even notice that her shoes were thrown off. She threw herself into Zhang Han’s arms and shouted, “It’s fake! Daddy, please tell me it’s fake!”","Zhang Han was in a daze. His dull eyes finally regained a trace of clarity.","His eyes turned red. Seeing Mengmeng crying, he raised his trembling hand and stroked her beautiful hair. His hoarse voice trembled slightly, “Go to sleep, daughter! Have a sleep. This is a dream.”","The soft energy made Mengmeng slowly close her eyes. She lay on the lap of Zhang Han and fell asleep.","Little Hei did not wag its tail at all. It made a pitiful sound again as if comforting or sad.","“Son! Son!”","Rong Jiali ran over in tears.","“Wait! Wait for a while.”","Zhang Guangyou hugged her and let her cry in his arms. He said in a low voice, “Let him be quiet.”","Everyone knew no one could help Zhang Han at this moment.","Two drops of tears fell along the face of Immortal Master Lingxi.","She gently wiped her tears with her fingers. When she saw the tears, she trembled and murmured in a low voice, “Beautiful love.”","Immortal Master Mingyu sighed from afar. “The sorrow of a hero.”","It was silent.","Days passed one after another. Soon, one month had passed.","Zhang Mu, Dong Chen, Yue Wuwei, and the others looked at each other.","“Zhang Han can’t go on like this.”","Yue Wuwei said worriedly, “He will be sick.”","“Alas!”","Zhang Mu sighed heavily.","Yue Wuwei and the others were all core members of Mount New Moon.","Just as they walked forward and were about to get closer, Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","An enormous amount of spatial power enveloped them.","With the Shadow Displacement Transposition, everyone appeared on Mount New Moon.","Yue Wuwei sighed and said, “He can only bear it himself.”","The 500,000 troops were also near Mount New Moon.","All the people who lived on Mount New Moon, including the children who didn’t know the truth, felt the oppressive atmosphere.","Without laughter, the whole Mount New Moon fell into silence.","Spring passed, and autumn arrived.","In the winter of the ancient martial arts world, snowflakes fluttered in the air and covered the entire world.","Zhang Han was covered with snow, but Mengmeng didn’t touch a drop of snow as if she were a sleeping princess.","Dahei and Little Hei remained motionless.","The boat of curse of Tiny Tot was drifting back and forth on the coast.","What was it looking for?","Three years passed!","The boat of curse made a faint sound.","Zhang Han raised his eyebrows slightly.","His eyes were no longer as clear as before. They were turbid, dull, and lifeless as if they were blind.","He slowly lowered his head and looked at Mengmeng in his arms.","Swoosh!","Zhang Han, Mengmeng, Dahei, and Little Hei returned to Mount New Moon.","The boat of curse also appeared on the sea near Mount New Moon, but it soon sank into the sea.","“Sleep! Have a good sleep.”","Zhang Han put Mengmeng on the bed in her bedroom, and his eyes became a little gentle.","He turned around and left. Then he returned to his bedroom and stood there in a daze for a few minutes.","She was no longer here.","He closed the door.","Swoosh!","He ignored any rules and appeared directly above the Boundless Sea.","He slowly got down on his knees.","“Sir, you have great supernatural power. I beg you to resurrect my wife.”","Sir once said with his mind that if Zhang Han knelt to acknowledge him as his master, he would promise Zhang Han one thing.","But now...","“Alas!”","A cluster of light from Sir’s mind appeared in front of Zhang Han. “No one can help you with this tribulation, but there is still a chance. You can fight for it. The odds of success are not very high.”","This cluster of light was extremely solid. It was the Eldest Mind.","“What is it?” Zhang Han raised his head.","“Do you remember the colorful beam of light that floated for three seconds?” Sir said with his mind, “The Moon Spirit Clan is a special clan. It’s people won’t die easily. But Zi Yan didn’t become a real member of the Moon Spirit Clan, so...”","Zhang Han gradually felt depressed.","“Apart from me, all my minds dissipated. It managed to keep the colorful light. It contains the special energy of the members of the Moon Spirit Clan. It’s divided into seven parts and attached to the bodies of the seven women above. If you can find the seven of them, take a drop of the blood essence each and condense all the blood in this Moon Spirit Pearl. This is the only hope left.”","A shining pearl floated out of the light ball of Sir’s mind.","Zhang Han took it with his right hand, looked at the pearl, pressed it against his chest, and attached it to his heart.","“Thank you, Master,” Zhang Han said in a low voice.","“Don’t call me Master. It’s just a joke,” the elder said. “There’s something in the light door that belongs to you. Take it to the higher world. I’ll control the rules here. If you stay in the higher world for a year, a day will pass here. Come back as soon as possible. Don’t let your daughter wait too long.”","Swoosh!","The Shadow of Light slowly dissipated.","Zhang Han was silent again. He looked at the light door in front of him in a daze.","He had lost interest in everything.","He entered the world of light alone.","The Bone Demons were everywhere.","He ignored everything and flew all the way inside.","He crossed the world, crossed another light door, and arrived at the Bone Demon Main Continent.","This was a dark world.","The Bone Demons who had reached the Tribulation Stage were everywhere.","In the deepest place, there was a mountain.","At the top of the mountain, there were bones everywhere, and there was a throne.","Zhang Han walked to the end and sat down.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Countless bones turned into rays of light energy and gathered on Zhang Han. A helmet covered his head, making his head look like a skull. His eyes were shining with red light.","Many skulls could be seen indistinctly in the black armor on his body.","The flowing light turned into a cloak.","Thousands of Bone Demons roared.","“Bone Spirit.”","Zhang Han felt a series of information rushing into his mind.","The Bone Spirit Troops were terrifying creatures from the higher world and lived in the miasma.","They could be infinitely integrated and upgraded.","Judging from the color, the fundamental realm of the Bone Spirit was silver in the Zone Lord Realm. The blue Bone Spirit was the Kingdom Lord, the gold was the High King, the red was the Heavenly Master, the purple was the Emperor-to-be, and the black was the Great Emperor.","The whole world was filled with white Bone Spirits around the Tribulation Stage.","“The Seven-star Sword turns out to be a Bone Sword.”","Zhang Han took out the Seven-star Sword. Hundreds of millions of Bone Spirits converged and turned into a long sword looking like dried bones.","The Bone Demon Field was very large. Countless Bone Demons kept gathering and merging.","Finally, two silver Bone Spirits stood in front of Zhang Han. They were in the Zone Lord Realm.","As Zhang Han willed, the Bone Spirits disappeared into the darkness hidden in the cloak.","“Can I assimilate the Bone Spirits just by killing people?","“I like it.”","The evil laughter shook the world.","Zhang Han disappeared.","He returned to Mount New Moon.","His armor dissipated. He looked at Mengmeng tenderly and slowly wrote a letter beside her.","Then, his figure disappeared.","Boom!","He broke the void and appeared in the Silver Dragon Galaxy. With only one step, he crossed the entire Galaxy and went straight to the Star Sea at an incredible speed!","When a demon awoke, everything would be destroyed.","“Ah! Ah! Ah!","“My Dad is gone.”","Shortly after Zhang Han left, Mengmeng cried all over Mount New Moon.","Zhang Guangyou and the others immediately came to the castle.","Seeing Mengmeng in pain, many people burst into tears.","“He’s going to the higher world. I’m going to find him.”","Mengmeng was crying, about to leave. Yue Wuwei and the others also supported her. But they suddenly found that all the Ancient Roads of Starry Sky were closed.","Even Mengmeng couldn’t control it.","Mengmeng was devastated.","At this time, signals of the whole world were suddenly cut off on a planet on the edge of the Star Sea.","Two silver skeletons appeared in the world. Zhang Han was wearing armor, and his cloak shook slightly.","In just ten minutes, two silver skeletons slaughtered the whole world.","The 30 billion people had all turned into bones. The entire world had turned into a pitch-black swamp.","30 billion skeletons kept devouring, evolving, and eventually became 10,000 white Bone Spirits in the Tribulation Stage.","Zhang Han took a step forward and came to another planet.","There were 150 billion people, including more than 300 Dao Seeking Cultivators of the Tribulation Stage and tens of thousands of people at the Integration and the Mastery of the major sects.","In just five minutes, they were slaughtered and assimilated by the descending Bone Spirits.","150 billion Bone Spirits turned into 20,000 skeletons in the Tribulation Stage.","Then he went to the third planet, the fourth planet... Finally, he went to the 100th planet.","Now, Zhang Han had millions of Bone Spirits in the Tribulation Stage.","He only wanted the Bone Spirits in the Tribulation Stage. The more, the better.","In the outer ring of the first mountain, the Bone Spirit Troops swept out ruthlessly like a strong wind.","However, the Dao Seeking Cultivators of the Star Sea knew nothing about this.","Every time the Bone Spirit Troops moved out, they would seal off the planet first. No news came out.","The more Bone Spirits there were, the faster the assimilation speed would be.","Soon, Zhang Han had trillions of Bone Spirits.","Soon, the Bone Spirit Troops separated.","A batch after another of them left.","They surrounded the entire Star Sea.","They continuously assimilated, devoured, and compressed the creatures. A few days later, there were no more creatures around the outer ring of the Star Sea.","The scale of the Bone Spirit Troops was as large as hundreds of billions."]},{"number":1726,"title":"Chapter 1726 He Came","paragraphs":["Chapter 1726 He Came","Some sects in the inner ring quickly discovered the clues.","“Why can’t I get in touch with the branch palaces in the outer ring?”","“Not only our sect. I’ve inquired about 17 sects. But I can’t get in touch with their branches in the outer ring.”","“Could it be a signal problem?” Someone questioned.","Soon, he was refuted.","“Not only the signal problem. The business teams that often came and went did not show up.”","“Send someone over to investigate.”","Many forces sent people over one after another.","Some flying ships sailed through the secondary space. Of course, it was the fastest to use the Space Shooting Planets.","Swoosh!","A spaceship flew from a Space Shooting Planet to the next destination.","At this time, they were shocked.","“Oh, my god!”","“What is this?”","They saw a planet about to be destroyed. They could even see countless skeletons levitating in the void as if it were the end of the world.","“Be quick to go back and enter the secondary space.”","In just two seconds, their spaceship entered the secondary space.","Buzz!","But as soon as they entered, an invisible energy blew up the spaceship.","These Dao Seeking Cultivators also died directly in the secondary space.","Gradually, some people succeeded in bringing the news back alive.","“Dried bones! They were dried bones everywhere.”","Many sects held meetings.","“We need to confirm whether this is the only army of dried bones or if there are many.”","“Sect Leader, there’s news about the second mountain. Countless planets in their outer ring have been attacked by dried bones.”","“The third mountain is also facing the attack of dried bones. They can’t stop it at all. All living creatures are in misery. Someone has taken a video of a planet.”","The video was played.","Under the gaze of many high-position officials of the forces, a large group of hundreds of millions of dried skeletons blew up the space stations, sealed off the planet, and flew quickly toward the surface of the continent.","The originally lush green continent was soon covered with a black layer.","The trees dried up, and no one on this planet escaped.","“Hiss!”","“How is this possible?”","“What on earth are those skeletons? Are they from the world of immortals?”","The people from many forces gasped.","“Alert! Three hundred planets near the outer ring of our sect have been attacked at the same time.”","“What about the video?”","The subordinate played the image.","The scene on the 300 planets was the same as what they had seen before. Endless dried bones covered the planets, leaving no survivors!","“They are slaughtering the planets! What sort of monster is this?”","The faces of countless Sect Leaders darkened. “Can we detect the strength and realm of these skeletons?”","“We can’t detect it. It’s said that the top six sects in our alliance are ready to fight back.”","“Join in the counterattack.”","“Send out our troops immediately. We must wipe out these monsters.”","Many people didn’t know their strengths.","More than 80% of the sects in the inner ring chose to fight back.","Countless spaceships gradually approached.","The news spread faster and faster.","“Are there troops of the dried skeletons everywhere in the outer ring?”","“Is our Star Sea being attacked? There are so many of them. That’s impossible. The Star Sea was so big. How could they be attacked at the same time?”","Some people couldn’t believe it. But when they saw the scenes one after another, they were stunned.","“Dried bones? What are dried bones? I’ve never seen such creatures before.”","Many people began to study it.","They were about to fight back.","Even some sects in the Nine Mountains Region began to learn of the news.","“Are you kidding me? Could it be just a rumor? It is impossible for the entire Star Sea to be attacked.”","“Sect Leader, these are some videos.”","After a while, the Sect Leader looked pale and his eyes were filled with horror. “Inform all the high-position officials to have a meeting.”","When many sects and forces had the meetings, the counterattack in the inner ring began.","People arrived at the battlefield.","“Oh, my god!”","The scene in front of them was full of dead bones.","“How to defeat them?”","“Attack! Attack!”","The fleet fired a round of attacks in unison.","Countless flames exploded in the troops of the bones.","A portion of the bones were wiped out.","“It’s useful! Ha... Continue to attack in a distance and kill them!”","The high-ranking officers of the spaceships finally found a successful way to fight.","The continuous bombardment killed a lot of enemies.","But there were too many dried bones.","Fortunately, these bones couldn’t break through the place attacking them.","However, they didn’t know far away from them, the Bone Spirits were advancing one by one in the secondary space. They could travel in secondary space.","These spaceships were unaware of this.","It was already too late by the time they discovered it.","Millions of silver Bone Spirits began to show their power.","Without any supernatural power or occult art, the Bone Spirits kept attacking the spaceships with their arms. Their strength was amazing, and a punch of them could make a hole several meters long on a spaceship.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Flying ships were smashed, and the Dao Seeking Cultivators inside were killed, assimilated, and turned into new Bone Spirits.","The assimilation was infinite.","They were the Bone Spirit Troops that came from the real universe and were suppressed by the Great Emperors in miasma!","Once the Bone Spirits appeared in the human domain, there would be slaughtering every time.","Every time the Bone Spirits rioted, there would inevitably be a king.","The Bone Spirit King was extremely difficult to kill. As well as there was any Bone Spirit left in any place, Bone Spirit King would be able to revive.","Suppressing and expelling were helpless methods.","Now that the Bone Spirits had arrived, Zhang Han, the ruthless God of Death, had begun to launch a devastating catastrophe on this world!","This was revenge against all of them.","Regardless of whether the other party was young, old, or beautiful, he would kill them for no reason. He had already gone mad.","Boom!","All the counterattack fleets were wiped out.","“Have all the fleets of the sects been destroyed?”","“There are bones everywhere, covering the entire world.”","The faces of countless Sect Leaders turned pale.","Someone replied, “Yes. Sect Leader. The situation is worse than we imagined. We can’t resist at all.”","“Sect Leader, let’s go to the Nine Mountains Region. The Human Clan is facing extinction. The Nine Mountains Region is our last line of defense and hope.”","“Let’s leave now!”","Many Sect Leaders gave the order almost at the same time.","There were countless spaceships on many planets. This was a huge migration.","However, many people on each planet couldn’t board the spaceships.","The number of spaceships could not support all of them. More than half of them stayed.","“No! Don’t give up on us.”","The news had spread all over the world.","“We can’t stay. Even if we have to fly ourselves, we have to go to the Nine Mountains Region.”","Countless people flew into the void toward the Nine Mountains Region.","Some of them had aircraft that flew not slowly. But compared with the Space Shooting Planets, they moved much slower.","There were countless planets in the outer ring, but they had been destroyed by the Bone Spirit Troops, let alone the planets in the inner ring.","From the outer ring to the inner ring, no planets were intact. All the planets had turned into swamps.","The assimilation speed of the Bone Spirits became faster and faster.","Soon, the entire inner ring was about to fall.","Gradually, many teams fled into the void.","“What’s behind? There seems to be some light.”","Many people turned around and were surprised.","“There are some white spots. Why do they seem to be flickering?”","“Ah!”","After seeing them clearly, everyone’s faces turned pale.","“Withered bones! Withered bones are coming! They are coming!”","Wherever the Bone Spirit Troops passed, not a blade of grass grew.","They became more and more, and they attacked faster and faster.","There was not a single living person in the entire inner ring.","Countless Bone Spirit Troops surrounded the Nine Mountains Region, and no one could stop their advance.","Nine Mountain World, everyone panicked.","“I can’t get in touch with the inner ring.”","“So many videos are enough to prove that the entire inner ring is suffering from the attack of the skeletons.”","“Many of these creatures are in the Tribulation Stage. According to many videos, there are more than a hundred...”","A hundred?","Everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","The number of people in the Tribulation Stage of the Nine Mountains Region was more than a million.","Then, the subordinate said with a bitter and pale face, “Trillion!”","“Hiss!”","Countless people sucked in a breath of cold air. “A hundred trillion?”","Even a Sect Leader of the Holy Land stood up involuntarily and said in horror, “Are you kidding? A hundred trillion in the Tribulation Stage? Are you kidding me?”","“They were just found.” The subordinate was about to cry. “There are still many places that haven’t been recorded. It is said that there are silvery bones all over the sky. The number of the troops of the bones far exceeds a hundred trillion.”","It was as if a bolt from the sky struck the hearts of the crowd.","All the Grand Masters of the Holy Lands, super sects, and first-rate forces were dumbfounded.","Everyone was filled with despair!","They couldn’t help thinking of the desperate cry of Han Yang Immortal not long ago.","“Perhaps Han Yang Immortal was also in despair at that time.”","Someone spoke up with a bitter voice.","His words woke the crowd up.","“Yes! Han Yang Immortal! We still have Han Yang Immortal. He has transcended the Cultivation World, and he must have a way to deal with these bones!”","“Even Prince Wo Lun is killed by him. Those people are immortals. Han Yang Immortal can kill immortals. He is invincible in the world. He can definitely suppress these bones!”","The Holy Lands, sects, first-rate forces, and the tens of thousands of clans in the Cultivation World thought of Zhang Han.","Many of them said, “We need to find Han Yang Immortal and ask him for help.”","“He will. As a member of the Human Clan, how can he watch the Human Clan be wiped out?”","“It’s a matter of the Human Clan. Han Yang Immortal will understand.”","“But how can we find him?”","“We need teams of warriors to inform him of this.”","Great hope rose in their hearts.","But at this moment, news came.","“The Nine Mountains Region has been surrounded.”","“We can’t get out at all. The place is sealed up.”","“An alliance sent out a message that the people of the top three mountains should gather on the first mountain. The people of the middle three mountains should gather on the fourth mountain. And the people of the last three mountains should gather on the seventh mountain.”","When the news came out, many people moved.","“Hurry up and assemble. As long as the Human Clan unites, there’s still a trace of hope.”","The first mountain, the fourth mountain, and the seventh mountain became the assembly points.","However, the Bone Spirit Troops still circled around them and had not taken action.","More forces gathered in the seventh mountain.","They began to move forward, not taking action. There were three thousand silver Bone Spirits, every single of them possessing a world-destroying strength.","The three thousand silver Bone Spirits took action and killed many people.","The people of the seventh mountain panicked.","“I can’t stop them at all.”","“Fiends! They are fiends!”","“Run! Let’s go to the fourth mountain.”","This group of people left for the fourth mountain. Unexpectedly, the Bone Spirit Troops didn’t take action when they were leaving.","The people of the fourth mountain had collected the forces of six mountains.","There were so many of them.","The number of the silver Bone Spirit was already tens of thousands.","Boom!","The war began.","It was a complete suppression. No one could hurt the silver Bone Spirits.","“They’ve surpassed the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage.”","“Good heavens!”","Countless Grand Masters were in despair.","“They haven’t made a move.”","“Go to the first mountain quickly.”","Tens of thousands of clans were driven to the first mountain.","Moreover, there were many Bone Spirits in the first mountain and the void of the universe nearby.","The group made their way to Grand Master Tongtian’s Holy Land.","“Grand Master Tongtian has lived for 50,000 years, so he must have powerful trump cards. Can he cross the void? We need the help of Han Yang Immortal.”","“We need to send someone out and wait for Han Yang Immortal to come. It’s our only way out.”","Many of them looked up at the sky. The passage was still there, and they were silent.","“How to visit him? We have used the ancestral ceremony. Will he help us?”","“He will.”","“This is a big event for the Human Clan. Han Yang Immortal is not a murderous person.”","“He will understand. Moreover, Grand Master Tongtian deceived us. Now that Grand Master Tongtian is dead, Han Yang Immortal has avenged his people.”","“Is there any way?”","Many Grand Masters were discussing.","At this time, the Bone Spirit Troops had arrived outside the Tongtian Holy Land.","They covered the entire void, and the people couldn’t even see starlight in the distance. They could only see an endless amount of dried bones.","“It’s too late to think of a solution.”","“We must resist.”","Under the desperate gazes of countless people, the troops of the withered bones stopped pressing forward and levitated in place, motionless.","Buzz!","Each skeleton suddenly threw their heads back and roared. Although they couldn’t make a sound, a faint fluorescent light appeared in their eyes.","The light illuminated the starry sky.","“What’s going on?”","“Will they go to the higher world through the passage?” Some people doubted it.","Under the gaze of countless eyes, within the troops of the skeletons, a man wearing armor and wielding a Bone Sword appeared. His eyes glowed with a bright red light.","Step by step, he crossed the void and descended here.","His long white hair and the cloak fluttered together.","Zhang Han came!","He looked ahead and said in a low and hoarse voice, “Everyone from the Mingyu Holy Land, the Red Feather Island, and the Highest Clouds Palace, leave.”","Boom!","Hearing the voice, everyone was stunned.","“Han Yang Immortal!”","A Grand Master of the Holy Land cried out involuntarily, “It’s Han Yang Immortal.”","“He’s the leader of these bones!”"]},{"number":1727,"title":"Chapter 1727 Returning to the Original State","paragraphs":["Chapter 1727 Returning to the Original State","“Han Yang Immortal! How could it be you? Are you going to destroy the Human Clan?”","“Han Yang Immortal, you are also from the Human Clan. How could you do this?”","“Even if we’ve asked the ancestors for help, we were in a passive position. What right do you have to slaughter the entire Human Clan?”","“All of this was done by Patriarch Tongtian, who is already dead, and the Tongtian Holy Land is still around. We, we can destroy the Holy Land together. Stop quickly. This is their fault. What does it have to do with us?”","“As a member of the Human Clan, Han Yang Immortal, you shouldn’t have done this. First of all, you have no reason to launch a large-scale attack against your clansmen. Can the destruction of the Human Clan save your lover?” A Grand Master sighed deeply and said, “You should lead the people of the Cultivation World to the world of immortals. We are all willing to let you be the Sect Leader and lead us. You should’ve been kind instead of starting a massacre. We are all members of the Human Clan!”","Many Grand Masters began to persuade Zhang Han.","Some of them spoke in low voices, some were agitated, and there were even a small number of people criticizing Zhang Han. Of course, most of them were pleading.","“Please, Han Yang Immortal, stop. Too many people have died. Can you leave some from the Cultivation World alive?”","However, in the face of all the voices, Zhang Han did not move at all.","The only things that could be seen in his eyes were bone-piercing coldness and killing intent.","“The three sects will leave within three breaths of time.”","Swoosh!","There were nearly a million people including the ones from the Mingyu Holy Land, the ones from the Red Feather Island under Immortal Master Lingxi’s command, and the people who once worked for the Highest Clouds Palace. They flew toward Zhang Han in a panic.","The Bone Spirit Troops made way for them, but they hadn’t left yet.","While some people even hesitated and were about to leave, three breaths of time passed.","Zhang Han suddenly waved the Bone Sword in his right hand and stabbed forward as his indifferent voice echoed through the sky.","“I represent death!”","Swoosh!","At the same time, all the dead bones’ eyes were shining with red light. From all directions, the dense dead bones moved.","It was like a tsunami crashing into a small island.","The people couldn’t resist at all.","The gap between them and the Bone Spirit Troops was too great.","“Oh, my god!”","Not far from Zhang Han, the Dao Seeking Cultivators of the three sects were watching this scene with their mouths agape.","“They’re all dead, all dead.”","They finally understood why the Bone Spirit Troops would be so large in number.","Because a few seconds later, the bodies of the fallen Dao Seeking Cultivators below withered and turned into dried bones.","The Bone Spirit Troops massacred and devoured like mad.","In the short span of an hour, everyone from the Nine Mountains Region, except for the ones from the three sects, had died.","“Hiss!”","Countless people gasped.","They felt as if they had fallen into an ice cave, their bodies shivering.","Their scalps tingled when they saw this.","They were shocked at this unprecedented massacre.","No one dared to say anything.","They were very glad that Grand Master Mingyu, Grand Master Lingxi, and Han Yang Immortal knew each other. Otherwise, they would have become dead bones without souls.","Zhang Han slowly raised his head.","He glanced at the circular passageway in the sky.","That was the place where Wo Lun and the others descended, as well as the place where Zhang Han’s calamity began.","Buzz!","The Bone Sword stabbed through the air.","Invisible ripples shattered the passageway.","Gradually, the sky returned to calm.","Under the gaze of the people from the three sects-","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The endless bones kept gathering together. With a flash of white light, they turned into a big ship full of skulls. Zhang Han stood at the bow of the ship.","Boom!","He broke through the void and left.","When he came here, he had endless dried bones with him.","After he left, the Star Sea only had a million people left.","“Han Yang Immortal. He... Alas, it’s all because of the ancestral ceremony.”","Some people from the three sects sighed with emotion.","“The Cultivation World has been reduced to its primitive state. The entire Star Sea has been destroyed.”","“What, what should we do?”","“Let’s go to the Galaxy, the Silver Dragon Galaxy. Immortal Master Mingyu, Immortal Master Lingxi, and Immortal Master Waterheaven are all there. Let’s wait for them in the Galaxy.”","“Yes. Let’s go to the Silver Dragon Galaxy. The current Star Sea is no longer the same as before.”","Not to mention that the Space Shooting Planets were gone, all the planets had turned into swamps. Mists filled the air, and only a few newborn bones could be seen from time to time.","This was a follow-up transformation, as well as the reason why Bone Spirits liked to destroy the world. As long as there was a withered bone, the Bone Spirit King wouldn’t die.","With this batch of million cultivators and the remaining forces of the Star Sea going to the Silver Dragon Galaxy, it was conceivable that the Silver Dragon Galaxy in the future would replace the Center Galaxy and become a brand new force in the Cultivation World.","But it would take more than a million years to return to the Star Sea on a large scale.","“Han Yang Immortal alone has brought the Cultivation World back to its original state.”","“If we didn’t see it with our own eyes, no one would believe it. It’s too terrifying.”","“...”","Zhang Han had no interest in other people’s thoughts.","At this time, he was like an emotionless machine, extremely indifferent to strangers.","Boom!","The Bone Spirit Ship broke through the void and returned to Earth in just a few hours.","Earth was sealed, but Zhang Han could come and go freely.","After he ran his power a bit, his right hand trembled slightly.","Swoosh!","With a flash, he arrived at the Hidden Dragon Village.","This was the place where he and Mengmeng had their little secrets.","He hid in the darkness under the shade of a tree in the distance.","The figure he loved was no longer as lively as before.","He saw Mengmeng, who was sitting in the pavilion in a daze.","Her father’s letter rang in her mind again.","“Mengmeng, I’m going out this time to look for a chance to save your mum. I don’t know how many years it will take for me to come back. I also want to take you with me, but I can’t. You must stay well and wait for me to come back...”","Mengmeng felt a sharp pain in her heart.","“No!” she cried out in pain.","Tears streamed down her face. She collapsed to the ground and cried, “Dad, don’t go.”","After crying for a long time, she walked to the edge of the pavilion.","She held an envelope in her hand and said in a sad voice, “Dad, you promised me that you would listen to whatever I say. As long as I put my wish in the box, it will come true. Boohoo, I won’t let you go...”","She put the letter in the stone box and cried her heart out.","Mengmeng didn’t expect that her Inner Demon Tribulation would come true in such a way.","In the dark, Zhang Han slowly took off his helmet. His face was full of vicissitudes, and his eyes were red. He clenched his fists and really wanted to hug her.","But he didn’t dare.","“My trip this time is full of dangers. I can’t take you with me. I don’t dare to.”","Zhang Han murmured as if he was talking to himself.","He turned around and waited for three seconds.","He lowered his head, and a teardrop fell from his cheek. The teardrop was crystal clear, falling on the tip of the grass and scattering.","At the same time, Zhang Han slowly disappeared.","He came to the Boundless Sea. As he stretched out his right hand, the Dark Mask lying on the ground of the ancient martial arts world crossed the void and floated in his palm.","He slowly floated toward the Bone Spirit Ship.","It was just like the scene when Zi Yan was flying back then.","He slowly landed on the bow of the ship, held the helmet in his right hand, and put it on.","Swoosh!","Wisps of red light floated out of his eyes.","It was the color of a Demonic Ghost, merciless and cold.","Creak! Creak!","The Bone Spirit Ship flew into the sky.","Zhang Han held the sword in his right hand and cut through the sky. The space was destroyed, and the Bone Spirit Ship rushed in.","This was the way to the real universe.","When the Bone Spirit Ship entered the passage and disappeared, Zhang Han said in a low voice, “All I can see is darkness.”","When the voice dissipated, the passage also slowly dissipated.","“Alas!”","The light ball of Sir’s Mind appeared for a few seconds. He looked up at the sky and sighed deeply.","...","When Zhang Han left the passage, he appeared in the void of the universe.","Without the rules of the Cultivation World, the space here was extremely stable, and countless stars and nebula could be seen around it.","The real universe was incomparably vast and boundless.","Zhang Han looked back.","There was no trace of the Cultivation World at all.","But he could feel it.","In the void of the universe, there was a green lamp with a crimson flame burning on it.","That Earth. The flame was guiding him home.","The green lamp was filled with an ancient aura while the flame flickered.","“The road...”","Zhang Han stared at it for a few seconds and then suddenly turned around.","The Bone Spirit Ship left.","It began its journey in the real universe.","Zhang Han sensed that there were seven dots of light within the Moon Spirit Pearl in his heart, each of which was of different color.","He found the ones he cared for and took out a drop of blood essence at the same time, which was his last hope.","“The first one is not far away.”","Zhang Han felt that the red light spot was not far away.","The Bone Spirit Ship was hidden in the void, flying quickly.","At the same time, countless Bone Spirits were fusing with each other.","Gradually, more and more silver Bone Spirits reached the Zone Lord Realm.","They merged with each other. Suddenly, a blue Bone Spirit appeared in front of Zhang Han.","It was in the Kingdom Lord Realm.","There were also hundreds of billions of silver Bone Spirits in the Zone Lord Realm.","“I will give you a new life.”","Zhang Han abruptly crushed the Dark Mask and poured the energy into the blue Bone Spirit.","“My host.”","The Bone Spirit’s eyes emitted a faint light as he had gained intelligence.","The Dark Mask was the new life of Ye Longyuan and the Demonic Ghost King Clown.","He was conscious, but he understood his mission.","“From now on, your name is Night Demon.”","“Yes, host.”","The entire Star Sea had turned into the Bone Spirit Troops, which now had a blue Bone Spirit in the Kingdom Lord Realm, and Zhang Han’s cultivation level had also reached the Middle Stage of the High King Realm.","Soon, he came to a planet.","He saw spaceships of all shapes and sizes. They were all made of metal, sharp and heavy.","The Bone Spirit Troops quietly landed on the planet.","Zhang Han kept absorbing the knowledge and information of this planet.","“Is this the border area of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire?”","Zhang Han raised his right hand slightly and pointed the sword at the planet.","Swoosh!","Hundreds of billions of Bone Spirits broke out in all parts of the planet.","They destroyed this place at lightning speed.","The first star of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire had turned into a swamp.","Buzz!","The Bone Spirit Ship gathered again.","On this planet, there were hundreds of billions of people, and there was only one in the Zone Lord Realm. However, more than 70% of them had the cultivation level around the Tribulation Stage.","The Blood Dragon Mountain Empire was indeed a little famous among the Northern Three Galaxys. It had a vast territory and a history of five million years.","The gap between the Northern Three Galaxys and the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire was like the gap between the Nine Mountains Region and one Holy Land.","The Northern Three Galaxys were incomparably large, and there were many forces that were even more formidable than the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire.","But none of this mattered.","Zhang Han went straight to the red dot inside the Moon Spirit Pearl.","All the planets where the Bone Spirit Troops passed were devoured.","Five thousand planets in total were devoured.","The Bone Spirit Troops had a total of eight trillion Zone Lords.","Along the way, the Bone Spirits crazily merged together.","Kingdom Lord Realm masters were born one after another.","When the number of Zone Lord Realm Bone Spirits decreased to 80 billion, Zhang Han already had 10,000 blue Bone Spirits.","Night Demon, on the other hand, was entirely dark blue and not far from becoming a High King.","Zhang Han had also reached the Last Stage of the High King Realm."]},{"number":1728,"title":"Chapter 1728 The Destruction of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire","paragraphs":["Chapter 1728 The Destruction of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire","On Saint Waluo Planet, the Hong Feng Clan was named after its patriarch.","Hong Feng was at the third level of the Kingdom Lord Realm. The clan was the strongest family on the Saint Waluo Planet.","This planet was dominated by the Hong Feng Clan. It had been like this for 500,000 years. Although it was in the territory of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire, this planet was independent.","There were also many forces like the Hong Feng Clan. The entire Blood Dragon Mountain Empire was very large. About ten percent of the planets did not belong to them.","Just like the situation in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, Vast Heaven Star was a place of the Four Great Sects, while the other sects were subsidiary sects.","“Hong Yue, Hong Yue!”","A fat boy in his teens ran over and shouted to a beautiful woman who was reading a book, “Today is a family event. We young people have to have an aptitude test. Why are you still reading?”","The woman raised her head. “It won’t start until a quarter-past noon. What’s the rush?”","“We should hurry up and go. Many people from other families are here. You are the most powerful among the younger generation of our Hong Feng Clan. You are now a second-tier Zone Lord. I just heard from Uncle that many young masters from rich and powerful families want to marry you.”","“I’m only 18 years old. Why should I get married?”","Hong Yue glared at him, and she couldn’t continue reading. She got up and walked to the venue of the family gathering with the fat boy.","The venue was in the central square of the family, which was the place where the annual family meeting had been held over the years.","“Sister Hong Yue, when you reach the fifth tier of the Zone Lord Realm, you can go out and train by yourself. Can you take me with you then?” the chubby boy said with a smile.","“Let’s talk about it when you reach the Zone Lord Realm,” Hong Yue said.","“This time, our clan’s Hong Jieguang has also reached the Zone Lord Realm. He wants to challenge you.” The chubby boy was filled with righteous indignation as he said, “Crush him, Sister Hong Yue.”","“Humph, he’s no match for me.”","Hong Yue let out a cold harrumph, her expression incomparably proud.","She was not only the talented woman of the Hong Feng Clan, but also the strongest talent on Saint Waluo Planet in the past ten thousand years.","She was very proud.","“It won’t be long before I can experience the starry sky alone, and the improvement of my cultivation level will be faster. Hong Jieguang will be even more inferior to me.","“From now on, I, Hong Yue, will also become a big shot like an Empress!","“Even if I can’t be a Great Emperor, I’ll be a Emperor-to-be!","“If I can’t be a Emperor-to-be, a Heavenly Master will do.","“It’s difficult to become a Heavenly Master. The king of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire is a Heavenly Master. Maybe I’ll be a High King.”","Hong Yue’s eyes flickered.","“No! I will be a Great Emperor in the future!”","She had dreams.","“Great. I’ll get to see Hong Jieguang being beaten later.”","The chubby boy was cheering, and his voice was long and drawn out. However, Hong Yue suddenly stopped and pulled him behind her.","“What are you doing?” The fat boy was puzzled.","He looked forward.","“What?!”","He was so scared that he fell to the ground.","In front of him was a man in black armor.","The armor exuded an ice-cold aura. On the armor, there were countless skulls, which were partly hidden and partly visible. It seemed that there was a terrifying being hidden within the armor.","The eyes on the helmet were shining with a bloodthirsty red light.","“What’s that?”","The fat boy was stunned. He had never seen such a scene before.","“Who are you?!”","Hong Yue was extremely nervous. She was half squatting while a weapon appeared in her right hand.","The other party didn’t say anything. He stretched out his right arm and raised his palm slightly.","Hong Yue’s weapon dissipated.","Moreover, her whole body floated upward. After she flew for more than ten meters, the two of them were very close to each other and suddenly disappeared into thin air.","“No!”","The fat boy burst into tears and ran to the venue.","“Sister Hong Yue has been taken away. Don’t let the monster take her away.”","He shouted.","His cry even aroused Patriarch Hong Feng’s attention.","“What happened?","“A man in skull armor? Humph! No matter which force he belongs to, find him! Lock down the space station and search the entire Saint Waluo Planet! Find him!”","However, he was destined to fail.","“Who, who, who are you?”","Zhang Han took Hong Yue to the Bone Spirit Ship in the void.","She could see that there were many blue bones around, and the person in front of her was wearing armor and a black cloak. “Who is he? How powerful is he? Why did he bring me here? Is he a devil?”","A series of question marks sounded in Hong Yue’s mind.","At this moment, she was extremely scared.","“Are you going to kill me? Are you going to eat me? I, I...” She suddenly looked at her flat chest and said, “Do you have any ill intentions? Tell me, but I will never yield to you.”","Zhang Han looked ahead and said nothing.","The Bone Spirit Ship was rapidly flying.","“Boo-hoo.”","Hong Yue cried as if she had been wronged. “How could I have been taken away by you? My family must be very anxious. Can you let me go? My flesh doesn’t taste good. I, I will be a Great Emperor in the future. You can’t ruin my dream.”","However, Zhang Han remained silent.","Hong Yue cried until she was exhausted, but it still didn’t work. She blinked her eyes and looked around.","“Damn!","“These blue bones look scary, so terrifying.”","But the horror had yet to come.","After flying for a few hours, they arrived at the next planet.","Zhang Han raised his right hand slightly and took her to a restaurant on the continent.","The dishes that some customers had just booked were served, and even the customers were downstairs. However, Zhang Han and Hong Yue were sitting there.","“Who are you? When did you arrive? I’m sorry, someone has already booked this table.”","The waiter came to talk to them.","Boom!","After the waiter said those words, the entire sky grew dim.","Countless dried bones flew down from the sky.","“What is that?”","“Ah!”","Miserable screams spread throughout the world.","Hong Yue stared blankly at the scene outside the window. The buildings on both sides of the street collapsed at a speed visible to the naked eye. Dust filled the air. Many people had died. They had been turned into dried bones and attacked others. This was a scene of destruction.","She froze on the spot for just an hour.","Everyone in the restaurant she was in was slaughtered.","What remained was the delicious food on the table in front of her.","But how could she eat it?","“Devil! Devil! You’re a devil!”","Hong Yue was frightened. She screamed and fainted.","When she woke up, she was already on the Bone Spirit Ship.","There were also many river-like skeletons gathered on the surface of the ship.","The fleets of the entire planet surrounded the planet, and all kinds of super main cannons were activated.","Boom!","The planet was destroyed, and powerful fluctuations spread out. Just as the fluctuations were about to spread, Hong Yue saw that the armored man raised the sword hanging from his waist and absorbed the endless fluctuations.","A planet was quietly destroyed.","“Hiss!”","Hong Yue gasped. She felt dizzy and fainted again.","When she woke up again, she was already in another restaurant on the next planet.","Outside the window, it was still a world-destroying scene, and there was still delicious food on the table.","“What is he going to do?”","Hong Yue’s face was pale. She was extremely scared.","“What are these dried bones?” She had never heard of such a thing before.","“Why did you catch me? Can you send me back? I beg you...”","Hong Yue pleaded.","It didn’t help.","She didn’t eat the second meal, and she couldn’t eat it at all, even though she was very hungry.","Once again, she saw another planet destroyed.","This time, she did not pass out.","There were more and more blue bones in the surroundings.","This went on on the third planet, the fourth planet, the fifth planet, and more.","When they arrived on the 350th planet, Hong Yue was already numb. Her mind suffered a great blow as she felt a bit stupefied and a bit confused.","Looking at the delicious food on the table, she quickly picked up her cutlery.","She ate half of the dishes fast.","In this way, she saw with her own eyes that a catastrophe against the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire began.","The Bone Spirit Ship was a hundred times larger than before, and there were too many of the Bone Spirits.","The number of silver Zone Lord Realm Bone Spirits had reached 50 billion, while the number of blue Kingdom Lords had reached 50 million. And Zhang Han’s cultivation level had also reached the Peak Stage of the High King Realm.","The assimilation continued, and the fusion continued rapidly.","The Bone Spirit Troops marched deeper into the outer area of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire. In terms of scale, the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire was a hundred times smaller than other similar forces. This was because it lacked foundation. Similarly, it also saved Zhang Han a lot of trouble.","This went on for eight months.","The Bone Spirit Troops were near the imperial city of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire.","It had 376 planets.","At this time, Zhang Han had become a Heavenly Master in the Early Stage. He had seven trillion silver Zone Lord Realm Bone Spirits, one trillion Kingdom Lord Realm blue Bone Spirits, one trillion High King Realm golden Bone Spirits, and one Night Demon.","The Bone Spirits were mad, which was the reason why the Great Emperors could only chase them away.","In the past, the Bone Spirit King didn’t have much intelligence. It only knew how to kill people. But now, Zhang Han was the king of the Bone Spirits who could destroy all planets. Even though the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire had detected something unusual, they hadn’t thought about it in this way.","“What the hell is going on? Did the planets really disappear?”","“Is someone targeting our Blood Dragon Mountain Empire?”","“My time is up. Which enemy is it?”","The king of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire was holding a meeting.","“Bad news, Your Majesty. It’s the Bone Spirits! The Bone Spirits are here!”","“What?!”","The king’s eyes widened and his face turned pale with fright.","“Hurry up and inform the others.”","“We can’t. We’re surrounded.”","“...”","Standing on the Bone Spirit Ship, Hong Yue was wearing red clothes and had a calm face.","When she saw one thing happening too many times, she got used to it. She was a little indifferent.","Planets were destroyed one after another. Zhang Han left no one alive. Only large bones remained.","She didn’t even know what fear was.","“These bones are devils. He specializes in destroying the world, but why didn’t he kill me? That’s quite strange.”","“I, the King of Blood Dragon Mountain Empire, will lead the army to fight against the Bone Spirits!”","Before the battle began, the king spoke domineeringly.","The subordinate beside him said with a pale face, “Your Majesty, we have detected the strength of the Bone Spirit Troops. There are more than six thousand trillion Zone Lords, ten trillion Kingdom Lords, one High King, and an unknown Bone Spirit King in armor.”","“H-how many?” The king was stunned.","The Zone Lord Realm didn’t sound very powerful. However, a Star Area could only produce about a hundred Zone Lords in a hundred years. It took their empire many years to cultivate a large group of powerful subordinates.","And what about the other party? They had thousands of trillions of Zone Lords.","“I’m doomed!”","The king couldn’t even make a pre-war declaration.","Soon after, the Bone Spirit Troops descended.","Zhang Han was in the front, followed by the girl in red.","He slowly pulled out the Bone Sword with his right hand and said indifferently, “Do you still remember... Prince Wo Lun of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire?”","“Wo Lun? He was sent to the border by me? Bone Spirit King, why are you...” The king’s posture was very humble as if he wanted to beg.","“Because of him!”","Zhang Han said in a hoarse voice, “My beloved left me.”","“Every debt has its debtor. I can kill Wo Lun,” the king immediately said.","“No!’","Under everyone’s gaze, the armored man suddenly raised the Bone Sword in his hand. His cold voice made people tremble.","“None of you can be forgiven!”","Swoosh!","Countless Bone Spirits poured out.","“He, he’s a human. He spoke. His beloved?”","A series of questions came to Hong Yue’s mind.","She witnessed all this.","The king of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire was stabbed to death by the armored man and turned into a golden skeleton.","The others had all died.","All of them turned into dried bones. The number increased greatly.","Hong Yue also saw the destruction of all the planets.","“The Blood Dragon Mountain Empire is gone. Only... the Saint Waluo Planet is left?”","The Blood Dragon Mountain Empire had turned into a vacuum, leaving only a lonely star.","“Could it be that it’s because I’m from on that planet that it’s able to avoid destruction?”","Hong Yue was suddenly stunned. She was in a daze.","Suddenly, she felt a little proud.","“Because of me, all the people on my planet get to survive!”"]},{"number":1729,"title":"Chapter 1729 - 1728 Luring the Enemies Away","paragraphs":["Chapter 1728 Luring the Enemies Away","As they set off again, Hong Yue couldn’t help but ask, “Um, Great Devil, you know how to speak. Why are you ignoring me?”","At this time, the golden Night Demon turned his head and said, “My host doesn’t want to talk nonsense. If you need anything, just come to me.”","“You, you, you can speak too?” Hong Yue was stunned.","Taking a closer look, she found that this withered golden skeleton was different. His eye sockets were not red but had a faint black light. Moreover, this light was like an eye, which appeared quite clever.","The eye sockets of the other 15 golden skeletons were blood-red.","This battle caused the number of Bone Spirits to soar. It could be said that the core of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire was of high quality. The number of silver Zone Lords had reached 89 trillion. The number of Kingdom Lord Realm blue Bone Spirits had reached 5 trillion. And there were 16 High King Realm golden Bone Spirits.","On the way, the fusion began quickly.","As for Zhang Han, since he reached the Heavenly Master Realm, his speed of cultivation slowed down. There was no doubt that this required a lot of help.","However, when the Bone Spirits appeared in the past, they were basically discovered at the beginning of the slaughter. No one had ever done such a thing as killing the people of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire quietly.","“What happened?”","Many trade teams and forces in the Galaxies were stunned.","“Where is the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire?”","“Where are the planets?”","“Have they encountered a Space Storm? No, no. It’s impossible for all the planets to disappear.”","“There is only one planet left, the Saint Waluo Planet.”","“What happened?”","The disappearance of the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire had become the hottest topic in the Galaxies. It was also an unsolved mystery of the world.","Many experts had studied it and found that it might be caused by a giant black hole, a folding space, or an earthquake in the void that had shattered the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire. There was no reasonable explanation.","The truth was often in the hands of a few people.","For example, only Hong Yue knew that the person in armor was the one who made the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire disappear.","“It’s time to move on.”","Zhang Han carefully sensed the Moon Spirit Pearl.","The nearest one was a small black dot.","He was closest to the small black dot among the seven-colored light spots, but it was quite far away.","This was a long journey.","The Bone Spirit Ship advanced through the void.","Wherever it passed, the planet would be devoured and blown up by the Bone Spirit Troops without any traces left.","In the universe, there were very few Great Emperors, but there was one in every space. For example, the Northern Three Galaxys had one.","Once the Bone Spirits were discovered, it would attract more than just a Great Emperor.","The starry sky was vast and boundless.","The Bone Spirit Ship was shockingly fast, but it spent a hundred years to cross the Northern Three Galaxys.","Within a hundred years, the Bone Spirit Ship had also changed a lot. Along the way, it devoured countless planets.","The Bone Spirit Troops grew stronger day by day.","There were five thousand trillion silver Zone Lords, three hundred trillion blue Kingdom Lords, and 376 golden High Kings. Night Demon’s color was deep. He was at the Last Stage of the High King Realm.","As for Zhang Han, he had advanced to the Heavenly Master Realm Middle Stage.","The size of the Bone Spirit Troops, as well as the army’s evolution, shocked Hong Yue.","She cultivated all the time. After being away from home for a hundred years, her cultivation level had reached the first tier of the Kingdom Lord Realm.","The reason was that every time Night Demon led the army to devour the planets, they would take some treasure vaults from the big sects.","They were not lacking in cultivation resources at all.","But Hong Yue also felt extremely lonely.","“I’m with demons.","“The Great Devil has killed countless people. He’s too cruel.","“I wonder if one day I’ll have a chance...”","Hong Yue stared at the back of Zhang Han with a strange look.","The idea in her mind was to launch a sneak attack and kill him, which would save the lives of countless people.","He was the enemy of the Human Clan, a complete demon.","Zhang Han didn’t care about what Hong Yue thought. He didn’t even say more than three sentences to her.","It had been a hundred years, and he hadn’t said much.","Only Night Demon was willing to chat with Hong Yue when she was alone to the point of madness.","“Don’t think too much.”","Night Demon leaned to one side. On his golden skeleton, there were two wisps of blackness floating in his eyes, which had a kind of breathtaking profound power.","He said, “My host has an immortal body. There are many Bone Spirits in the void along the way. As long as there is one, my host will be resurrected. Besides, with your current strength, you can’t even get close to him. For so many years, he has treated you well. I can only take many cultivation resources and cultivation methods with his consent. You should know what’s good for you.”","When Hong Yue heard these words, her expression froze.","It suddenly occurred to her that what Night Demon said was true.","Every time Zhang Han devoured a planet, he would take her to a restaurant for a meal.","Although he didn’t say much, he meant no harm to her. He even spared the lives of all the people on Saint Waluo Planet.","“Got it.”","After Hong Yue came to her senses, she said aggrievedly, “But, but he also killed too many people.”","Night Demon said softly, “By committing sins, one will know what pain is. You don’t understand.”","His words reminded Hong Yue of the time when they were in the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire.","“His beloved...”","Hong Yue stared at the back of the person sitting on the throne.","At this time, Zhang Han moved, raised his head slightly, and murmured in a hoarse and aged voice as if he was muttering to himself.","“I walk in the darkness, looking for my own light.”","What he said could barely be regarded as an explanation, which made Hong Yue confused.","Looking at the man on the throne with his long hair fluttering under the helmet, she thought to herself.","“The Bone Spirit King has a story. However, he is simply too murderous.”","She was a little conflicted.","But she also gave up the idea of becoming the savior.","She didn’t know that after Zhang Han lowered his head slightly, he looked at his hands with blood-red eyes.","“Sins?","“Maybe.”","The Bone Spirit Ship occasionally made a few dull sounds in the void.","After a hundred years, Hong Yue had gotten used to living on the Bone Spirit Ship.","On several occasions, when the troops went to devour planets, she wandered around the world of destruction and got some books and electronic products.","“This is the Wolf Tomb Galaxy.”","Hong Yue took the initiative to say, “It is said that in ancient times, a wolf king in the Great Emperor Realm died here, and the Galaxy was named after it. Now there are three Great Emperors in the Galaxy, respectively...”","As Zhang Han listened, he found that the second black dot was going deep into the sphere of influence of a Great Emperor.","“Black Tiger Great Emperor.”","The golden Bone Demon Night Spirit said, “This Great Emperor is very powerful. He ranks first in the Wolf Tomb Galaxy.”","“Go.”","Zhang Han waved his hand slightly.","Night Demon flew out alone to investigate the situation.","On the way, he became a young master with the aura of a Zone Lord and a graceful bearing.","Seeing this, Hong Yue was quite dumbfounded.","“This is really... a fake good-looking face.”","The Bone Spirit Ship floated in the void, silently waiting.","Day after day, Zhang Han occasionally sensed Night Demon’s movements.","At first, Night Demon went to the sect of the Black Tiger Great Emperor to work as a small servant. Because he was handsome and his strength improved rapidly, he was promoted to an outer-door disciple. When he reached the Kingdom Lord Realm, he was an inner-door disciple.","In just a short year, Night Demon finally saw his target. He lived in the Great Emperor’s manor.","The target’s name was Hei Yue, and she was the Great Emperor’s only daughter.","“Hiss!”","Night Demon couldn’t help but gasp the first time he met Hei Yue.","“It’s the Great Emperor’s daughter. This is tough.","“Host is at the Middle Stage of the Heavenly Master Realm, far inferior to the Great Emperor Realm.","“I’m afraid that it will take at least a thousand years for Host to capture Hei Yue. He will only be able to destroy this place after becoming an Emperor-to-be.","“There’s an even faster way.”","Night Demon gently stroked his handsome face. “Should I sacrifice myself and seduce her?”","Suddenly, Night Demon had an idea.","“I need to go to Host.”","He immediately left and sneaked back to the Bone Spirit Ship.","Zhang Han waved his right hand slightly.","On the Bone Spirit Ship, hundreds of Bone Spirit Squads flew away.","Each squad had a golden High King leading them. There were millions of Kingdom Lord Realm blue Bone Spirits and trillions of Zone Lord Realm silver Bone Spirits.","They all turned into streaks of light and flew into the distance.","Three years later.","“Not good!”","“Your Majesty, Bone Spirits have appeared at the border of the empire. More than 300 planets have been destroyed!”","Swoosh!","Black Tiger Great Emperor was having tea when he shot to his feet. His eyes were fierce. “What? Bone Spirits? Where did they come from?”","With that, he contacted the other two Great Emperors with a grave expression.","The appearance of Bone Spirits wasn’t a good thing. Even the Great Emperors had to be careful. Once the Bone Spirits showed up, they would immediately destroy the world.","Zhang Han was luring his enemies to leave their territories.","The three Great Emperors led the elite troops of the empire to the border to suppress the Bone Spirits in person.","The strength of the empire had decreased a lot, but there were still several Heavenly Masters in the center, but no Emperor-to-be.","Zhang Han was not afraid of these Heavenly Masters at all.","He flew into Black Tiger Great Emperor’s territory alone.","It didn’t alarm anyone.","Unfortunately, just as Princess Hei Yue was about to take a shower, the maids in the room all left.","When she was about to take off her clothes, she was startled.","“Who, who is it?”","She turned around and saw a scene that made her pupils shrink rapidly.","It was a man in armor with blood-red eyes and an oppressive yet terrifying aura.","“How dare he come here?”","“Who are you?”","Before Hei Yue continued, she was controlled by Zhang Han, and their figures slowly disappeared.","Moments later, the empire’s alarm rang, and countless squads flew about in disorder.","“The Princess is missing.”","In the beginning, the Heavenly Masters did not feel anything.","“Is she hiding somewhere again?”","“Is she trying to sneak out to have fun?”","“She can’t run out. The empire is surrounded by layers of guards. She’s probably only near the imperial palace.”","After searching around and failing to find Hei Yue, the several Heavenly Masters started to panic.","At this moment, Zhang Han had already brought Hei Yue, who was wearing a bathrobe, to the Bone Spirit Ship.","“You!”","Hei Yue finally realized something. Her face was pale as she stammered, “You, you are Bone Spirit King.”","However, Hong Yue had a strange look on her face.","“Hey? Do I have a companion now? Nice to meet you.”","Hong Yue took the initiative to say, “My name is Hong Yue. I was captured by the Bone Spirit King more than a hundred years ago. Well, he is very bloodthirsty. He has already slaughtered tens of thousands of planets. Don’t quarrel any more. Be careful, or the Bone Spirit King will eat you.”","“Hiss!”","Hei Yue’s eyes were wide open, and her mouth was agape. She wanted to say something, but she didn’t dare to say anything."]},{"number":1730,"title":"Chapter 1730 Advancing All the Way","paragraphs":["Chapter 1730 Advancing All the Way","“You’re called Hei Yue, right?”","Hong Yue smiled when she saw that the other party was dumbfounded.","At this moment, the Bone Spirit Ship was already on its way, rushing into the distance.","“Come on. Take a seat here.”","Hong Yue patted the sofa next to her.","Hei Yue subconsciously walked over and sat down obediently after seeing that she had a human companion.","Unlike Hong Yue, she was well aware of how terrifying the Bone Spirits were.","There were even many people who had never heard of the Bone Spirits. However, she knew that every time the Bone Spirits came into the world, it represented a catastrophe that could easily destroy the entire Galaxy.","In history, more than a hundred Galaxies had been swallowed up by Bone Spirits. It was the time when the greatest Emperors in history took action. A total of 360 Great Emperors gathered together to suppress Bone Spirit King and keep him out of the Human Clan’s territory.","“We both have the word ‘Yue’ in our names,” Hong Yue said with great interest.","“Uh, what a coincidence.”","Hei Yue was also curious about Hong Yue’s presence.","“Why didn’t the Bone Spirits kill her?”","Hong Yue seemed to have seen through her doubts and said, “When I was on the Saint Waluo Planet, I was the most powerful genius of the Hong Feng Clan. I was captured because of my reputation. That’s why the Saint Waluo Planet was able to survive. You don’t know that the entire Blood Dragon Mountain Empire has been devoured by him.”","Hiss!","Hei Yue gasped.","“An empire was devoured, but no one found out about it? Who the hell?","“Was there no Great Emperor there?”","Only after listening to Hong Yue’s narration did Hei Yue realize that it wasn’t that there wasn’t a Great Emperor present, but that this Bone Spirit King was simply too cunning.","“It is known that King Bone Spirit collects a large number of dark souls with an empty mind. All he knows how to do is slaughter people. Why is this man a King Bone Spirit who has ideas and schemes?”","Hei Yue’s scalp was numb.","“He has lured his enemies away from their territories. Oh my god, is this also a trick that the Bone Spirit King can play?","“When a creature that is extremely difficult to deal with learns how to scheme, just how terrifying will it be?”","When she thought about it, she found it terrifying.","Hei Yue took a deep breath and looked at the back of Zhang Han.","“I am the daughter of Black Tiger Great Emperor. It’s useless for you to catch me. You will only attract my father’s attention. If you let me go, you may have a chance to live. As long as you let me go, I will ask my father not to hunt you down. What do you think?”","She even began to negotiate with Zhang Han.","“It’s useful.”","The golden Bone Spirit Night Demon suddenly turned into a disciple of the sect.","“WHAT?!”","Hei Yue was dumbfounded.","Night Demon said in a deep voice, “I’ve been lurking around for many years just to capture you. How could I possibly let you go?”","Buzz!","Hei Yue felt a bit dizzy.","She fainted.","“Bone Spirit King asked his subordinate to disguise himself for so many years just to catch me. It’s over. I’m doomed. They won’t let me go.”","Moments later, Hei Yue slowly woke up.","“Don’t worry, he won’t kill us. I’ve already fainted several times, and you’ll slowly get used to it,” Hong Yue said.","“I...”","Hei Yue’s eyes turned red. “I have never left the empire. How could you take me away?”","“Alas.” Hong Yue sighed and patted her on the shoulder.","They were in the same boat.","But it was useless. That man didn’t even say a word, let alone give an answer.","The Bone Spirit Ship quickly left the Wolf Tomb Galaxy.","It rushed to the next target.","When they arrived at the edge, Zhang Han raised his right hand.","Invisible energy sealed Hei Yue, and the Bone Spirit Ship was also wreathed in strange energy that shielded its aura and others’ senses.","The Bone Spirit Ship suddenly accelerated, made a turn, and left.","About a quarter of an hour later.","Boom!","A towering body wielding a broadsword appeared out of thin air where the Bone Spirit Ship had been.","“Where are they?”","It was the Black Tiger Great Emperor.","His Great Emperor’s aura was boundless. Just his aura alone was enough to shatter the surrounding space.","Gritting his teeth, he said, “Bone Spirits! Bone Spirits!","“I will definitely capture you!”","Boom!","He continued to move forward at an extremely fast speed, but he was heading in the wrong direction.","Therefore, Black Tiger Great Emperor retreated and kept trying in another direction.","The speed of the Great Emperor was extremely fast.","It took the Bone Spirit Ship fifty years to get rid of him.","In the past fifty years, the troops had not devoured any planets.","They kept moving further and further away, moving toward the next blue light spot.","After Zhang Han couldn’t feel the Black Tiger Great Emperor, he advanced for another ten years.","It was not until then that the Bone Spirit Ship began to devour the planets.","Planets were destroyed one after another.","Hei Yue looked at Zhang Han with eyes full of killing intent and hatred.","But Zhang Han didn’t care.","Hong Yue and Hei Yue were merely strangers who traveled with him for a short period.","Another 20 years had passed.","Many planets had disappeared.","The Bone Spirit Troops had been strengthened, which now had six thousand trillion Zone Lord Realm silver Bone Spirits, five hundred trillion blue Kingdom Lords, and three hundred five hundred golden High Kings.","Among them, Night Demon’s cultivation level was the highest, which was the Last Stage of the High King Realm.","As for Zhang Han, his cultivation level had also reached the Heavenly Master Realm Last Stage.","Over the years, Hei Yue had gradually grown numb.","She would chat with Hong Yue from time to time, or cultivate. She was full of energy, feeling that one day, she would be able to kill the Bone Spirit King.","On the Lisas Planet.","“This is a memorable day, a day full of happiness. Lan Yue and Jiang Qingyang are getting married. Let’s give our blessings to the newlyweds. Let’s welcome the couple!”","In a huge auditorium, it was very lively. Tens of thousands of people were attending the wedding.","This was the wedding ceremony held by the Lan Family and the strongest sect. The former was a top family. Jiang Qingyang was the son of the latter’s Sect Leader.","Jiang Qingyang’s father was a Heavenly Master in the Early Stage, and his prestige in the nearby area was extremely high.","It could not be said that the couple was well-matched in social status. There was a big gap between the Lan Family and the Jiang Family. However, Patriarch Jiang quite liked Lan Yue, an excellent woman. She was talented and beautiful and was a perfect match for Jiang Qingyang.","Under everyone’s gaze, the newlyweds slowly walked in.","“Jiang Qingyang, do you marry Lan Yue and take care of her for the rest of your life? Let her...”","“I do!” Jiang Qingyang said loudly.","“Lan Yue, do you...”","“I do!”","The high-position officials of the two families looked at the couple on the stage with a smile.","“Patriarch Jiang.”","“Hey? Why are you still calling me patriarch? Just call me Old Jiang.”","“Hahaha!”","The host said enthusiastically, “You can hug and kiss your bride now.”","Just as Jiang Qingyang walked over, he hugged Lan Yue, closed his eyes, and was about to kiss her.","However, he suddenly felt that the woman in his arms stepped back.","“What’s going on?”","Jiang Qingyang opened his eyes.","A man in armor was holding onto Lan Yue.","“What are you doing? Let go of me!” Lan Yue struggled.","“Lan Yue!”","Jiang Qingyang roared.","Patriarch Jiang was about to take action. As a Heavenly Master, he was very powerful.","However, he had never expected that the armored man’s aura would reach the Heavenly Master Realm Last Stage and suppress all the people present. No one could move at all.","In such a scene, the armored man said something in a hoarse voice under everyone’s gaze.","“I’ll let her come back after a thousand years.”","Swoosh!","Lan Yue was taken away by an unknown person.","Before they could fly far, their figures disappeared.","Many roars and angry voices rose one after another.","However, Zhang Han and Lan Yue appeared on the Bone Spirit Ship and marched forward.","“Let me go!”","Lan Yue kicked up a fuss. “I’m just married. What right do you have to detain me?","“Why don’t you kill me? I’d rather die than yield.","“Do it NOW! Let me go back!”","Lan Yue was anxious and wanted to run over and grab the cloak of the man on the throne.","However, Night Demon gently pushed her and she fell to the ground.","“Come here.”","Hei Yue shot her a glance.","Lan Yue glanced at her and said coldly, “Piss off.”","In fact, she was on the verge of a mental breakdown. It had not been easy for her to get married, but she had been taken away.","“We were also captured by him,” Hong Yue explained.","Lan Yue’s eyes trembled. She slowly walked over and burst into tears.","She cried for more than half a day.","“I just got married,” Lan Yue said with a grievance. “How long have you been detained?”","“Less than two hundred years,” Hong Yue said calmly. “Don’t worry. You’ll get used to it soon enough.”","“NO!” Lan Yue cried even louder. “What will happen to Qingyang?”","“There’s nothing you can do about it.” Hei Yue huffed. “Don’t cry. What’s the point of crying? I’m the daughter of the Black Tiger Great Emperor, and I’m just staying here obediently as well. Even my father can’t do anything about it. How can your husband save you?”","Clatter!","Lan Yue was stunned. “Even a Great Emperor can’t defeat him?”","“It’s not feasible. It’s just that he’s just too cunning,” Hei Yue said helplessly.","“And cruel.” Hong Yue added, “He’s inhuman, murderous, and has slaughtered countless people. There’s only darkness in his eyes. But he treats us well. At the very least, he won’t kill people on our planet for our sake. He also gives us cultivation resources and food.”","“Cruel?”","Soon, Lan Yue experienced it.","The three women were sitting in a restaurant.","Hong Yue gulped down the food, disregarding her image as a lady as Hei Yue ate in small bites.","As for Lan Yue, looking at the scene of destruction outside, she was already stunned. She then glanced at Zhang Han, who was sitting not far away, and finally understood how cruel he was that the other two women had mentioned.","Soon, the planets were swallowed up one by one. The more scenes Lan Yue saw, the more numb she became.","It was said that female was always making the drama. Hong Yue, Hei Yue, and Lan Yue were usually able to chat with each other. They stayed on the Bone Spirit Ship every day and even played cards sometimes.","They had no choice but to do so.","Another few decades passed.","The Bone Spirit Troops grew stronger day by day and continued to develop in secret. Aside from Black Tiger Great Emperor’s men, no other Great Emperors had detected anything.","On a planet.","“This time, our Bai Family will achieve success and fame. We will be isolated.”","The army of the Bai Family had gathered, and a large number of troops had appeared on the horizon. They were enemies.","“This time, the whole world is against us. We will not surrender. Even if we die, we will die standing.”","The patriarch of the Bai Family was furious.","The Bai Family became the enemy of the whole world a few years ago. When they got the supreme treasure, it was absorbed by Bai Yue and caused a series of enemies. In the end, among the more than 300 sects on the planet, nearly 300 joined forces to fight against the whole world.","They had no hope.","Their situation was very similar to that when Zhang Han dominated the Cultivation World.","Just as Bai Yue was about to put on her armor and fight, she was taken away.","“Bai Yue has been captured.”","Many people exclaimed. “Bai Yue is the hope of the Bai Family. How could she be taken away in front of so many people?”","“Who are you? Why are you taking me?”","Bai Yue sensed carefully that the man who took her away didn’t seem to be from any force.","“Let me go. Before I die in battle, you can catch me. I really can’t leave now.”","She sensed that the aura of the armored man beside her was very powerful.","But she had never expected that what happened next would be like this.","Swoosh!","Endless dried bones fell from the sky.","“Heavens, what is this?”","Except for the land where the army of the Bai Family stood and the green land, other places had become a swamp."]},{"number":1731,"title":"Chapter 1731 Great Emperor Purple Moon","paragraphs":["Chapter 1731 Great Emperor Purple Moon","Zhang Han was no longer afraid to have the traces of the Bone Spirits discovered.","His next target was still far away.","The Bone Spirit Ship set out again.","Hong Yue said, “Hey, a newcomer has arrived.”","Hei Yue and Lan Yue also welcomed Bai Yue.","“What’s your name?”","“Bai Yue.”","“It’s so strange. Our names all have the word ‘Yue’ in them. Does he have a fetish?”","“He’s not taking us as concubines, is he?”","Hong Yue shook her head repeatedly. “That’s impossible. I was the first one to get here, but he doesn’t talk to me much.”","Zhang Han directly captured them and placed them on the Bone Spirit Ship without paying any attention to them.","Thinking of this, Lan Yue felt that she was still very special. When he caught her, he said to others that said he would let her go a thousand years later.","A thousand years was a very long time for Lan Yue.","She wondered if Qingyang would have another woman.","The four women chattered together.","Along the way, Bai Yue also experienced what had happened to the others. She saw planets being destroyed one by one. At first, she was furious and murderous. In the end, she felt helpless and numb and returned to her ordinary life.","The women chatted, ate, cultivated, and improved their strength. Anyway, they were not short of resources.","Eighty years later, the Bone Spirit Troops had become incomparably large.","Zhang Han had reached the Peak Stage of the Heavenly Master Realm.","He had nine thousand trillion Zone Lord Realm silver Bone Spirits, three thousand trillion Kingdom Lord Realm blue Bone Spirits, and 1.3 billion High King Realm golden Bone Spirits.","Some Bone Spirits in the troops turned red. They were all Heavenly Masters. There were a total of 136 of them.","The leader was still Night Demon.","His strength had increased too quickly.","Originally, the four women all felt that their cultivation had progressed very quickly, and they often went into seclusion. However, when they saw these Bone Spirits, they were quite discouraged, and their cultivation became more and more difficult.","Night Demon said from the side, “My host, the front of us is the Sealess Dead Area, which is a forbidden area for the Human Clan. We can’t cross it. If we take a detour, it will take us another 50 years.”","Before Zhang Han could react, the Bone Spirit Ship had disappeared into the Dead Area.","The Sealess Dead Area was huge, and there were no living beings in it. The surface of every planet was rugged and uneven, and countless continents were floating in the starry sky.","It was said that a world-shaking battle had erupted in the Sealess Dead Area, and more than fifty Great Emperors had died there.","While flying, the Bone Spirit Ship suddenly burst into light and retreated.","Boom!","The entire Bone Spirit Ship was blown up.","In order to protect Hong Yue and the others, Zhang Han lost ten times more Bone Spirits than usual.","Swoosh!","The Bone Spirit Ship quickly left the Sealess Dead Area.","It obediently took a detour from the side.","Zhang Han’s mind became clear.","This Sealess Dead Area was indeed extraordinary. Furthermore, it was located in the outer regions. A single unknown attack had injured him.","He had lost half of the Bone Spirit Troops.","However, it was easy to make up for the losses during the decades of the detour, and he even gained more.","Zhang Han arrived at his destination.","Qing Yue was taken away.","“We have another newcomer.”","The four women greeted Qing Yue and chatted with each other.","“I have a request!”","Qing Yue seemed to have calmed down a lot. She walked to Zhang Han and said, “My biggest wish is to see my brother make a name for himself and become the most powerful person on this planet. He should achieve that in 30 years. Can you wait for 30 years?”","Zhang Han raised his right hand slightly.","“No need to wait.”","After saying that, Night Demon led tens of thousands of troops to fly to the surface of the continent.","They came back in two hours.","“It’s done.”","Night Demon said, “Only your Qing Family is left in the world. Your brother has become the No.1 on the planet, and your wish has been fulfilled.”","Rumble!","Qing Yue fell into a daze.","It wasn’t that her younger brother had become stronger, but that all the experts had died.","Was it because of her words that so many people were implicated?","Qing Yue was dumbfounded.","Hei Yue said, “Stop dwelling on it. You won’t be able to get off once you’re on the ship. You don’t need to blame yourself. The Bone Spirit King has killed countless people. The death of people on your planet has nothing to do with you.”","“That’s right. After all, the Bone Spirits did it,” said Lan Yue.","The ship set off again.","The news of the Bone Spirit Troops’ invasion continued to spread.","In the universe, the news of several super forces crossing the Galaxies was spread by some major forces.","They were on guard.","However, the universe was too vast. The speed at which the news spread was not as fast as that of the Bone Spirit Ship.","When Zhang Han found Huang Yue, she also had a story.","After her family was destroyed, she began her vengeance and had been holding back.","She didn’t know how many more years she would have to hold back. Her enemy was an expert at the Early Stage of the Heavenly Master Realm.","Zhang Han arrived.","When he was about to take her to leave, she panicked for a few seconds and said, “If you can avenge me, I’m willing to leave with you.”","Thus, the Bone Spirit Troops poured down without leaving a single creature alive.","On the Bone Spirit Ship, Huang Yue was the calmest.","She just sat there in a daze and didn’t say anything.","“There are six of us now. How many more does he want to catch?”","Hong Yue and the others talked to each other.","They didn’t know when this kind of life would end.","Hei Yue desperately hoped that her father, the Black Tiger Great Emperor, would come over, kill the Bone Spirit King, and save them.","But thinking about it, she found that the place she was at was very far away from her hometown.","“We will be saved if this matter can attract the attention of the top forces of the virtual space.” Hei Yue thought to herself.","One could use the helmet of the virtual world to achieve virtual space. It was a technological mechanical product. It could be used to travel across distant areas, achieve face-to-face communication, and even have the effect of sparring.","For example, in the Second World, the Star Map was extremely large, almost the same as it was now. The virtual helmets were divided into different grades.","The Black Tiger Great Emperor had a high-level helmet in the virtual space, but unfortunately, he once had a dispute with the high-position officials of the virtual space.","What Hei Yue didn’t know was that the Black Tiger Great Emperor had contacted someone from the virtual space not long after Hei Yue’s capture.","They also attached great importance to this matter. After a bit of investigation, they discovered that the Bone Spirits did it, which quite a bit of attention.","At this point, many regions had already taken precautions.","A few days after Huang Yue was taken away, several Great Emperors came to this planet.","“Could it be that the cunning Bone Spirit King is a mutated creature?”","They looked at the destroyed planet and said in a cold voice, “Whether it’s a mutation or not, we have to be cautious about this matter.”","“When the Bone Spirit King is cunning, intelligent, and mature, what kind of disaster will it be?”","“Every creature will be slaughtered.” One Great Emperor sighed. “However, the defensive nets have been set up in the various regions. It will be easy to find the Bone Spirits if they show up again. As long as we can lock them down, we can suppress the Bone Spirit King.”","“...”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The Bone Spirit Ship was flying in the void.","Zhang Han also sensed many detection devices.","He ignored that.","The Bone Spirits were constantly merging.","The energy fed back to Zhang Han was like a vast sea.","He had reached the Peak Stage of the Heavenly Master Realm.","And he was getting closer and closer to the Emperor-to-be Realm.","Similarly, the speed at which the Bone Spirits disappeared was extremely fast.","When Zhang Han was not far from the Emperor-to-be Realm, there were only five trillion Zone Lord Realm silver Bone Spirits, three hundred million Kingdom Lord Realm blue Bone Spirits, five million High King Realm golden Bone Spirits, and only three red Heavenly Masters.","“There’s only one left.”","Zhang Han sensed the remaining light spot in the Moon Spirit Pearl. It was light purple. However, it was the brightest.","Since Zhang Han stepped into the starry sky, he had slaughtered countless people along the way.","In the eyes of Hong Yue and the others, he was also a complete devil.","As for Zhang Han, occasionally, he would take a look at his hands.","He was full of sins, but he had no way back. Only by devouring the planets endlessly could he seize the opportunity.","This journey took him five hundred years.","Finally, he was about to reach his destination.","He had sensed that some large Star Areas had taken precautions.","It was unknown how many people were guarding and investigating day and night.","However, there was no trace of the Bone Spirits. They had only appeared five times in the past hundreds of years, but each time, it was a large-scale invasion, which caused great turbulence and made people panic.","“How can the Bone Spirits still find an opportunity when we’re on such tight guard?”","The high-position officials of many forces were powerless and angry.","“Why are the Bone Spirits different now? They ran away as soon as the battle was over and couldn’t be caught at all. How could they be suppressed?”","“They’re here! They’re here!”","“The Purple Moon Empire has sent a message saying that the Bone Spirits have appeared within their territory. Hurry up and provide support!”","This news alarmed many forces.","The Great Emperors of the nearby empires went to the Purple Moon Empire one by one.","Back a few months ago when Zhang Han set foot on the border of the Purple Moon Empire.","“The Purple Moon Empire. Could it be that the last person he wants to capture is Great Emperor Purple Moon?”","Hong Yue said in surprise, “I’ve heard of the reputation of Great Emperor Purple Moon even from so far away. She’s a very powerful empress.”","“That’s right.” Hei Yue nodded. “I’ve heard from my father that Great Emperor Purple Moon is the number one in the Great Emperor Realm in the Wood Fighting Galaxy. Her strength is terrifying. What’s even more terrifying is that Great Emperor Purple Moon... has a husband whose strength seems to have surpassed that of a Great Emperor. It’s just that a million years ago, he went to the Outer Domain Battlefield to suppress the Heavenly Demon, but he didn’t seem to have come back. That has caused countless speculations.”","“The Outer Domain Battlefield? What’s that?” Lan Yue asked curiously.","“Only people above the Emperor-to-be Realm know about it. It’s quite terrifying,” Hei Yue replied. “My father didn’t tell me in detail.”","Listening to their conversation, Zhang Han knew that the last person should be Great Emperor Purple Moon.","She was in the Great Emperor Realm.","As long as she was willing to take out a drop of blood essence, his mission would be over.","Zhang Han fixed his turbid eyes on the Moon God Mountain Star Area.","The Bone Spirit Ship was approaching.","He was now an Emperor-to-be. Although there was still a long way to go before he became a Great Emperor, he was not afraid. Zhang Han had integrated his six bodies. He was not the Bone Spirit King. The Bone Spirits were just his weapon.","In the Imperial Palace Star located in the center of the Moon God Mountain Star Area, a woman in a light blue dress was holding a three- or four-year-old child.","“Mothee.” The little boy’s eyes were clear, and he called out with a smile.","“It’s ‘mother’.” The woman smiled. “Say ‘mother’.”","“Mother!”","“You’re right this time.” The woman in the blue dress said with a smile, “What’s your name?”","“I don’t know.”","“Your name is Han Yi. Your father is Han Hao. Everyone calls him Demon Han.”","“Mm. Han Yi. Han Yi. Demon Han. Demon.”","The little boy was babbling, but the woman was quite gentle.","In the distance, several maids were discussing with a smile.","“The Emperor has prepared for a thousand years before he had the Crown Prince. When the Crown Prince was born, there was a super strange phenomenon. That scene was very grand. None of you saw it.”","“I wonder when Heaven-suppressing Emperor will come back.”","“I guess the Crown Prince has grown up by the time he comes back.”","Han Hao, also known as Heaven-suppressing Emperor, was the husband of Great Emperor Purple Moon.","While the maids were talking, Great Emperor Purple Moon suddenly raised her head and looked at the sky in the distance with a frown.","“Yi, go and have some milk first. I will be back soon.”","Purple Moon gestured to the maids.","They quickly rushed over and walked into the palace with the little boy in their arms.","Swoosh!","With a cold expression, Great Emperor Purple Moon appeared in the void of the universe outside in a flash.","When she looked at the Bone Spirit Ship slowly approaching in front of her, there was a trace of surprise and seriousness in her eyes."]},{"number":1732,"title":"Chapter 1732 Incorrect Behavior?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1732 Incorrect Behavior?","She had also heard about the Bone Spirits, but the other party was far away.","There must be a reason why the Bone Spirits appeared here.","She still had to observe what it was.","Great Emperor Purple Moon was confident that she could defeat even a Great Emperor like the Bone Spirit King.","Under the gaze of Great Emperor Purple Moon, the layer of light around the Bone Spirit Ship dissipated.","The people in it revealed their faces.","There were six women sitting on the sofa in the back.","A throne and Bone Spirit King were right in front of her.","“Good heavens!”","“Is that Great Emperor Purple Moon up ahead?”","“What a strong person of courage! How beautiful she is.”","When Hong Yue and the others saw this, they were shocked.","Under their gazes, Zhang Han slowly stood up. With a flash, he appeared in the void of the universe and looked at Great Emperor Purple Moon.","Purple Moon was the Taoist title his wife had used before.","“I want a drop of your blood essence.” Zhang Han said directly without any nonsense.","“What?”","Great Emperor Purple Moon frowned. “Bone Spirit King, are you negotiating with me?”","Zhang Han was silent for two seconds and replied, “Yes.”","“As an alien creature, how dare you negotiate with me?” Great Emperor Purple Moon said coldly. “Once any Bone Spirit appears, it will be suppressed.”","Although her expression was indifferent, she was a little confused.","When Bone Spirit Kings appeared in the past, they didn’t say much and directly launched attacks until they were suppressed. They had spiritual intelligence, but there was too much. It made the Bone Spirit Kings look like lunatics who would kill at all costs.","However, the person before her was very different.","“Do you want the Purple Moon Empire or your drop of blood essence?” Zhang Han asked in a low voice.","Great Emperor Purple Moon narrowed her eyes when hearing the hoarse voice. “Are you threatening me?”","“Yes!”","“Ha...” Great Emperor Purple Moon’s long hair fluttered in the wind, and her aura rose steadily. “Do you know our Purple Moon Empire has 35 billion planets? How many planets can you devour? When you appeared in front of me, you already had no way to escape.”","“Is that so?” Zhang Han questioned.","In a flash, he returned to the Bone Spirit Ship. The entire ship slowly dissipated in front of the Great Emperor Purple Moon.","“Hmm?”","Great Emperor Purple Moon narrowed her eyes.","What kind of ability was this?","Why did the Bone Spirit King have such strange spatial power?","She immediately sent a message.","The Bone Spirit King appeared in the Purple Moon Empire and was about to start a massacre.","She frowned after she returned to the Imperial Palace.","The next day, she heard a few pieces of news.","“The 13 planets of the Northern Cauldron have been invaded by some Bone Spirits.”","The fifth day came.","“Twenty-three planets in Mount Nanzhi have been invaded. None of the people survived.”","The tenth came.","“56 planets in the Dragon-breaking District have been invaded. None people survived.”","Hearing the news one after another, Great Emperor Purple Moon’s face darkened a little.","“How can it be so fast?”","The Emperor-to-be people all knew about the troops of the Bone Spirits. The Bone Spirit Troops could devour a planet at an average speed of three days. The Bone Spirits enjoyed turning the world into darkness and making more Bone Spirits.","This time, it was extraordinary. It was too fast!","Moreover, every time the other party appeared, the location was different.","“He’s threatening me!”","Great Emperor Purple Moon looked indifferent.","She was waiting for other Great Emperors to arrive.","Finally, half a year later, sixteen thousand planets had been devoured.","By this time, thirty-two Great Emperors had arrived.","The Purple Moon Empire was on high alert. It was too difficult for them to capture the movements of the troops of the Bone Spirits.","Every time they appeared, the news would be sent back. When some of the Great Emperors were about to arrive, the troops of the Bone Spirits would have long withdrawn.","“What happened?”","“Could it be that the Bone Spirit King has clear intelligence? That’s impossible. To become the Bone Spirit King, one must merge with tens of thousands of souls.","“But this time, the appearance of the Bone Spirit King is strange. His movements are strange. He has openly devoured all the way from the Northern Three Galaxies. What on earth is his purpose?”","“Fortunately, he stayed here. Let’s continue to seek help.”","Great Emperors descended upon the Purple Moon Empire one after another.","Five years later, the number of the Great Emperors exceeded two hundred.","However, the Purple Moon Empire was too large. It was difficult to capture the agile troops of the Bone Spirit.","“In just five years, 230,000 planets have been devoured. The Purple Moon Empire is in a state of panic, and many people have escaped.”","“Bone Spirit King is indeed targeting Great Emperor Purple Moon.”","“Does he have anything to do with Heaven-suppressing Emperor?” Someone doubted. “After the troops of the Bone Spirits appeared, Heaven-suppressing Emperor suppressed them into the miasma. Could it be that those Bone Spirits have returned for revenge?”","“Great Emperor Purple Moon, where is Heaven-suppressing Emperor? If he returns, we will be able to capture the Bone Spirit Troops,” someone asked.","Great Emperor Purple Moon shook her head slightly. “I don’t know when he’ll be back either.”","“It is troublesome. Let’s continue to ask for help from the nearby Great Emperors and take action separately. If any of us can restrain the Bone Spirits, we will be able to suppress them.”","The number of the Great Emperors increased rapidly, from three hundred to four hundred. Finally, there were more than five hundred of them.","This was the first time to gather so many Great Emperors here.","Finally, the Great Emperor Wing God appeared. He moved extremely fast. He had a pair of innate wings that allowed him to traverse the void.","“Great Emperor Wing God is holding back the Bone Spirit Troops in the Cave Battle Zone.”","“Hurry up and go support them!”","Great Emperors came one after another.","The Great Emperor Wing God circled around the troops of the Bone Spirits and continued to fight them.","“Catch them!”","Great Emperor Purple Moon and the others arrived quickly.","More than four hundred Great Emperors attacked at the same time.","The scene was extremely intense.","“The Bone Spirit King’s defense is strong.”","As they fought, they felt a little strange.","The Bone Spirit King was wearing armor. It withstood all the attacks. Each attack made a group of the Bone Spirits turn into powder and float away from the Bone Spirit Ship.","He was also using these Bone Spirits to withstand these attacks.","But he didn’t seem to be injured.","“Could it be because of that armor?”","“No matter what, they won’t be able to come out if we suppress them to the miasma.”","The miasma was a dimensional Alternate Space.","It was connected to the alien creatures’ world. They were very horrible. However, the alien creatures could not pass through the passage and come here. Therefore, once they were found in the starry sky of the Human Clan, they would be killed or suppressed and brought to the miasma.","In this way, Zhang Han always faced attacks. He kept retreating quickly to avoid excessive consumption.","But this group of Great Emperors drove him in one direction.","After a full 70 years of travel, when Zhang Han was suppressed to the entrance of the miasma land, Hei Yue was flustered.","“Great Emperors, I’m the daughter of Black Tiger Great Emperor. My father hasn’t arrived yet. There are still six of us here!”","“Yeah! Please take us into account!”","Hearing these voices, many Great Emperors remained silent.","Compared to the Bone Spirit King, the six of them were nothing serious. The Bone Spirit King should be suppressed, but how could he let go of the people he had worked so hard to capture?","Great Emperor Purple Moon asked, “Can you let them go?”","Zhang Han didn’t respond.","He stood at the bow of the Bone Spirit Ship and looked ahead calmly until his figure disappeared.","He said in a hoarse voice, “I will return and get what I want.”","Zhang Han admitted that he was too impatient. When he reached the Emperor-to-be Realm, the Great Emperors basically couldn’t kill him, so he took action decisively.","However, he was still suppressed. Fortunately, the other party was a Great Emperor.","He wouldn’t be hurt. Even if he entered the miasma, he would only retreat for a short period of time.","However, Great Emperor Purple Moon also said, “Blood essence? I only have one drop of blood essence. If it dissipates, I’ll die. If you want to kill me, just come. But the premise is that you can leave the miasma!”","Rumble!","Great Emperor Purple Moon attacked in an instant.","The entire Bone Spirit Ship was bombarded into the miasma.","It seemed to be a black hole in the universe with halos swirling around it. There was another world inside, which was like a wormhole. There was a Bounded Domain in the miasma. The strange creatures basically had no hope of breaking through.","Moreover, Zhang Han felt an extraordinary power on the planet not far from the miasma.","Was that the sovereign who had surpassed the Great Emperor?","Great Emperor Purple Moon only had one drop of blood essence.","If she gave it to him, she would die.","It was not enough!","His cultivation level wasn’t high enough. Only by becoming a Great Emperor would he have a chance.","The miasma...","Zhang Han turned around and fixed his bloody eyes on the miasma.","This was an extremely muddy Star Area, and the universe was covered in mist.","“It’s over!”","Hei Yue cried from the side, “We can’t leave this place after entering it. Even a Great Emperor will die here.”","There was no hope!","The six women even felt dizzy when they breathed the air here.","Fortunately, a layer of energy rose from the Bone Spirit Ship, isolating everything. It made them feel a little more comfortable.","“There are countless alien creatures living in the miasma.”","“There are various terrifying creatures. This is a desperate situation.”","In the face of some voices, the red Heavenly Master, Bone Spirit Night Demon suddenly said, “Good. The host likes desperate situations.”","“Hmm?”","The women were stunned.","The Bone Spirits were also alien creatures.","Hei Yue knew more.","“Bone Spirits are indeed powerful among the alien races. They aren’t easy to be killed and can assimilate other creatures. However, they possess the pressure of grades. Bone Spirits won’t devour other high-grade creatures,” Hei Yue said.","“No!”","The Night Demon with red bones raised its arms slightly and said, “Actually, you can call me the Bone Spirit King. The host is the controller!”","His six bodies merged and transcended the world.","The Night Demon was glad to see how powerful the host was.","Finally, after several days in the void above the miasma, A loud roar sounded.","Suddenly, a large area of blackness appeared in front of them.","After seeing it clearly, Hei Yue sucked in a breath of cold air. “This is a Wolf Tortoise!”","The Wolf Tortoise looked similar to Black Tortoise. It was commonly known as a tortoise. It had a wolf-like head and astonishing pressure. Moreover, this Wolf Tortoise had the Emperor-to-be power.","They encountered a person in the Emperor-to-be Realm after a few days. Such things were unpredictable here.","Clang!","Under their gazes, Zhang Han took out his Bone Spirits and rushed over. In the smoke, they couldn’t see anything clearly but could hear cries.","After a moment, the wizened skeleton of the Wolf Tortoise flew back. Its sinister body stunned Hei Yue and the others.","They felt it was a mistake to drive the Bone Spirit Ship to the miasma."]},{"number":1733,"title":"Chapter 1733 I’m the Nether Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 1733 I’m the Nether Emperor","“Has Wolf Tortoise died just like that?”","Hei Yue fell into a daze.","She had never expected the legendary creature with strong defense to be killed and assimilated by the armored man who controlled the Bone Spirit Troops in just a few seconds.","The Bone Spirit of the Wolf Tortoise!","“Good heavens!”","The Bone Spirits weren’t from an alien race. He was trying to assimilate the other outsiders. If he devoured enough creatures...","“The strongest Bone Spirit Troops in history?”","Sweat appeared on Hei Yue’s forehead.","If this continued, how many members of the Human Clan would be slaughtered by him?","In the universe, the territory of the Human Clan was vast, and it developed extremely fast.","There were countless wonderful places, opportunities, and crises.","The Purple Moon Empire had tens of billions of planets, and it was one of the empires in the galaxies.","The territory of the Human Clan was very large. Every time the Bone Spirit Troops appeared, they would cause quite a stir. But compared with the other races and clans, it didn’t make much trouble with the Human Clan.","But this time, if the Bone Spirit Troops and alien creatures came out, it would be too terrifying.","Buzz!","The Bone Spirit of the Wolf Tortoise attached itself to the Bone Spirit Ship without making a sound.","The big ship continued to move forward.","Seeing the alien creatures being devoured one after another, the women felt their scalps go numb.","“There are Yin souls all around!”","Hei Yue said, “Bone Spirits can assimilate the physical bodies, but they can’t assimilate the creatures with Yin souls. Instead, they are restrained by Yin souls. If these Yin souls invaded the Bone Spirits, they can contaminate a lot of Bone Spirits and reduce the number of Bone Spirits.”","They didn’t care about it. Zhang Han didn’t say anything to them, and Night Demon rarely spoke. They were just onlookers.","“It seems that the Bone Spirits are not invincible.” Hong Yue sighed softly. “I was the first to be caught. I haven’t seen the Bone Spirit Troops suffer a loss yet. So many Great Emperors could only drive them away instead of killing them.”","“How can there be true invincibility in this world?” Lan Yue shook her head slightly.","“Yes. I didn’t expect that the Yin souls could deal with the Bone Spirits.” Hong Yue nodded.","Right at this moment, the armored man sitting on the throne in front suddenly stood up and walked to the bow.","He slowly spread out his arms to both sides.","The black cloak fluttered in the wind.","Swoosh!","The Night Demon flew out with a swoosh. Accompanied by Zhang Han’s bloody eyes, the entire Bone Spirit Ship emitted a monstrous red light.","“Who said that the Yin souls can’t be devoured?”","Night Demon turned its head sideways, said in a low voice, and rushed into the countless Yin souls alone.","In the place covered by the red light, the traces of bones of the drifting Yin souls could be seen.","However, the bones were translucent and hard to capture with the naked eye. However, their outlines could be seen.","The sinister-looking or horrible-looking Yin souls turned into Bone Spirits of the Yin souls in the blink of an eye.","“What?!”","“Can the Yin souls be swallowed?”","Hei Yue and the others fell into a daze once more.","“Oh my god! Even the Yin souls can be assimilated into the Bone Spirits. It’s so crazy.”","There was also a king in the Emperor-to-be Realm among the Yin soul creatures.","Originally, it wanted to devour the Bone Spirit energy, but he didn’t expect that more than half of its troops had been lost.","Then the troops of the Yin souls left dejectedly and quickly.","The Bone Spirits of the Yin souls returned to the ship.","The whole ship became more bizarre. There was a faint mist around it as if there were horrible wails.","They advanced for dozens of days.","An enormous creature hundreds of times larger than the Bone Spirit Ship appeared.","“Burning Dragon! The legendary Burning Dragon!”","It was in the Emperor-to-be Realm.","Zhang Han leaped forward.","The Night Demon led the Wolf Tortoise and other troops to assist in the battle.","This time, they fought for an entire year!","In the vast fog, there was a loud roar coming from the front.","Finally, that person returned.","Behind him was a Burning Dragon entirely purple in color!","It was Emperor-to-be and purple.","This was the first Bone Spirit in the Emperor-to-be Realm.","After they fought for three years, there were significant effects.","This Burning Dragon was at the Peak-Stage Emperor-to-be Realm, not far from becoming a Great Emperor.","Zhang Han consumed trillions of Bone Spirits and finally assimilated them at all costs.","“It’s so beautiful.”","The Night Demon stroked the skeleton of Burning Dragon and appreciated it for a moment. Then, Burning Dragon also attached itself to the Bone Spirit Vessel.","After this battle, the number of Bone Spirits decreased a lot, but their strength improved a lot.","In the miasma, they traversed one region after another and assimilated the alien creatures.","Then some alien creatures that Hei Yue didn’t recognize appeared.","Zhang Han and the others assimilated the creatures and devoured them.","“Great Emperor!”","“Great Emperor!”","Fifty years later, the Night Demon with a purple withered skeleton was so excited that it couldn’t control itself. Seeing Zhang Han, whose aura had soared, the Night Demon shouted excitedly, “Congratulations, host, for becoming a Great Emperor!”","“Is he a Great Emperor?”","Hei Yue and the others felt their scalps go numb.","“Since he’s already a Great Emperor, his destructive power must be even stronger than before.”","“Alas.” Hong Yue sighed. “I’ve already cultivated to the fifth tier of the Kingdom Lord. I thought I had cultivated fast but didn’t expect he would quietly become a Great Emperor.”","“Night Demon, what’s the title of your host?” Huang Yue asked.","Night Demon didn’t know what to say. It knew Zhang Han was not interested in anything.","Since he had become a Great Emperor, it was indeed necessary for him to have an awe-inspiring reputation.","After pondering for a moment, the Night Demon suddenly said, “Since the host represents death, his title is Nether.”","“Nether Emperor.” Hei Yue was in a trance.","“Nether Emperor?”","“Nether Emperor.”","“Heavens! Nether Emperor!”","The others were also shocked.","When Hei Yue came to her senses, she said with a complicated expression, “Fortunately, it’s in the miasma. Otherwise, with the Nether Emperor’s terrifying power, he would have stirred up great turmoil in the universe.” She said with certainty.","At this time, Night Demon rotated its skull and made a sound.","“Who said we can’t go back? Look! The Bone Spirit Ship has turned around!”","Hei Yue and the others took a closer look and saw that the Bone Spirit Ship was slowly turning around and flying toward the direction it had come from.","“Can we go out?”","A trace of hope rose in the hearts of Hei Yue and the others, but they suddenly realized that they should be worried about the Great Emperors of the Human Clan.","The Bone Spirit Ship was moving forward. The darkness descended after dusk.","“Can we go out?”","They went back to the Bounded Domain of the miasma.","Zhang Han’s armor emitted invisible fluctuations. The space trembled and constantly flickered. It had reached the point where it was balanced with the Bounded Domain.","The entire Bone Spirit Ship was covered in fluctuations. It rushed out, not drawing any attention.","“We came out!”","Hei Yue and the others were dumbfounded. It was incredible.","Who could kill the Nether Emperor?","They couldn’t even suppress him.","Wasn’t he too ferocious?","“Nether Emperor, will you let us go? Or will you kill us after you finish what you want to do?”","Hong Yue suddenly said, “Can you tell us first so that we can be mentally prepared?”","Bai Yue thought for a moment and echoed, “Yes. We want to know it.”","Lan Yue and the others chimed in one after another.","Zhang Han didn’t respond at first.","When the Bone Spirit Ship flew far away, his deep and hoarse voice slowly spread.","“Great Emperor Purple Moon will die, and you will live.”","“Will you kill many people?” Hong Yue could not help but ask.","Zhang Han did not answer.","They flew quickly and arrived at the Purple Moon Empire.","Within the Purple Moon Empire, the turbulence of the Bone Spirits more than a hundred years ago had become a thing of the past.","The destroyed planet did not revive. Instead, it became a Deadland, a tourist attraction for fleets.","Sometimes, the fleet would stop outside and watch for a while.","“Bone Spirits have appeared here. They are terrifying alien creatures. Although there are countless battles in the field of Human Clan, we have to unite against alien creatures.”","In the imperial palace, some people were talking.","“Han Yi, are you slacking off again?”","Great Emperor Purple Moon had caught a guy in his fifteen or sixteen-year-old.","He was Han Yi. A hundred years had passed, but he was still not an adult.","“Mother, I’m about to reach the Kingdom Lord. I’m very excellent. Please let me play for a while.” The boy’s carefree life made him maintain his innocence.","“As I said, I’ll take you to a few fun places when you reach the Kingdom Lord,” Great Emperor Purple Moon said helplessly.","“Is my Father there?”","“No.”","“When will my Father be back? I heard that he’s the Heaven-suppressing Emperor. He’s super powerful.” Han Yi looked a little expectant.","Great Emperor Purple Moon was silent for a moment. “Maybe he’ll come back in a few hundred years. Don’t think about it for now. After you reach the Kingdom Lord, I’ll take you to play.”","“Okay.”","Han Yi went to cultivate unhappily.","Great Emperor Purple Moon stood behind him and sighed softly.","For some reason, she had been feeling depressed recently.","She was from a special race. When she was depressed, it often symbolized something.","She thought of Heaven-suppressing Emperor. With his strength, he should not be in danger.","But she hadn’t gone out recently.","She frowned and pondered for a moment. Then she suddenly recalled the strange Bone Spirit King.","He was calmly suppressed to the miasma.","“He’s too calm.”","Great Emperor Purple Moon shook her head slightly.","She had seen many scenes in her mind in the past hundred years. Sometimes, she would think of the mysterious Bone Spirit King in armor.","“Why was he so calm? Why did he want a drop of his blood essence to fight to the end here?","“With his strange behavior, if he had escaped earlier, it would be even harder to catch him.”","Just at this time, a voice that caused people to shudder with fear resounded throughout the planet.","“Great Emperor Purple Moon, I’m here to extract your blood essence.”","Boom!","Countless people were shocked.","“What?”","Han Yi became anxious on the spot. “Who dares to talk to my Mother like this?”","“Keep an eye on him.”","Great Emperor Purple Moon turned cold and spoke to the guards.","The group of people brought Han Yi into the palace.","More people flew into the void. When they saw the great Bone Spirit Ship they had seen before, everyone and it had enlarged by tens of thousands of times, appearing in the void in front of them, everyone was dumbfounded.","Even Great Emperor Purple Moon couldn’t help but gasp.","“Be quick to contact the other Great Emperors for help.”","One of her subordinates immediately began to find people.","Zhang Han stood at the bow of the ship, looked at her with scarlet eyes, and said in a low voice, “Which one do you choose between suffering a great calamity and your blood essence being destroyed?”","“Bone Spirit King, you...”","Before Great Emperor Purple Moon could finish her words, the Night Demon, who had become the purple Emperor-to-be, spoke, “I am the Bone Spirit King. He is my host, the Nether Emperor!”","Boom!","The words made many people in the Purple Moon Empire feel cold all over.","“Nether Emperor?”","Great Emperor Purple Moon’s face darkened. “Do you think you can kill me?”","Zhang Han did not reply.","He spread out his hands to both sides.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Countless Bone Spirit Troops left the Bone Spirit Ship.","They covered the entire void behind him extremely fast.","In the Bone Spirit Troops, there were about 9 million billion silver Bone Spirits in the Zone Lord Realm, five million billion blue ones in the Kingdom Lord, 0.9 million billion gold ones in the High Kings, ten billion red ones in the Heavenly Master, and three thousand purple ones in Emperor-to-be Realm.","Bone-scorching skeletons of the Burning Dragon, Wolf Tortoise, and various alien creatures turned into Bone Spirits.","Things were getting out of hand.","Great Emperor Purple Moon narrowed her eyes.","Her heart was extremely heavy.","Why would there be such a change?","Only a sovereign would have a chance of suppressing someone at his level.","“I want you to be willing to hand over your blood essence.”","Zhang Han said in a low voice, “If you don’t want to, I’ll kill until you’re willing.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Endless Bone Spirits flew in all directions.","It was clear that this was a world-shaking disaster with so many troops.","If he was given enough time, even the Purple Moon Empire would be destroyed in a few years.","“Kill!”","With a cold expression, Great Emperor Purple Moon rushed over with an ancient sword full of vicissitudes of life.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Zhang Han didn’t even make a move and let the other party attack him.","The price was the disappearance of some Bone Spirits.","However, the Bone Spirit Ship was retreating.","This battle lasted for two months.","Great Emperor Purple Moon would sometimes receive news.","“Three hundred planets have been slaughtered!”","After a while, she was informed, “Ten thousand planets have been invaded by the Bone Spirits.","“Three hundred thousand planets had been invaded.","“There were five million planets that had been invaded.”","The terrifying increase in the number of planets that had been invaded caused great pain to Great Emperor Purple Moon.","At this time, a group of ten Great Emperors arrived.","They joined forces to attack.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","A battle of this level could shatter the void at any time.","The intensity was hair-raising.","However, Zhang Han was not injured and did not react at all.","When the number of the Great Emperors rose to 100, Zhang Han made his move.","This was the first time Hei Yue and the other five had clearly seen Zhang Han attack.","With a flash, he withstood hundreds of attacks with his physical body and stabbed a Great Emperor with his Bone Sword.","Boom!","The body of the Great Emperor was smashed into pieces.","However, it soon reformed. His pale complexion indicated that he was seriously injured.","“Nether Emperor, why are you doing this?”","One of the Great Emperors couldn’t help but ask, “Great Emperor Purple Moon only has one drop of blood essence. Why do you want to kill her?”","“Cut the crap. When the sovereign arrives, he won’t even have a chance to survive!”","Zhang Han also knew the other party was indeed a more powerful existence. He was no match for the sovereign.","However, he had a way to make Great Emperor Purple Moon nod.","Zhang Han waved his right hand slightly.","The entire Bone Spirit Ship came to a stop.","A video appeared in front of everyone.","That was the palace of Great Emperor Purple Moon.","The entire planet was surrounded by the troops of the Bone Spirit.","Someone said, “You can’t enter the Imperial Palace Star. You can’t break the seal left by Heaven-suppressing Emperor.”","They all felt Great Emperor Purple Moon’s Imperial Palace was a safe place.","But there was a Burning Dragon on the screen. Countless Bone Spirits, which were incomparably huge, emitted their energy and poured into the sharp claws.","Sizzling!","The Bounded Domain that surrounded the entire planet was torn apart!","“The empire’s defensive forces have been wiped out.”","Zhang Han stared at Great Emperor Purple Moon with his bloody eyes and said in a low voice, “Which one do you want to choose?”","Swoosh!","All of the faces of the Great Emperors fell.","“Nether Emperor, you’re also a Great Emperor. Why don’t you have your own rules?” Someone said furiously.","They could do nothing. More than a hundred Great Emperors had joined forces to fight against him for so long, but the Nether Emperor hadn’t fought back much. They couldn’t hurt him.","These Great Emperors communicated with each other through the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","“He’s about to reach the realm of the sovereign.”","They had no choice but to wait for the sovereign to arrive. However, there were very few sovereigns in the universe. Even if they could contact the sovereigns to come, it would take the latter a long time to get here.","The time was enough for the Nether Emperor to accomplish what he wanted to do.","It was a dark force that could do whatever it wanted at the current time.","It was terrifying, shocking, and irresistible.","No matter how strong the Great Emperors were, they felt powerless in their hearts.","“What should we do?”","All eyes were on the Great Emperor Purple Moon.","With a bitter look, she whispered, “If I give you my blood essence, will you stop?”","Her voice trembled slightly. She still had a lot of unfinished things to do. She had not watched Han Yi grow up and seen Heaven-suppressing Emperor again.","Why did she have to make such a choice?","“If you give me your blood essence, the Bone Spirits won’t kill anyone from now on,” Zhang Han said resolutely.","“How can I trust you?” Great Emperor Purple Moon asked.","“You have no other choice,” Zhang Han replied.","“You can only willingly choose what I have left to you.”","“Great Emperor Purple Moon, this is his plan! Don’t be impulsive!” A Great Emperor consoled.","However, everyone knew with the Nether Emperor’s strength and the troops of the Bone Spirits, he could cause tens of thousands of times stronger turbulences.","But he didn’t do that. He only wanted the blood essence of the Great Emperor Purple Moon. In fact, the Great Emperors present believed him, but they were also afraid because they didn’t know if it was a trick.","“There’s nothing we can do. The Nether Emperor’s strength is close to that of a sovereign. We have no way.”","Many Emperors used the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique with each other.","At this time, Great Emperor Purple Moon took a deep breath and said, “Let Han Yi go to sleep, bring him to me, and I’ll agree.”","“Okay.”","After Zhang Han responded, the countless Bone Spirit Troops invaded the Imperial Palace and took away Han Yi who was sleeping.","Soon, the Bone Spirit Troops returned from all directions and attached themselves to the Bone Spirit Ship.","The troops were so many that the Great Emperors present felt powerless.","Even the creatures of the alien races had been assimilated by the Bone Spirits. The invasion of the Bone Spirits this time was thousands of times stronger than the last one.","Nether Emperor was too terrifying.","Soon, Han Yi was brought over by the Bone Spirit Troops.","Great Emperor Purple Moon hugged him as she looked at him.","She didn’t let him go for a long time.","In the end, she let go of him and handed him over to a Great Emperor who had a good relationship with her.","“Take him away. Don’t let him live in hatred. Just tell him that I’ve gone to find his father. I...”","There were many words that she wanted to say but couldn’t.","Great Emperor Purple Moon flew toward the ship with tears in her eyes.","It was a desperate scene.","More than a hundred Great Emperors remained silent. Their hearts were filled with rage.","The universe became quiet.","Great Emperor Purple Moon slowly walked up to Zhang Han and said sadly, “Remember your promise.”","“I never lie.” Zhang Han responded in a low voice.","At this time, his mind was much clearer, but the atmosphere around him made him a little depressed.","“The blood essence you want!”","Great Emperor Purple Moon began to glow brightly.","She dissipated, and a drop of blood essence containing the power of the Great Emperor floated in the air.","“Great Emperor Purple Moon!”","Many Great Emperors cried out in grief.","She was dead. She had died. In the end, she did not return to the Heaven-suppressing Emperor.","At the same time, Zhang Han became nervous and turned sideways. “Each of you gives me a drop of blood essence. Hurry up!”","“Ah!”","Hei Yue and the others were in a daze. After all, a Great Emperor had vanished before them.","However, Zhang Han brought them back to reality.","They did not dare to resist. Each of them took out a drop of blood essence.","“What is the Nether Emperor trying to do?”","More than a hundred Great Emperors also began to watch the scene nervously.","If the Nether Emperor was plotting something and wanted to use this opportunity to break through to the sovereign, they would have to flee immediately.","Under everyone’s gaze, seven drops of blood essence were floating in the air.","The Nether Emperor suddenly pierced into his chest with his right hand and took out a shining pearl.","He had waited for this moment for too long.","At this time, Zhang Han fell into a state of hope and fear."]},{"number":1734,"title":"Chapter 1734 The Beautiful Look and Smile","paragraphs":["Chapter 1734 The Beautiful Look and Smile","Seven drops of blood slowly merged into the pearl, which suddenly flickered in the void and emitted bright moonlight. The void of the universe was illuminated by the moonlight.","“What is he trying to do?”","“Does he want to become a sovereign?”","“Record everything about him. No matter what, we have to hand this matter over to the sovereign.”","Many of the Great Emperors backed up a certain distance.","The six women behind Zhang Han looked at the scene in front of them in a daze.","Under their gazes, the armored man raised both hands and slowly took off his helmet!","When they saw his face, they were all stunned.","It was a handsome man. At this time, his eyes were deep, shining with tension. His eyebrows were sharp. He stood at the bow of the ship, making the Galaxies in the universe pale in comparison.","He seemed to be the sovereign of the whole world, standing on the top of the sky and overlooking the world.","What happened to the mysterious man?","What did his drifting white hair mean?","Suddenly, the Great Emperors came to their senses.","He was the Nether Emperor representing death.","He was from the Human Clan, but he commanded countless Bone Spirits and slaughtered countless people. He was full of sins.","Under everyone’s gaze, he slowly raised his arms as if he wanted to hug something.","Suddenly, a brilliant light appeared in front of him, and a beautiful figure appeared!","“Is this aura from the Moon Spirit Clan?”","Some of the Great Emperors’ pupils constricted.","They could see her face and a lot of other things.","It was Zi Yan’s outline, but it was her illusory figure.","She saw Zhang Han, but there was confusion in her eyes, just like the confusion when she was just born in the Moon Spirit Clan.","Zhang Han looked stiff, but his eyes were bright. His arms were trembling as if he wanted to smile.","Swoosh!","But as soon as he smiled, the moonlight dissipated.","Zi Yan flickered and disappeared into the void.","It was dark again. Zhang Han was also disappointed.","He suddenly staggered.","The helmet fell to the ground.","He was in a daze, and his eyes became turbid as he sat back down.","Night Demon was also trembling. It immediately placed the throne under Zhang Han.","Zhang Han fell on the throne and fell into a daze.","“I failed. I failed...”","He felt the green light that belonged to him and represented the way home.","He still had his daughter, Mengmeng, waiting for him!","But...","Zhang Han instantly became clear-headed again. It seemed that the light of hope could be extinguished at any time.","Two drops of tears slid down his face.","He murmured in a hoarse voice, “I can’t go back. I can’t.”","He sat alone on the throne, silent, with dull and listless turbid eyes.","Tap!","The two drops of tears converged into one drop and fell.","The other more than 100 Great Emperors were a bit dazed.","“Is Nether Emperor crying?”","Some of them asked in disbelief, “What is he trying to do?”","Zhang Han couldn’t hear these voices at all.","He was like a half-dead man without any reaction.","“Alas!”","Night Demon floated a few meters into the air.","“I’m the Bone Spirit King, a follower of the Nether Emperor. He hasn’t lied.”","“From today on, the Bone Spirits will not kill a single person. Instead...”","Night Demon pointed to a Barren Star not far from the right. The countless Bone Spirits contained in the Bone Spirit Vessel began to fly toward the planet and burrow into the ground.","“I will stay here and protect the host until he is willing to leave.”","Night Demon uttered the last sentence.","“You are free now.”","With a wave of its hand, Hong Yue and the other five were driven off the large ship.","The Bone Spirit Ship flew into the planet.","The throne was located at the top of a beautiful mountain. The Night Demon was standing behind it in silence.","Countless Bone Spirits covered the surface of the planet.","Perhaps because of the surge of the cold Qi, it snowed all over the world. The huge snow covered the Bone Spirits and the Ice Mountains all over the world.","“Are we free?”","Hong Yue and the others were still a little unaccustomed.","“We’re finally free.”","When they came to their senses, they burst into tears of joy.","“Come here!”","“Who are you? Why did you follow the Nether Emperor?”","Facing more than a hundred Great Emperors, they hadn’t felt frightened before as if the Great Emperors were all losers. But now, the six women were nervous.","“I’m the first one to be caught. I was in the Blood Dragon Mountain Empire,” Hong Yue said.","“I’m the second one. My father is Black Tiger Great Emperor. Nether Emperor took me away directly.”","The women told all the stories between them and the Nether Emperor. The group of Great Emperors understood many things.","“The Nether Emperor invaded with a purpose.”","“Their names are similar. What does he want the blood essence of the seven people for?”","“If Great Emperor Purple Moon had two drops of blood essence, wouldn’t she have died?”","At this moment, the female Great Emperor hugging Han Yi said coldly, “No matter what his purpose is, no matter what the results are, I will tell Han Yi the truth. I will send some people to keep an eye on this place at all times. Maybe some sovereigns will come to kill the Nether Emperor. Maybe the Heaven-suppressing Emperor will return. Maybe Han Yi will become a Great Emperor and personally take revenge. The thing has nothing to do with us but has something to do with Han Yi.”","Then these people scattered. Many Great Emperors waited for their subordinates to arrive before leaving.","There were a lot of similar detection facilities in place. Even dozens of Great Emperors had temporarily settled down nearby.","When Han Yi woke up and knew everything, he collapsed.","Now, Zhang Han was covered with heavy snow on that Barren Star. He felt that a strong person had landed in the place.","But the person stopped for a moment in the distance and left.","Five years later, another sovereign arrived.","After watching for a few minutes, the person left.","Time went just like that.","It seemed that this Barren Star had been forgotten.","However, some people knew there was at least a sovereign and dozens of Great Emperors not far away. They did not make a move around the Barren Star.","In fact, through some new Bone Spirits having invaded the Purple Moon Empire, Night Demon sensed the growth of Han Yi. The one teaching him was a sovereign who had a good relationship with Heaven-suppressing Emperor.","He was growing.","However, Night Demon didn’t care. Its new life was given by its host.","At the same time, the matter of the Nether Emperor included many effects. After his matter became known in public, the people were impacted. His title resounded through the galaxies.","Seven thousand years passed just like that.","8,000 years had passed since Zhang Han came to the real universe.","Under the control of Sir’s mind, a day on Earth was equivalent to a year in the outside world. In other words, more than 20 years had passed on Earth.","One day, a young man with an imposing aura arrived with a sword in his hand. He was leading several hundred Great Emperors.","“I, Han Yi, have become a sovereign. I’m here to kill you.”","A cold and indifferent voice resounded throughout the world.","Zhang Han reacted. He moved his arms, picked up his helmet, and put it on.","Night Demon raised its arms and shouted silently.","Bone Spirits from all over the world surged. Giant creatures appeared one after another. It was a horrifying scene.","Zhang Han picked up the Bone Sword with his right hand and walked forward step by step.","“Ah!”","Han Yi’s expression was ferocious and full of hatred.","He was already a sovereign, and there were five sovereigns and hundreds of Great Emperors accompanying him.","However, only Han Yi took action.","“Why is the Nether Emperor weaker than before?”","“He got injured. He can use the exhaustion of his Bone Spirits to avoid injury.”","“Nether Emperor is seriously injured. His Bone Sword has fallen.”","Poof!","A sword pierced through his chest.","Han Yi roared, “Go to hell! Go to hell!”","Boom!","The energy of the sovereign could destroy the world.","Under everyone’s gaze, the Nether Emperor’s body dissipated.","“Host!”","The black skeleton, the Night Demon who had become a Great Emperor, exclaimed.","It stood at the back, picked up the Bone Sword, and raised the sword, about to lead the world’s Bone Spirits to fight.","However, it didn’t do that. In fact, it knew the host had given up, and he had been waiting here...","“I’m the Bone Spirit King, Night Demon.","“I am undying.","“You killed my host, so you are my enemies. I will return to the miasma. One day, I’ll lead the alien races to descend!”","It was the real devil. From the Dark Mask to the Demonic Ghost King Clown and the Bone Spirit King, it only cared about its host even if the host was wrong.","All of the Bone Spirits had vanished, leaving only the Bone Spirits in the Heavenly Master or beyond the Heavenly Master born on some Bone Spirits on the planets.","The Night Demon left and headed toward the miasma.","“The battle is over.” A sovereign spoke out.","“Really?” Han Yi looked around and saw that there were still Bone Spirits left. They were being slaughtered by many Great Emperors.","“The battle is over.” That was the last thought Zhang Han had.","When his soul dissipated, he suddenly saw that the bronze lamp was burning with a flame.","He was sucked into the ancient lamp and entered a white world.","A clear Shadow of Light was standing in front of him with its back to him.","“You?”","Zhang Han came to his senses and asked, “Sir?”","Could it be that he had been saved by Sir?","“Your six bodies merged together and became immortal. How could you die so easily?”","Sir’s voice was extremely clear, but it sounded quite familiar.","Zhang Han was a little shocked.","At present, only something familiar could attract his attention.","“I failed.”","Zhang Han looked tired. But the next second, the person in front of him slowly turned around.","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes.","“How is the person look the same as me?”","“Are you surprised?”","Sir, who was exactly the same as him, suddenly smiled brightly. “Let me show you some images first.”","The white space suddenly sank into three-dimensional pictures.","That was what he looked like when he was in the Tribulation Stage. At that time, the divine thunder over the sky had swept across the void.","However, the development of the matter was beyond Zhang Han’s expectations.","In the video, he defeated the Heavenly Tribulation and defeated the divine thunder over the sky. The rules of the world couldn’t control him. The Heaven Road opened, and he went to the world of immortals, the real universe.","Zhang Han came to his senses.","“Could it be I survived the Tribulation Stage before?”","The scene changed. He had been constantly training in the real universe. He had traveled to various Star Areas, Astral Domains, and galaxies, and his strength had gradually increased.","He became a Great Emperor, and his might shook the world. Then he became a sovereign and personally suppressed the alien races. He led the sovereigns and the Great Emperors to create the miasma!","“That’s right. You contributed to the miasma,” Sir said softly. “You’ve slaughtered countless people on this trip, but the miasma has saved more people of the Human Clan. Your merits offset your faults. You don’t have to feel burdened. Just continue to watch.”","In the video, after Zhang Han became a sovereign, he was extremely lonely. He had no target and no relatives.","It was said it was cold at the top and lonely when one was invincible.","He had too many regrets. Therefore, he comprehended the rules of time and space, trying to defy the heavens and return.","One day, he suddenly discovered a special existence.","“Are you just born from the Moon Spirit Clan? Follow me and cultivate.”","A little girl appeared and began to cultivate with Zhang Han.","“Your name is Zhang Han. What’s my name?”","Looking at the little girl in the purple dress, he thought for a moment and said, “Purple Moon.”","A few years later, she said, “Zhang Han, my name is Zi Yan, okay? Purple Moon is too ordinary.”","“Okay.”","A few years later, he began to comprehend the supreme treasure, the Stele of Time and Space.","“Zhang Han. Zhang Han!”","“I want to comprehend it.”","“Why? You are already so powerful. Are you pursuing immortality?” The little girl blinked her beautiful eyes and asked.","“No! It’s time reversal,” Zhang Han replied seriously.","A few years later, Zi Yan had grown up a little. She came over and asked, “Why are you comprehending time and space? Do you want to be invincible? It doesn’t seem to make much sense. Why don’t you play with me for a while?”","“No! It’s time reversal.” Zhang Han still shook his head.","Zi Yan grew older and even became a Heavenly Master. She asked, “You’ve comprehended it for so many years. There are many places in this world interesting. Don’t think about going back in time.”","He shook his head slightly.","Zi Yan bit her lower lip gently. In a flash, she grew up and came to the Stele of Time and Space.","“Zhang Han, if you could become the most carefree person in the universe, it would be so cool.”","He shook his head and said nothing.","At this time, the way she looked at him was a little strange. She had anger because he was too stubborn. She was affectionate, but it was not the kind of feeling she grew up with him. There were entanglements, intelligence, and complexity.","Every time she came, she wanted to change Zhang Han, but she couldn’t.","Soon, she also became a Great Emperor.","He knew that it was practically impossible to reverse time and space, but he didn’t expect to transform the Stele of Time and Space into a pearl.","This day, his loud laughter shook the sky.","Zi Yan was awakened.","She ran over and saw the pearl. He said that he had found a way and was about to succeed. She said that she wanted to celebrate with him.","She knew she could not stop him from leaving. She knew a lot, but she specially prepared the Intoxicated Sovereign. The wine was awesome.","She knew Zhang Han wouldn’t stay here for long but did not hesitate. The night slowly fell, and the two of them slept together. Two years later, when he was ready, he opened a light door.","“You can’t go in. I want to go back. Maybe I’ll step into the cosmos in the future,” Zhang Han said with a complicated look. Then, he took half a step into the light door.","However, Zi Yan rushed over without hesitation and said, “I’m pregnant.” Zhang Han was shocked.","He had a burden on his shoulders.","He even wanted to take Zi Yan back to reality. He could think of a way, but the light door suddenly dissipated.","Zi Yan was disintegrated by the Law of time and space. Zhang Han hugged her desperately to protect her.","The space turbulence passed, but Zhang Han only had one thought. He wanted to return to the Great Emperor from the sovereign.","“I’m back.”","The situation was under his control.","“The mind is divided into nine parts, and the main mind occupies half of the mind.”","Except that his first mind had half of his mind, the rest of his mind was almost equally divided into 8 parts.","In the Cultivation World, the Great emperors could do whatever they wanted. Unfortunately, there was only one part of his mind.","He could control the rules of the world at will.","Time and space reversed, and Han Yang Immortal failed to pass the Tribulation Stage and was reborn.","“The Thunder Body, the Great Demon’s Figure, the Extreme Purity Immortal Body, the Dragon-tiger Beast, the Nine Suns Godly Body, and the Athanasia Demon Gong.”","“She’s pregnant. I have to prepare some gifts.”","On the screen, Zhang Han was very happy.","He kept arranging the trump cards that he could bring over from the door of space and time.","“The Heavenly Pearl.”","“The worldlet.”","A lot of things had changed on the original basis.","“Zi Yan, this is our fate in this life. I will make up for the regret in my heart, and we will also have a happy home,” Zhang Han murmured.","When the light dissipated, everything returned to normal.","In the Langya Mountain of Shang Jing City, the sloppy man leaning against the car suddenly opened his eyes.","“I succeed!”","His mind slowly fell silent.","The video ended.","Zhang Han was stunned.","He had successfully passed the Tribulation Stage and went to the higher world to become the sovereign. He and Zi Yan were already a couple before, weren’t they?","Actually, they were not a couple at that time, but she became his woman.","Therefore, this was like a game for nurturing a person of the Moon Spirit Clan as a wife.","Therefore, after he came back, Zi Yan appeared inexplicably, and they had a daughter.","Therefore, at that time, Sir’s mind decided to make trouble and create roses to play with Zhang Han.","Therefore, as a member of the Moon Spirit Clan, Zi Yan was taken to the Cultivation World by him.","“As I said, anyone who defies the natural order must have defects. As a sovereign, I could bear the tribulation after I opened the Space Portal, but Zi Yan couldn’t. This is a tribulation that she must go through. Even if it’s not the Blood Dragon Shan Empire, something unexpected will happen.”","Sir’s mind said, “That’s right, I am you, and you are me. I am a unique existence now, but you have a new life.”","“I pulled you back and exhausted my mind. I have no more reason to exist. I almost have no cultivation now. I seem to be a Peak Strength Warrior. If you have nothing to do, go back, take a shower, and sleep. Mengmeng has waited for you for a long time.”","Zhang Han had mixed feelings.","When he understood everything, his eyes were no longer turbid. However, he was still depressed. “But I failed. Seven drops of blood essence failed to make her appear again.”","“It’s the will of Heaven. The sovereign is not the strongest, so many accidents will happen. If you really feel distressed, you can go back to Xiangjiang on foot. This will be a journey of your heart.” Sir’s mind smiled and said, “Since you have known the truth, go back. I’ve completed my mission. From now on, there’s no mind here. The rules will be under the control of the little princess.”"]},{"number":1735,"title":"Chapter 1735 The End!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1735 The End!","Swoosh!","His mind slowly dissipated. The world turned into a white light again.","Three days later, several climbers in their early twenties were walking forward in a jungle.","Swoosh!","A sound attracted the attention of a man in his early twenties.","A hand suddenly emerged from the ground!","“Ouch! What’s that?” The man was scared. He sprained his ankle and sat down on the ground. The atmosphere suddenly became horrifying.","“What the fuck! There’s a hand.”","“Fuck! He climbed out!”","Under their gazes, a man covered in mud and had no clothes crawled out of the ground.","“Ah! Ghost!”","They were scared. They peed in their pants and turned around to escape.","Even the man, who had sprained his ankle, ran away quickly.","They might be at the end of their rope and would hardly be able to come out and climb mountains together in the future.","“I’m finally out.”","Zhang Han looked around and didn’t know where he was.","He walked aimlessly.","After walking out of the forest, he saw a village.","He took a set of shabby clothes with him.","His clothes were dirty. He looked like a beggar, but he didn’t care at all. He still felt very distressed.","In any case, Zi Yan was not saved.","Did one have to suffer a calamity after defying the heavens?","“If I stepped forward a little later.” Zhang Han sighed softly.","Once he stepped in the light door, there was no way out.","“She’s so silly.”","Zhang Han kept walking forward, regardless of the wind and rain for a day and a night. When he was thirsty, he would drink some spring water. When he was hungry, he would eat some wild fruits.","He was like a walking corpse.","Finally, he knew that he was in Port City.","He crossed the mountains and headed south for Xiangjiang.","Many days passed.","He came to Lin Hai City, a prosperous city.","He walked to the seaside and moved forward under the night sky.","The moonlight was so beautiful, just like her.","In many seaside villas and scenic spots, there were many tourists having a good time or celebrating with the people of their companies.","When he passed by a place that was the venue of a banquet, a 13-year-old girl was a little surprised to see him.","“How could a beggar come here?”","The kind little girl held a plate with a lot of food. “Are you hungry?”","At this time, Zhang Han, with gray hair and a dirty face, was listless. He looked at the girl and shook his head slightly.","“You can eat here, but you can’t affect the banquet. Or else, others will drive you away.”","The lovely little girl grabbed Zhang Han by the sleeve and came to the corner under the tree.","Zhang Han was silent for a moment and took the plate. He looked at the little girl jumping away and the lively banquet. It was obvious that many elites of big companies were here, chatting in groups.","Suddenly, a whisper entered his ears. It was coming closer and closer from behind a tree on the side.","“Sister, this is a good opportunity to get to know Childe Long. You just need to drink. I’m here. What are you afraid of?”","“Childe Long sent me disgusting messages in private. I won’t talk to him.”","“But you have taken over the company, and you needed performance. It will be difficult for us to cooperate without Childe Long’s consent.”","“I won’t do that. He’s disgusting. He’s good at pretending in front of people, and he’s a wretched man in private.”","It sounded a little capricious. This kind of little woman was definitely not a good leader of the company, but she had a personality.","Her voice attracted the attention of Zhang Han.","At first, her figure was very vague. Then she got closer and closer. It was obvious that she was going to pass by Zhang Han and go back to the venue.","“Forget it. Anyway, you are the boss and leader. Since we can’t cooperate with his company this time, let’s work hard next time. I don’t like Childe Long either.”","“Let’s not talk about him. Let’s go back and chat with President Li. We’ll go back later.”","The voice became clearer, melodious, and light. It made Zhang Han tremble.","The plate in his hand fell to the ground.","He suddenly stood up, took a step to the side, and looked straight at the two women.","They got closer and closer to him.","Thump! Thump!","Zhang Han could even hear his own heartbeat.","He was so nervous that he felt suffocated.","Did a miracle happen?","The two women slowly walked to the light.","He saw them clearly.","One of them was wearing a red dress. The other woman was wearing a white dress, but Zhang Han ignored her.","His eyes were fixed on the person in the red dress.","She had a delicate face, beautiful big eyes, and long eyelashes that flickered.","Rumble!","Zhang Han was shocked.","“Who are you? Why are you here?” The woman in the white dress glanced around and quickly pulled the beauty beside her away.","Zhang Han’s heart and hands were trembling. He kept staring at the figure with tears in his eyes.","They dodged Zhang Han from the side and walked to the venue.","Zhang Han stood behind them in a daze.","The woman in the white dress whispered something in her ear.","Then the two of them let out a pleasant laugh.","In the laughter, she suddenly turned her head and looked curiously at the crying man standing under the tree.","The smile intoxicated Zhang Han. He woke up, was resurrected, and was reborn!","He stood under the tree and looked at her chatting calmly with others in the venue. Was she really calm? No! She was not a cold president at all. What she had just said seemed to linger in his ears.","He watched her get in the car and leave.","Then Zhang Han turned around quietly.","He walked on the beach with a smile.","Gradually, he began to jog, run, and run madly.","He lost his shoes. Even his tattered sleeves were blown away by the wind.","However, he was laughing wildly.","“Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha!”","“I made it! Ha! Ha! Ha!”","“She’s back! She came back! I succeeded!”","“Ah!” He roared in his heart.","After shouting for a while, Zhang Han burst into tears.","Men didn’t cry easily because they weren’t sad. However, Zhang Han’s tears were not the case. The tears washed his soul and all his negative emotions. At this moment, he was reborn.","He ran like a lunatic all the way, but he moved too slowly. When he jumped into the sea, he, who was in the God Transformation, couldn’t fly. He secretly came to a ship and went back to Xiangjiang.","Mount New Moon was much quieter than before.","Even though there were many people, they were all quiet.","Mengmeng stayed in the castle all year round and did not come out. Everyone knew that she was sad.","Hiss! Hiss! Hiss!","The tip of Little Hei lying on the balcony of the castle suddenly sniffed.","“Woof! Woof! Woof!”","Little Hei shouted in confusion and couldn’t even say a word, “Woof! Woof! Woof! Woof! Woof! Woof!”","Its voice spread all over Mount New Moon.","“What happened to Little Hei?”","Many people were amazed.","“Woof! Woof! Woof!”","With a swoosh, Little Hei ran to Mengmeng, who was reading a book. It kept gesticulating with its front paws.","“Woof! The host is back!”","It took him a lot of effort to finish its words.","Boom!","Mengmeng dropped the book in her hand to the ground.","Her eyes gradually widened in less than a second and were filled with tears. She followed Little Hei and quickly ran outside.","At the gate of Mount New Moon, the person she missed day and night came back.","“Dad!” Mengmeng pursed her lips, and tears fell from her big eyes one by one.","“Mengmeng.”","Zhang Han had tears in his eyes.","He had met too many difficulties.","“Dad!” Mengmeng threw herself into his arms and cried bitterly.","The other people on Mount New Moon flew over as fast as lightning.","“Han! Son!” Rong Jiali burst into tears and shouted at Zhang Han.","“Son, you’re finally back.” Zhang Guangyou also shed tears.","In just three minutes, everyone, including Yue Wuwei, Zhao Feng, Xu Yong, Zi Qiang, Zi Long, Dong Chen, Kong Ling’er, and Chu Qingyi, came here from all directions.","There was a burst of crying.","“Where’s my Mummy?” Mengmeng asked in a choked voice.","“Your Mummy hasn’t come back for the time being.” Zhang Han wiped the tears from the corners of his eyes, glanced at the crowd, and finally fixed his eyes on Mengmeng. He said with a smile, “But Daddy made it. Your Mummy has come back to life, but Daddy has to pursue her again.”","Mengmeng burst into tears again to vent her emotions over the years.","Tears fell like raindrops. Many people crying began to laugh. It was as beautiful as the rainbow after the rain!","The Mount New Moon was revived, and the atmosphere was very lively.","“Daddy, hurry up and get changed. It’s dirty. Then we can go and see Mummy.” Mengmeng kept urging him.","“Wait for me. I’ll go now,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","Zhang Han put on a suit. Even his hair turned black, and it was trimmed into a buzz cut. Seeing himself in the mirror, he smiled and waved, “You can do it.”","No matter how difficult the journey was, as long as the result was good, everything was worth it.","That night, he and Mengmeng secretly saw Zi Yan.","“Ah!”","“What happened?”","“Be quick to wake up the memory of Mummy!” Mengmeng said anxiously.","“Don’t worry. Look at your Mummy now. She’s cute, silly, and sweet. It won’t be too late to wake up her memory when Daddy catches up with her and let her feel the passionate love again.”","“Okay.”","Two hours later, he said, “She’s asleep. Let’s go back first. I have to prepare for it.”","“Take me back,” Mengmeng said.","Zhang Han was speechless.","“I can’t fly now. When I came back this time, I had already reached the Peak Strength Realm. Open the Space Portal,” Zhang Han said.","“The Peak Strength? Ha...” Mengmeng burst into laughter.","She immediately opened the Space Portal and returned to Mount New Moon. Then, she began to trick her father. “Oh! My father is now at Peak Strength. He is super powerful. Everyone, you can take revenge.”","After saying that, Mengmeng slipped away.","“Woof! Woof! Woof!”","“I’ve long wanted to play Throwing High with you, host.”","Dahei ran over.","“Ahem.” Chen Changqing said, ” Brother Han, let’s have a competition. Come on! Don’t waste this opportunity.”","“Boss, I also want to see your strength.” Instructor Liu made a joke.","“Ouch,” Immortal Master Lingxi said in a sarcastic tone, “You turn out to be in the powerful Peak Strength now. You’re so fierce. Ha... Zhang Han, you’ve hit me so many times. This time, I’ll seize the opportunity.”","Hiss!","Zhang Han gasped.","He looked at Dahei, who was the first to rush over, and the crowd eager to fight.","“No! Dad, why are you here to join in the fun?” Zhang Han was speechless.","Zhang Guangyou was also there.","Zhang Mu was also there.","Even Zhao Feng came. This guy was the most reliable in the past. However, he changed in a short time. Humph!","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Zhang Han was first thrown around in the air by Dahei and played by everyone.","“Ha...”","Mengmeng stood on the balcony, giggled, and ran over.","Her Dad had become the weakest on the scene. She wanted to seize this opportunity!","“Be careful. I’m not bragging.”","Zhang Han shouted in the air, “I was a Great Emperor, the Nether Emperor. I was also a sovereign. I studied the rules of space and time very clearly. Be careful, or I’ll take revenge on you. I still have the Bone Spirit Troops, and I can even assimilate the alien creatures.”","“Stop bragging. Face the strong wind!”","Dong Chen flew over from a distance and kicked Zhang Han in the ass.","“What the fuck!”","It seemed that this game would last for a while.","Five days passed.","The Anmei Company was about to recruit some people.","The president’s secretary sat in the office, ready to start the interviews of the five people.","“Next,” she said coldly.","The person who opened the door was in good spirits. He was wearing a suit and looked gentle and elegant.","“Your resume is ridiculous. You know 36 languages. You are an advanced financial trader and a Ph.D. in management...”","After she read for a minute, she said lightly, “You’re in charge of fake certificates, aren’t you?”","But the man didn’t care. He smiled and said, “Hello, my name is Zhang Han. I think those problems have been verified in the preliminary test.”","“Who knows if you have pretended or prepared? I’ll verify your Fralope first.”","After talking with him for a long time, she found that the other party’s language was very fluent.","“In Lauguage of Brighton.”","It was still fluent.","“Language of Rashk.”","“Language of Tai.”","Ten minutes later, the woman’s expression changed a little. “Not bad. You really have the abilities. What do you think of the company’s development?”","Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “I’ll sit and think.”","“You’re quite naughty.” The woman snorted. “You applied for a male secretary.”","“I know.” Zhang Han put on a serious look and said, “I can be an ideal secretary.”","“What do you mean?” The woman was stunned.","“I’ll go if my boss has any problem. If there’s nothing needing me, I won’t disturb her.” Zhang Han coughed softly and said.","“You have thin arms and legs. It would be even better if you were stronger,” the woman commented.","Judging from her words, she almost confirmed.","“I’m strong. It’s easy for me to fight against three people at a time,” Zhang Han said.","“Ha... You are quite funny. But don’t be like this in front of the president, understand? Otherwise, you may not even pass the probation period. Go back and prepare. If it’s convenient, you can start work tomorrow.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han left happily.","He walked out of the building and glanced upstairs.","Anmei Company!","This was his new journey!"]}]);
